L["Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. Night elf sentinels at Talrendis Point fight the Spitelash naga for the ruins of Eldarath, while at Valormok the Horde has paid in blood for trusting a blood elf mage.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."] = "艾萨拉残破的高塔中仍藏着上层精灵的秘密，所有人都赶来挖掘。暗夜精灵哨兵在塔伦迪斯营地与鞭笞者纳迦争夺埃达拉斯废墟，而在瓦罗莫克，部落则因轻信一名血精灵法师而付出了血的代价。\n\n北方，黑喉熊怪栖身于厄索兰的营地中。他们被雷加希萨特赶出了家园，又因恶魔散播的腐化而染病。他们的守门人正在寻找盟友。"
