L["The old feud between the Magram and the Gelkis has spilled into Shen'dralas, where elven ruins hide a valley of bones and a dark magic that answers to whoever reaches for it. Whichever clan you call friend, the dead there will not stay quiet.\n\nBeyond the centaur battle lines, cracked pylons hum in the forest, a reclusive order of elves still keeps its temple, and a gardener wonders what became of the treants she left to guard her flowers."] = "玛格拉姆与吉尔吉斯之间的宿怨已蔓延到辛德拉拉斯。这里的精灵废墟中隐藏着一座白骨之谷，以及一种会回应任何伸手索取者的黑暗魔法。无论你与哪个部族结为朋友，那里的死者都不会安息。\n\n在半人马的战线之外，破裂的晶塔在森林中嗡嗡作响，一个隐世的精灵教团仍守护着他们的神殿，还有一位园丁想知道，她留下来守护花朵的树人后来怎么样了。"
