L["Zephras Isle floats in Skywall, the realm of Al'Akir, held aloft by anchor pylons the wind spirits left behind. The spirits are gone, the pylons falter, and the Al'Aketh cult preaches that only devotion to the Windlord can save the Skyborne.\n\nCome of age in Thendal Grove, then carry the island's troubles from Shen'dar Village to the port of Valanaar, where the High Order and the Windshapers distrust each other almost as much as they fear High Priestess Lorthuna."] = "泽弗拉斯岛漂浮在奥拉基尔的国度天空之墙中，靠风之灵留下的锚定晶塔支撑在空中。如今风之灵已经离去，晶塔摇摇欲坠，而奥拉凯斯教派则宣扬，只有虔诚侍奉风王才能拯救天裔。\n\n在森达尔林地迎来成年，然后将岛上的种种危机从辛达尔村带到港城瓦拉纳尔。在那里，至高教团与塑风者之间的互不信任，几乎和他们对高阶女祭司洛苏娜的恐惧一样深。"
