L["Myrokos Silentform has work for Ravenholdt's agents. The Syndicate has grown bold in the hills of Alterac and Arathi, and someone must cut it where it will bleed the most."] = "麦洛克斯有任务要交给拉文霍德的特工。辛迪加在奥特兰克和阿拉希的山丘间日益猖狂，必须有人在最能让它失血的地方下刀。"
L["You began by removing Lord Tomas from Durnholde Keep. Later, Myrokos had you lift a scouting report from a Syndicate pocket and beat its searchers to the heirlooms of House Perenolde in the ruins of Alterac. In a stolen uniform you walked into Stromgarde Keep, found the leverage to make Anastasia talk, and broke up the secret handoff at Thoradin's Wall, carrying the prize back to Ravenholdt."] = "你的第一项任务是将托马斯勋爵从敦霍尔德城堡中除掉。后来，米洛克斯让你从一名辛迪加成员的口袋里偷出一份侦察报告，并抢在辛迪加的搜寻者之前，在奥特兰克的废墟中拿到佩雷诺德家族的传家宝。你穿着偷来的制服走进激流堡，找到了让安娜斯塔西娅开口的把柄，并破坏了在索拉丁之墙进行的秘密交接，把战利品带回了拉文霍德。"
