L["Nobody in the Circle is ever in a hurry, and the spirits are worse. I was sent to sit with the great spirit of the bear, and it took its time telling me what a bear is. Strong, mostly. I had guessed that part, but it's polite to let a spirit finish.\n\nThe trial that followed had claws. There was a beast to face, and it was not interested in my reasons. I won. Winning, it turned out, was the easy half. The other half was what the spirit had been getting at all along: strength is for something. A bear doesn't brawl for the fun of it. It stands between its own and the world, and then it goes back to its berries.\n\nI came home able to wear that shape whenever I like. People step out of your way more. I find it very restful."] = "塞纳里奥议会里就没有着急的人，那些灵魂更别提了。他们派我去陪巨熊之灵坐坐，结果它不紧不慢地给我讲了半天熊到底是什么。主要就是：壮。这一点我其实早猜到了，可灵魂说话，你总得让人家说完。\n\n接下来的试炼是带爪子的。有头野兽得去对付，而它对我的理由一点兴趣都没有。我赢了。后来才发现，赢只是容易的那一半。另一半，才是那位灵魂从头到尾想说的：力量是拿来干正事的。熊不会为了好玩去打架。它挡在自家人和外面的世界之间，挡完了，就回去接着吃它的浆果。\n\n回来以后，我想什么时候变成那副模样都行。大家给你让路痛快多了。我觉得这样挺清静。"
L["The Circle never hands you a spell. It hands you a problem and sits back to see what you'll do with it.\n\nThis time it was the deer of Darkshore, sickening up and down the coast. I went up to Cliffspring Falls to find where it began, and Alanndarian Nightsong in Auberdine turned what I brought back into a salve.\n\nThen I spent a slow, pleasant afternoon walking Darkshore from the river nearly to Ashenvale, finding sick deer and putting salve on them. Ten in all. Not one of them said thank you. Each got up, gave me a look as though I'd been rude, and wandered off into the trees.\n\nHealthy, though. Gratitude is a people habit. Deer just get on with things, and the older I get, the more I think they have the right idea."] = "塞纳里奥议会从来不直接教你法术。它丢给你一个难题，然后往后一靠，看你怎么办。\n\n这回是黑海岸的鹿，沿着整条海岸上上下下都在生病。我上峭壁之泉去找病根，奥伯丁的奥兰达利亚·夜歌把我带回来的东西做成了药膏。\n\n然后我悠悠闲闲地过了一个下午，从河边一路走到差不多灰谷边上，见到病鹿就给它抹药膏。一共十头。没有一头跟我说谢谢。每一头都是爬起来，瞪我一眼，好像我多没礼貌似的，然后慢悠悠地钻进林子里去了。\n\n不过病是好了。道谢是人才有的习惯。鹿只管过自己的日子，我年纪越大，越觉得它们才是对的。"
L["Druids learn healing the way everyone learns anything: somebody's sick, and you're the one standing there.\n\nThe somebody was the gazelles of the northern Barrens. I climbed Dreadmist Peak to find where the sickness began, and Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads set about making a salve. He needed kodo horns. The kodos had a view on that. We came to an arrangement.\n\nThen I spent a long, warm day north of the Crossroads, chasing sick gazelles and dabbing salve on them. Ten in all. Have you ever tried to doctor a gazelle? They're quick even when they're poorly. Not one stopped to thank me. They got up and ran.\n\nWhich is the point, really. A gazelle that runs is a gazelle that's well."] = "德鲁伊学治疗，跟谁学什么都一个样：有人病了，而站在跟前的恰好是你。\n\n这回病的是北边贫瘠之地的瞪羚。我爬上鬼雾峰去找病根，十字路口的图加·符文图腾开始着手调药膏。他需要科多兽的角。科多兽对此有自己的看法。后来我们“谈妥”了。\n\n然后我在十字路口北边过了漫长又暖和的一天，追着病瞪羚往它们身上抹药膏。一共十只。你给瞪羚看过病吗？它们病着也跑得飞快。没有一只停下来谢我。爬起来就跑了。\n\n说到底，这才是重点。能跑的瞪羚，就是没病的瞪羚。"
L["Moonglade is the one place in the world where nobody rushes you, so naturally it's where they teach you to swim.\n\nThe first trial meant hunting the bottom of Lake Elune'ara for a shrine bauble and carrying it up to the Shrine of Remulos. Tajarri was waiting there to tell me I'd passed. I was too waterlogged to argue.\n\nThe second was the Pendant of the Sea Lion, which comes in two halves, and nobody would simply tell me where they were. You ask the folk of Moonglade, and they give you a hint and a kind smile and go back to whatever they were doing. Druids. I'm allowed to say that.\n\nI found both halves and brought the pendant to Dendrite Starblaze, and I've had the sea lion's shape ever since. Finest way to travel I know. No boats, no docks, and nobody asks you for a fare."] = "月光林地是全世界唯一没人催你的地方，所以理所当然，他们就挑这儿教你游泳。\n\n第一项试炼是潜到月神湖底去摸一个神殿饰物，再把它带到雷姆洛斯神殿。塔加里在那儿等着，告诉我过关了。我当时泡得浑身发胀，懒得跟谁争。\n\n第二项是海狮坠饰。它分成两半，偏偏没人肯直接告诉我在哪儿。你去问月光林地的人，他们就给你一点提示，外加一个和善的微笑，然后接着忙自己的事。德鲁伊嘛。我自己就是，我有资格这么说。\n\n两半我都找齐了，把坠饰交给德迪利特·星焰，从那以后海狮的形态就归我了。这是我知道的最好的出行方式。不用坐船，不用码头，也没人找你收船钱。"
L["Dendrite Starblaze called me back to Moonglade to meet a cat. The spirit of one, anyway, up in the southern hills, and cats, as everybody knows, don't teach just anybody.\n\nBefore it would say much, it wanted three relics: the Fang, the Claw and the Silent Shadow. All three were down in the Stormrage Barrow Dens, a long, dim place where it pays to be quiet. I went in, came out with all three and laid them in front of the spirit. It looked at them for a good long while. Cats do.\n\nThen it gave me its blessing, and the shape that goes with it: soft feet, sharp claws and the knack of not being noticed. Dendrite didn't look the least bit surprised. I suspect the whole thing had been arranged before I ever arrived."] = "德迪利特·星焰把我叫回月光林地，去见一只猫。准确说是一只猫的灵魂，在南边的山里。谁都知道，猫可不是随便什么人都教的。\n\n它开口之前，先要三件圣物：獠牙、利爪和无声之影。三件都在怒风兽穴里，那地方又长又暗，最好别出声。我进去，带着三件东西出来，摆在那位灵魂面前。它盯着看了好半天。猫就是这样。\n\n然后它给了我祝福，还有配套的形态：软软的肉垫、尖尖的爪子，外加不被人注意的本事。德迪利特一点都不意外。我怀疑整件事在我到之前就已经安排好了。"
L["Every hunter starts the same way. Your trainer hands you a rod, points at something with teeth and tells you to go and make friends.\n\nThe Taming Rod does half the talking. You get close, you hold steady, and if you've got it right the beast stops trying to eat you and starts following you about instead. Then you work together a while, so you both learn the job. I did that three times, with three different beasts, and handed the rod back each time with all my fingers.\n\nAfter that I was sent to a proper trainer to learn how to keep a beast of my own. I've had a partner at my side ever since. Finds the trail, takes the first bite, holds them still while I shoot. I get paid. It gets fed. Best bargain either of us ever made."] = "每个猎人的开头都一样。训练师递给你一根棒子，指着一个长牙的东西，叫你去交个朋友。\n\n驯兽棒能替你把话说一半。你凑过去，稳住，要是做对了，那头野兽就不再想吃你，反倒开始跟着你到处跑。然后你们一起干一阵活，好让彼此都学会这份差事。我这么干了三回，换了三头不同的野兽，每次交还棒子的时候，手指头都还一根不少。\n\n之后他们让我去找正经的训练师，学怎么养一头属于自己的野兽。从那以后，我身边就一直有个搭档。它找踪迹，咬第一口，按住目标让我射。我拿钱，它吃饭。这是我们俩这辈子谈过最划算的买卖。"
L["Out of Molten Core, if you're lucky, comes a leaf. Ancient Petrified Leaf. Looks like nothing. Its owner turned out to be Vartrus, an ancient up in Felwood, and Vartrus wanted four demons dead.\n\nThey weren't hard to kill. They were hard to find, because they were living among ordinary folk under friendly names. Artorius the Amiable, for one. Very amiable. Less so after the first arrow.\n\nIt had to be done alone, the ancients said. My pet and I agreed the pet didn't count. The pet did most of the tracking, so that seemed only fair.\n\nThe other two ancients wanted sinew from a grown black dragon and a grown blue one. Neither dragon was in a giving mood. What I got for it all was Rhok'delar, the longbow of the Ancient Keepers. My pet still hasn't forgiven me for not getting one too."] = "运气好的话，熔火之心里会掉出一片叶子。古树的石化叶片。看着啥也不是。结果它的主人是费伍德森林里的古树瓦特鲁斯，而瓦特鲁斯想要四个恶魔的命。\n\n它们不难杀，难的是找，因为它们混在普通人中间，还顶着挺友善的名字。比如那位“和蔼的阿托里乌斯”。确实挺和蔼。挨了第一箭以后就没那么和蔼了。\n\n古树们说，这事必须单独完成。我和我的宠物一致认为，宠物不算数。追踪的活儿大半都是它干的，这么算也挺公平。\n\n另外两位古树想要成年黑龙和成年蓝龙的龙筋。两条龙都没什么施舍的心情。最后我换来了伦鲁迪洛尔，上古守护者的长弓。我的宠物到现在还没原谅我没给它也弄一把。"
L["Every mage needs a focus, and the clever ones have theirs made by the best. In Valanaar, the best is Belann Windwood, who has been shaping staves and wands for the High Order for more than a century.\n\nThe price is one of the order's oldest traditions: a fallen bough from the oldest trees on the isle, the kind the wind has been working on longer than anyone has kept count. A Wind-Infused Bough, to be precise, and I always am.\n\nYou'd think a fallen branch would be easy to find. Fallen branches are everywhere. The right one is not. I found it anyway, because I'm good at this.\n\nOut of it Belann made a focus that answers to me and nobody else. It's a tradition, apparently. I prefer to think of it as overdue recognition."] = "每个法师都需要一件法器，聪明的法师会找最好的人来做。在瓦拉纳尔，最好的就是贝兰·风木，一百多年来一直在为至高教团打造法杖和魔杖。\n\n代价是教团最古老的传统之一：从岛上最古老的树上掉下来的一根树枝，风在它身上下的功夫，比谁记得的年头都长。准确地说，是一根注风树枝。我说话向来准确。\n\n你可能觉得掉在地上的树枝很好找。地上到处都是。可对的那根就不是了。我还是找到了，因为我干这个就是在行。\n\n贝兰用它给我做了一件只听我一个人使唤的法器。据说这是传统。我更愿意把它看作迟来的认可。"
L["Tabetha lives out in Dustwallow Marsh, and she's who the trainers send you to when you're ready for a wand. Practical sort. Knows her business.\n\nShe wanted a book called Rituals of Power, which Magus Tirth keeps in a strongbox out on the Shimmering Flats. The box only opens to the right phrase, and nobody was going to just tell me the phrase. I had to go and find it. Frankly, that was the easiest part of the whole affair. Words are what I do.\n\nAfter a little shopping, jade and a bramble with lightning still crackling in it, Tabetha did her ritual. I watched very closely. I walked out with a wand of my own school.\n\nMost people think a wand is a stick that throws sparks. Most people are right. But it's my stick, and the sparks go exactly where I tell them."] = "塔贝萨住在尘泥沼泽，等你够格拿魔杖了，训练师们就会把你打发到她那儿去。她是个实在人，懂行。\n\n她要一本叫《能量仪祭》的书，锁在大法师提尔斯放在闪光平原的保险箱里。箱子只认对的口令，而且没人会直接告诉我口令是什么。我得自己去找。说实话，那是整件事里最简单的部分。跟文字打交道本来就是我的本行。\n\n又采购了一圈——玉石，还有一根里头还噼啪冒着电的荆棘——塔贝萨就开始做她的仪式。我看得非常仔细。出门的时候，我手里多了一根属于我自己那一系的魔杖。\n\n大多数人觉得魔杖就是一根会喷火星的棍子。大多数人说得没错。但这是我的棍子，火星往哪儿飞，全听我的。"
L["Archmage Xylem keeps a tower on the cliffs of Azshara, and when an archmage that far from anywhere asks for help, it's never boring.\n\nPolymorph does something odd to the Spitelash naga. Turn one into a sheep, and a few seconds later a copy of it falls out of the spell, as though the magic can't decide what it's holding. You kill the copy. Xylem needed fifty.\n\nFifty. I sheeped half the coast. It was the most scientific afternoon of my life.\n\nAnd what do fifty scraps of broken magic teach you? How to turn someone into a pig. Is a pig better than a sheep? It's funnier, and I've come to believe that counts."] = "大法师克希雷姆在艾萨拉的悬崖上有座塔。一位住得这么偏的大法师找你帮忙，事情绝不会无聊。\n\n变形术对恶鞭纳迦有种古怪的作用：把一个变成羊，过几秒钟就会有一个复制品从法术里掉出来，好像魔法拿不准自己手里抓的到底是什么。你得把那个复制品干掉。克希雷姆要五十个。\n\n五十个。我把半条海岸的纳迦都变成了羊。那是我这辈子最有科学精神的一个下午。\n\n那五十块破碎的魔法能教你什么？教你怎么把人变成猪。猪比羊强吗？猪更好笑，而我渐渐相信，这也算数。"
L["The errand was a Prismatic Shell, and a warlord called Krellian had one. Had. The real work came after."] = "差事是一个虹彩贝壳，有个叫克雷利安的军阀手里就有一个。曾经有。真正的活儿在后头。"
L["Dire Maul has a library, the Athenaeum, and in it sits Lorekeeper Lydros, who looks after a great many books and a few very good spells. I liked Lydros at once. Anyone who stays in a ruin for the reading has their priorities in order.\n\nThe spell's price was the essence of Hydrospawn, a water elemental loose in the Warpwood Quarter. Hydrospawn didn't care to be anybody's price. It was a damp afternoon. I brought the essence back.\n\nWhat I got for it isn't flashy. No fire, no frost, nothing anyone will write a song about. But a fight is a short thing between two long rests. Anyone can throw a fireball. Not everyone can bring refreshments, and at the end of a long day underground, you'd be amazed which one people remember."] = "厄运之槌里有座图书馆，里面坐着博学者莱德罗斯，看管着一大堆书和几个非常好的法术。我一见莱德罗斯就喜欢上了。为了读书肯在废墟里待着的人，脑子里的轻重缓急都是对的。\n\n法术的代价是海多斯博恩的精华，那是一个在扭木广场里乱窜的水元素。海多斯博恩可不想当谁的代价。那是个湿漉漉的下午。精华我还是带回来了。\n\n我换来的东西不怎么炫。没有火，没有冰，没人会为它写歌。可打架只是两段长长的休息中间的一小会儿。谁都会扔火球。可不是谁都能管吃管喝。在地底下熬了一整天之后，你会惊讶大家最后记住的是哪一样。"
L["My training started in Deathknell, under Aramis Hammerhand. What I learned there: the Light doesn't care what you were, only what you do with it. Also, it takes some getting used to.\n\nAramis put me to work on the injured Deathguard. Five of them, five times the Holy Light, five soldiers back on their feet. Not glamorous. It's the job, and I've always liked the job.\n\nThen there was a frightened paladin in Deathknell, a brother of the order who couldn't make his peace with what he'd become. I didn't have a speech ready. I offered what help I could and hoped it was a start. Some wounds the Light reaches slowly.\n\nAfter that, Aramis pointed me down the road to Brill, where Shari Stilwell was waiting to take over my education. I'm good at going where I'm pointed. It's one of my better qualities, and I have several."] = "我的训练是在丧钟镇开始的，师父是阿拉米斯·锤手。我在那儿学到的是：圣光不在乎你以前是什么，只在乎你拿它做什么。另外，这东西得花点时间才能习惯。\n\n阿拉米斯让我去照看受伤的亡灵卫兵。五个人，五发圣光术，五个士兵重新站了起来。不风光。但这就是活儿，而我一向喜欢干活。\n\n然后丧钟镇还有个吓坏了的圣骑士，是骑士团里的一位兄弟，怎么也没法接受自己变成了现在这副样子。我没准备什么演讲。我尽力帮了点忙，希望这能算个开头。有些伤口，圣光得慢慢才能照到。\n\n之后，阿拉米斯给我指了去布瑞尔的路，莎莉·斯迪威尔在那儿等着接手教我。让我往哪儿走我就往哪儿走，这我擅长。这算是我比较好的优点之一，而我的优点还不少。"
L["Bandarion Keep sits at the far western edge of Tirisfal, where a company of paladins is building a home for itself. Old stone, good walls, and murlocs at the gate. We sorted out the murlocs first. You can't make anywhere a home with murlocs at the gate.\n\nDanitha Morr showed me round and told me what the place could become, and I believed every word. Not everyone in paladin's armor out there is a friend, though. The Tarnished still turn their blades on their own kind. I dealt with a good many of them, and then with their commander, Rudolph Gelhardt.\n\nDanitha had me carry Gelhardt's head to Sylvanas Windrunner, a token of good faith from an order she barely trusts. I'm not sure a severed head builds much trust. Still, it's the thought that counts."] = "班达里安堡在提瑞斯法的最西边，一队圣骑士正在那儿给自己安家。老石头，好城墙，还有堵在门口的鱼人。我们先收拾了鱼人。门口蹲着鱼人，哪儿都安不了家。\n\n丹妮莎·莫尔带我四处转了转，讲这地方将来能变成什么样，每个字我都信。不过外头穿圣骑士盔甲的，不全是朋友。“黯淡者”们还在对自己人挥刀。我收拾了一大批，然后又收拾了他们的指挥官，鲁道夫·盖尔哈特。\n\n丹妮莎让我把盖尔哈特的脑袋送去给希尔瓦娜斯·风行者，算是一个她几乎不信任的骑士团递上的诚意。我不太确定一颗砍下来的脑袋能建立多少信任。不过嘛，心意到了就行。"
L["Danitha Morr holds that a paladin does good because it's good, not because anybody's watching. To make the point, I was sent to the Undercity to help Tanis Alderwood.\n\nTanis needed linen. Ten pieces, to hold his wife together, because she was failing and he was doing what he could. He couldn't work out why a paladin would bother with something that small. Ten linen is a small thing. That was rather the point.\n\nThe bigger lesson came with the Symbol of Life. Out at Venomweb Vale, Deathguard Falgan lay dead for the second time, and I brought him back. The Scarlet Crusade were camped right there with their attack plans for Brill, so I took those too, and the Deathguard were ready before the blow fell.\n\nLinen for a stranger, plans off the Crusade. Turns out it's the same lesson."] = "丹妮莎·莫尔的看法是，圣骑士行善是因为善本身，而不是因为有人在看。为了让我明白这个道理，我被派到幽暗城去帮塔尼斯·桤木。\n\n塔尼斯需要亚麻布。十块，用来把他妻子缝补完整，因为她快撑不住了，而他在尽自己所能。他想不通一个圣骑士为什么要管这么小的事。十块亚麻布确实是小事。重点恰恰就在这儿。\n\n更大的一课来自生命符记。在毒蛛峡谷，亡灵卫兵法尔甘第二次死在了那儿，我把他救了回来。血色十字军就在旁边扎营，手里攥着进攻布瑞尔的计划，我就顺手把计划也拿走了，于是刀还没落下来，亡灵卫兵们就已经准备好了。\n\n给陌生人送亚麻布，从十字军手里抢计划。结果是同一课。"
L["Two Earthen Ring travelers had gone missing in Silverpine. The keep saw a chance to prove itself to the Horde. I saw two people who needed finding. Either way, I went.\n\nFenris Isle held half the answer. One of the travelers lay dead. The other, Lumina Windsinger, was locked up in Fenris Keep. I took the key off the gnolls, opened the door, and we fought our way out together. Lumina is a Windshaper. You should see what a Windshaper does to a gnoll.\n\nA worgen had struck them on the road, Lumina said, and one of those beasts would not stay dead. That calls for a special sort of blade. Ott in Tarren Mill forged it while I stood by, and I'll say this for Ott: the talent is badly underrated.\n\nThen I went looking for Old Fire-Eye. Some things will stay dead if you ask them properly."] = "有两位大地之环的旅人在银松森林失踪了。堡里觉得这是向部落证明自己的好机会。我只看到两个需要被找到的人。不管怎么说，我都去了。\n\n答案的一半在芬里斯岛。一个旅人已经死了。另一个，卢米娜·风歌，被关在芬里斯城堡里。我从豺狼人身上拿到钥匙，打开门，然后我们一起杀了出去。卢米娜是一位塑风者。你真该看看塑风者是怎么收拾豺狼人的。\n\n卢米娜说，他们是在路上被狼人袭击的，而其中一头野兽怎么都死不透。这得用一种特别的刀。塔伦米尔的奥特就在我旁边把它打了出来，我得替奥特说句公道话：这手艺被严重低估了。\n\n然后我就去找老火眼了。有些东西，只要你好好请，它就会乖乖死透。"
L["Duthorian Rall teaches at the Cathedral of Light, and Rall's view is that having the Light with you is the easy part. The hard part is what you do when evil walks into your lands and you're the one standing there.\n\nSo Rall sent me to Westfall, to Daphne Stilwell, and the Defias picked that very afternoon to come for her. They came in waves. The rule was simple: she lives and I live, or the test is failed. Nobody gets to fall over and try again.\n\nI won't pretend it was tidy. The Defias don't fight fair, and there were more of them than I'd have liked. But I stayed in front of her and kept the Light going, and when it was over we were both still standing.\n\nThat, apparently, is valor. I'd have called it a long afternoon. I suppose it can be both."] = "达索瑞恩·拉尔在光明大教堂教书。在拉尔看来，有圣光相伴是容易的部分。难的是邪恶闯进你的地盘、而站在那儿的偏偏是你的时候，你怎么办。\n\n于是拉尔把我派到西部荒野，去找达芙妮·斯迪威尔，而迪菲亚偏偏挑了那个下午来找她。他们一波接一波地来。规矩很简单：她活着，我也活着，不然试炼就算失败。没人能摔倒了再重来一次。\n\n我不装，打得一点也不漂亮。迪菲亚打架不讲规矩，人数也比我希望的多。但我一直挡在她前面，圣光一直没断，等打完了，我们俩都还站着。\n\n这显然就叫“勇气”。要我说，那就是个漫长的下午。我想两者可以兼得。"
L["Jordan Stilwell works a forge outside the gates of Ironforge, and Jordan's idea of a test is a shopping list. Lumber, ore, a Kor gem, and Jordan's own smithing hammer, which was somehow anywhere but with Jordan.\n\nI'll spare you the roads. There were a great many roads. The gem alone came to me corrupted and had to go all the way to Darkshore to be made clean.\n\nBut I stood by the anvil when it all came together, and I watched Jordan make Verigan's Fist. They say the Light is in all honest work. I'd believed that in a general sort of way. Standing at that forge, I believed it properly.\n\nRighteousness, it turns out, is mostly carrying things and not complaining. I managed one of the two."] = "乔丹·斯迪威尔在铁炉堡大门外守着一座铁匠炉，乔丹所谓的试炼，就是一张购物清单。木料、矿石、一颗科尔宝石，还有乔丹自己的锻造锤——不知怎么回事，这锤子哪儿都在，就是不在乔丹手边。\n\n路上的事我就不细说了。路实在太多了。光那颗宝石到我手里的时候就已经被腐化了，还得一路送到黑海岸去净化。\n\n但东西凑齐的时候，我就站在铁砧旁边，看着乔丹打出了维里甘之拳。人们说，圣光存在于一切诚实的劳动里。以前我也大概这么认为。站在那座炉子前，我才是真信了。\n\n结果所谓“正义”，大部分就是搬东西，外加不抱怨。这两样我做到了一样。"
L["Danitha Morr called me home to Bandarion Keep, and for once it wasn't to send me off somewhere else. It was to give me something.\n\nA paladin's warhorse isn't bought at a stable. It's consecrated for battle, and it comes when you call. Danitha taught me how. The first time mine appeared, I just stood and looked at it for a while. They say a paladin's steed is as fearless as the paladin it carries. In my experience, the horse has the better claim.\n\nI've walked a great many roads in the Light's service, and I'd walk every one of them again. I'd simply rather not, now that there's a horse."] = "丹妮莎·莫尔把我叫回班达里安堡，这回难得不是要把我派到别处去，而是要给我点东西。\n\n圣骑士的战马不是在马厩里买的。它是为战斗而受了祝圣的，你一召唤它就来。丹妮莎教会了我。我的马第一次出现的时候，我就站在那儿盯着它看了好一会儿。人们说，圣骑士的坐骑和背上的圣骑士一样无所畏惧。照我的经验，这话放在马身上更站得住脚。\n\n为了侍奉圣光，我走过很多很多路，每一条我都愿意再走一遍。只不过现在有了马，我宁可不走了。"
L["Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker doesn't hand out horses. A paladin's charger is a spirit, and you earn it.\n\nYou also pay for it, which nobody mentions at the start. A hundred and fifty gold for a censer to cleanse Terrordale. A hundred and fifty more for barding. Fifty more to Merideth Carlson in Southshore for the horse feed, that fifty being to soothe her ruffled sensibilities. Nobody had told me sensibilities came so dear.\n\nThe part worth telling happened under Scholomance, in the Great Ossuary. I used the scryer, judged the spirits it raised, and then Death Knight Darkreaver came for me. He had the soul of a fallen charger, and he did not intend to give it up. He gave it up.\n\nThe charger came to me redeemed. Three hundred and fifty gold, all told. Worth every coin."] = "格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵可不发马。圣骑士的军马是一个灵魂，得你自己去挣。\n\n还得你自己掏钱，这一点一开始可没人提。一百五十金买一个香炉，去净化恐惧谷。再一百五十金买马铠。再五十金给南海镇的梅丽德丝·卡尔森买马饲料，这五十金是为了抚平她受了委屈的心情。可没人告诉过我，心情这么值钱。\n\n值得一讲的部分发生在通灵学院底下的大藏骨堂。我用了预言水晶球，审判了它唤出来的那些灵魂，然后死亡骑士达克雷尔就冲我来了。他手里攥着一匹阵亡战马的灵魂，根本不打算交出来。最后他还是交出来了。\n\n那匹军马被救赎之后来到了我身边。前前后后三百五十金。每个铜板都花得值。"
L["A charger is a spirit, not a purchase. Nobody mentions the bill.\n\nA hundred and fifty gold for a censer to cleanse Terrordale. A hundred and fifty more to Ott for the barding, and worth it. Then fifty to Nathanos Blightcaller for the horse feed, the fifty being for his time. Nathanos values his time very highly.\n\nThe part worth telling happened under Scholomance, in the Great Ossuary. I used the scryer, judged the spirits it raised, and then Death Knight Darkreaver came for me. He was holding the soul of a fallen charger. The rite's last step is called Justice and Retribution, and I gave Darkreaver plenty of both.\n\nThe charger answered me after that. It has every time since."] = "军马是一个灵魂，不是一件货物。只是没人跟你提账单的事。\n\n一百五十金买香炉，去净化恐惧谷。再一百五十金给奥特做马铠，这钱花得值。然后五十金给纳萨诺斯·凋零者买马饲料，这五十金是他的辛苦费。纳萨诺斯把自己的时间看得非常金贵。\n\n值得一讲的部分发生在通灵学院底下的大藏骨堂。我用了预言水晶球，审判了它唤出来的那些灵魂，然后死亡骑士达克雷尔就冲我来了。他手里攥着一匹阵亡战马的灵魂。仪式的最后一步叫“正义与惩戒”，这两样我都给了达克雷尔，管够。\n\n从那以后，那匹军马就听我召唤了。每一次都来。"
L["The Eye of Divinity came out of Molten Core and into my hands, and it led me to Eris Havenfire in the Eastern Plaguelands. Eris had a test in mind.\n\nPeasants. A whole stream of them, running for their lives with the Scourge behind them. My task was to get fifty through alive. If fifteen fell first, I'd failed. A post nearby keeps count of the dead, and you learn quickly not to look at it.\n\nYou learn other things, too. That frightened people run straight into trouble. That you can't heal everyone at once, so you choose, and keep choosing. That shadow is very good at clearing a path, and the Light is for whoever's on it.\n\nFifty made it. Eris gave me what I'd earned, and with the Eye it became Benediction. I never learned a single one of their names. I remember a good many faces."] = "神圣之眼从熔火之心落到了我手里，它把我引到了东瘟疫之地的艾瑞斯·哈文法面前。艾瑞斯早就想好了一场考验。\n\n农民。一大串农民，身后追着天灾军团，拼了命地跑。我的任务是让其中五十个活着跑过去。要是先死了十五个，我就算失败。旁边有根柱子专门记死了多少人，你很快就学会别去看它。\n\n你还会学到别的。吓坏了的人会一头扎进麻烦里。你没法同时治好所有人，所以你得选，而且得一直选下去。暗影很擅长清出一条路来，而圣光，是给走在那条路上的人的。\n\n五十个人活了下来。艾瑞斯给了我应得的东西，它和神圣之眼合在一起，变成了祈福。他们的名字我一个都不知道。可好多张脸，我都记得。"
L["Shaw doesn't do pep talks. He sends me to Westfall to see his man Kearnen, and Kearnen points me at a Defias tower full of people who'd love to see me dead. Fine. I lift the key, I'm up the stairs, and there's a chest with a lovely lock on it. I open the lovely lock. Whatever was waiting inside opens me right back.\n\nBy the time I'm standing in front of Shaw again I'm a funny color and the floor won't hold still. The Touch of Zanzil, it turns out, and the only cure in Stormwind is a goblin in the barracks cellar called Doc Mixilpixil. First he has me lie down on his floor so he can look at me. Then he calls it the itis and sends me shopping: wildflowers, a vial, a tube, a spool of thread. Still don't know what the thread was for. It worked, though. And I learned something about poison that day. I'd rather be on the handle end."] = "肖尔从来不搞什么鼓舞人心的讲话。他把我打发到西部荒野去见他手下的吉尔妮，吉尔妮又把我指向一座迪菲亚的塔，里面全是巴不得我死的人。行啊。我顺走钥匙，上了楼，那儿有个箱子，上面挂着一把漂亮的锁。我打开了那把漂亮的锁。结果里头等着的东西，也顺手把我给“打开”了。\n\n等我再站到肖尔面前的时候，我的脸色已经不对了，地板也晃个不停。原来是赞吉尔之触，整个暴风城唯一能治的，是兵营地窖里一个叫道克·米希匹克斯的地精。他先让我躺在他的地板上给我看了看。然后诊断说我这是“炎”——就一个字，啥炎都没说——接着打发我去买东西：野花、一个小瓶、一根管子、一卷线。我到现在都不知道那卷线是干什么用的。反正治好了。那天我对毒药也有了点心得。我还是更愿意握在刀柄那头。"
L["Shenthul's idea of hello is a salute you have to learn first. Shattered Hand business. So I learned it, and then he sent me out to the Barrens to fire two flares at a Venture Co. tower and do the salute again for his man inside, Taskmaster Fizzule. Very subtle, the Shattered Hand.\n\nFizzule wanted the tower taken apart, quietly. I lifted the foreman's key, put a few of their people down, and Grand Foreman Gallywix didn't get to keep his head. His lockbox was full of Zanzil's mix, and some of it ended up in me. Shenthul knew the one man who could fix that, Serge Hinott, all the way up in Tarren Mill. Long walk. Then I sat on a stool while he brewed the cure, which is the most patient I have ever been.\n\nFizzule got the head. I got the story."] = "申苏尔打招呼的方式，是一个你得先学会的敬礼。碎手的规矩。我学会了，然后他把我派到贫瘠之地，冲着风险投资公司的一座塔放两发信号弹，再给塔里他的人——工头费苏勒——敬一遍礼。碎手做事，真是低调极了。\n\n费苏勒想让那座塔悄悄地散架。我顺走了领班的钥匙，放倒了他们几个人，加里维克斯大工头的脑袋也没能留住。他的保险箱里装满了赞吉尔的药剂，其中一些进了我的身体。申苏尔认识唯一能治这个的人，瑟尔格·希诺特，远在塔伦米尔。好长一段路。然后我坐在凳子上等他熬解药，那是我这辈子最有耐心的一次。\n\n脑袋归费苏勒。故事归我。"
L["Best letter I ever got had no name on it. Just a place, a cabin outside Pyrewood, and one letter at the bottom. C.\n\nIn the cabin there's a chest, and in the chest there's a job. Get the Horn of Xelthos out of Shadowfang Keep, and go alone. Alone, into Shadowfang. Sure. A goblin called Veenix up in Stonetalon got me past the courtyard gate, and after that it was me, the worgen and a lot of standing very still in corners. I put the horn in the chest and walked off, and a while later another letter tells me my pay is waiting. It was. Good pay, too.\n\nNext job was the Eye of Bhossca, in the Scarlet Monastery. I found a disguise on the grounds and strolled through the place like I'd been converted. Nobody blinked.\n\nNever met C. Never asked. When the money's that good, you don't."] = "我收到过最好的一封信，上面没署名。只写了个地方，焚木村外的一间小屋，最底下一个字母：C。\n\n小屋里有个箱子，箱子里有份活儿。去影牙城堡把谢尔索斯号角拿出来，而且得一个人去。一个人，进影牙城堡。行，没问题。石爪山脉有个叫维尼克斯的地精帮我过了庭院大门，之后就是我、狼人，还有大把大把在角落里一动不动站着的时间。我把号角放进箱子就走了，过了一阵又来一封信，说我的报酬在等着我。确实在等。给得还挺大方。\n\n下一单是波斯卡之眼，在血色修道院里。我在院子里找到一套伪装，在那地方晃来晃去，跟已经皈依了似的。没人多看一眼。\n\n我从没见过C。也从没问过。钱给得这么痛快，你就别问。"
L["Somebody in the city who knows somebody slips me a seal with a raven on it. Ravenholdt. It's a manor up in the hills above Hillsbrad where the best of us keep house, and you don't just walk up and knock. There's a test of cunning on the way in. I'm writing this, so you can guess how that went.\n\nFahrad met me inside. Lovely old place. Everybody's very polite and nobody turns their back on you. I liked it right away."] = "城里有个认识某某人的某某人，塞给我一枚刻着渡鸦的印章。拉文霍德。那是希尔斯布莱德上头山里的一座庄园，我们这行里最好的人都在那儿安家，你可不能直接走上去敲门。进门的路上有一场诡诈的考验。我现在能坐在这儿讲，结果你自己猜吧。\n\n法拉德在里面接待了我。好地方，有年头了。人人都很客气，谁也不会背对着你。我一下子就喜欢上了。"
L["Somebody in the city who knows somebody slips me a seal with a raven on it. Ravenholdt. It's a manor up in the hills above Hillsbrad, and you don't just walk up and knock. There's a test of cunning on the way in. I'm writing this, so you can guess how that went.\n\nOnce you're in, Myrokos Silentform keeps you busy. The Syndicate has been getting cocky up in Alterac, and Myrokos has opinions about that. Lord Tomas, Durnholde Keep: no longer a problem. A scouting report, lifted right out of a Syndicate pocket. The old Perenolde heirlooms, out of the ruins of Alterac before their diggers got there.\n\nBest one was Stromgarde. I put on a stolen Syndicate uniform and walked into the keep like I owned it. Found Anastasia, found the money she'd rather nobody knew about, and suddenly she was very chatty. Then I broke up their little handoff at Thoradin's Wall and carried the prize home."] = "城里有个认识某某人的某某人，塞给我一枚刻着渡鸦的印章。拉文霍德。那是希尔斯布莱德上头山里的一座庄园，你可不能直接走上去敲门。进门的路上有一场诡诈的考验。我现在能坐在这儿讲，结果你自己猜吧。\n\n一旦进了门，麦洛克斯就会让你忙个不停。辛迪加最近在奥特兰克越来越嚣张，麦洛克斯对此很有意见。敦霍尔德城堡的托马斯领主：不再是个麻烦了。一份侦察报告，直接从辛迪加的口袋里摸了出来。佩雷诺德家的老传家宝，赶在他们的挖掘工到之前，从奥特兰克废墟里弄了出来。\n\n最精彩的是激流堡。我穿上一套偷来的辛迪加制服，大摇大摆地走进城堡，跟我是主人似的。找到安娜斯塔西娅，找到她那笔最好谁都别知道的钱，突然之间她就变得特别健谈。然后我在索拉丁之墙搅黄了他们的小交易，把东西带回了家。"
L["Here's a fun way to find out you've been played. A letter shows up from Ravenholdt. Fahrad. Come home, we need to talk. So I go, and Fahrad sits me down and tells me C has a name. Caius Blackwood. Some big spellcaster in bed with the Syndicate, the very Syndicate I'd been cutting up for Myrokos, and there I was fetching his trinkets for him like a good dog.\n\nSo we fixed it. C wanted one more thing, the Talisman of Kazdor, out of Zul'Farrak. I went in alone, like always, and brought it out, but this time it went to the manor first. Zan Shivsproket took it down to the basement and put a little surprise inside. Anybody tries to pour magic into it or out of it, boom. Then I set it in the chest, same as ever, and walked away whistling.\n\nFahrad says now we wait. Fine by me. Waiting's half the job."] = "想知道自己被人耍了？有个挺好玩的办法。拉文霍德来了封信。法拉德写的。回来一趟，我们得谈谈。于是我回去了，法拉德让我坐下，告诉我C是有名字的。凯乌斯·布莱克伍德。某个跟辛迪加穿一条裤子的大施法者——就是我一直在替麦洛克斯一刀一刀收拾的那个辛迪加——而我呢，一直像条乖狗一样替他跑腿捡小玩意儿。\n\n所以我们把这事摆平了。C还想要最后一样东西，卡兹多尔护符，在祖尔法拉克里。我照旧一个人进去，把它带了出来，但这回先送回了庄园。萨恩·刀链把它拿到地下室，往里面塞了个小惊喜。谁要是想往里灌魔法，或者从里面抽魔法，轰。然后我照老样子把它放进箱子，吹着口哨走了。\n\n法拉德说，现在就等着。我没意见。等待本来就是这行的一半。"
L["Earth is the first element a shaman meets, and the slowest to say anything. I respect that. I don't always enjoy it.\n\nAfter a small errand to prove I'd do as I was asked, I was handed the Earth Sapta and sent to a holy place to drink it. The world goes very quiet when you do. And then the earth was there in front of me, a spirit of it made small enough to talk to.\n\nIt didn't give a speech. It gave me a rock. A piece of rough quartz, plain as you like, and I carried it home as though it might break.\n\nFrom that rock came my first totem. I set it in the ground, and the ground answered. I've argued with the earth plenty since, mostly about how long things take. It has never once failed to show up."] = "萨满祭司遇到的第一个元素是大地，也是最慢开口的一个。我尊重这一点。但不见得总是享受。\n\n先跑了个小差事，证明我听话，然后他们把大地灵契交到我手上，让我去一处圣地喝下去。喝下去以后，整个世界都变得特别安静。然后大地就出现在我面前，是它的一个灵魂，缩到了能跟人说话的大小。\n\n它没发表讲话。它给了我一块石头。一块粗糙的石英，要多普通有多普通，我捧着它回家，好像它会碎似的。\n\n我的第一个图腾就是从那块石头来的。我把它插进地里，大地回应了我。从那以后我跟大地吵过不少回，大多是吵它干什么都慢。可它一次都没缺过席。"
L["Fire is the loud one. Ask it a question and it shouts the answer, usually at your eyebrows.\n\nThe rite starts with a torch that won't light, the Torch of the Dormant Flame, and you carry it about feeling foolish. Along the way there's a spirit to face, and it wanted a fight. Fire generally does. I gave it one and won, which is the only way that conversation ends well.\n\nAt the end there's a brazier at a shrine, and a flame that doesn't go out. I carried it back like it was the last fire in the world. Whatever the name says, I was not about to be the shaman who let the eternal flame go out.\n\nAfter that, fire came when I called. Not politely. But it came, and it's been at my side ever since, crackling away and offering opinions nobody asked for."] = "火是嗓门最大的那个。你问它一个问题，它就把答案吼出来，一般是冲着你的眉毛吼。\n\n仪式从一支点不着的火把开始，叫眠炎火把，你举着它到处走，觉得自己傻得很。半路上要面对一个灵魂，它想打一架。火一般都想打架。我陪它打了，还赢了，这是那场对话唯一能好好收场的方式。\n\n最后有座圣殿，那里有个火盆，里面的火永远不灭。我捧着它回去，像捧着世上最后一团火。不管名字怎么说，我可不想当那个让永恒之火灭掉的萨满祭司。\n\n从那以后，我一召唤，火就来。不怎么客气。但它会来，而且一直待在我身边，噼里啪啦地发表一堆没人问它的意见。"
L["Water doesn't hurry, and it doesn't want you to either.\n\nHervdana Saegrund in the Wetlands gave me an empty waterskin and directions. When I brought it back full, she gave me another, and then another. One of them had to be filled at Stonewatch Falls, right among the Nightcrawler murlocs, and I told the water the murlocs were its problem, not mine. It disagreed. Another meant crossing the sea to Astranaar. Out of the three, she made a vial of the purest water I've ever seen.\n\nAfter that came Stendel's Pond in Westfall, where something had gone foul. I fought the corruption out of it, and when the pond ran clean, its spirit rose and gave me a shard of itself for my totem.\n\nWater gives freely once it trusts you. Getting it to trust you takes about half of Azeroth."] = "水不着急，它也不想让你着急。\n\n湿地的赫尔夫达娜·赛格伦德给了我一个空水袋，外加一番指路。我装满了拿回去，她又给我一个，然后又一个。其中一个得在石堡瀑布装，就在一群鱼人中间，我跟水说鱼人是它的问题，不是我的。它不同意。另一个得渡海去阿斯特兰纳。她用这三袋水做出了一瓶我见过最纯净的水。\n\n之后是西部荒野的斯特登的池塘，那里有什么东西变质了。我把腐化从池子里打了出去，等池水重新变清，它的灵魂升了起来，给了我一块自己的碎片，做我的图腾。\n\n水一旦信任你，就会大大方方地给。可要让它信任你，大概得跑遍半个艾泽拉斯。"
L["Water teaches patience, and it teaches it by sending you everywhere.\n\nBrine keeps a hut above a watering hole in the southern Barrens. Brine gave me an empty waterskin and told me where to fill it. When I brought it back, I got another, and then another. One of them had to come from the well in Tarren Mill, which is a very long way to go for a drink. Out of the three, she made a vial of the purest water.\n\nWhat was left of it went to the Brazier of Everfount in Silverpine, where a corrupted spirit of water was waiting. I beat it, and the water's true spirit rose clean and gave me a shard of itself to take home.\n\nI grumbled about the walk. The water, as far as I could tell, found that funny. Water goes everywhere and never complains."] = "水教人耐心，教法就是把你派得天南海北。\n\n布瑞恩在南边贫瘠之地的一个水坑上头有间小屋。布瑞恩给了我一个空水袋，告诉我去哪儿装。我拿回去，又拿到一个，然后又一个。其中一袋得从塔伦米尔的井里打，为了一口水跑那么远，也真够可以的。她用这三袋水做出了一瓶最纯净的水。\n\n剩下的那点送到了银松森林的永恒之泉火盆，一个被腐化的水之灵在那儿等着。我打败了它，水真正的灵魂干干净净地升了起来，给了我一块自己的碎片带回家。\n\n我一路上都在抱怨路太远。照我看，水觉得这挺好笑。水哪儿都去，从来不抱怨。"
L["Air was the last of the four, and the one that made me work hardest for it.\n\nThe quilboar had been working a ritual with twisted totems, one for each element, and Veyric up in the Arathi Highlands wanted it stopped. Charlga Razorflank down in Razorfen Kraul had the notes on it, so I went down and took the notes, the usual way. Then I collected their totems and turned them on their own ritual. What was left when it broke was the Eye of the Tempest, and I carried it to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in the Alterac Mountains.\n\nSo now I have all four. They argue constantly, mostly through me. I wouldn't have it any other way."] = "风是四个元素里的最后一个，也是让我最费劲的一个。\n\n野猪人一直在用扭曲的图腾搞一场仪式，每种元素一个图腾，阿拉希高地的维里克想让这事停下来。剃刀沼泽里的卡尔加·刺肋手上有这仪式的笔记，于是我下去，用老办法把笔记拿到了手。然后我把他们的图腾收集起来，反过来用它们对付他们自己的仪式。仪式破了之后剩下的东西，就是雷暴之眼，我把它带给了奥特兰克山脉的捕风者巴斯拉。\n\n所以现在四个我都有了。它们天天吵架，大多是借我的嘴吵。换个活法我还不乐意呢。"
L["After earth, fire and water, I braced myself for air. Air, it turns out, mostly wants you to show up.\n\nMy trainer sent me to Thousand Needles to find Prate Cloudseer, and that was the trial: go there. Mind you, it's a long way down and a long way back, and the wind up on those mesas will push you off one if you let it, so perhaps the walk was the point.\n\nPrate gave me the last totem, and the circle was closed. Earth under my feet, fire at my side, water in my hand and air at my back.\n\nFour elements, and not one of them likes the others. Earth thinks air is flighty. Fire thinks water is dull. Water thinks everybody's in too much of a hurry. And there's me in the middle, keeping the peace, which is about what a shaman is for."] = "有了大地、火和水之后，我做好了迎接风的准备。结果风主要就是想让你人到场。\n\n我的训练师让我去千针石林找普拉特·白云，这就是试炼：去那儿。话说回来，那一趟下去很远，回来也很远，台地上的风你要是不防着，能把你从上头吹下去，所以说不定走这一趟本身就是重点。\n\n普拉特给了我最后一个图腾，这一圈就圆满了。脚下是大地，身边是火，手里是水，背后是风。\n\n四个元素，没有一个喜欢别的。大地觉得风轻浮。火觉得水无聊。水觉得谁都太着急。而我夹在中间劝架，萨满祭司大概就是干这个的。"
L["Long after my first totems, Kardris Dreamseeker in Orgrimmar decided I was ready for the harder lesson: holding all four elements at once instead of one at a time.\n\nThat meant Bath'rah the Windwatcher, up in the Alterac Mountains, and Bath'rah wanted a sample of each element. The real thing. You don't buy elemental fire off a cart. You take it from something made of fire, and the something objects.\n\nThen came the spirit totem, which wanted eight spider eyes and eight black claws. I asked the spirits what those had to do with anything. The spirits did not say. Spirits rarely do when you most want them to.\n\nMastery, they call it. I'd call it a truce. Four elements that can't stand one another, agreeing to work through me at the same time. Some days they even manage it."] = "在我拿到第一批图腾很久以后，奥格瑞玛的卡德里斯认为我已经准备好上更难的一课了：同时驾驭四种元素，而不是一次一种。\n\n这就得去奥特兰克山脉找捕风者巴斯拉，而巴斯拉要每种元素的样本各一份。要真货。元素之火可不是路边摊上能买的。你得从一个火做的东西身上拿，而那个东西会有意见。\n\n接着是灵魂图腾，要八只蜘蛛眼和八只黑爪子。我问灵魂们这些跟那些有什么关系。灵魂们没说。你最想听它们说话的时候，它们一般都不说。\n\n他们管这叫“精通”。我管它叫“停战”。四个互相看不顺眼的元素，同意同时借我的手干活。有些日子它们还真做得到。"
L["Eldrun Stormbreaker was building a scryer to see through the shadows of the Great Ossuary in Scholomance, and a scryer like that wants diamonds. Two good ones. I found them. That was the easy part.\n\nThen I took the scryer down to the Ossuary's basement and set it going. The spirits came first, every one of them bound to a death knight called Darkreaver, and none of them pleased to be seen. I fought them down. When the last went, Darkreaver came himself.\n\nEarth held my feet, fire did the shouting, and between us we finished him. I carried his head back to Eldrun, and the restless dead under Scholomance are a good deal less restless now.\n\nMost of my life I've listened to spirits. Some of them, I've learned, you just have to shout over."] = "埃尔德伦·风暴破坏者在造一个预言水晶球，好看穿通灵学院大藏骨堂里的阴影，而这种水晶球需要钻石。两颗好的。我找到了。那是容易的部分。\n\n然后我把水晶球带到藏骨堂的地下室，让它运转起来。先来的是那些灵魂，每一个都被束缚在一个叫达克雷尔的死亡骑士身上，被人看见了谁都不高兴。我把它们一个个打趴下。最后一个消失的时候，达克雷尔亲自来了。\n\n大地稳住我的脚，火负责大喊大叫，我们一起把他了结了。我把他的脑袋带回去交给埃尔德伦，通灵学院底下那些不安生的亡魂，现在安分多了。\n\n我这辈子大部分时间都在听灵魂说话。后来我发现，有些灵魂，你只能比它们嗓门更大。"
L["Every warlock remembers their first voidwalker. Mine came out of the dark looking about as pleased as you'd expect.\n\nFirst my teacher sent me to fetch something the summoning couldn't be done without. Teachers like mine are never in a hurry to tell you why. I fetched it.\n\nThen the binding. You call, and something big and blue and hollow comes through and makes it plain it would rather not work for you. That's the part nobody can teach. You subdue it. You keep at it until it stops arguing and starts listening.\n\nIt's been with me ever since. Doesn't eat, doesn't sleep, doesn't talk. Stands between me and whatever's angry, takes the beating and never once asks about wages. I'd call it a friend, but I don't think it would know what to do with that."] = "每个术士都记得自己的第一个虚空行者。我的那个从黑暗里冒出来的时候，表情跟你想象的一样高兴。\n\n首先，我的老师派我去取一样东西，没有它就召唤不成。我老师那样的人，从来不急着告诉你为什么。我就去取了。\n\n然后是束缚。你一召唤，就有个又大、又蓝、又空心的东西钻出来，明明白白地表示它宁可不给你干活。这部分谁也教不了你。你得制伏它。一直耗着，耗到它不再顶嘴，开始听话。\n\n从那以后它就一直跟着我。不吃，不睡，不说话。挡在我和任何发火的东西中间，挨揍，从来不问一句工钱。我很想管它叫朋友，可我觉得它不知道该拿这个词怎么办。"
L["Gakin the Darkbinder is a patient teacher, as long as you don't mind being sent across the sea for your lessons.\n\nA succubus needs the right focus, and Gakin sent me to Takar the Seer in the Barrens to learn what it was. Takar sent me north into Ashenvale for heartswood. I came back with it, and Gakin turned it into the Heartswood Core.\n\nThen the circle. I called, and a succubus answered. They always look you over first, as though they're the ones doing the choosing. She looked. I subdued her. We've had an understanding ever since.\n\nShe's charming, vicious and doesn't like me one bit, and I wouldn't trade her for any bodyguard in Stormwind. You always know where you stand with a demon. Usually it's slightly too close."] = "黑暗缚灵者加科因是个很有耐心的老师，只要你不介意为了上课被派到大海对面去。\n\n魅魔需要合适的聚焦物，加科因派我去贫瘠之地找先知塔卡尔，问问那是什么。塔卡尔又打发我往北去灰谷找同心树。我带了回来，加科因把它做成了同心树核心。\n\n然后是法阵。我一召唤，一个魅魔就应声而来。她们总是先把你上下打量一番，好像挑人的是她们。她打量了。我制伏了她。从那以后我们俩就有了默契。\n\n她迷人，凶狠，一点都不喜欢我，可暴风城任何一个保镖我都不换。跟恶魔打交道，你永远清楚自己站在哪儿。通常是站得稍微近了点。"
L["For a succubus you need hearts. Pure ones. That narrows the field more than you'd think.\n\nGodrick Farsan in the Temple of the Damned gave me two names: Dalin Forgewright and Corma Villard. I came back with their hearts. I didn't ask what made them pure, and they weren't in a position to tell me.\n\nThen the circle. I called, and a succubus came through and looked me up and down as though she were the one doing the hiring. They all do, the first time. I subdued her, which is the polite word for it, and since then she's been the most charming thing in my employ.\n\nPeople ask whether she's dangerous. Of course she is. That's rather the point of her."] = "召唤魅魔需要心脏。纯洁的那种。这一条筛掉的人比你想的多。\n\n诅咒神庙里的高德瑞克·法杉给了我两个名字：达林·铸匠和科马·维拉德。我把他们的心脏带回来了。我没问他们纯洁在哪儿，而他们当时也没法告诉我了。\n\n然后是法阵。我一召唤，一个魅魔就钻了出来，把我从头到脚打量一遍，好像雇人的是她。第一次她们都这样。我制伏了她——这是比较客气的说法——从那以后，她就是我手下最迷人的一个。\n\n有人问她危不危险。当然危险。要的就是这个。"
L["A felhunter eats magic. That's the whole appeal. The trouble is you need a book to bind one, and the book was in pieces.\n\nStrahad Farsan down in Ratchet knew the binding, and Krom Stoutarm back in Ironforge knew books, and I spent a good while carrying scraps of moldy paper between the two of them. Eventually Krom had the thing put back together, and Strahad put the Tome of the Cabal in my hands.\n\nI drew the circle, and a felhunter came through starving, and I am, to a felhunter, a walking supper. I got the binding on it before it got a taste.\n\nNow it trots at my heel and sniffs at every mage we pass. I keep my own spellbooks off the floor."] = "地狱猎犬吃魔法。它的魅力全在这儿。麻烦的是，束缚它得用一本书，而那本书碎成了好几块。\n\n棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉懂束缚之术，铁炉堡的克罗姆·粗臂懂书，于是我花了好长时间，抱着一堆发霉的纸片在他们俩之间来回跑。最后克罗姆终于把那东西拼好了，斯坦哈德把阴谋之书交到了我手里。\n\n我画好法阵，一只饿坏了的地狱猎犬钻了出来，而在地狱猎犬眼里，我就是一顿会走路的晚饭。在它尝到味道之前，我把束缚套上了。\n\n现在它跟在我脚边一路小跑，见了法师就凑上去闻。我自己的法术书从来不放在地上。"
L["A felhunter takes the Tome of the Cabal, and the Tome of the Cabal, naturally, was in pieces.\n\nStrahad Farsan down in Ratchet knew the binding, and Jorah Annison back in the Undercity knew books, and I carried scraps of moldy paper between the two of them until I knew that road better than some caravans do. Eventually Jorah had the thing put back together, and Strahad handed it over.\n\nI drew the circle, and a felhunter came through hungry. Magic is what they eat, and I'm made of the stuff. I got the binding on it before it got a bite.\n\nNow it walks at my heel and makes mages nervous. I count that in its favor."] = "召唤地狱猎犬得用阴谋之书，而阴谋之书，理所当然，碎成了好几块。\n\n棘齿城的斯坦哈德·法尔杉懂束缚之术，幽暗城的约拉·安尼森懂书，我抱着一堆发霉的纸片在他们俩之间来回跑，跑到后来，那条路我比有些商队都熟。最后约拉终于把那东西拼好了，斯坦哈德把它交给了我。\n\n我画好法阵，一只饿着肚子的地狱猎犬钻了出来。它们吃的就是魔法，而我浑身上下都是这玩意儿。在它咬上一口之前，我把束缚套上了。\n\n现在它走在我脚边，让法师们紧张兮兮。我把这算作它的优点。"
L["Most people buy a horse. Warlocks get sent to Ratchet.\n\nMy trainer pointed me back down to Strahad Farsan, who by then was practically family, to learn to summon a felsteed. It isn't bought and it isn't bred. You call it, it comes, and it carries you, and it would very much like everybody to know it's from somewhere worse than here.\n\nI've never named mine. It wouldn't answer to it anyway. But it doesn't tire, it doesn't spook, and it has never once wanted a stable or a bucket of oats. The hooves are on fire, mind. Keep it away from anybody's haystack.\n\nA warlock's mount ought to frighten people a little. It saves on conversation."] = "大多数人的马是买的。术士的马，得去棘齿城。\n\n我的训练师又把我打发回斯坦哈德·法尔杉那儿——到那时候他跟我都快成一家人了——去学召唤地狱战马。这马不是买的，也不是配种配出来的。你一召唤，它就来，驮着你走，而且巴不得让所有人都知道，它是从一个比这儿糟糕得多的地方来的。\n\n我从来没给我的马起过名字。反正起了它也不会应。可它不累，不惊，也从来没要过马厩或者一桶燕麦。不过蹄子是着火的，提醒你一句。离谁家的草垛都远点。\n\n术士的坐骑就该让人有点怕。省得跟人寒暄。"
L["Anyone can call a felsteed. A dreadsteed of Xoroth you earn, and Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes made very sure I knew it.\n\nThe shopping list for that ritual would make a dragon weep, partly because thirty-five black dragonscales were on it. But my favorite errand was the imp. Gorzeeki Wildeyes handed me an imp in a jar and had me take it to school. The Scholomance, I mean. It needed their alchemy lab to make a parchment. Only imp I know with an education.\n\nAt the end, in Dire Maul, I set it all out and called. The dreadsteed came through furious. I put it down, and when its spirit rose, I bound it.\n\nIt's still cross about that. We get along fine."] = "地狱战马谁都能召唤。克索诺斯恐惧战马可得自己挣，燃烧平原的莫苏尔·召血者可是让我把这一点记得牢牢的。\n\n那场仪式要的东西，清单长得能让一条龙哭出来，部分原因是上面写着三十五片黑色龙鳞。不过我最喜欢的差事是那只小鬼。戈瑟奇·邪眼递给我一只装在罐子里的小鬼，让我带它去上学。我是说通灵学院。它得用那儿的炼金实验室做一张羊皮纸。这是我认识的唯一一只受过教育的小鬼。\n\n最后，在厄运之槌，我把所有东西摆好，开始召唤。恐惧战马气冲冲地冲了出来。我把它打倒，等它的灵魂升起来的时候，把它束缚住了。\n\n它到现在还为这事生气。我们处得挺好。"
L["Warriors learn to hit first. Then they learn to get hit. The second one keeps you alive.\n\nMy first trial was a job, and the job was a fight. It always is. I won, and I brought back what they'd asked for. Nothing clever. Hit the thing, carry the thing, come home.\n\nThen the lesson. Feet set. Shield up. Weight low. Let the blow land where you can take it. You hit softer standing like that. Doesn't matter. The other side tires first.\n\nI hated it at first. Standing still feels like losing. Then I took a few hits in that stance that would have dropped me flat a week before, and I was still up. I came round fast after that.\n\nPeople think a warrior is all swing. The good ones are mostly stand."] = "战士先学打人。然后学挨打。能让你活下来的是后一样。\n\n我的第一场试炼是份差事，而差事就是打一架。向来如此。我赢了，把他们要的东西带了回来。没什么巧的。揍那东西，扛着那东西，回家。\n\n然后是正课。脚站稳。盾举起来。重心放低。让那一下落在你扛得住的地方。这么站着，你打出去的劲儿是小了点。无所谓。对面会先累。\n\n一开始我恨死这个了。站着不动感觉就像在输。后来我用这个架势硬吃了几下，要是搁在一周前，每一下都能把我放倒，可我还站着。从那以后我转变得很快。\n\n大家以为战士就是抡。好战士大部分时候是在站。"
L["Here's how I got this.\n\nThe Islander runs a fighting pit on Fray Island, out in the Barrens. You step on the grate and they come at you, one after another, and then Big Will comes. Big Will is well named. I put Big Will on the ground.\n\nThat got me sent to Bath'rah the Windwatcher, up in the Alterac hills. Bath'rah wanted charms and tusks and roots, a cauldron's worth, all to call up an air elemental named Cyclonian.\n\nCyclonian came. Cyclonian is a storm with a temper. I hit it until it stopped being a storm, and I took its heart.\n\nBath'rah set the heart into the weapon I chose. Now it spins. So does anybody standing too close."] = "这东西是这么来的。\n\n岛民在贫瘠之地的勇士岛上开了个格斗场。你往铁栅板上一站，他们就一个接一个地冲上来，最后比格维尔登场。比格维尔的块头跟他的名声一样大。我把比格维尔放倒了。\n\n这让我被派去找捕风者巴斯拉，在奥特兰克的山里。巴斯拉要护符、獠牙和树根，够装满一口大锅，全是为了召唤一个叫塞克隆尼亚的风元素。\n\n塞克隆尼亚来了。塞克隆尼亚就是一场脾气很坏的风暴。我一直揍，揍到它不再是风暴为止，然后拿走了它的心脏。\n\n巴斯拉把那颗心脏镶进了我挑的武器里。现在它会转。站得太近的人也会跟着转。"
L["Shaw sends me to Theramore to meet his man there, Sully McCleary. Sully won't say a word in the inn. Too many ears. Out behind the graveyard he hands me a disguise kit, and next thing I know I'm one of Jaina's marines, standing guard in her tower while she and her people talk.\n\nYou learn a lot standing still in a room full of important people who think you're furniture. A man had washed up on the shore, and what he claimed had them all worried. And there it was again and again in their talk: the island.\n\nI walked out of there slow, like a marine with nowhere to be, and didn't breathe right until I was back in the marsh."] = "肖尔派我去塞拉摩见他在那儿的人，苏利·麦克莱利。苏利在旅店里一个字都不肯说。耳朵太多。到了墓地后头，他递给我一套伪装工具，转眼间我就成了吉安娜的一名陆战队员，站在她的塔楼里站岗，听她和她的人谈事。\n\n在一屋子把你当家具的大人物中间站着不动，能听到很多东西。有个男人被冲上了岸，他说的话让他们所有人都很担心。而他们的谈话里一遍又一遍地出现同一个词：那座岛。\n\n我慢悠悠地走了出去，像个没事可干的陆战队员，一直回到沼泽里才敢正常喘气。"
L["Eitrigg doesn't waste words. A band of Kor'kron went into Dustwallow Marsh and didn't come back. Find out. That's the whole briefing.\n\nAt Brackenwall, Nazeer Bloodpike remembered them all right. Loud, proud, and talking about the island. Which island? Nobody thought to ask a Kor'kron.\n\nThe trail ran out at Sergeant Ulka, sitting by the water with a wound that would have dropped most people, insisting everything was under control. I offered a hand. The sergeant would not take it. That's the Kor'kron for you. You'd admire it if it weren't so tiring."] = "伊崔格从不多说废话。一队库卡隆进了尘泥沼泽，再也没回来。去查。整个任务简报就这些。\n\n在蕨墙村，纳泽尔·血矛对他们印象深刻。嗓门大，脾气傲，嘴里一直念叨着那座岛。哪座岛？没人想到去问一个库卡隆。\n\n线索断在乌尔卡中士那儿。中士坐在水边，身上的伤换了大多数人早就倒下了，却还坚持说一切尽在掌握。我伸手想扶一把。中士不肯接。库卡隆就是这样。要不是这么累人，你还真会佩服。"
L["Alcaz Island. An old keep, rotten docks, and under it a prison nobody was ever supposed to know about. By the time I got down there it was already a brawl: guards in blood-red bandanas, naga coming up out of the water, and black dragons, because of course.\n\nI went looking for the king. Found a torturer they called the Questioner instead, and he had a key, and the key fit the chains on a fellow named Mason Connery. Nice man. Very grateful. Then a note on the floor told me the rest. The king had died trying to escape, just before the naga came in.\n\nI read it twice. Then I took it back to Sully, and Sully went very quiet."] = "奥卡兹岛。一座老要塞，烂掉的码头，底下还有一座本该谁都不知道的监狱。等我下到那儿的时候，里面已经打成一锅粥了：戴血红色头巾的看守，从水里冒上来的纳迦，还有黑龙，当然少不了黑龙。\n\n我去找国王。结果找到一个被他们叫作“审问者”的施刑人，他身上有把钥匙，钥匙正好能打开一个叫梅森·康纳利的家伙身上的锁链。人不错。非常感激。然后地上的一张字条把剩下的事告诉了我。国王在纳迦闯进来之前，试图越狱的时候死了。\n\n我读了两遍。然后把它带回去给苏利，苏利一下子就不出声了。"
L["Ulka sent me in after Commander Folkar. Alcaz Prison was a mess: guards in blood-red bandanas, naga out of the sea, black dragons for good measure. Folkar was alive, barely, his axe arm broken and most of his elites dead around him, and still every inch a Kor'kron. He told me why they'd come. The Warchief wanted Varian Wrynn, King of Stormwind, brought to Orgrimmar alive.\n\nSo I went looking for a king. I found a torturer called the Questioner, took his key, and let a chained prisoner named Mason Connery out of his irons. Then a note on the ground told me the rest. Varian had died trying to escape, just before the naga hit.\n\nI had to go back and tell Folkar. Longest short walk of my life."] = "乌尔卡派我进去找指挥官弗卡尔。奥卡兹监狱乱成一团：戴血红色头巾的看守，从海里上来的纳迦，再加几条黑龙凑热闹。弗卡尔还活着，勉强活着，握斧子的那条胳膊断了，手下的精锐大多死在了他身边，可他从头到脚还是个十足的库卡隆。他告诉了我他们为什么来。酋长想把暴风城国王瓦里安·乌瑞恩活着带回奥格瑞玛。\n\n于是我去找一位国王。我找到一个叫“审问者”的施刑人，拿了他的钥匙，把一个叫梅森·康纳利的囚犯从镣铐里放了出来。然后地上的一张字条把剩下的事告诉了我。瓦里安在纳迦打进来之前，试图越狱的时候死了。\n\n我得回去告诉弗卡尔。那是我这辈子走过的最长的一小段路。"
L["Sully begged me to tell no one but Shaw, so I told Shaw, and Shaw took it the way he takes everything, which is to say you'd never know.\n\nConnery had pressed a note into my hand on the way out. A treasure, he said, worth more than gold, buried in Westfall. I dug it up. A box of papers. Worth more than gold to somebody, I'm sure. Renzik, Shaw's goblin, was dying to see them, and a goblin in Booty Bay named Rix Xizzix would have paid me for them instead. I'll let you guess.\n\nConnery only asked one thing in return. If anyone wonders, he's dead. Caught in dragonfire and blown out to sea. So, for the record: tragic. Never met the man."] = "苏利求我除了肖尔谁都别告诉，所以我就只告诉了肖尔，肖尔接受这消息的样子跟他接受任何事一样，也就是说，你根本看不出来。\n\n我出来的时候，康纳利往我手里塞了张字条。他说有一笔宝藏，比黄金还值钱，埋在西部荒野。我挖出来了。一箱子文件。对某些人来说肯定比黄金值钱。肖尔手下的地精雷吉克急得想看，而藏宝海湾一个叫里克斯·希兹克斯的地精，宁愿掏钱从我手里买下来。结果嘛，你自己猜。\n\n康纳利只求了我一件事作为回报。要是有人问起，他已经死了。被龙火烧着，吹进了大海。所以，正式说一下：真是悲剧。我从没见过这个人。"
L["Folkar couldn't make the trip himself, so I carried it to Thrall: the king was dead, and the Kor'kron had come home with nothing but bad news and a broken arm. Thrall listened. Thrall always listens. Somehow that's worse.\n\nConnery had pressed a note into my hand on the way out. A treasure in Westfall, worth more than gold. It was a box of papers. Nazgrel, who advises the Warchief, wanted a look, and a goblin in Booty Bay named Rix Xizzix would have paid me for them instead. I'll let you guess.\n\nConnery only asked one thing in return. If anyone wonders, he's dead. Caught in dragonfire and blown out to sea. So, for the record: tragic. Never met the man."] = "弗卡尔没法亲自跑这一趟，所以我替他把消息带给了萨尔：国王死了，库卡隆回到家，带回来的只有坏消息和一条断胳膊。萨尔听着。萨尔总是在听。不知怎么的，这反而更难受。\n\n我出来的时候，康纳利往我手里塞了张字条。西部荒野有笔宝藏，比黄金还值钱。结果是一箱子文件。给酋长出谋划策的纳兹格雷尔想看一眼，而藏宝海湾一个叫里克斯·希兹克斯的地精，宁愿掏钱从我手里买下来。结果嘛，你自己猜。\n\n康纳利只求了我一件事作为回报。要是有人问起，他已经死了。被龙火烧着，吹进了大海。所以，正式说一下：真是悲剧。我从没见过这个人。"
L["A young sentinel in Darnassus hadn't heard from her sister in too long, so I went to Azshara to look. I found Keldara Sunblade a prisoner of the satyr, and hurt. Except she wasn't. She'd been playing it up the whole time, waiting for her captors to get careless. Turns out I was the opening she'd been waiting for.\n\nAfter that the commander at Talrendis Point put me to work on the naga picking over the old kaldorei ruins, which kept me busy a good while. It ended with Warlord Krellian, hiding behind his guards in a temple. Guards only get you so far.\n\nThe commander held that head like a promise. Azshara might be kaldorei again yet."] = "达纳苏斯有个年轻的哨兵，太久没收到姐妹的消息了，所以我去艾萨拉看看。我找到了凯尔达拉·日刃，她被萨特抓了，还受了伤。才怪。她一直在装，等着抓她的人松懈下来。结果我就是她一直在等的那个机会。\n\n之后塔伦迪斯营地的指挥官让我去对付那些在卡多雷古老废墟里翻东西的纳迦，这让我忙了好一阵子。最后收尾的是军阀克雷利安，他躲在一座神殿里，前面挡着一排卫兵。卫兵也就只能挡这么一会儿。\n\n指挥官捧着那颗脑袋，像捧着一个承诺。艾萨拉说不定还能重新归卡多雷所有。"
L["One of the sentinels had spotted a kaldorei woman alone on the Shattered Strand, plainly no fighter. Saria Fairmoon. An archaeologist, more or less, digging for highborne relics while the naga looted everything around her, and very glad to find an assistant who could fight.\n\nSo I assisted. A staff from under a naga lady's nose, a crystal off a murloc, a mark of the old queen's favor. And three highborne tablets called Creation, Manipulation and Power, which in hindsight should have told me something.\n\nThen Saria wanted to show me what it had all been for, and I found out what she'd really been after.\n\nI went back to Talrendis Point with her knapsack full of artifacts and news nobody wanted. Saria didn't come with me."] = "有个哨兵发现破碎海岸上有个卡多雷女人，独自一人，一看就不是打仗的料。萨莉亚·皎月。算是个考古学家吧，在纳迦把周围洗劫一空的时候，她在挖上层精灵的遗物，能找到一个会打架的助手，她高兴坏了。\n\n于是我就当了助手。从一位纳迦女士眼皮底下拿了根法杖，从一个鱼人身上拿了块水晶，还有一枚古代女王恩宠的印记。外加三块上层精灵的石板，分别叫“创造”“操控”和“力量”，现在回头想想，这名字本该让我警觉的。\n\n然后萨莉亚想让我看看这一切到底是为了什么，我这才知道她真正想要的是什么。\n\n我带着她那一背包的古物，还有一个谁都不想听的消息，回到了塔伦迪斯营地。萨莉亚没跟我一起回来。"
L["Belgrom Rockmaul had sent a dozen warriors to Azshara to guard a blood elf mage who'd promised him the riches of the highborne. When I got there the warriors were dead. The mage, Magus Rimtori, had killed them all.\n\nI found the camp: three sealed crystals feeding a summoning spell, and the seals in the pockets of Rimtori's officers. I took the seals and broke them, the crystals erupted, and while Rimtori was still reeling I finished it. The head went to Belgrom.\n\nThe mage's tome ended up with a warlock in Orgrimmar, who found a demon in its diagrams and wanted its heart. So I called the thing up at the Altar of Storms and brought the heart back. The warlock never said what it was for. I didn't ask."] = "贝尔戈洛姆·石槌派了十几个战士去艾萨拉，护卫一个向他许诺上层精灵财富的血精灵法师。等我到的时候，那些战士都死了。那个法师，魔导师里姆托里，把他们全杀了。\n\n我找到了营地：三块封印的水晶在给一个召唤法术供能，而封印就在里姆托里手下军官们的口袋里。我拿到封印，把它们打碎，水晶炸开了，趁里姆托里还没缓过神，我把事情了结了。脑袋送去给了贝尔戈洛姆。\n\n那个法师的法术书最后落到了奥格瑞玛的一个术士手里，那术士在书里的图示中发现了一个恶魔，想要它的心脏。于是我在风暴祭坛把那东西召了出来，把心脏带了回去。术士从没说过那是拿来干什么的。我也没问。"
L["The Blackmaw are furbolgs without a home. The Legashi satyr drove them out of their den, and they've been living in makeshift camps ever since, getting sicker.\n\nTheir gatekeeper had sent scouts to spy on the satyr stronghold and hadn't heard back. I found one of them, Korsa, alone outside the walls. One scout dead, one taken, and Korsa too ashamed to go home and say so.\n\nSo we fixed it. We cut down Master Feardred, who served the satyr lord, thinned out the stronghold, and broke Graal out of a satyr cage.\n\nThe scouts walked back into Ursolan with their heads up. That was the whole point."] = "黑喉部族是一群无家可归的熊怪。雷加希萨特把他们赶出了巢穴，从那以后他们就一直住在临时营地里，病得越来越重。\n\n他们的护门者派了斥候去侦察萨特的要塞，一直没有回音。我找到了其中一个，科尔萨，一个人待在城墙外头。一个斥候死了，一个被抓了，而科尔萨羞得不敢回家报告。\n\n于是我们把这事摆平了。我们干掉了替萨特领主卖命的费尔德雷德大师，把要塞里的萨特清了一大片，又把格拉尔从萨特的笼子里救了出来。\n\n斥候们昂着头走回了乌索兰。要的就是这个。"
L["A Blackmaw named Furze was burning up with a fever that looked like it was unmaking him from the inside, and he wasn't the first. The tribe's elder had a theory about a cure, and it was the last place anybody wanted it to be: the Legashi's own firewater.\n\nSo I went into the satyr camp for a drink. They weren't sharing, so I took the recipe off one of them and brewed my own batch in their cauldron, satyrweed and a mote of fel power. I've smelled worse. Not much worse.\n\nThe elder turned it into a tincture, and I tested it on corrupted beasts out east: knock one down, dose it, watch. It worked well enough to give the elder hope.\n\nThe first real dose went to Furze. He'd waited long enough."] = "有个叫弗尔兹的黑喉熊怪发着高烧，那病看着像是在从里往外把他拆散，而他不是第一个。部族的长者对解药有个猜想，偏偏是谁都最不希望的地方：雷加希自己酿的烈酒。\n\n于是我进萨特营地去喝一杯。他们不肯分享，我就从其中一个身上拿了配方，用他们的大锅自己酿了一锅，萨特草加一粒邪能微粒。我闻过更难闻的。没难闻多少。\n\n长者把它做成了药酊，我拿到东边去在被腐化的野兽身上试：打倒一只，灌一口，看着。效果好到足以让长者燃起希望。\n\n第一剂真正的药给了弗尔兹。他等得够久了。"
L["The Blackmaw needed warriors, so I went to Timbermaw Hold to ask their cousins. Funny thing: when the satyr overran the Blackmaw, the rest of the Timbermaw sealed their passage and never knew their own kin had made it out.\n\nGorn One Eye was glad to help, and couldn't. The Timbermaw had their own war on with the Deadwood. So I brought back the Deadwood chieftain's mace, with nobody holding it, and that freed up some warriors.\n\nI planted the Timbermaw War Banner in the satyr prince's summoning circle, the reinforcements came, and the prince fell. The demon who'd moved into Blackmaw Hold went the same way.\n\nFor the first time in a long while, the Blackmaw had something to plan besides the next retreat."] = "黑喉需要战士，所以我去木喉要塞找他们的表亲帮忙。说来也怪：萨特攻陷黑喉的时候，其他木喉熊怪封死了通道，压根不知道自己的亲戚逃了出来。\n\n独眼高恩很乐意帮忙，可惜帮不了。木喉自己正跟死木部族打仗。于是我把死木酋长的权杖带了回来——拿权杖的人已经不在了——这样就腾出了一些战士。\n\n我把木喉战旗插在萨特王子的召唤法阵里，援兵来了，王子倒了。占了黑喉要塞的那个恶魔，也是同样的下场。\n\n这么久以来头一回，黑喉除了下一次撤退，总算有点别的事可以计划了。"
L["Some of the best things I've ever found, I found poking through ash. There's a burned-out wreck in Westfall, nothing left in it worth stealing, and in the middle of it a note. Charred half to nothing. But somebody had written it for whoever bothered to look, and I always bother to look.\n\nWhat was left of it pointed across the sea. To the Barrens, of all places. So I went, a very long way for a scrap of paper, and found a second burned-out ruin waiting for me. The twin of the first, an ocean apart, with the same sign left on it. And nailed up beside it, a plank with more writing.\n\nWhoever this was had gone to a lot of trouble. That's usually a good sign. Usually."] = "我这辈子找到过的一些最好的东西，都是在灰烬里翻出来的。西部荒野有一处烧毁的残骸，里面早就没什么值得偷的了，正中间却有一张字条。烧得几乎只剩一半。但有人特意写给愿意找一找的人，而我向来愿意找一找。\n\n剩下的那半张指向大海对面。偏偏是贫瘠之地。于是我去了，为了一张纸片跑了老远老远，结果又有一处烧毁的废墟在那儿等着我。跟第一处一模一样，隔着一整片大洋，上面留着同样的记号。旁边还钉着一块木板，上面写着更多的字。\n\n不管这是谁，都费了好大一番工夫。这通常是个好兆头。通常是。"
L["There's a burned-out wreck out in the Barrens, the kind you ride past a hundred times. I didn't ride past it. In the ash was a note, charred so badly I could barely make it out, but somebody had plainly meant it to be found.\n\nWhat was left of it sent me across the sea to Westfall. Long trip for a scrap of paper. And there it was: a second burned-out ruin, twin of the first, a whole ocean away, with the same sign left on it. Nailed up beside it was a plank with the next set of instructions.\n\nI stood there a while thinking somebody out there had far too much time on their hands. Then I read the plank."] = "贫瘠之地有一处烧毁的残骸，就是那种你骑马路过一百次都不会多看一眼的地方。我没路过。灰烬里有一张字条，烧得我几乎认不出写的是什么，但明摆着有人是存心要让它被找到的。\n\n剩下的那点字把我打发到大海对面的西部荒野。为了一张纸片跑这么远。结果它就在那儿：第二处烧毁的废墟，跟第一处一模一样，隔着一整片大洋，上面留着同样的记号。旁边钉着一块木板，上面写着下一步的指示。\n\n我在那儿站了一会儿，心想外头肯定有人闲得发慌。然后我读了那块木板。"
L["The plank sent me up into the Stonetalon Mountains, to a camp tucked away where nobody would ever stumble on it. Whoever lived there had left in a hurry. Crates still full of tools. Two good sturdy bags. And the sort of pocket litter you only leave behind when you're in a rush to be somewhere else.\n\nThe litter pointed me to the edge of the cliff, and then, as far as I could tell, over it. So I jumped.\n\nThey call that a leap of faith. I call it a very long moment. I came down on a ledge below in one piece, right beside a mound of fresh dirt. Somebody had been digging there, and not long ago.\n\nI'd come this far. I wasn't going to be stopped by a pile of dirt."] = "木板把我指上了石爪山脉，那儿有个藏得严严实实、谁都不可能误打误撞找到的营地。住在那儿的人走得很匆忙。箱子里的工具还是满的。两个结实的好包。还有一堆零碎杂物，只有急着去别处的人才会落下。\n\n那些杂物把我指到了悬崖边，然后，照我的理解，是指向悬崖下面。于是我跳了。\n\n人们管这叫“信仰之跃”。我管它叫“非常漫长的一瞬间”。我完完整整地落在了下面的一处岩架上，旁边正好是一堆新翻的土。有人在这儿挖过，而且没多久。\n\n都走到这一步了，我可不会被一堆土拦住。"
L["The dirt gave up a messenger bag with a parchment in it, and the parchment sent me clear across the sea to Stonewrought Dam, where a carved eagle on the stone heads pointed its fist at Thoradin's Wall. Lovely view, if you like heights.\n\nUp on the old wall was one more bag and one last note. Whoever had left it was gone. I'd just missed them, by the look of it. And under the note was what the whole trail had been guarding, across two continents, a cliff and a dam.\n\nA sleeping bag. A cozy one.\n\nI'd love to tell you I was disappointed. I wasn't. It's a very good sleeping bag."] = "土里挖出来一个邮差包，里面有张羊皮纸，羊皮纸又把我一路打发到大海对面的巨石水坝，石像头顶上一只雕刻的雄鹰把爪子指向索拉丁之墙。风景不错，如果你喜欢高处的话。\n\n在那堵古老的城墙上，有最后一个包和最后一张字条。留下它的人已经走了。看样子我刚好跟对方错过。而在字条底下，就是这一路线索守护的东西，跨过两片大陆、一座悬崖和一道水坝。\n\n一个睡袋。一个很舒服的睡袋。\n\n我很想告诉你我挺失望的。可我没有。这睡袋真的很好。"
L["Up on the lower slopes of Hyjal lives a hermit druid called Ketharas, in a cave, by choice. I liked him right away. Anyone who picks a cave over company has given it some thought.\n\nHe eased me in with seeds and owl eggs, then sent me west to the ancients and dryads still nursing their wounds from the war. That's where it got hard. One of their own, an ancient named Sunderbark, was too far gone in the corruption to come back, and somebody had to put him down.\n\nI did. Then I planted a seed in what was left of him.\n\nAfter that they sent me looking for a bird. A small one, I was told, with a great deal of power."] = "在海加尔山的低坡上，住着一个叫凯萨拉斯的隐士德鲁伊，住在山洞里，自己选的。我一下子就喜欢上他了。能挑山洞不挑人堆的，肯定是想清楚了的。\n\n他先拿种子和猫头鹰蛋让我慢慢上手，然后把我往西派，去找那些还在养战争留下的伤的古树和树妖。从那儿开始就难了。他们自己人当中，有一位叫裂皮的古树被腐化得太深，再也回不来了，总得有人送他上路。\n\n我送了。然后在他剩下的残骸里种下了一颗种子。\n\n之后他们派我去找一只鸟。一只小鸟，他们说，可本事大得很。"
L["The bird was a crow, and the crow was trouble, the good kind. A warlock outfit was cooking things up out of fel ash below the Felblood Scar, and she wanted it stopped. Her plan started with pinecones.\n\nPrickly ones. Turns out a prickly pinecone, delivered with feeling, ruins a warlock's workstation. I ruined four.\n\nThen she got bold. The warlocks kept a demon in a cage, Felflick, and she dangled an iron key where Felflick could see it. For a shot at freedom, Felflick told me whose bones to fetch and whose soulstone to take. The bones went onto the warlocks' own heap, and something big and foul crawled back out. I put it back down.\n\nAfter all that, Felflick wanted paying. What I did about that stays between me and the crow."] = "那只鸟是只乌鸦，而那只乌鸦是个麻烦，好的那种。邪血伤痕底下有一伙术士正在用邪能灰烬鼓捣东西，她想让这事停下来。她的计划从松果开始。\n\n带刺的那种。原来一颗带刺的松果，只要扔得够用心，就能毁掉一个术士的工作台。我毁了四个。\n\n然后她胆子大了起来。术士们笼子里关着一个恶魔，菲尔弗利克，她把一把铁钥匙晃到菲尔弗利克看得见的地方。为了换个出去的机会，菲尔弗利克告诉我该去取谁的骨头，该拿谁的灵魂石。骨头扔到了术士们自己的骨堆上，结果一个又大又恶心的东西从里面爬了出来。我又把它放倒了。\n\n折腾完这一切，菲尔弗利克要报酬。我是怎么处理的，那是我和乌鸦之间的事。"
L["In the ash west of the warlock camp I found a Wild God dying. Velician. You don't forget a thing like that. Velician pressed a branch of the World Tree into my hands, gone bad, with a sickly green crystal grown out of it, and begged that it reach the crow.\n\nNobody on the mountain could read it, so it went down to Moonglade, to an ancient called Orokai. Orokai sat with the branch a while and then showed me what it remembered. A druid named Ve'han Talongrasp had stolen part of a Wild God's power. And he'd talked about a Pact.\n\nNobody ever forms a Pact to plant flowers.\n\nI carried that back up the mountain."] = "在术士营地西边的灰烬里，我发现一位荒野之神快要死了。维里希安。这种事你忘不掉。维里希安把一根世界之树的枝条塞到我手里，那枝条已经坏了，上面长出一块病恹恹的绿色水晶，他求我一定把它交给那只乌鸦。\n\n山上没人看得懂它，所以它被送下山到了月光林地，交给一位叫奥洛凯的古树。奥洛凯守着那根枝条坐了一会儿，然后让我看了它记得的东西。一个叫维汉·爪握的德鲁伊偷走了一位荒野之神的一部分力量。而且他提到过一个“盟约”。\n\n从来没人结盟约是为了种花的。\n\n我把这个消息带回了山上。"
L["Ketharas had a plan to turn the stolen power back on the thief, and it needed gifts from the gods themselves. So I went shopping among the Wild Gods.\n\nThere's an effigy on a bridge above the Cradle of Tranquility. Touch it and Jereman comes, cleverest of the lot, they say, and Jereman knew exactly who to ask. A fox in the ruins of Dae'gun said the spell could feed on the ashes of Azgalor, one of the Legion's lieutenants, so I took a pinch of a demon lord. Another god wanted a drop of the life the Scourge had stolen, so I took that back off the Scourge. And a jewel from the harpies' nests. The harpies were not consulted.\n\nI came away with a much higher opinion of foxes."] = "凯萨拉斯有个计划，要把偷来的力量反过来对准小偷，而这需要神祇们亲手送的礼物。于是我去荒野之神那儿采购了一圈。\n\n宁静摇篮上方的一座桥上有尊雕像。碰一下，杰勒曼就会出现，据说是诸神里最聪明的一位，而杰勒曼清楚该去问谁。达尔苟废墟里的一只狐狸说，这个法术可以用阿兹加洛的骨灰来喂，那是燃烧军团的一个副官，于是我捏了一撮恶魔领主。另一位神想要一滴被天灾军团偷走的生命，于是我又从天灾军团那儿把它抢了回来。还有一颗从鹰身人巢里拿的宝石。没人征求过鹰身人的意见。\n\n这一趟下来，我对狐狸的评价高多了。"
L["Ketharas bound the gods' gifts into the branch, and out came the Staff of the Mountain. Up at the Summit of Eternity the druids put a name to the enemy: the Blackthorne Pact. Druids who'd lost their immortality, blamed Malfurion for it, and swore they'd take that power back.\n\nThe staff did what it was made for. Point it at one of them and the wards came off, and then it was a plain fight, which suited me. Ve'han's wards came off too, in the lodge under the great tree, and without his stolen power he went down like anybody else.\n\nThe Wild God he'd been trying to devour went home free. The druids thanked me, and offered the hermit a standing welcome, should Ketharas ever want company.\n\nI wouldn't hold my breath."] = "凯萨拉斯把诸神的礼物封进了那根枝条，于是有了山岳法杖。在永恒之巅，德鲁伊们终于说出了敌人的名字：黑棘盟约。一群失去了永生的德鲁伊，把这笔账算在玛法里奥头上，发誓要把那份力量夺回来。\n\n那根法杖干了它该干的事。拿它指着他们中的一个，防护就没了，剩下的就是一场普通的打斗，这正合我意。维汉的防护也没了，就在那棵大树底下的小屋里，没了偷来的力量，他倒下的样子跟谁都一样。\n\n他一直想吞掉的那位荒野之神自由地回家了。德鲁伊们向我道谢，还向那位隐士发出了长期邀请，要是凯萨拉斯哪天想找人作伴的话。\n\n我看就别抱什么指望了。"
L["I delivered a goblin's crate to Farholde Keep and walked straight into somebody else's war. Farholde and the orcs of Rog'mar had been fighting over the Riverglades for years, and now the Twilight's Hammer had burned the village of Sunnyglade and moved into the ruins.\n\nI spent a while clearing them out and carrying their pages and charms back to the keep. That's not the part I remember.\n\nThe part I remember is Farmer Elbrim. The raiders had taken keepsakes off the farmers they killed. I took them back and laid them on the graves. Then Elbrim asked me to go into the barn where the family had hidden and bring out whatever was left.\n\nA doll and a locket. That was what was left."] = "我替一个地精把一只货箱送到法霍德要塞，结果一头撞进了别人的战争。法霍德和洛格玛的兽人为了河林已经打了好多年，现在暮光之锤又烧了阳光林地这座村子，住进了废墟里。\n\n我花了一阵子清理他们，把他们的书页和护符搬回要塞。我记住的不是这部分。\n\n我记住的是农夫埃尔布林。那些袭击者从他们杀掉的农民身上拿走了纪念物。我把东西抢回来，放在了坟上。然后埃尔布林请我进那个谷仓，就是那家人躲过的地方，把剩下的东西带出来。\n\n一个布娃娃和一个挂坠盒。剩下的就这些。"
L["I carried a goblin's crate up to Rog'mar, where the orcs had been fighting the humans of Farholde over the Riverglades for years. Krom'rosh wanted the humans reminded that Rog'mar was still there. So I raided their farm and their training camps, and their feed went into Rog'mar's stewpot.\n\nThen there was the new problem. The Twilight's Hammer had burned the human village of Sunnyglade and settled into the ashes. Nobody had invited them.\n\nTran'gul wanted to know why they'd come. I brought back the shadowmancers' letters, Tran'gul read every word, and then wanted a miner, alive and talking.\n\nThe miner wasn't talking, at first. I can be very persuasive.\n\nBy the end of it Tran'gul was sure of one thing. The cult hadn't come to the Riverglades for a village. It had come to dig."] = "我替一个地精把货箱送上洛格玛。那儿的兽人为了河林跟法霍德的人类打了好多年，克罗姆罗什想提醒提醒那些人类，洛格玛还在这儿呢。于是我洗劫了他们的农场和训练营，他们的饲料进了洛格玛的汤锅。\n\n然后才是新麻烦。暮光之锤烧了人类的村子阳光林地，在灰烬里安了家。谁也没请他们来。\n\n特兰古尔想知道他们为什么来。我把暗影法师们的信带了回去，特兰古尔一字不落地读完，接着就要一个矿工，要活的，还得能开口。\n\n那矿工一开始不肯开口。我这人很有说服力。\n\n到最后，特兰古尔确定了一件事。这个教派来河林不是为了一座村子。它是来挖东西的。"
L["Under Sunnyglade the cult had caves, and in the caves it had ogres, and it was pouring void magic into them to see what happened. Mostly what happened was dead ogres. Now and then it was something a lot bigger and angrier.\n\nDown there I found Claire, an apprentice from Farholde Keep, trapped under the place Claire used to call home. Claire handed me a crystal catalyst to fill with the cult's magic, and I filled it, the hard way.\n\nThe one in charge down there was Chogg'Zac. Chogg'Zac had two heads. Claire wanted both. I brought back both.\n\nThen I carried the full catalyst up to Farholde and let the experts worry about what was in it."] = "阳光林地底下，教派有几个洞穴，洞穴里有食人魔，他们正往食人魔身上灌虚空魔法，看看会发生什么。大多数时候发生的是死食人魔。偶尔会冒出个大得多、也凶得多的东西。\n\n我在下面找到了克莱尔，法霍德要塞的一个学徒，被困在克莱尔以前叫作“家”的地方底下。克莱尔递给我一个水晶催化器，让我装满教派的魔法，我装满了，用的是笨办法。\n\n下面管事的是乔格扎克。乔格扎克有两个脑袋。克莱尔两个都要。我两个都带回来了。\n\n然后我把装满的催化器送上法霍德，让专家们去操心里面装的到底是什么。"
L["There's a cave under Sunnyglade, and down there I met Clubtoe. An ogre miner, looking for friends who'd gone missing. I helped look. What we found was the cult pouring void magic into ogres, making a few of them huge and wrong and killing a great many more.\n\nClubtoe took that about as well as you'd expect. We smashed their glowing circles and went for the one in charge, Chogg'Zac. One ogre, two heads.\n\nThat was it for Clubtoe and the Twilight's Hammer. Before heading off to join the ogres who'd already walked out on the cult, Clubtoe handed me one of the heads to carry home to Rog'mar.\n\nNice gesture. Heavy gesture."] = "阳光林地底下有个洞穴，我在那儿碰见了棍趾。一个食人魔矿工，在找失踪的朋友。我帮着一起找。我们找到的是教派在往食人魔身上灌虚空魔法，把其中几个弄得又大又不对劲，害死的却多得多。\n\n棍趾对此的反应，跟你想的差不多。我们砸了他们那些发光的法阵，直奔管事的乔格扎克而去。一个食人魔，两个脑袋。\n\n棍趾跟暮光之锤就此一刀两断。临走前，棍趾要去投奔那些早就离开教派的食人魔，把其中一个脑袋交给我，让我带回洛格玛。\n\n心意不错。心意挺沉。"
L["An ogre's head makes a fine introduction, so Tran'gul sent me north with one to Bolder'ok, where the ogres who quit the Twilight's Hammer live by one rule: whoever hits hardest is right.\n\nTheir leader, Clugfist, sized me up the only way an ogre knows. Smash the weaklings who crept back to the cult. Then get Clugfist's own weapon back off Klunk, the champion who ran off with it. I did both.\n\nClugfist allowed that the Horde might be stronger than expected. From an ogre, that's practically a love song.\n\nI carried the decree home: Bolder'ok and Rog'mar would be spilling blood together soon."] = "食人魔的脑袋是份很好的见面礼，所以特兰古尔让我带着一个往北去博尔德罗克，那些离开了暮光之锤的食人魔就住在那儿，只认一条规矩：谁打得最狠，谁就有理。\n\n他们的首领克鲁格菲斯特用食人魔唯一懂的办法掂量了我一番。先去揍那些偷偷溜回教派的软蛋。再从克朗克手里把克鲁格菲斯特自己的武器拿回来，那个勇士拿着它跑了。两件我都办了。\n\n克鲁格菲斯特承认，部落也许比预想的要强。从食人魔嘴里说出来，这差不多就是一首情歌了。\n\n我把这道法令带了回去：博尔德罗克和洛格玛很快就要并肩见血了。"
L["West of Sunnyglade the cult had built itself a fortress, the Twilight's Shroud, and a sergeant from Farholde had been holding the border in front of it with no word from home. Somebody had to turn up eventually. It was me.\n\nFive of Farholde's scouts were sitting in the cult's cages. I took keys off the cultists until I had enough and let them all out.\n\nThen I went looking for whoever was running the cult's whole campaign. Overlord Kilgar, deep in the Shroud. The sergeant asked for his head, so that's what I brought back.\n\nGood news for Farholde, for once."] = "教派在阳光林地西边给自己修了一座堡垒，叫暮光之帷，法霍德的一位中士一直在堡垒前面守着边界，家里一点消息都没有。早晚得有人来。来的是我。\n\n法霍德的五个斥候被关在教派的笼子里。我从教徒身上一把把地拿钥匙，凑够了数，把他们全放了出来。\n\n然后我去找那个统领教派整场行动的人。霸主基尔加，在暮光之帷深处。中士要他的脑袋，所以我就带回了他的脑袋。\n\n难得有一回，法霍德听到的是好消息。"
L["Da'grosh is the sort who doesn't wait for anybody. Da'grosh had charged the cult's new fortress, the Twilight's Shroud, and watched his warriors dragged off into cages. So we went back in, and I let five of Rog'mar's scouts out.\n\nThe better part was a cave nearby where the cult kept ogres digging for it. A Bolder'ok ogre and I talked five of those miners into turning on their masters. Their executioner didn't get talked into anything, so I took the executioner's mace home to Bolder'ok.\n\nLast came Overlord Kilgar, who ran the whole show. Da'grosh wanted his head. Da'grosh got it."] = "达格罗什是那种谁也不等的人。达格罗什冲了教派的新堡垒暮光之帷，眼睁睁看着自己的战士被拖进了笼子。于是我们又杀了回去，我把洛格玛的五个斥候放了出来。\n\n更精彩的是附近的一个洞穴，教派在那儿逼着食人魔替他们挖矿。我和一个博尔德罗克的食人魔一起，说动了五个矿工反抗他们的主子。他们的刽子手怎么说都不动心，所以我把刽子手的权杖带回了博尔德罗克。\n\n最后是霸主基尔加，整场戏都是他在主持。达格罗什要他的脑袋。达格罗什拿到了。"
L["Kilgar was dead and the cult kept coming anyway, which is the trouble with cults.\n\nAshe Amberhall at Farholde had an idea, and a soulstone. I called a thrall up out of one of the cult's conduits and caught it in the stone, and Ashe asked it questions until it gave up where they were coming from: a stronghold hidden in the mountains, Krol'dok.\n\nSo I went and had a look. I made sure the stronghold had no leader anymore, and came home with the Eye of Mugg to prove it. It's the sort of proof nobody argues with."] = "基尔加死了，可教派还是源源不断地来，这就是教派的麻烦。\n\n法霍德的艾什·安伯霍尔有个主意，还有一块灵魂石。我从教派的一个导管里召出一个奴仆，把它关进石头里，艾什一直问它问题，直到它交代出他们是从哪儿来的：一座藏在山里的要塞，克罗多克。\n\n于是我就去瞧了瞧。我确保那座要塞再也没有首领，然后带着穆格之眼回了家，当作证据。这种证据，没人会跟你争。"
L["With Kilgar dead you'd think the cult would take the hint. It didn't. Their trail led to a stronghold hidden in the mountains, Krol'dok, and Da'grosh was waiting outside it with a job for whoever went in.\n\nInside, I collected a token of vengeance. Fifteen cultists' ears. I counted twice.\n\nI came out with their tome as well, and the Eye of Mugg, so Rog'mar could see for itself that the stronghold's leader wouldn't be leading anything anymore."] = "基尔加都死了，你会以为教派该识趣了。它没有。他们的踪迹通向一座藏在山里的要塞，克罗多克，而达格罗什就等在要塞外面，手上有件差事要交给进去的人。\n\n进去以后，我收集了一份复仇的信物。十五个教徒的耳朵。我数了两遍。\n\n我出来的时候还带着他们的典籍，以及穆格之眼，好让洛格玛亲眼看看，那座要塞的首领再也领导不了什么了。"
L["Somewhere in Krol'dok, a blacksmith called Tunk had been carrying the mould for a key. Tunk didn't need it anymore. I took it back to Farholde Keep, where Alphonse Dumas called it rather crude, kept the embers hot, and sent me off for four pieces of thick leather and twelve iron bars. What came out of the forge was a key to Krol'dok's compound. Word is it opens a locked door deep inside, the short way to whoever waits at the back. I'm keeping it for next time."] = "在克罗多克的某个角落，有个叫吞克的铁匠，身上一直带着一副钥匙模具。吞克已经用不着它了。我把它带回法霍德要塞，阿尔方斯·杜马斯说它相当粗糙，让炉火一直烧着，然后打发我去弄四块厚皮和十二块铁锭。出炉的是一把克罗多克大门钥匙。听说它能打开要塞深处一扇上锁的门，是通往最里面那位的近路。我先留着，下回用。"
L["Somewhere in Krol'dok, a blacksmith called Tunk had been carrying the mould for a key. Tunk didn't need it anymore. I took it to Kreza Darkthorn at Rog'mar, who called it crude and worn, kept the embers hot, and sent me off for four pieces of thick leather and twelve iron bars. What came out of the forge was a key to Krol'dok's compound. Word is it opens a locked door deep inside, the short way to whoever waits at the back. I'm keeping it for next time."] = "在克罗多克的某个角落，有个叫吞克的铁匠，身上一直带着一副钥匙模具。吞克已经用不着它了。我把它带到洛格玛交给克雷扎·暗棘，克雷扎说它又粗糙又磨损，让炉火一直烧着，然后打发我去弄四块厚皮和十二块铁锭。出炉的是一把克罗多克大门钥匙。听说它能打开要塞深处一扇上锁的门，是通往最里面那位的近路。我先留着，下回用。"
L["Farholde had been writing to Stormwind for years, and Stormwind had been not writing back. So the knight commander tried a different sort of letter, and I carried the overlord's head to Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep. Hard to ignore a head.\n\nThen a field marshal's log came my way, and the man who wrote it was still out in the Twilight's Shroud. I found Marshal Ryan dying. He gave me his crest, a warning he never got to finish, and a name. Abigail.\n\nThe knight commander asked me to carry the crest to her in Cathedral Square, and not to expect company. Some faces aren't welcome at some doors, apparently.\n\nI didn't ask why. Some errands you just do."] = "法霍德这些年一直在给暴风城写信，暴风城一直没回。于是骑士指挥官换了一种写信的方式，让我把霸主的脑袋送去给暴风要塞里的伯瓦尔·弗塔根。一颗脑袋可不好装作没看见。\n\n后来一本元帅的日志落到了我手里，写它的人还在暮光之帷外面。我找到治安官瑞恩的时候，他已经快死了。他给了我他的纹章，一句没来得及说完的警告，还有一个名字。阿比盖尔。\n\n骑士指挥官让我把纹章送到教堂广场交给她，还说别指望有人陪我去。看来有些脸，在有些门口是不受欢迎的。\n\n我没问为什么。有些差事，做就是了。"
L["The Magram and the Gelkis have been feuding longer than anyone can remember, and each wanted me on their side. I'm not saying which one got me. Either way I ended up in the Valley of Bones, where skeletons were clawing up out of the ground. Not centaur skeletons, either.\n\nThe Magram looked at that and saw an army. Orgrul wanted bones to build it with, gently cursed, and wanted exactly four hundred and twenty-six of them. Somebody there can count. The Gelkis looked at the necromancers' robes, saw their own exiles, and wanted the curse broken.\n\nEither way, I ended up holding somebody else's staff and pointing it at the dead. What it did depended on who'd made it."] = "玛格拉姆和吉尔吉斯之间的仇，谁也记不清结了多久，两边都想拉我入伙。我不说我跟了哪边。反正不管怎样，我最后都到了白骨之谷，那儿的骷髅正从地里往外爬。而且还不是半人马的骷髅。\n\n玛格拉姆看着这一幕，看到的是一支军队。奥格鲁尔想要骨头来组建它，稍稍下点诅咒的那种，而且要的正好是四百二十六根。那边有人是会数数的。吉尔吉斯看着那些亡灵法师的长袍，认出了自己部族的流亡者，想把诅咒破掉。\n\n不管怎样，我最后都握着别人的法杖，对准了死人。它会发生什么，取决于是谁做的这根法杖。"
L["Ride with the Gelkis, and the khan of the Magram is the problem. With so many Magram tied up in the valley their village was nearly empty, and Khan Jehn died in his own home at the hands of outsiders working for the Gelkis.\n\nRide with the Magram, and the khan's death is the news waiting for you when you come back from the front. Orgrul didn't rage about it. Orgrul just handed the necromancy staff back to the Magram, and in a tent by the village lake, Khan Jehn got up again.\n\nWhich ride was mine, I'm keeping to myself. Either way, the khan had a worse week than I did."] = "跟着吉尔吉斯走，玛格拉姆的可汗就是那个麻烦。大量玛格拉姆都被拖在山谷里，他们的村子几乎空了，杰恩可汗就死在了自己家里，下手的是替吉尔吉斯办事的外人。\n\n跟着玛格拉姆走，可汗的死讯就是你从前线回来时等着你的消息。奥格鲁尔没有大发雷霆。奥格鲁尔只是把那根死灵法杖交还给玛格拉姆，于是在村边湖畔的一顶帐篷里，杰恩可汗又站了起来。\n\n我跟的是哪一路，我自己留着。不管怎样，可汗那一周都过得比我糟。"
L["In the woods past the centaur lines I found a crystal pylon, cracked and humming, and Mordent Evenshade, who wanted it fixed. Its missing pieces had been carried off as trophies to both centaur villages. I took them back. From both.\n\nThen I wandered the woods with a borrowed relic, scooping up loose mana and pouring it into the pylons, and right about the time they hummed properly, the sky changed. Mordent only got round to explaining afterward.\n\nThe temple's historian was still rattled that I'd carried that relic through haunted woods, but not too rattled to send me after a dying protector's crystal heart and point me at an unstable rift. Was there still enough mana here to make new guardians?\n\nI threw it. We found out."] = "在半人马战线外的树林里，我发现了一座水晶晶塔，裂了缝，嗡嗡作响，旁边是莫登特·暮影，想把它修好。它缺的那些部件被当成战利品带到了两个半人马村子里。我都拿回来了。两边都拿了。\n\n然后我带着一件借来的圣物在树林里转悠，把散落的魔力舀起来，倒进晶塔里，差不多就在它们嗡得正常了的时候，天变了。莫登特是事后才顾得上解释的。\n\n神殿的史官还在为我带着那件圣物穿过闹鬼的树林而心有余悸，不过还没吓到不敢派我去取一个垂死守护者的水晶之心，还给我指了一道不稳定的裂隙。这里剩下的魔力，还够不够造出新的守护者？\n\n我把它扔了进去。我们找到了答案。"
L["Mithera's garden had gone wild and mean, and the necklace that woke its treants was missing from its shrine. Her old friend Woodwyrd was still there, dead and still feeling the flames. I put Woodwyrd out with a vial of water from the depths of Maraudon, which is not a sentence I ever expected to say.\n\nThe thieves were quilboar. Kog'thug the Brave owned up to it, which was brave, I suppose, but the necklace was with Kog'thug's mate now, and the two of them weren't speaking. Peace took a bouquet from the very garden they'd robbed and the blood of Agamaggan from Razorfen Downs. Not Razorfen Kraul. Kog'thug made very sure I knew the difference.\n\nThe necklace went home with its magic spent. Still from her daughter, though."] = "米瑟拉的花园已经长得又野又凶，唤醒树人的那条项链也从神龛里不见了。她的老朋友伍德维德还在那儿，人已经死了，却还感受得到火焰。我用一瓶从玛拉顿深处取来的水把伍德维德身上的火浇灭了，这种话我从来没想过自己会说出口。\n\n小偷是野猪人。勇者科格萨格认了，这确实挺勇敢的吧，可项链现在在科格萨格的伴侣手里，而他们俩正在冷战。要讲和，得用一束从他们偷过的那座花园里采的花，外加剃刀高地的阿迦玛甘之血。不是剃刀沼泽。科格萨格非得让我把这两个地方分清楚不可。\n\n项链回家了，魔力已经耗尽。可它依然是她女儿送的。"
L["Coming of age in Thendal Grove mostly means the village finally hands you the chores it's been saving up. I did a lot of chores.\n\nThe good part came after. Somebody lent me better eyes for a look at the anchor pylon, the thing holding our whole island up in the sky, and Falorne Fallwind showed me how to read the leylines, the gift my line carries. Hard to explain. Like putting your ear to the ground and hearing the island hum.\n\nIt wasn't all humming. Al'Aketh converts were out by the standing stones, goading the wind sprites into a fury. First time I met the cult. Wouldn't be the last.\n\nFor my last trial, Aetheen of the Gales sent me into the ursera caves after the den mother. I came back with her head, and the grove let me go."] = "在森达尔林地成年，主要意味着村子终于把攒了好久的杂活一股脑儿交给你。我干了好多杂活。\n\n好的部分在后头。有人借给我一双更好的眼睛，让我去看看锚定晶塔，就是把我们整座岛托在天上的那个东西，法罗恩·秋风还教我读地脉，那是我的血脉带着的天赋。很难解释。就像把耳朵贴在地上，听见整座岛在嗡嗡作响。\n\n也不全是嗡嗡声。奥拉凯斯的皈依者跑到了巨石阵那边，在挑唆风灵发狂。那是我头一回碰上这个教派。不会是最后一回。\n\n我的最后一场试炼，是烈风之埃瑟恩派我进乌萨拉的洞穴去找那头巢母。我带着它的脑袋回来，林地就放我走了。"
L["Coming of age in Thendal Grove, you learn fast that the grown-ups have been saving chores for you. I'll skip the chores.\n\nWhat I remember is the sky. Ventaari Brightwish took me to the Elemental Convergence to use the skysight, the gift my line carries. You look up, and the sky looks back. That's the best I can do. Somebody lent me better eyes, too, for a look at the anchor pylon that keeps the whole island aloft. You don't think about that much, growing up. You do after.\n\nThen the winds by the standing stones went wild, and it turned out Al'Aketh converts were stirring the sprites up on purpose. My first brush with the cult.\n\nLast came my trial, in the ursera caves, after the den mother. I came back. She didn't."] = "在森达尔林地成年，你很快就会明白，大人们一直在给你攒杂活。杂活我就略过了。\n\n我记得的是天空。文塔里·明愿带我去了元素汇流处，去用天视，那是我的血脉带着的天赋。你抬头看天，天也回头看你。我只能形容到这个份上了。还有人借给我一双更好的眼睛，让我去看看那座把整座岛托在空中的锚定晶塔。小时候你不怎么想这种事。看过以后就会想了。\n\n然后巨石阵边上的风发了狂，原来是奥拉凯斯的皈依者在故意挑唆风灵。那是我头一回跟这个教派打交道。\n\n最后是我的试炼，在乌萨拉的洞穴里，去找那头巢母。我回来了。它没回来。"
L["On the road to Shen'dar Village I broke up a band of thugs that High Priestess Lorthuna had sent down from the Shrine of Akir. Good warm-up.\n\nIn Shen'dar the constable needed one look at me to know which order I belonged to, and sent me to my elder. Rathiril Sunlance of the High Order sat me down, told me how bad things were for the island, and then asked me to go and run the Windshapers off a place the High Order holds sacred. Which meant beating six of their novice seers.\n\nThat's the orders for you. Both love the island. They just can't stand each other.\n\nThe constable's own errand was refreshingly simple. A bandit called Badwind Bennic had a gang in the cave behind the waterfall. Had."] = "去申达尔村的路上，我收拾了一伙高阶女祭司洛苏娜从阿基尔神殿派下来的打手。热热身，挺好。\n\n在申达尔，治安官看我一眼就知道我是哪个教团的，把我打发去见我的长老。至高教团的拉西里尔·日矛让我坐下，跟我讲这座岛的处境有多糟，然后让我去把塑风者从一个至高教团视为圣地的地方赶走。也就是说，得打趴他们六个见习先知。\n\n两个教团就是这样。都爱这座岛。就是互相看不顺眼。\n\n治安官自己的差事倒是简单得让人神清气爽。有个叫“恶风”本尼克的土匪，在瀑布后头的山洞里拉了一帮人。曾经拉了一帮人。"
L["On the road to Shen'dar Village I broke up a band of thugs that High Priestess Lorthuna had sent down from the Shrine of Akir. Good warm-up.\n\nIn Shen'dar the constable read my lineage at a glance and sent me to my elder, Illaya Amberwind of the Windshapers. Illaya talked a long while about the island's plight. Then about the High Order, whose apprentices were all over a place the Windshapers hold sacred. That part was shorter, and it ended with me beating six of them.\n\nThat's the two orders for you. Both would give anything for the island. Neither would share a bench.\n\nAfter that, clearing bandits out of a cave behind the waterfall felt almost restful."] = "去申达尔村的路上，我收拾了一伙高阶女祭司洛苏娜从阿基尔神殿派下来的打手。热热身，挺好。\n\n在申达尔，治安官一眼就看出了我的血脉，把我打发去见我的长老，塑风者的伊拉娅·琥珀风。伊拉娅讲了好半天这座岛的困境。然后讲至高教团，说他们的学徒占满了一个塑风者视为圣地的地方。这部分讲得短一些，结尾是我去打趴了他们六个。\n\n两个教团就是这样。为了这座岛，两边什么都舍得。可谁也不肯跟对方坐一条板凳。\n\n之后，去瀑布后面的山洞里清理土匪，感觉简直是在休息。"
L["The cult had a missionary preaching in Shen'dar, and the constable was tired of it. So I joined up. Somebody put the Mark of Akir on me, and off I went to Falaath Village, one of the faithful.\n\nMissionary Jasaan preached contrition at me while living lightning strolled up and down the streets like it paid rent there. I nodded in all the right places. What I carried home was enough for the constable to strike first, and my second visit to Falaath went a lot worse for them.\n\nThen the cult hit the western watchtower, and I got there too late. Peacekeeper Vaaniel was dead. There was a bloody note, and among the things it sent me after was a family signet. A Shadowsong signet, for the High Elder in Valanaar.\n\nThe report was the easy part to deliver."] = "教派派了个传教士在申达尔布道，治安官早就烦透了。于是我入了伙。有人给我打上了阿基尔印记，我就以信徒的身份去了法拉斯村。\n\n传教士贾萨安对着我宣讲悔罪，而活生生的闪电就在街上溜达来溜达去，跟交了房租似的。该点头的地方我都点了头。我带回去的情报足够让治安官先下手，等我第二次去法拉斯的时候，他们的日子可就难过多了。\n\n后来教派袭击了西边的瞭望塔，我去晚了。维和者瓦尼尔已经死了。现场有一张沾血的字条，它让我去找的东西里，有一枚家族印戒。影歌家的印戒，要交给瓦拉纳尔的大长老。\n\n报告倒是最好交的那部分。"
L["The head of my order, the Supreme Magister, had a grand plan and a missing scholar. The scholar was Fillion Flamebreeze, and I found Fillion in a shriekling den, hurt. So I carried that scholar out past everything in there that wanted us both dead. Harder than it sounds. Later I went back in for the Shriekling Matriarch and brought Fillion her head.\n\nFillion's readings were the plan: a way to steer skycutter ships between Skywall and Azeroth. I gathered them again at the standing stones, right under the Windshapers' noses.\n\nThen the cult sent the High Order a box. Inside was Belathaan Brightwish's silvered tongue. I went out and evened the account, and after that the High Order pledged itself to the fight."] = "我所在教团的首领，至高魔导师，有一个宏伟的计划，还有一个失踪的学者。学者是菲利安·焰风，我在一个尖啸兽巢穴里找到了菲利安，受了伤。于是我带着这位学者往外走，一路上里面所有东西都想要我们俩的命。比听起来难多了。后来我又回去找尖啸兽女族长，把她的脑袋带给了菲利安。\n\n菲利安的测量数据就是那个计划：一种在天空之墙和艾泽拉斯之间驾驶破空船的方法。我在巨石阵那儿又重新测了一遍，就在塑风者的眼皮底下。\n\n然后教派给至高教团送来了一个盒子。里面是贝拉坦·明愿那条能说会道的银舌头。我出去把这笔账算平了，之后至高教团就宣誓投入了这场战斗。"
L["The head of my order, the Grand Skyseer, had a grand plan and a broken construct. Riaani Nightwind told me what it was missing: crystallized lightning, an enchanted gyrozephyr and an air construct core. Lovely words. I found the parts. I also found where they pointed, which was straight at the High Order. At Belathaan Brightwish, to be exact.\n\nI caught up with Belathaan on the road to the Shrine of Akir, and we had words. Firm ones.\n\nThen the cult answered in blood. Windshaper novices dead in the highlands. I went out to the lowlands and took ten charms off cultist corpses in return. Not even, but a start, and the Windshapers pledged themselves to the fight, High Order or no High Order."] = "我所在教团的首领，大观天者，有一个宏伟的计划，还有一个坏掉的构造体。里阿尼·夜风告诉我它缺什么：结晶闪电、一个附魔旋风仪和一颗空气构造体核心。名字都挺好听。零件我找到了。我还发现了它们指向谁：直指至高教团。准确地说，是贝拉坦·明愿。\n\n我在去阿基尔神殿的路上追上了贝拉坦，我们谈了谈。谈得很坚决。\n\n然后教派用血作了回应。塑风者的见习生死在了高地上。我去了低地，从教徒的尸体上拿了十枚护符作为回敬。还没扯平，但算个开头，塑风者也宣誓投入了这场战斗，不管至高教团来不来。"
L["The druids in Shadowgale Forest had gone quiet, and in a haunted forest, quiet is never good news.\n\nThe cult had ambushed their den. Elegael Thornpaw had come through it, barely, and knew who'd done it: Commander Haalien, one of their own circle, gone over to the Al'Aketh. I brought back Haalien's head. Tucked behind the bracer was a torn missive saying somebody in Valanaar was feeding the cult everything it knew.\n\nAfter that I took poultices into the den and went from druid to druid, patching up the ones who could still be patched.\n\nI took the missive home to Valanaar, and the names of the dead."] = "影风森林里的德鲁伊没了动静，而在一片闹鬼的森林里，没动静从来都不是好消息。\n\n教派伏击了他们的巢穴。艾勒盖尔·棘爪勉强挺了过来，知道是谁干的：指挥官哈利恩，他们自己圈子里的人，投靠了奥拉凯斯。我把哈利恩的脑袋带了回来。护腕后面塞着一封撕破的密信，说瓦拉纳尔有人把知道的一切都透露给了教派。\n\n之后我带着药膏进了巢穴，一个德鲁伊一个德鲁伊地看过去，把还能补的都补上了。\n\n我把密信带回了瓦拉纳尔，还有死者的名字。"
L["The cult went for the watchtowers next. At the eastern one the relief force was hanging on by its fingernails, so I went for the cult's healers first. Take away the healers and the brawlers get a lot less brave. Commander Belguilos, a peacekeeper who'd turned Breaker for the cult, went down after that, and so did the assault.\n\nBack in Valanaar the High Elder had a lead: a cultist who wanted out. I found the turncoat's hiding place, and the turncoat in it, already dead, with the assassins still hanging about. Ten fewer by the time I left. Under the body was a damaged blue crystal, still glowing.\n\nWhatever the High Elder got out of that crystal ended all talk of caution. We were going to the Shrine of Akir."] = "教派接下来盯上了瞭望塔。东边那座的援军已经快撑不住了，所以我先去收拾教派的治疗者。治疗者一没，那些打手的胆子就小多了。指挥官贝尔吉洛斯，一个替教派当了破坏者的维和者，随后也倒下了，那场进攻也跟着垮了。\n\n回到瓦拉纳尔，大长老有了条线索：有个教徒想脱身。我找到了那个叛徒的藏身处，叛徒也在里面，已经死了，刺客们还在附近转悠。等我离开的时候，他们少了十个。尸体底下有一块受损的蓝色水晶，还在发光。\n\n不管大长老从那块水晶里看出了什么，从那以后再没人提“谨慎”两个字。我们要去阿基尔神殿了。"
L["The peacekeepers and both orders marched on the Shrine of Akir together and cut a path to the inner sanctum. Empty. Lorthuna had gone up through a portal into the sky.\n\nSo up we went after her, and the help the orders had sent for arrived from Azeroth, the Kirin Tor and the Earthen Ring both. The high priestess was stopped. But the wards that hid Zephras from Al'Akir were down, and no island holds out against the Windlord in his own realm.\n\nSo the orders went down to Azeroth to look for a way to save it. The High Order took a skycutter to Dalaran, a portal took me on to Stormwind, and before long I was being introduced to the Alliance's leaders, one city at a time.\n\nNot bad for somebody who'd never stood on ground that didn't float."] = "维和者和两大教团一起向阿基尔神殿进军，杀出一条路，直通内殿。空的。洛苏娜已经穿过一道传送门上天去了。\n\n于是我们追了上去，两个教团请的援兵也从艾泽拉斯赶到了，肯瑞托和大地之环都来了。高阶女祭司被拦了下来。可是把泽风岛藏起来、不让奥拉基尔发现的那些结界已经倒了，在风王自己的国度里，没有哪座岛扛得住他。\n\n所以两个教团下到艾泽拉斯，去找救岛的办法。至高教团坐破空船去了达拉然，一道传送门又把我送到了暴风城，没过多久，我就被一座城一座城地引见给联盟的各位领袖。\n\n对一个从来没在不会飘的地面上站过的人来说，还不赖。"
L["Both orders and the peacekeepers, side by side for once, fought their way into the Shrine of Akir and found the inner sanctum empty. Lorthuna had slipped through a portal to the spires overhead.\n\nUp we went. Help came from Azeroth, the Earthen Ring and the Kirin Tor, and the high priestess was stopped. But the wards that hid Zephras from Al'Akir were down, and the island couldn't stand against the Windlord in his own realm.\n\nSo the Windshapers took a skycutter down to Mulgore to look for a way to save it, and I went on to Orgrimmar, where Thrall sent me round to meet the rest of the Horde.\n\nFirst time I'd stood on ground that wasn't floating. I kept checking."] = "两个教团和维和者难得并肩作战，一路杀进阿基尔神殿，结果发现内殿是空的。洛苏娜已经溜进一道传送门，去了头顶的尖塔上。\n\n我们追了上去。援兵从艾泽拉斯赶来，大地之环和肯瑞托都到了，高阶女祭司被拦了下来。可是把泽风岛藏起来、不让奥拉基尔发现的那些结界已经倒了，在风王自己的国度里，这座岛扛不住他。\n\n于是塑风者坐破空船下到莫高雷去找救岛的办法，我则继续前往奥格瑞玛，萨尔让我去见见部落的其他人。\n\n那是我头一回站在不会飘的地面上。我老是忍不住低头确认。"
L["So there's this apothecary in Brill. Johaan. Hums while he works. First day, he sends me out to kill dogs for their blood. Then murlocs for their scales, then spiders for their venom, and I'm thinking this had better be a soup.\n\nIt was not a soup. It was a drink, and the lucky guest was a dwarf they were keeping in the tavern cellar. I'll spare you that part. Johaan was thrilled. He wrote it all down, handed me his findings for Silverpine and told me to walk carefully.\n\nI walked very carefully."] = "布瑞尔有个药剂师，叫乔汉。干活的时候还哼着小曲。第一天，他就打发我出去杀狗取血。然后杀鱼人取鳞，杀蜘蛛取毒，我心想，这最好是在熬汤。\n\n不是汤。是一种饮料，而那位幸运的客人是个矮人，被他们关在旅店的地窖里。那部分我就不细说了。乔汉高兴坏了。他把一切都记了下来，把研究成果交给我带去银松森林，叮嘱我路上小心。\n\n我走得非常小心。"
L["Silverpine is where Johaan's work goes to grow up. Renferrel at the Sepulcher wanted bear hearts and spider blood, which by then felt like ordinary shopping, and I hauled the lot down to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity. He looked at it the way most people look at cake.\n\nTurns out somebody had tried this recipe before. A fellow called Berard, whose journal was still lying around in Pyrewood Village. Lovely place. Do not stay the night. I got the journal out, and then Faranell wanted moss off the things in Lake Lordamere and a hardened tumor, and I stopped asking what any of it was for.\n\nThat's the trick with apothecaries. The less you ask, the better you sleep."] = "银松森林是乔汉的研究长大成人的地方。瑟伯切尔的伦弗利尔要熊心和蜘蛛血，到那时候我已经觉得这跟平常买菜差不多了，我把这些东西一股脑儿拖到幽暗城，交给大药剂师法拉尼尔。他看着它们的眼神，就像大多数人看着蛋糕。\n\n原来以前有人试过这个配方。一个叫贝拉德的家伙，他的日记还扔在焚木村里。好地方。千万别在那儿过夜。我把日记弄了出来，然后法拉尼尔又要洛丹米尔湖里那些东西身上的苔藓，还有一颗硬化的肿瘤，从那以后我就不再问这些东西是干什么用的了。\n\n跟药剂师打交道的诀窍就在这儿。问得越少，睡得越香。"
L["Apothecary Lydon runs things in Tarren Mill, and Lydon likes to test his work on whoever's handy. I brought him bear tongues and creeper ichor, he cooked up the Elixir of Suffering, and then he handed it back to me. Not to drink. For Umpi, the poor beast he keeps in his room. Umpi did not enjoy it.\n\nNext came mountain lion blood for the Elixir of Pain, and that one was for Stanley. Stanley lived on a farm down in Hillsbrad Fields and was, until I came along, a very good dog. One sip and he was something else entirely, and we had words, and I won.\n\nLydon was delighted. Lydon is always delighted."] = "药剂师林度恩管着塔伦米尔，林度恩喜欢拿手边随便什么人来测试他的成果。我给他带来了熊舌头和食苔蛛的毒液，他熬出了受难药剂，然后又把它递回给我。不是让我喝。是给乌比，他养在房间里的那头可怜的野兽。乌比可不喜欢。\n\n接下来是用山狮的血做痛苦药剂，那一份是给斯坦利的。斯坦利住在希尔斯布莱德农场，在我出现之前，它一直是条非常好的狗。喝了一口，它就彻底变成了另一种东西，我们“理论”了一番，我赢了。\n\n林度恩高兴极了。林度恩永远高兴。"
L["The Elixir of Agony was Lydon's masterpiece, and it took half of Hillsbrad to make. Mudsnout blossoms. A trip down to Faranell so he could add his own little touch. Troll's blood, scales off the naga on the coast, eyes off the murlocs. And then the secret ingredient: beer. A keg of Shindigger Stout from Dun Garok.\n\nLydon had some farmers locked upstairs at the inn, and the farmers, he figured, would drink anything. He tainted the keg and I carried it up and set it on their rug, friendly as you like.\n\nThen I went downstairs and had a drink of my own. Not from that keg."] = "苦楚药剂是林度恩的杰作，做它得跑遍半个希尔斯布莱德。泥鼻花。还得下一趟幽暗城找法拉尼尔，让他加上一点自己的小手笔。巨魔的血，海岸边纳迦身上的鳞片，鱼人的眼睛。然后是秘密配方：啤酒。一桶来自丹加洛克的欢宴黑啤酒。\n\n林度恩在旅店楼上关了几个农民，照他的估计，那些农民什么都肯喝。他往酒桶里下了料，我扛上楼，放在他们的地毯上，要多友好有多友好。\n\n然后我下楼给自己也来了一杯。不是那桶里的。"
L["Next job for the Society was back home in the Apothecarium, for a fellow named Theodore Griffs. He'd heard about a spider up in the ruins over the city, Witherfang, whose venom eats right through dead flesh. In the Undercity that's not a rumor. That's a job offer.\n\nSo into the Ruins of Lordaeron we went, a few of us, because nobody sane goes in there alone. Witherfang was big and quick and not at all happy to see us. We brought Griffs his Highly Toxic Strain anyway, and he held the vial up to the light like a jeweler.\n\nEverything else I'd fetched them was for killing the living. That one was for the dead. I went up for some air after that, which in the Undercity takes a while."] = "我给协会干的下一份活儿，是回到老家的炼金房，替一个叫萨多雷·格雷夫的家伙办事。他听说城上面的废墟里有只蜘蛛，叫枯牙，它的毒液能直接把死肉蚀穿。在幽暗城，这可不是什么传闻。这是一份工作邀约。\n\n于是我们几个人进了洛丹伦废墟，因为脑子正常的人不会一个人进去。枯牙又大又快，见到我们一点都不高兴。我们还是把剧毒菌株带给了格雷夫，他把药瓶举到光下端详，活像个珠宝匠。\n\n我之前给他们取的所有东西，都是用来杀活人的。这一样是对付死人的。那之后我上去透了透气，在幽暗城，这得走好一会儿。"
L["The Agamands owned the mills north of Brill, back when they were alive. They're still there. They just don't run the place anymore.\n\nThe deathguard wanted the grounds cleared, and Coleman Farthing wanted something more personal: the family. Devlin Agamand haunts those mills, and Coleman wanted Devlin's remains, and then the remains of the rest of them, one after another. The whole family, one sack at a time.\n\nColeman had wanted proof of what became of the Agamands. I brought back most of the Agamands. That seemed to settle the question."] = "阿加曼德家族还活着的时候，布瑞尔北边的磨坊是他们的。他们现在还在那儿。只是不再管事了。\n\n亡灵卫兵想把那片地方清干净，而库勒曼·法席恩想要的东西更私人一点：这家人本身。德夫林·阿加曼德在那些磨坊里游荡，库勒曼想要德夫林的遗骸，然后是其他人的遗骸，一个接一个。整个家族，一袋一袋地装。\n\n库勒曼想要阿加曼德一家下落的证据。我把阿加曼德一家的大部分都带回来了。这问题看来是解决了。"
L["Somewhere in the middle of it I came across a letter one of the Agamands had written and never got round to delivering. So I delivered it. Late, admittedly. The post in Tirisfal has never been quick."] = "中途我碰到了一封信，是阿加曼德家某个人写好了却一直没来得及寄出去的。于是我把它送到了。是晚了点，我承认。提瑞斯法的邮差从来就不快。"
L["Coleman sent me on to Magistrate Sevren, and Sevren had heard things about the crypt under the mills. Turns out the Agamands I'd already met weren't the only Agamands. There were older ones down in the dark, generations of them, and not one of them was resting.\n\nSo down I went. Wailing ancestors and rotting ancestors, and the wailing ones are worse. Take my word for it. A rotting ancestor goes down easily enough, but a wailing one stays in your ears for days.\n\nAt the back of it all was Captain Dargol. I brought the captain's skull back to Sevren, and that was the end of the Agamand family's trouble, as far as Brill was concerned. One grave at a time, every one of them left quieter than I found it."] = "库勒曼又把我打发去见执政官塞弗伦，塞弗伦听说了磨坊底下那座墓穴的一些事。原来我见过的那些阿加曼德，还不是全部的阿加曼德。黑暗里还有更老的，好几代人，没有一个在安息。\n\n于是我下去了。哀嚎的祖先和腐烂的祖先，哀嚎的那种更糟。信我一句。腐烂的祖先一打就倒，可哀嚎的那种，会在你耳朵里待上好几天。\n\n最里头是达高尔队长。我把队长的头骨带回去交给了塞弗伦，就布瑞尔而言，阿加曼德家族的麻烦到此为止。一座坟接一座坟，每一座都比我来之前安静了。"
L["Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze in Auberdine had a scout who'd gone quiet up the coast, near an old tower called Althalaxx. Would I go and look? I went and looked.\n\nThe scout, Balthule Shadowstrike, was fine. Keeping an eye on the tower from a safe distance, which was wise, because the tower was full of warlocks. The Cult of the Dark Strand, they call themselves. Anyone who picks a name like that is hoping you'll ask about it, so I didn't. I took their papers instead. Four worn parchments, which their owners had no more use for.\n\nBalthule didn't like what was written on them. Not one bit. A letter went off to Delgren the Purifier in Ashenvale, and I went with it. Whatever the cult was up to, the tower was only the part you could see from the beach."] = "奥伯丁的哨兵艾莉萨·星风有个斥候，在海岸北边一座叫奥萨拉克斯的古塔附近没了音讯。我愿不愿意去看看？我去看了。\n\n那个斥候，巴苏尔·影击，好好的。正从安全距离外盯着那座塔，这很明智，因为塔里全是术士。他们自称黑暗之链教派。起这种名字的人，就盼着你开口问，所以我没问。我拿走了他们的文件。四张破旧的羊皮纸，反正它们的主人也用不上了。\n\n巴苏尔不喜欢上面写的东西。一点都不喜欢。一封信送去了灰谷的净化者德尔格伦那儿，我也跟着去了。不管那个教派在搞什么，那座塔都只是你在海滩上能看到的那一部分。"
L["Delgren the Purifier keeps watch at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale, and Delgren read the letter and handed me a list. Soul gems, a tome somebody didn't want to part with, the usual cult leftovers.\n\nThe odd one out was the Highborne. There were souls trapped in Night Run and in Satyrnaar, bound up and waiting for somebody to come along and cut them loose. So I cut them loose. I can't tell you what a Highborne soul does with its freedom, but they didn't hang about to discuss it.\n\nEvery piece I brought back, Delgren said, weakened whatever was holding court at the top of Althalaxx. When there was nothing left to bring, it was back up to Darkshore to tell the scout the time had come."] = "净化者德尔格伦在灰谷的迈斯特拉岗哨守着，德尔格伦读完信，递给我一张清单。灵魂宝石，一本某人不舍得交出来的典籍，都是教派常见的剩货。\n\n特别的是那些上层精灵。夜道谷和萨提纳尔里困着他们的灵魂，被束缚着，等人来给他们松绑。于是我给他们松了绑。我说不上来上层精灵的灵魂拿到自由以后会干什么，反正它们没留下来跟我讨论。\n\n德尔格伦说，我带回来的每一样东西，都会削弱奥萨拉克斯塔顶上坐镇的那个东西。等到没什么可带的了，就该回黑海岸，告诉那个斥候时候到了。"
L["The Tower of Althalaxx has a great many stairs and a warlock on most of them. Balthule's orders were short: Athrikus Narassin, top of the tower, bring back the head.\n\nSo I took the stairs one at a time and the warlocks the same way. At the top was Narassin, the one who'd gathered the whole Dark Strand there in the first place. All my running about in Ashenvale had taken the edge off whatever power was behind him. There was enough edge left to keep things lively.\n\nI came down with the head and gave it to Balthule, and Balthule sent me straight back to Ashenvale to tell Delgren. That's how it works in those woods, I've learned. Nothing is really finished until somebody in another forest has heard about it."] = "奥萨拉克斯之塔有很多很多级台阶，大部分台阶上都站着一个术士。巴苏尔的命令很简短：埃瑟里克斯·纳拉辛，塔顶，把脑袋带回来。\n\n于是我一级一级地爬台阶，术士也一个一个地收拾。塔顶上就是纳拉辛，当初把整个黑暗之链召集到那儿的就是他。我在灰谷跑来跑去，已经把他背后那股力量削掉了不少锋芒。剩下的锋芒，也足够让场面热闹了。\n\n我带着脑袋下来交给巴苏尔，巴苏尔又直接把我打发回灰谷去告诉德尔格伦。我算是明白了，那片林子里就是这么办事的。一件事，非得等另一片森林里的人也听说了，才算真正办完。"
L["Arugal is the reason Silverpine has worgen. Dalar Dawnweaver, down at the Sepulcher, wanted proof the curse was still at work. I could have saved us both some time. Stand in that forest after dark for a minute. That's your proof.\n\nDalar wanted it done properly, though, and properly mostly meant shackles. Shackles off the gluttons, shackles off the darksouls, shackles out of Pyrewood, until I could have opened a smithy. Somewhere along the way there was a thing called the Remedy of Arugal. Judging by the forest, it remedied nothing. And there was Grimson the Pale, whose head I brought back. Paler, by then.\n\nDalar took all of it and looked pleased, in a grim sort of way. Grim is about as pleased as anyone gets in Silverpine."] = "阿鲁高就是银松森林有狼人的原因。瑟伯切尔的达拉尔·道恩维沃尔想要证据，证明诅咒还在起作用。我本来可以替我们俩省点时间。天黑以后在那片森林里站一分钟。这就是证据。\n\n不过达拉尔想按规矩来，而规矩主要就是镣铐。从暴食者身上拿镣铐，从黑魂身上拿镣铐，从焚木村拿镣铐，多到我都能开个铁匠铺了。半路上还有个东西叫阿鲁高的解药。看看那片森林就知道，它什么都没解。还有苍白的格雷姆森，我把他的脑袋带了回来。到那时候，他更苍白了。\n\n达拉尔全都收下了，看上去挺满意，那种阴沉沉的满意。在银松森林，阴沉就已经是人最满意的样子了。"
L["Shadow Priest Allister had a different worry: Dalaran. A band of their wizards had settled in at Ambermill, and they had crates moving along the road north of Pyrewood. I helped myself to one. Inside was a pendant scratched all over with runes.\n\nDalar Dawnweaver had a look and decided the wizards were digging into old magic under Silverpine. The kind Dalaran gets very excited about and everybody else comes to regret. Allister wanted more of those pendants, which meant a good few wizards who no longer needed them.\n\nAt the top of it all was the Weaver, Archmage Ataeric. I took his staff off him the direct way and handed it to Allister. Very nice staff. It seemed a shame to hand it over."] = "暗影牧师奥利斯特担心的是另一件事：达拉然。他们的一帮巫师在安伯米尔驻扎了下来，还有箱子沿着焚木村北边的路运来运去。我顺手拿了一箱。里面是一个刻满了符文的坠饰。\n\n达拉尔·道恩维沃尔看了看，断定那些巫师是在挖银松森林底下的古老魔法。就是那种达拉然兴奋得不得了、而其他人事后都会后悔的东西。奥利斯特想要更多这种坠饰，这就意味着得有不少巫师从此用不上它们了。\n\n坐在最顶上的是编织者，大法师埃塔瑞克。我用最直接的办法把他的法杖拿了过来，交给了奥利斯特。非常好的一根法杖。交出去还真有点可惜。"
L["Everything in Silverpine ends up pointing at Shadowfang Keep sooner or later, so I stopped arguing and went in.\n\nEverybody wanted something out of there. The High Executor wanted to know what had become of two missing deathstalkers. A keeper in the Apothecarium wanted a book called the Book of Ur. And Dalar Dawnweaver wanted Arugal's head. Just the head. Dalar was very clear on that.\n\nI found the deathstalkers. Only one of them was in any shape to talk. I found the book. And I found Arugal at the top of his keep, with worgen at every turn on the way up, and he made me work for every step.\n\nThe book went to the Undercity and the head went to the Sepulcher. That's about as tidy as Silverpine ever gets."] = "银松森林里的一切，迟早都会指向影牙城堡，所以我不再争了，直接进去。\n\n每个人都想从那儿弄点东西出来。高级执行官想知道两个失踪的亡灵哨兵怎么样了。炼金房的一位管理员想要一本叫《乌尔之书》的书。达拉尔·道恩维沃尔想要阿鲁高的脑袋。只要脑袋。达拉尔说得非常清楚。\n\n我找到了亡灵哨兵。只有一个还能说话。我找到了那本书。我还在城堡顶上找到了阿鲁高，上去的路上每个拐角都有狼人，他让我每一步都走得不轻松。\n\n书送到了幽暗城，脑袋送到了瑟伯切尔。在银松森林，这已经算是最利落的结局了。"
L["High Executor Darthalia runs Tarren Mill like a war room, because it is one. Down in Hillsbrad the humans were still farming and trading as if the Forsaken weren't sitting up the hill, and Darthalia meant to correct that.\n\nFirst orders were the northern farms, with a couple of farmers named outright. Darthalia likes names on a list. After that, the peasants. Grim work. It got done.\n\nThat was the opening move. Darthalia already had the next one picked out."] = "高级执行官达萨利亚把塔伦米尔当作战室来管，因为它本来就是。山下的希尔斯布莱德，人类照样种地做买卖，好像被遗忘者没坐在山上似的，而达萨利亚打算纠正这一点。\n\n第一道命令是北边的农场，还点名要了几个农夫。达萨利亚喜欢清单上写着名字。之后是那些农民。活儿很阴沉。但办完了。\n\n这只是开局的一步。下一步，达萨利亚早就挑好了。"
L["Deathguard Samsa had a sideline going too: thirty human skulls. Thirty. Samsa didn't explain, and in Tarren Mill you learn quickly which questions aren't worth the answer."] = "亡灵卫兵沙穆萨还有个副业：三十个人类头骨。三十个。沙穆萨没解释，而在塔伦米尔，你很快就会明白哪些问题不值得听答案。"
L["After the farms, the town. Darthalia took Hillsbrad apart like a clock: the smithy, the town hall, the mine. I walked out of the town hall with the registry under my arm and the proclamation destroyed behind me. Hard to run a town without a smith, a council or its paperwork."] = "农场之后是镇子。达萨利亚像拆钟表一样把希尔斯布莱德拆开了：铁匠铺、镇公所、矿洞。我从镇公所出来的时候，胳膊底下夹着户籍册，身后的公告也已经毁了。没有铁匠、没有议会、没有文书，镇子可就很难转下去了。"
L["The best bit, though, was the wanted poster outside the inn in Tarren Mill. Four names on it: a clerk, a citizen, a miner and a farmer, every one of them marked dangerous. A farmer, I can see. A miner, sure. But I'd have paid good money to see the clerk be dangerous."] = "不过最精彩的，是塔伦米尔旅店外面那张通缉令。上面四个名字：一个书记员、一个市民、一个矿工和一个农夫，每一个都标着“危险”。农夫，我能理解。矿工，也行。可那个书记员要怎么个危险法，我愿意花大价钱看看。"
L["Dun Garok is a dwarven fort down in the south of the foothills, and it was the last thing standing between Darthalia and a finished campaign. Ten mountaineers, eight riflemen, four priests and Captain Ironhill. The riflemen were the worst of it. Dwarves can shoot, and they've had a lot of practice.\n\nOnce Ironhill fell, Darthalia sealed up a commendation and sent me down to the Undercity to hand it to Varimathras. My own praise, sealed, and not for my eyes. I carried it the whole way without peeking and handed it over with a perfectly straight face.\n\nI like to think it was flattering. I'll never know. That's the trouble with sealed letters. They're all about you, and none of them are for you."] = "丹加洛克是丘陵南边的一座矮人要塞，也是达萨利亚这场战役收尾前的最后一道障碍。十个山地人，八个火枪手，四个牧师，外加达伦·铁山上尉。火枪手最难对付。矮人会打枪，而且练得够多。\n\n铁山一倒，达萨利亚就封好一份嘉奖令，派我下到幽暗城交给瓦里玛萨斯。夸我自己的话，封着，不许我看。我一路上一眼都没偷看，交出去的时候脸上一本正经。\n\n我愿意相信上面写的都是好话。我永远不会知道了。封着的信就是这点麻烦。写的全是你，却没有一封是给你看的。"
L["You'd be amazed what pirates leave lying around. Aboard one of the Bloodsail ships off Stranglethorn's Wild Shore, I came across a little scroll with a riddle on it. Cortello's, it said. No idea who Cortello was. Still haven't.\n\nNow, I know better than to trust verse I find on a pirate ship. But nobody writes a riddle about nothing. There's always something at the bottom of it worth hiding, and I had time on my hands.\n\nI worked it out, more or less, and it sent me all the way to the Swamp of Sorrows, to the first wooden bridge west of Stonard. Under the bridge, in the muck, another scroll. Soggy, of course. It had been living under a bridge in a swamp. I'd be soggy too."] = "你会惊讶海盗们会把什么东西随手乱扔。在荆棘谷蛮荒海岸外的一艘血帆海盗船上，我发现了一小卷写着谜语的纸。上面说是科泰罗的。科泰罗是谁，我不知道。现在也不知道。\n\n我当然知道，在海盗船上捡到的诗不能信。可没人会为了什么都没有写一个谜语。谜底下总藏着值得藏的东西，而我正好闲着。\n\n我差不多解开了，它把我一路打发到悲伤沼泽，斯通纳德西边的第一座木桥。桥底下的烂泥里，又有一卷纸。当然是湿透的。它在沼泽里的桥底下住了那么久。换我我也湿透。"
L["The soggy scroll had another riddle on it, which by then I'd come to expect, and this one wanted me in Dustwallow Marsh. Over the sea. For a bit of paper. I did wonder on the boat what I was doing with myself.\n\nBloodfen Burrow is raptor country, and the Bloodfen raptors are not shy. They treat anybody poking around their home as dinner that's had the decency to walk in. I'll give Cortello this much: nobody was going to stumble on that hiding place by accident.\n\nDown among the raptors, sure enough, there was another scrap. Musty, this one, like it had been waiting a long time for somebody stubborn enough to turn up. I'm very stubborn about treasure."] = "那卷湿纸上又是一个谜语，到那时候我已经见怪不怪了，这回它要我去尘泥沼泽。跨海。为了一张纸。在船上我确实琢磨过自己到底在干什么。\n\n鲜血沼泽墓穴是迅猛龙的地盘，鲜血沼泽的迅猛龙可一点都不怕生。谁在它们家附近乱翻，它们就把谁当成一顿自觉走上门来的晚饭。我得替科泰罗说句话：没人会误打误撞发现那个藏东西的地方。\n\n果然，在迅猛龙中间又有一张纸片。这张发霉了，像是等了很久，就等一个够倔的人出现。说到宝藏，我倔得很。"
L["The musty scroll was the last of them, and it pointed at the Hinterlands, at the great waterfall on the eastern coast. By then I'd boarded a pirate ship, crawled under a bridge and walked into a raptor den on the strength of a stranger's handwriting. You'd think I'd have learned something. I had not.\n\nUnder the falls, there it was: Cortello's treasure. An actual chest, the kind you hope for as a child and stop believing in once you're grown.\n\nI won't tell you what was in it. Not because it was disappointing. Because I've told this story enough times to know that once you say what's in the chest, everyone stops listening. Cortello paid well for the trouble. Leave it at that."] = "发霉的那卷是最后一卷，它指向辛特兰，东海岸的大瀑布。到那时候，我已经凭着一个陌生人的笔迹，登过海盗船，钻过桥底，还走进了迅猛龙的窝。你以为我总该学到点什么了吧。并没有。\n\n瀑布底下，它就在那儿：科泰罗的宝藏。一个货真价实的箱子，就是你小时候盼着、长大了就不再相信的那种。\n\n箱子里有什么，我不告诉你。不是因为让人失望。是因为这个故事我讲过太多遍了，我知道只要一说出箱子里装着什么，大家就都不听了。科泰罗为这番折腾付的报酬挺丰厚。就说到这儿吧。"
L["Marlene Redpath asked me to look in on her niece, Pamela, in Darrowshire. Darrowshire's over in the Eastern Plaguelands, and nobody has lived there in a long time. I went anyway.\n\nPamela was there. A little girl at her old home in the ruins, waiting for her family to come back and very worried about her doll. She was also a ghost. She didn't bring it up, so neither did I.\n\nThe doll had come apart, and the pieces were scattered about the town. I picked through Darrowshire until I had the lot, and for a minute there, with Pamela hugging that doll, I almost forgot where we were standing.\n\nThen she asked me to go and see her Auntie Marlene, and I started to understand how long she'd been waiting."] = "玛莱恩·雷德帕斯请我去达隆郡看看她的侄女帕米拉。达隆郡在东瘟疫之地，那儿已经很久没人住了。我还是去了。\n\n帕米拉在那儿。一个小女孩，待在废墟里自己的老家，等着家人回来，非常担心她的洋娃娃。她也是个鬼魂。她没提，我也就没提。\n\n洋娃娃散架了，碎片撒得满镇都是。我把达隆郡翻了个遍，直到凑齐了，有那么一会儿，看着帕米拉抱着那个娃娃，我差点忘了我们站在什么地方。\n\n然后她让我去看看她的玛莱恩姑妈，我这才开始明白，她已经等了多久。"
L["Pamela's aunt had a job waiting for me: a wedding ring, for a historian who'd been asking around about Darrowshire.\n\nThe historian was Chromie. A gnome, cheerful, and a little too well informed about things that hadn't happened yet. Chromie wanted the Annals of Darrowshire, an old history of the town that took some finding, and once she had it she added to it. Extended, she called it. I didn't ask where the extra pages came from. I'm not sure I'd have liked the answer.\n\nThe extended version went to Pamela's uncle, Carlin Redpath, at Light's Hope Chapel."] = "帕米拉的姑妈给我准备了一份活儿：一枚结婚戒指，交给一个一直在打听达隆郡的历史学家。\n\n那位历史学家是克罗米。一个侏儒，乐呵呵的，对还没发生的事知道得有点太多了。克罗米想要《达隆郡的历史》，一本讲这座镇子的古老史书，费了好大劲才找到，她一拿到手就往里添东西。她管这叫“增订”。我没问多出来的那几页是从哪儿来的。我不确定我会喜欢那个答案。\n\n增订版送到了圣光之愿礼拜堂，交给帕米拉的叔叔卡林·雷德帕斯。"
L["Carlin wanted Darrowshire's old defenders freed from that town, and I freed fifteen of them. The dead of Darrowshire have waited long enough for everything."] = "卡林想让达隆郡当年的守卫者从那座镇子里解脱，我解脱了十五个。达隆郡的死者，什么都已经等得够久了。"
L["Carlin Redpath had the annals now, and Carlin wanted the last battle of Darrowshire put right. Putting it right, it turned out, takes a great many relics off the dead.\n\nA villain's skull and another villain's broken sword. A hero's libram, and the shield of Pamela's father. And five skulls that resonated, which meant sorting through a great many skulls that didn't. Most skulls, it turns out, have nothing to say.\n\nWhen it was all gathered, Carlin wrapped the lot in one bundle and sent me back to Chromie with it. Every hero and villain of that night, packed into one sack on my back. It was heavier than it looked."] = "卡林·雷德帕斯现在有了那本史书，卡林想把达隆郡的最后一战扳回来。结果，要扳回来，得从死人身上拿一大堆遗物。\n\n一个恶棍的头骨，另一个恶棍的断剑。一位英雄的圣契，还有帕米拉父亲的盾牌。外加五个会共鸣的头骨，这意味着得在一大堆不会共鸣的头骨里挑。原来大多数头骨都没什么可说的。\n\n等全都凑齐了，卡林把它们打成一个包，让我带回去交给克罗米。那一夜所有的英雄和恶棍，全塞在我背上的一个袋子里。比看上去沉。"
L["Chromie sent me back to Darrowshire with the bundle. I set it down in the town square, and the night Darrowshire fell started again all around me. The dead got up. Both sides.\n\nMy job was to keep the right people standing long enough, and mostly that meant Captain Redpath, Pamela's father, who had to hold on until his own corrupted self came to meet him. Then it did. I put it down, and the captain's spirit came walking into the square, himself again.\n\nAfter that I went to see Pamela at her home. For once, somebody had good news for her: her father had come home.\n\nShe gave me the key to his old chest by way of thanks. There was treasure in it. Some stories end well, and I'm not about to argue."] = "克罗米让我带着那个包回到达隆郡。我把它放在镇广场上，达隆郡陷落的那一夜就在我周围重新开始了。死人都站了起来。两边的都是。\n\n我的任务是让对的人站得够久，主要就是雷德帕斯队长，帕米拉的父亲，他得撑到他自己那个被腐化的分身来找他。它来了。我把它放倒了，队长的灵魂走进了广场，又变回了他自己。\n\n之后我去帕米拉家看她。难得有一回，有人给她带来了好消息：她的父亲回家了。\n\n她给了我他那只旧箱子的钥匙作为谢礼。里面有宝贝。有些故事就是有个好结局，我可不打算跟它争。"
L["Northshire was supposed to be the quiet part. I'd barely found the abbey before the deputy had me pulling red bandanas off thieves, and every thief had a friend. In the vineyards, across the river, out at the logging camp: same masks, same red. Apparently they have a dress code.\n\nThe best of it was the Collector. A schedule turned up with that name on it, and Marshal Dughan read it and sent me hunting. A thief who goes by the Collector is asking for a certain kind of visitor. The Collector had a ring, and the Collector had my full attention, and only one of those two made it through the day.\n\nThat's a lot of matching masks for a few bandits. Bandits don't coordinate."] = "北郡本该是最清静的地方。我刚找到修道院，副官就让我去从盗贼身上扒红头巾，而每个盗贼都有朋友。葡萄园里、河对岸、伐木营地：一样的面罩，一样的红。看来他们有着装规定。\n\n最精彩的是收货人。翻出来一张日程表，上面写着这个名字，治安官杜汉读完就派我去追。一个自称“收货人”的贼，就是在招呼某一类访客上门。收货人有一枚戒指，收货人也得到了我全部的注意力，这两样里只有一样活过了那一天。\n\n就几个土匪而言，一模一样的面罩也太多了点。土匪可不会互相配合。"
L["Gryan Stoutmantle counts in fifteens. Fifteen trappers, fifteen smugglers, fifteen pillagers, fifteen looters, fifteen highwaymen, and a few extra so I wouldn't get bored. For a while there, the People's Militia was mostly me.\n\nBest errand of the lot was a note. Gryan sent me to Lakeshire to see someone called Wiley the Black, and Wiley gave me a note. I carried it back to Westfall. Gryan had me carry it on to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind. Shaw had me carry his report back to Westfall. Three zones and four trips for some paper, and nobody once thought to hire a courier. I was the courier.\n\nStill, Shaw's report gave Gryan a name to put to all those masks. That changes a fight."] = "格里安·斯托曼是按十五个十五个来数的。十五个设陷者，十五个走私者，十五个掠夺者，十五个抢劫者，十五个拦路贼，再额外加几个，免得我无聊。有那么一阵子，人民军基本上就是我一个人。\n\n最棒的差事是一张字条。格里安派我去湖畔镇见一个叫黑衣威利的人，威利给了我一张字条。我把它带回了西部荒野。格里安又让我把它带去暴风城交给马迪亚斯·肖尔。肖尔又让我把他的报告带回西部荒野。三个地区，四趟路，就为了几张纸，而且一次都没人想到要雇个信使。我就是那个信使。\n\n不过，肖尔的报告让格里安终于能给那些面罩安上一个名字了。这一下，仗就不一样打了。"
L["A name's a fine thing, but Gryan wanted an address. So I watched the roads south of Moonbrook until a Defias messenger came strolling along with a letter, and we settled the question of who'd be delivering it. Me. To Gryan.\n\nWhat really helped was the Defias Traitor, who turned up at Sentinel Hill ready to show us where the rest of them were hiding. All it took was walking a turncoat down to Moonbrook alive, and the road to Moonbrook is not a friendly road. I kept the Traitor breathing right up to the hole in the ground they'd been using for a front door.\n\nThe old mine. Of course it was the mine."] = "有了名字是好事，可格里安想要的是地址。于是我在月溪镇南边的路上守着，直到一个迪菲亚信使拿着一封信晃悠过来，我们解决了由谁来送这封信的问题。我送。送给格里安。\n\n真正帮上大忙的是迪菲亚叛徒，这人跑到哨兵岭，愿意带我们去看其余的人藏在哪儿。只需要把一个叛徒活着护送到月溪镇，可去月溪镇的路可不是什么友好的路。我一路保着这个叛徒喘气，一直走到他们当正门用的那个地洞跟前。\n\n那座老矿井。当然是矿井。"
L["The Deadmines. You go in expecting a mine, and you get one, and then a goblin foundry, and then a cave so big there's a whole ship sitting in it. A proper ship, cannons and all, under Westfall. Whoever dug that place out knew their trade.\n\nEdwin VanCleef was up on the deck, and he did not go quietly. Gryan wanted his head, and I carried it out into the daylight and all the way up to Sentinel Hill.\n\nThere was a letter on VanCleef, too. Addressed to the City Architect in Stormwind, and never sent. That's another story."] = "死亡矿井。你进去的时候以为是个矿，它确实是个矿，然后是个地精铸造厂，再然后是个大得能停下一整艘船的山洞。一艘正经的船，大炮什么的都有，就在西部荒野底下。挖出这地方的人，是真懂行。\n\n艾德温·范克里夫站在甲板上，他可没有乖乖就范。格里安要他的脑袋，我把它带到了阳光底下，一路带上了哨兵岭。\n\n范克里夫身上还有一封信。写给暴风城的城市建筑师，一直没寄出去。那是另一个故事了。"
L["Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind had asked me to fetch a Gnoam Sprecklesprocket while I was down there. I couldn't tell you what one is. Shoni knew, and Shoni was paying, and that was enough for me."] = "暴风城的沉默的舒尼让我趁下去的时候，顺便带一个小型高能发动机回来。我说不上那是个什么东西。舒尼知道，舒尼付钱，对我来说这就够了。"
L["VanCleef's letter was for Baros Alexston, the City Architect. Baros had known the Stonemasons back when they were still just masons, and I got the feeling that letter landed somewhere sore. Next thing I knew, I was on my way to the Stockade.\n\nOne of the Brotherhood's leaders, Bazil Thredd, was locked up in there, and the prisoners had picked that moment to riot. The warden wanted it put down and Thredd's head brought out. So in I went: a whole building full of people with nothing to lose and a grudge against anyone holding a key. Thredd was waiting deep in the back. I came out with the head.\n\nThe warden thanked me, and then mentioned, as if it were nothing, that Thredd had had a visitor."] = "范克里夫的信是给巴隆斯·阿历克斯顿的，就是那位城市建筑师。巴隆斯在石匠们还只是石匠的时候就认识他们了，我感觉那封信戳到了什么痛处。紧接着，我就被派去了监狱。\n\n兄弟会的头目之一，巴基尔·斯瑞德，被关在里面，而犯人们偏偏挑了这个时候暴动。典狱官想把暴动压下去，还要把斯瑞德的脑袋带出来。于是我进去了：一整栋楼的人，个个一无所有，对任何拿钥匙的人都怀恨在心。斯瑞德在最里头等着。我带着脑袋出来了。\n\n典狱官谢过我，然后像是随口一提似的说，斯瑞德之前来过一个访客。"
L["The warden had written down what that visitor looked like and sealed it, and I carried the envelope across Stormwind like it might go off. It went from hand to hand until it reached Shaw, and Shaw told me to look up an old friend.\n\nThe old friend sold cheese. Elling Trias, in the Trade District, behind a counter stacked with wheels of the stuff, and SI:7 the whole time. Half the city has bought cheddar off that man and never known.\n\nTrias sent me up to the castle to meet Tyrion, who had a plan and a little mechanical spy to carry it out. The plan needed silk cloth and two fresh apples. I've been handed some strange shopping lists in my time. That one was for catching a traitor, and it had apples on it."] = "典狱官把那个访客的模样写了下来，封好，我揣着那个信封穿过暴风城，好像它随时会炸似的。它一手传一手，最后到了肖尔那儿，肖尔让我去找一位老朋友。\n\n那位老朋友卖奶酪。埃林·提亚斯，在贸易区，守着一个摞满了奶酪轮的柜台，而他一直都是军情七处的人。半个城的人都从他手里买过切达奶酪，却从来不知道。\n\n提亚斯让我上城堡去见泰里恩，泰里恩有个计划，还有一个小小的机械间谍来执行它。这个计划需要丝绸，还有两个新鲜苹果。这些年我收到过不少奇怪的购物清单。那一张是用来抓叛徒的，上面居然写着苹果。"
L["The spybot did its work, and I ended up crouched in the castle garden, waiting on a meeting. Lord Gregor Lescovar, an actual lord of Stormwind, came out to talk business with Marzon the Silent Blade. For somebody called the Silent Blade, Marzon talked plenty. I let them get it all said.\n\nThen I stood up. Neither of them enjoyed that part.\n\nAfter that the story went up the ladder, one important person at a time, until I was carrying a report into the keep for the king. It started with thieves in a Northshire vineyard. It ended in the royal garden with a lord.\n\nI don't know what the king made of it. I do know there was one fewer lord at dinner."] = "侦察机器人完成了它的工作，我最后蹲在城堡花园里，等着一场会面。葛瑞格·莱斯科瓦公爵，一位货真价实的暴风城贵族，出来跟沉默之刃马尔松谈生意。一个叫“沉默之刃”的人，话可真不少。我让他们把话都说完了。\n\n然后我站了起来。他们俩都不怎么喜欢这一段。\n\n之后这个故事沿着梯子一级一级往上传，一个大人物接一个大人物，直到我拿着一份报告走进要塞去见国王。它从北郡葡萄园里的几个贼开始。在王家花园里的一位贵族那儿结束。\n\n我不知道国王对此怎么看。我只知道，那天晚宴上少了一位贵族。"
L["Everybody has a bit of old dungeon armor that's seen better days. I took my bracers to Deliana on the High Seat in Ironforge, and Deliana said they could be a great deal better. All it would cost was the bracers, twenty gold, and fifteen blood samples out of Winterspring.\n\nI paid, and they came back better. Fair's fair. But Deliana wasn't done with me. There was a sealed container of blood that needed to go to a goblin called Mux Manascrambler, all the way down in Gadgetzan, and somehow I was already the one carrying it.\n\nAn earnest proposition, they call this sort of thing. In my experience, earnest means long."] = "谁都有一两件见过世面、但早已今非昔比的旧地下城护甲。我把我的护腕拿到铁炉堡王座大厅去找德莉亚娜，德莉亚娜说它们还能好上一大截。代价不过是这对护腕、二十金币，再加十五份从冬泉谷弄来的血样。\n\n我付了，护腕回来的时候确实更好了。公平交易。可德莉亚娜还没打算放过我。有一罐密封的血得送去给一个叫穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波的地精，远在加基森，而不知怎么的，扛着它的已经是我了。\n\n他们管这种事叫“一个诚恳的提议”。照我的经验，诚恳的意思就是“很长”。"
L["Everybody has a bit of old dungeon armor that's seen better days. I took my bracers to Mokvar in Orgrimmar, and Mokvar said they could be a great deal better. All it would cost was the bracers, twenty gold, and fifteen venom samples out of Silithus, which are about as much fun to collect as they sound.\n\nI paid, and they came back better. Fair's fair. But Mokvar wasn't done with me. There was a sealed container of venom that needed to go to a goblin called Mux Manascrambler, down in Gadgetzan, and somehow I was already the one carrying it.\n\nAn earnest proposition, they call this sort of thing. In my experience, earnest means long."] = "谁都有一两件见过世面、但早已今非昔比的旧地下城护甲。我把我的护腕拿到奥格瑞玛去找莫克瓦尔，莫克瓦尔说它们还能好上一大截。代价不过是这对护腕、二十金币，再加十五份从希利苏斯弄来的毒液样本，收集起来就跟听上去一样好玩。\n\n我付了，护腕回来的时候确实更好了。公平交易。可莫克瓦尔还没打算放过我。有一罐密封的毒液得送去给一个叫穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波的地精，在加基森，而不知怎么的，扛着它的已经是我了。\n\n他们管这种事叫“一个诚恳的提议”。照我的经验，诚恳的意思就是“很长”。"
L["Mux Manascrambler is a goblin with a plan, and a goblin's plan always starts with your money. Forty gold and a cartload of reagents bought me the Ectoplasmic Distiller, and then I had to go out and use it on ghosts in three different corners of the world. Ghosts do not enjoy being distilled.\n\nThe best part was the shifty merchant: an imp in a cave in Winterspring, selling Fel Elemental Rods. Doing business with an imp is exactly as much fun as it sounds. I counted my fingers afterward.\n\nOut of all of it came the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer. I carried it home, and my belt and gloves got the same treatment the bracers had. Just compensation, they called it. I'd call it a start."] = "穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波是个有计划的地精，而地精的计划总是从你的钱开始。四十金币加一车施法材料，换来了灵质提纯器，然后我还得出门，到世界上三个不同的角落去拿它对付鬼魂。鬼魂可不喜欢被提纯。\n\n最精彩的是那个鬼鬼祟祟的商人：冬泉谷一个山洞里的小鬼，卖恶魔元素之杖。跟小鬼做生意，就跟听上去一样好玩。完事以后我数了数手指头。\n\n这一切最后换来了超维度幽灵显形器。我把它带回家，我的腰带和手套也得到了跟护腕一样的待遇。他们管这叫“合理的补偿”。要我说，这才刚开个头。"
L["The Ghost Revealer, it turns out, works. I switched it on at the gates of Stratholme, and there stood Anthion Harmon, dead and waiting, with a plea. Baron Rivendare had Ysida Harmon somewhere inside, and time was short.\n\nSo we ran Stratholme. Not walked. Ran, through the whole rotten city to the Baron himself, and we got there in time. Ysida gave me a locket to carry out, so Anthion would know it was true.\n\nThe dead don't stay sentimental for long when there's work left. Next thing I knew, Anthion had me fetching iron, leather and cloth for a banner, and the unfinished banner was going to an old friend of his in Dire Maul. These jobs never get shorter."] = "结果那个幽灵显形器还真管用。我在斯坦索姆的大门口打开它，安泰恩·哈尔蒙就站在那儿，死了，在等着，还带着一个请求。瑞文戴尔男爵把伊思达·哈尔蒙关在里面某个地方，时间不多了。\n\n于是我们冲进了斯坦索姆。不是走。是跑，穿过整座腐烂的城，一直跑到男爵本人面前，而且赶上了。伊思达给了我一个挂坠盒，让我带出去，好让安泰恩知道这是真的。\n\n死人只要还有活儿没干完，就不会伤感太久。转眼间，安泰恩就让我去取铁、皮革和布料来做一面旗帜，而那面没做完的旗帜，要送到厄运之槌去给他的一位老朋友。这种活儿从来不会变短。"
L["Anthion's old friend was Falrin Treeshaper, in the library at Dire Maul. Falrin looked at the unfinished banner and agreed to help, right after a small matter of ogres. Falrin has a vendetta. I never got the whole story. I got a number, twenty-five, and that's how many warbeads I took off ogres before Falrin was satisfied.\n\nAn enchantment and some more shopping later, I was holding the Banner of Provocation, which is exactly what it sounds like. Plant it in the right place and somebody comes looking for a fight.\n\nFalrin even had the place picked out: the Ring of Law, in Blackrock Depths. Some people send flowers."] = "安泰恩的老朋友是法尔林·树影，在厄运之槌的图书馆里。法尔林看了看那面没做完的旗帜，答应帮忙，不过得先处理一桩小事：食人魔。法尔林有笔血仇要报。来龙去脉我始终没听全。我只听到一个数字，二十五，我从食人魔身上拿了这么多串食人魔珠串，法尔林才满意。\n\n又是一道附魔，又是一轮采购，我手里就多了一面挑战之旗，名副其实。插对了地方，就会有人跑来找你打架。\n\n法尔林连地方都替我挑好了：黑石深渊里的法律之环。有些人送花。"
L["Here's how you pick a fight in the Ring of Law on purpose. You walk into Blackrock Depths, let the Dark Irons sentence you, and while they're at it you plant the Banner of Provocation in the middle of the ring.\n\nTheldren took the hint. Theldren and his whole team of gladiators, all at once, while the crowd cheered for anybody but me. We beat them anyway. Theldren had been carrying the top piece of an amulet that once belonged to a Lord Valthalak. That name would come up again. Often.\n\nAnthion had a few parting words for me after that, and then it was home, where my boots, trousers and mantle got their turn."] = "想故意在法律之环里挑起一场架，办法是这样的。你走进黑石深渊，让黑铁矮人判你的刑，趁他们宣判的工夫，你把挑战之旗插在擂台正中间。\n\n塞尔德林听懂了暗示。塞尔德林带着他整支角斗士队伍一起上，观众给除了我以外的每个人喝彩。我们还是赢了。塞尔德林身上带着一个护符的顶部碎片，那护符曾经属于一位瓦塔拉克公爵。这个名字后来还会出现。经常出现。\n\n之后安泰恩跟我说了几句告别的话，然后就是回家，轮到我的靴子、裤子和披风了。"
L["Back home they pointed me at Blackrock Mountain, Ghost Revealer in hand. Somewhere near the Spire, they said, I'd find somebody. I switched it on, and there was Bodley. Dead, like most of my acquaintances that season, and with a great deal to say about Lord Valthalak.\n\nWhat it came down to was fire. Three kings of flame, Bodley called them. I fetched a piece of each, and a hallowed brazier to hold them, and brought the lot back to a ghost inside a mountain.\n\nWhat came out of that was a brazier for calling up the dead. Bodley seemed to think that was good news. Bodley's standards have changed."] = "回到家，他们又把我指向黑石山，手里拿着幽灵显形器。他们说，在黑石塔附近，我会找到某个人。我打开显形器，伯德雷就在那儿。死了，跟我那段时间认识的大多数人一样，而且对瓦塔拉克公爵有一肚子话要说。\n\n说到底就是火。伯德雷管它们叫三位火焰之王。我从每一位身上都取了一块，又弄来一个神圣火盆来装它们，把这一堆全带回去，交给一座山里头的鬼魂。\n\n最后做出来的是一个能召唤死者的火盆。伯德雷好像觉得这是个好消息。伯德雷的标准已经变了。"
L["Theldren had given me the top of Lord Valthalak's amulet. Bodley wanted the left and the right, and there's only one way to get them. Bodley names some old relic, you fetch it, and you light the brazier in the right dungeon. Somebody long dead comes out of it, angry, carrying a piece of the amulet. You kill them again. Then you do the whole thing over for the other side.\n\nSomewhere in the middle, Bodley gave me a long look and announced, I see Alcaz Island in your future. Bodley was right. Twenty bloodkelp, off the naga out there.\n\nI never did find out what a ghost wants with twenty bloodkelp."] = "塞尔德林已经给了我瓦塔拉克公爵护符的顶部。伯德雷要左边和右边那两块，而要拿到它们只有一个办法。伯德雷说出某件古老的遗物，你去取来，然后在对的地下城里点燃火盆。某个死了很久的家伙会从里面冒出来，气冲冲的，身上带着一块护符碎片。你再杀他一次。然后另一边再从头来一遍。\n\n中途有一回，伯德雷盯着我看了很久，宣布道：“我看见你的未来里有奥卡兹岛。”伯德雷说对了。二十份血藻，从那边的纳迦身上拿。\n\n一个鬼魂要二十份血藻干什么，我到最后也没弄明白。"
L["With the amulet whole again, Bodley wanted it used. A Flask of Supreme Power and a sack of Blackrock bracers later, I was in Upper Blackrock Spire, in the Beast's old room, lighting the brazier one last time.\n\nLord Valthalak answered. Lord Valthalak was not happy to be called. We put him down, and then came the strangest part of the whole business: I held his own amulet over his corpse, then handed it to his ghost, who sent me back to Bodley.\n\nBodley called this part Mea Culpa. I took it for an apology. Bodley's, not mine."] = "护符重新拼好以后，伯德雷想让它派上用场。一瓶超级能量合剂和一袋黑石护腕之后，我站在了黑石塔上层，在比斯巨兽从前的房间里，最后一次点燃火盆。\n\n瓦塔拉克公爵回应了。瓦塔拉克公爵很不高兴被人叫出来。我们把他放倒了，然后是整件事里最古怪的一段：我把他自己的护符举在他的尸体上方，再交给他的鬼魂，他的鬼魂又把我打发回伯德雷那儿。\n\n伯德雷管这一段叫“我之过”。我把它理解成一句道歉。是伯德雷的，不是我的。"
L["The last stop was the first one. I went back to where all of this started, with the cap and tunic of my old set, and handed them over. Saving the best for last, apparently.\n\nWhat came back finished the set. To anyone else it's just good armor. But I know what's in it: a goblin's ghost machine, a race through Stratholme, a brawl in the Ring of Law, and one dead lord who got his amulet back from my own hand.\n\nPeople ask where I got it. I tell them it's a long story. Then, if they're buying, I tell them this one."] = "最后一站就是第一站。我回到这一切开始的地方，把我那套旧装备的帽子和外衣交了上去。看来是把最好的留到了最后。\n\n拿回来的东西让整套装备齐了。在别人眼里，它就是一套好护甲。可我知道里面装着什么：一个地精的鬼魂机器，一场穿越斯坦索姆的赛跑，法律之环里的一场混战，还有一位从我手里拿回自己护符的死去的公爵。\n\n有人问我这套是从哪儿弄来的。我跟他们说，说来话长。然后，要是他们请客，我就给他们讲这个故事。"
L["Darkshire keeps its lamps lit all night, every night, and after a while there you stop thinking that's odd. Commander Althea Ebonlocke runs the Night Watch, and the Night Watch was short on everything except work.\n\nThe work was Raven Hill Cemetery, where the dead had stopped staying put. Skeletons of every kind: warriors, mages, fiends, horrors, and the names don't get any friendlier. The worst of it was the eastern mausoleum. Twenty plague spreaders, in the dark, in a crypt, and every one of them living up to the name.\n\nI came out filthy, and the commander nodded at me like I'd done a decent day's work. In Darkshire that's practically a parade."] = "夜色镇的灯每天晚上都亮一整夜，在那儿待久了，你就不再觉得这有什么奇怪的了。指挥官阿尔泰娅·埃伯洛克管着守夜人，而守夜人什么都缺，就是不缺活儿。\n\n活儿就是乌鸦岭墓地，那儿的死人已经不肯老老实实待着了。各种各样的骷髅：战士、法师、恶魔、恐怖者，名字一个比一个不友好。最糟的是东边的陵墓。二十个瘟疫传播者，黑灯瞎火，在墓穴里，每一个都对得起这个名字。\n\n我出来的时候脏得要命，指挥官冲我点了点头，像是我干了一天像样的活儿。在夜色镇，这差不多就等于一场游行了。"
L["Sven Yorgen's family was murdered, and what Sven wanted was a name. Somebody had buried a book behind an old stump on his farm, and I spent a good while showing it around Darkshire. The clues, once I had them all: not from around here, nervous, jittery, gone west. I found him out past town. Folks call him Jitters. Some people just make it easy.\n\nOnce Jitters had finished that journal, we had our name. Morbent Fel, a necromancer out at Raven Hill. Getting at Morbent took a special weapon, and the weapon took a tour of its own: a bishop in Stormwind, a shipwreck in the Wetlands, a forge back in Stormwind. Morbent's Bane, they called it.\n\nMorbent took one look at it and stopped being difficult."] = "斯温·约根一家被人杀了，斯温想要的是一个名字。有人在他农场的一个老树桩后面埋了一本书，我拿着它在夜色镇到处问了好一阵子。线索凑齐以后是这样的：不是本地人，紧张，一惊一乍，往西去了。我在镇子外头找到了他。大家都管他叫基特斯。有些人就是让你省心。\n\n基特斯把那本日志写完以后，我们就有了名字。摩本特·费尔，乌鸦岭的一个亡灵巫师。要对付摩本特，得有一件特别的武器，而这件武器自己也得周游一圈：暴风城的一位主教，湿地的一艘沉船，再回到暴风城的一座锻炉。他们管它叫摩本特的克星。\n\n摩本特看了它一眼，就不再难缠了。"
L["Sirra Von'Indi keeps a library in Darkshire, and Sirra had noticed what nobody else had bothered to: Raven Hill's history had died along with its people. I went poking through the ruins and came back with a tome about a family called Valor. Heroes, the whole lot of them. Dead heroes, which in Duskwood means they're still around.\n\nThere were four of them, each one had left a weapon behind, and every weapon came with a chore. One wanted a mace back from a skeleton that had walked off with it. The others wanted Defias, worgs and ogres seen to. Heroes to the last, and still handing out work."] = "希拉·沃宁迪在夜色镇管着一座图书馆，希拉注意到了别人都懒得留意的一件事：乌鸦岭的历史，跟那里的人一起死掉了。我去废墟里翻了翻，带回来一本书，讲的是一个叫瓦洛尔的家族。全家都是英雄。死了的英雄，在暮色森林里，这意味着他们还在附近转悠。\n\n他们一共四个人，每人都留下了一件武器，而每件武器都附带一份杂活。一个想让我从一具拿着他的锤子跑掉的骷髅手里把锤子要回来。其他几个想让我去收拾迪菲亚、座狼和食人魔。英雄到底，死了还在派活儿。"
L["None of it put them to rest. So I carried the family's weapons back to Raven Hill, to find out what single night had pinned them all there."] = "这些都没能让他们安息。于是我把这家人的武器带回了乌鸦岭，去弄清楚到底是哪一个夜晚，把他们全都钉在了那里。"
L["North of Raven Hill there's a grave so weathered you can hardly read it. I asked around Darkshire whose it was, and the librarian knew. Morgan Ladimore. It's a sad story, and I'll leave the telling of it to the people who live there. The short of it: something called Mor'Ladim walks the woods near that grave, and the commander of the Night Watch wanted him gone for good.\n\nI brought back his skull. Then the commander told me the rest. One of Ladimore's children had lived, and she was right there in Darkshire, standing watch. Sarah Ladimore.\n\nSarah heard me out, then gave me a ring and asked me to leave it on her father's grave. So I walked back up the hill and did.\n\nSome errands you don't make jokes about. That's one."] = "乌鸦岭北边有一座坟，风吹雨打得字都快看不清了。我在夜色镇四处打听那是谁的坟，图书管理员知道。摩根·拉迪莫尔。那是个悲伤的故事，还是留给住在那儿的人去讲吧。简单说：有个叫摩拉迪姆的东西在那座坟附近的林子里游荡，守夜人的指挥官想让他彻底消失。\n\n我把他的头骨带了回来。然后指挥官把剩下的告诉了我。拉迪莫尔有一个孩子活了下来，她就在夜色镇，正在站岗。莎拉·拉迪莫尔。\n\n莎拉听我说完，给了我一枚戒指，请我把它放在她父亲的坟上。于是我又走回山上，放下了。\n\n有些差事，你不拿来开玩笑。这就是一件。"
L["Madame Eva had a vision, and the vision had a name in it. Stalvan. That one word cost me a walk across half the kingdom.\n\nStalvan himself was hard to find. His paperwork was everywhere. A town registry, a footlocker in a Westfall schoolhouse, a letter that never got delivered, a crate of somebody's old things down in the Stormwind canals, a chest upstairs in a marshal's house in Elwynn. Every one of them held a page, and every page was worse than the last. A faded one. A muddy one. A bloody one.\n\nIt ended at Mistmantle Manor with Stalvan Mistmantle, who didn't want visitors. I brought his family ring back to Madame Eva. Eva didn't look surprised. I doubt anything surprises her."] = "伊瓦夫人看到了一个幻象，幻象里有一个名字。斯塔文。就这一个词，害得我走遍了半个王国。\n\n斯塔文本人很难找。他的文书倒是到处都是。一本镇上的户籍册，西部荒野一座校舍里的一只储物箱，一封一直没送出去的信，暴风城运河底下一箱不知道谁的旧东西，艾尔文森林一位元帅家楼上的一只箱子。每一处都有一页纸，而每一页都比上一页更糟。一页褪了色。一页沾了泥。一页沾了血。\n\n最后在米斯特曼托庄园结束，主角是斯塔文·米斯特曼托，他不想见客。我把他的家族戒指带回去给了伊瓦夫人。伊瓦一点都不意外。我怀疑世上没什么能让她意外。"
L["Duskwood has worgen. Of course it does. The Nightbane prowl Brightwood Grove and the Rotting Orchard, and someone in Darkshire called Calor keeps count of them.\n\nCalor started me on the shadow weavers, which are worgen who cast spells, which is a thing I'd been happier not knowing about. After that it was runners and fangs and whatever else the pack could spare, and every trip out, the woods got a little quieter and I got a little choosier about where I put my back.\n\nWhen it was done, Calor wrote me a note for Master Carevin. I'd been on trial the whole time without being told. Seems I passed. The reward for passing was being trusted with more worgen."] = "暮色森林有狼人。当然有。夜行狼人在阳光树林和烂果园里游荡，夜色镇有个叫卡洛尔的人专门数着它们。\n\n卡洛尔让我先从暗影织法者开始，那是会施法的狼人，这种事我宁愿不知道。之后是奔跑者、尖牙，还有狼群能派出来的随便什么东西，每出去一趟，林子就安静一点，而我选背靠哪儿的时候也就更挑剔一点。\n\n全部办完以后，卡洛尔给我写了一张字条，让我交给卡雷文大师。原来我一直在接受考验，只是没人告诉我。看来我通过了。通过的奖励是：被托付更多的狼人。"
L["Up past the Raven Hill cemetery, in a shack, lives an old hermit called Abercrombie. Lonely sort, you'd think. Wanted a few things from town, and I was glad to help.\n\nHere's what he wanted. Thread spun from ghost hair. Zombie juice. A pile of ghoul ribs. Looking back, the ghoul ribs were a hint.\n\nThen he gave me a letter for the mayor, and the mayor couldn't read it. It had to be translated, and not long after the mayor read it properly, something called Stitches came lurching down the road toward Darkshire. Abercrombie had been building company.\n\nThere was a bride, too. Eliza, out in the cemetery. Eliza had the Embalmer's heart, so I took it off her and brought it to the mayor. Courting in Duskwood is a grim business."] = "乌鸦岭墓地再往上，有间小屋里住着一个叫亚伯克隆比的老隐士。你会以为是个孤单的人。想从镇上要几样东西，我很乐意帮忙。\n\n他要的是这些。用鬼魂头发纺的线。僵尸汁。一堆食尸鬼的肋骨。现在回头看，食尸鬼的肋骨就是个暗示。\n\n然后他给了我一封信让我交给镇长，可镇长看不懂。得找人翻译，等镇长终于把信读明白没多久，一个叫斯迪奇的东西就摇摇晃晃地顺着大路朝夜色镇来了。亚伯克隆比一直在给自己造个伴儿。\n\n还有个新娘。伊莉莎，在墓地里。伊莉莎拿着防腐师的心脏，我就从她那儿把它拿过来，交给了镇长。在暮色森林谈恋爱，是件阴森森的事。"
L["There's a ghost on the road where the Swamp of Sorrows gives way to the Blasted Lands. The Fallen Hero of the Horde, they call him, and his is a sorry tale. He took his soldiers toward the Blasted Lands and waited for orders. The orders never came.\n\nStonard knew the story. A few questions there, and I knew where the orders had actually gone: out to the murloc camps, into the keeping of something called the Swamp Talker. I went and took them back. The Warchief's own orders, long overdue and a bit damp.\n\nI carried them to the ghost. A dead man, finally reading the orders he'd waited for. I let him have a minute."] = "在悲伤沼泽和诅咒之地交界的那条路上，有个鬼魂。他们管他叫部落英雄的灵魂，他的故事挺惨。他带着自己的士兵往诅咒之地去，然后等待命令。命令始终没来。\n\n斯通纳德的人知道这个故事。在那儿问了几句，我就知道那些命令实际上去了哪儿：去了鱼人营地，落到了一个叫沼泽空谈者的东西手里。我去把它们拿了回来。酋长亲自下的命令，迟到了很久，还有点潮。\n\n我把命令带给了那个鬼魂。一个死人，终于读到了他等了那么久的命令。我让他自己待了一会儿。"
L["An ambassador at Nethergarde Keep had an errand for me I didn't see coming: go and talk to a Horde ghost. With demons camped on the doorstep, I suppose the old squabbles can wait.\n\nThe Fallen Hero of the Horde stands where the swamp gives way to the Blasted Lands, and he told me all of it. Soldiers who crossed over, and what Razelikh the Defiler's people did with them after. Out there the dead don't get to rest. They get bound to stones and put to work.\n\nSo he gave me a job: set them loose, eighteen of them, at the Stones of Binding. You have to stay right by the stone while you work or it all comes apart, and fighting well while rooted to one spot is harder than it sounds.\n\nOdd work for the Alliance. The dead don't seem to mind whose colors you wear."] = "守望堡的一位大使给了我一份我完全没料到的差事：去跟一个部落的鬼魂谈谈。恶魔都在门口扎营了，那些陈年旧怨我想也可以先放一放。\n\n部落英雄的灵魂站在沼泽和诅咒之地交界的地方，他把一切都告诉了我。越过边界的士兵们，还有污染者拉瑟莱克的手下后来怎么处置了他们。在那边，死人是得不到安息的。他们被绑在石头上，被逼着干活。\n\n于是他给了我一份活儿：在束缚之石那儿，把他们放出来，十八个。干活的时候你得一直守在石头旁边，不然就全白费了，而被钉在一个地方还要打得漂亮，比听上去难多了。\n\n对联盟来说，这活儿挺怪。不过死人看样子并不在乎你穿的是谁的颜色。"
L["With the orders read, the Fallen Hero told me the rest of it. What happened to the soldiers who crossed into the Blasted Lands, and what Razelikh the Defiler's people did with them after. Out there the dead don't get to rest. They get bound to stones and put to work.\n\nSo he gave me a job: set them loose, eighteen of them, at the Stones of Binding. The catch is that you have to stay close to the stone while you work, or the whole thing comes apart. Nobody tells you how hard it is to fight well while rooted to one spot.\n\nWhen it was done, he didn't thank me, exactly. He started remembering names."] = "读完了命令，部落英雄的灵魂把剩下的事告诉了我。那些越过边界进入诅咒之地的士兵后来怎么样了，还有污染者拉瑟莱克的手下后来怎么处置了他们。在那边，死人是得不到安息的。他们被绑在石头上，被逼着干活。\n\n于是他给了我一份活儿：在束缚之石那儿，把他们放出来，十八个。麻烦在于，干活的时候你得一直守在石头旁边，不然就全白费了。没人告诉你，被钉在一个地方还要打得漂亮有多难。\n\n办完以后，他也没怎么谢我。他开始想起一个个名字来了。"
L["Once the stones were quiet, the Fallen Hero gave me a name: Corporal Thund Splithoof, one of his own. Thund was waiting near the road into the Blasted Lands, with a spectral lockbox and something inside it for me. The dead, it turns out, pay their debts.\n\nThe second name was Lieutenant Kirith. Find out what became of Kirith, the Fallen Hero said. So I went looking, and out at the Serpent's Coil I found what was left: a spirit, with news.\n\nI carried the news back to the road. The Fallen Hero took it in, and then said two words I didn't expect from an old soldier of the Horde. Demon hunter."] = "石头都安静下来以后，部落英雄的灵魂给了我一个名字：桑德·裂蹄下士，他自己的人。桑德在通往诅咒之地的路边等着，带着一个幽灵保险箱，里面有给我的东西。原来，死人也是会还债的。\n\n第二个名字是基利斯中尉。去查查基利斯怎么样了，部落英雄的灵魂说。于是我去找了，在盘蛇谷找到了剩下的东西：一个灵魂，还带着消息。\n\n我把消息带回了那条路上。部落英雄的灵魂听完，说出了两个我没想到会从一个部落老兵嘴里听到的词。恶魔猎手。"
L["The demon hunter was Loramus Thalipedes, who lives on the coast of Azshara by the Bay of Storms. Loramus told me his story, then worked a spell of enlightenment while I stood there waiting, and when it was done I understood the problem. Razelikh is warded, and getting through that ward takes the beast's name.\n\nThe name came by way of a temple down by the water, whose lord wanted Hetaera dead first and the heads brought as proof. All three of them. Bloodied, beaten and bruised, which tells you how that fight went.\n\nLast came twenty chunks of Azsharite, hidden all over southern Azshara, and a felhound to sniff them out. Best partner I had that year. Never said a word."] = "那位恶魔猎手是洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯，住在艾萨拉的海岸边，挨着风暴海湾。洛拉姆斯给我讲了他的故事，然后施了一道启迪法术，我就站在那儿等着，等法术完成，我就明白问题在哪儿了。拉瑟莱克有结界护身，要穿过那道结界，得知道那头野兽的名字。\n\n名字是从水边的一座神殿得来的，神殿的主人要我先干掉赫塔拉，再把脑袋带回去当证据。三个脑袋全要。血淋淋、打烂了、青一块紫一块，你听这个就知道那一仗是怎么打的。\n\n最后是二十块艾萨拉水晶，藏在艾萨拉南部各处，还有一只地狱犬帮我闻出来。那是我那一年最好的搭档。一句话都没说过。"
L["The demon hunter packed the Azsharite into a shipment and sent me off with it to Galvan the Ancient, in northern Stranglethorn. That's one end of the world to the other, near enough, hauling a crate of crystal somebody had very particular plans for.\n\nGalvan is called the Ancient for a reason, and nobody hurries Galvan. I stood by while the forge did its work, and what came out of the fire was Felbane, made for the one job ordinary steel can't do. Razelikh's lieutenants can't be killed by anything else.\n\nThen I carried it all the way back to the Blasted Lands, to the Fallen Hero on his road. I'd like to think it was the first good news he'd had since he died."] = "恶魔猎手把艾萨拉水晶打包成一批货，派我带着它去找荆棘谷北部的“古人”加尔文。差不多是从世界的这一头到那一头，拖着一箱有人早就打好了特别主意的水晶。\n\n加尔文被叫作“古人”是有原因的，谁也催不动加尔文。我站在一旁等锻炉干活，从火里出来的就是邪能克星，专门干那件普通钢铁干不了的活儿。拉瑟莱克的副官们，别的东西都杀不死。\n\n然后我把它一路带回诅咒之地，交给路上的部落英雄的灵魂。我愿意相信，那是他死后听到的第一个好消息。"
L["Razelikh kept three lieutenants, and each of them wore a piece of a shattered amulet. None of them could die until Felbane had weakened them, and the weapons only had so much in them. Use them wisely, the Fallen Hero said. I did. Mostly.\n\nThree pieces made one, and with that I went up the Rise of the Defiler to see the demon himself. The Fallen Hero had a name for him by then. Rakh'likh.\n\nI came back with the demon's severed horn, and the Ward of the Defiler with it, so the Fallen Hero could destroy that ward before it fell into the wrong hands. He didn't get his soldiers back. He got the horn."] = "拉瑟莱克手下有三个副官，每个都戴着一块破碎护符的碎片。在被邪能克星削弱之前，他们谁都死不了，而那些武器的力量也就那么多。部落英雄的灵魂说，省着点用。我省着用了。大体上。\n\n三块碎片拼成了一块，我带着它登上污染者高地，去见那个恶魔本尊。到那时候，部落英雄的灵魂已经知道了它的名字。拉克利克。\n\n我带回了恶魔被砍下的角，还有污染者的结界，好让部落英雄的灵魂在那道结界落入坏人手里之前把它毁掉。他没能把他的士兵要回来。他拿到了那只角。"
L["It started as the oddest little job. A troll in Steamwheedle Port named Yeh'kinya handed me a bramble and sent me to Feralas to catch ghosts. Not big ghosts. Screecher ghosts. Find a dead screecher, use the bramble, and its spirit comes along with you.\n\nThree of them, that's all he wanted. I brought them back, and whatever those spirits told him, he liked it. It had to do with an old troll prophecy.\n\nI remember thinking, what does a dead screecher know about prophecy? More than I did, as it turned out. That was the first thread. I had no idea how much was tied to the other end of it."] = "一开始只是一份最古怪的小活儿。热砂港一个叫叶基亚的巨魔递给我一根荆棘，打发我去菲拉斯抓鬼。不是什么大鬼。尖啸者的鬼。找到一只死掉的尖啸者，用一下那根荆棘，它的灵魂就会跟着你走。\n\n三只，他就要这么多。我带了回去，不管那些灵魂跟他说了什么，他都很喜欢。这跟一个古老的巨魔预言有关。\n\n我记得当时还想，一只死掉的尖啸者能懂什么预言？结果它懂的比我多。那是第一根线头。我当时完全不知道，另一头拴着多少东西。"
L["The prophecy, it turned out, was written on tablets, and the tablets were in Zul'Farrak. Where else. Sand, heat, sand trolls, more sand. I brought two of them back and Yeh'kinya read them like a letter from home.\n\nThe tablets spoke of an ancient egg from the days of the old troll empires, and that egg sat in a cave at the top of Jintha'Alor, with every Vilebranch in the Hinterlands between me and it. I went up. I came down with the egg. The Vilebranch had a lot to say about that, most of it at the tops of their voices.\n\nYeh'kinya held it like a newborn. I've seen parents with less care."] = "原来那个预言写在石板上，而石板在祖尔法拉克。还能在哪儿。沙子，酷热，沙怒巨魔，更多的沙子。我带回来两块，叶基亚读它们就像在读家书。\n\n石板上说的是古代巨魔帝国时期的一颗古老的蛋，那颗蛋就放在辛萨罗山顶的一个洞里，而在我和它之间，隔着辛特兰所有的邪枝巨魔。我上去了。我带着蛋下来了。邪枝巨魔对此有很多话要说，大部分是扯着嗓子喊出来的。\n\n叶基亚抱着它，像抱着一个刚出生的婴儿。我见过的有些父母都没这么小心。"
L["Then Yeh'kinya told me what the egg was for. It was a vessel, and he wanted it filled. With Hakkar.\n\nSo down into the Temple of Atal'Hakkar I went, the sunken one in the Swamp of Sorrows, and not alone, because that place doesn't take visitors one at a time. At the very bottom, in the Sanctum of the Fallen God, the Avatar of Hakkar rose up to meet us. Big. Winged. Furious. We put it down, I used the egg, and the egg drank in the essence of a god like dry ground takes rain.\n\nI carried it back to Tanaris in my pack, between my bedroll and my supper, and felt it the whole way.\n\nLooking back, that was the moment to start asking questions. I didn't. It was a very nice egg."] = "然后叶基亚告诉了我那颗蛋是干什么用的。它是一个容器，而他想把它装满。装哈卡。\n\n于是我下到了阿塔哈卡神庙，就是悲伤沼泽里沉下去的那座，而且不是一个人，因为那地方不接待单独来的访客。在最底下的堕落之神圣殿，哈卡的化身升起来迎接我们。巨大。长着翅膀。暴怒。我们把它放倒了，我用了那颗蛋，蛋吸进了一位神的精华，就像干裂的土地喝雨水。\n\n我把它装在背包里带回塔纳利斯，夹在铺盖卷和晚饭中间，一路上都能感觉到它。\n\n现在回头看，那一刻就该开始问问题了。我没问。那是一颗非常好看的蛋。"
L["Back in Steamwheedle Port, Prospector Ironboot stopped me with a question. Did I know there were six Mosh'aru tablets? Not two. Six. Yeh'kinya had somehow forgotten to mention the other four.\n\nTwo of them were in Zul'Mashar, out in the Eastern Plaguelands, which is a fine place to visit if you enjoy being chewed on. The last two were in Lower Blackrock Spire, which is worse. I fetched all four, and Ironboot read the whole set.\n\nRead whole, the prophecy said something else entirely. Two tablets sounded like a way to keep Hakkar out of the world. Six sounded like a way to let him back in.\n\nI thought about that egg, and every mile I'd carried it. I'd been a great help to somebody. I just hadn't asked who."] = "回到热砂港，勘查员铁靴拦住我，问了个问题。我知不知道摩沙鲁石板一共有六块？不是两块。六块。叶基亚不知怎么的，忘了提另外四块。\n\n其中两块在东瘟疫之地的祖玛沙尔，如果你喜欢被啃，那倒是个好去处。最后两块在黑石塔下层，那地方更糟。四块我都取了回来，铁靴把整套读了一遍。\n\n整套读下来，那个预言说的完全是另一回事。两块石板听着像是把哈卡挡在世界之外的办法。六块听着像是放他回来的办法。\n\n我想起了那颗蛋，还有我扛着它走过的每一里路。我可是帮了某人一个大忙。只是没问是谁。"
L["The prospector reckoned I ought to go and have a word with Yeh'kinya. The prospector was right.\n\nI won't give you the whole conversation. The short of it was that Hakkar the Soulflayer was coming back into the world through Zul'Gurub, and the trolls who meant to meet him there were the Zandalar. Somebody had to carry word to their man Molthor, out on Yojamba Isle off the coast of Stranglethorn. That was me.\n\nSo a job that started with a bramble and three dead screechers ended with me on a beach full of Zandalar, with Zul'Gurub the obvious next stop.\n\nThat one's a story for another night. Buy the next round and I might tell it."] = "勘查员觉得我该去跟叶基亚好好谈谈。勘查员说得对。\n\n那场谈话我就不全讲了。简单说就是，夺灵者哈卡正通过祖尔格拉布回到这个世界，而打算在那儿迎接他的巨魔，是赞达拉。总得有人去给他们的人莫托尔报信，他在荆棘谷外海的尤亚姆巴岛上。那个人就是我。\n\n就这样，一份从一根荆棘和三只死尖啸者开始的活儿，最后让我站在了满是赞达拉巨魔的海滩上，下一站显然就是祖尔格拉布。\n\n那是另一个晚上的故事了。再请一轮，说不定我就讲。"
L["There's a poster outside Westbrook Garrison. WANTED, it says, and then Hogger, in quotes, as if even the marshal wasn't sure that was his real name. A Riverpaw brute, out at Forest's Edge. Bring back his claw.\n\nOne gnoll, I thought. How bad can one gnoll be?\n\nHere's what nobody tells you about Hogger. He's big, he's quick, he hits like a runaway cart, and he doesn't live alone. The Riverpaw are thick in those woods, and every one of them takes his side. Say his name in Goldshire and watch the room go quiet.\n\nI brought back the claw, and it's a big one. You could rake a garden with it. Marshal Dughan looked at it for a good while, and then paid me.\n\nThe road to Westfall is a little safer now. A little."] = "西泉要塞外面贴着一张告示。上面写着“通缉”，然后是“霍格”，还加了引号，好像连治安官都不确定这是不是他的真名。一个河爪豺狼人里的狠角色，在林边空地。把他的爪子带回来。\n\n就一个豺狼人，我想。一个豺狼人能有多难对付？\n\n关于霍格，有些事没人会告诉你。他块头大，动作快，打起人来像一辆失控的马车，而且他不是一个人住。那片林子里到处都是河爪豺狼人，每一个都站在他那边。在闪金镇提一句他的名字，你看满屋子的人会不会安静下来。\n\n我把爪子带回来了，个头可不小。你都能拿它耙花园。治安官杜汉盯着它看了好一会儿，然后付了钱。\n\n去西部荒野的路现在安全了一点。就一点。"
L["Under the Thandol Span, where the bridge is broken, there's a stretch of riverbed nobody bothers to look at. I looked. There was what was left of a dwarf down there, and a waterlogged envelope.\n\nIt was a letter from Sully Balloo to Sara Balloo in Ironforge. Not orders. Not a map to anything. A man writing home to his wife, saying goodbye in case he didn't get another chance. He didn't.\n\nSo I carried it to Ironforge and found Sara. You don't want to be the one handing over a letter like that, but somebody has to. Sara read it, wrote a note of her own and asked me to take it to King Magni. She wanted her king to know what Sully had given. So up to the High Seat I went."] = "萨多尔大桥断掉的那一段底下，有一片没人愿意看一眼的河床。我看了。那下面有一个矮人剩下的东西，还有一个泡透了的信封。\n\n那是苏利·巴鲁写给铁炉堡的萨拉·巴鲁的信。不是命令。也不是什么藏宝图。是一个男人写给家里妻子的信，跟她道别，以防他再也没有机会。他确实没有了。\n\n于是我把信带到铁炉堡，找到了萨拉。没人愿意当那个递这种信的人，可总得有人去。萨拉读完，自己也写了一张字条，请我交给麦格尼国王。她想让她的国王知道苏利付出了什么。于是我上了王座大厅。"
L["Kings get a lot of letters. Magni read Sara's and decided Sully Balloo would have a memorial, and that the Grand Mason would build it.\n\nThe Grand Mason took one look at the commission and decided only the best stone would do: Alterac Granite, five pieces of it. Long way to go for rocks. Very good rocks, I'm told. I carried every one of them back to Ironforge and felt each of them in my shoulders the next morning.\n\nThen I reported back to the king, and Sully got his memorial. Kings hand out a lot of things, titles and medals and land. A stone for one soldier nobody else was out looking for isn't the grandest of them. I liked it best."] = "国王会收到很多信。麦格尼读了萨拉的信，决定给苏利·巴鲁立一座纪念碑，由大石匠来建。\n\n大石匠看了一眼这份委托，就认定只有最好的石头才配得上：奥特兰克花岗石，五块。为了几块石头跑这么远。听说是非常好的石头。我把每一块都背回了铁炉堡，第二天早上，每一块的分量都还压在我肩膀上。\n\n然后我回去向国王复命，苏利有了他的纪念碑。国王会发很多东西，头衔、勋章、封地。为一个除了我之外没人去找的士兵立一块石头，算不上其中最隆重的。可我最喜欢它。"
L["There's a wrecked raft in a pond in Un'Goro, and if you poke around it you'll find a small pack. Inside: a large compass, a curled map, a key with a lion's head on it, and a photograph of a gnome dressed in green.\n\nWell. Marshal's Refuge isn't far, and there's a gnome there called Linken. You can see where this is going.\n\nLinken knew the things were his. Linken did not know much else. Where he'd been, what the key opened, why he'd been rafting through a crater full of dinosaurs: all gone. What he did have was a sword, and a name to take it to. Donova Snowden, in Winterspring.\n\nThe far end of Kalimdor, naturally. I've noticed that about lost things. They're never lost anywhere close."] = "安戈洛的一个池塘里有一只破木筏，要是你在它周围翻一翻，就会找到一个小背包。里面有：一个大罗盘，一张卷起来的地图，一把带狮子头的钥匙，还有一张穿绿衣服的侏儒的照片。\n\n嗯。马绍尔营地离那儿不远，那儿有个侏儒叫林克。你应该猜到接下来是怎么回事了。\n\n林克知道这些东西是他的。别的林克就不怎么知道了。他去过哪儿，那把钥匙开什么，他为什么要坐着木筏在一个满是恐龙的环形山里漂：全忘了。他有的是一把剑，还有一个可以拿着剑去找的名字。冬泉谷的多诺瓦·雪山。\n\n当然是卡利姆多的另一头。我发现丢了的东西都这样。从来不会丢在近处。"
L["Donova Snowden took one look at Linken's sword and decided the answer was in a graveyard. Getting there was the strange part.\n\nIt took a trip to Feralas for something called the Videre Elixir, and then the graveyard outside Gadgetzan, where Donova's instructions were very clear. Drink the elixir by the gravestone. I drank it. I died.\n\nThat was the plan, mind you. As a ghost I could meet Gaeriyan, who told me which grave to look at once I had a body again. So I walked back to my body, got up, found the gravestone, and came away with a better sword than the one I'd brought.\n\nFirst time I ever died on instructions. Strangely restful."] = "多诺瓦·雪山看了一眼林克的剑，就认定答案在一片墓地里。怎么去那儿才是怪事。\n\n先得去一趟菲拉斯，弄一种叫视灵药剂的东西，然后是加基森外面的墓地，多诺瓦的指示说得非常清楚。在墓碑旁边喝下药剂。我喝了。我死了。\n\n提醒你一句，这是计划的一部分。变成鬼魂以后我就能见到加里杨，加里杨告诉我等我重新有了身体以后该看哪座坟。于是我走回自己的身体，爬起来，找到那块墓碑，带走了一把比我带来的那把更好的剑。\n\n头一回照着指示去死。出奇地安详。"
L["Eridan Bluewind, up in Felwood, knew what Linken had been trying to make: a silver heart.\n\nThat took a fistful of silvery claws and an irontree heart, which meant arguing with a good deal of local wildlife, and then a book. The Book of Aquor. Carry the lot down to Tanaris, open the book, and out comes Aquementas, a water elemental, standing in the middle of the desert.\n\nAquementas did not care to be summoned. Once we'd settled that, the claws and the heart had become the Silver Totem of Aquementas, and I carried it back to Linken.\n\nA water elemental, called up in the driest place I know, to make a totem for a gnome who couldn't remember where he'd been. You couldn't make that up. I didn't."] = "费伍德森林的艾瑞丹·蓝风知道林克一直想做的是什么：一颗银色的心。\n\n这需要一大把银色的爪子和一颗铁树之心，这意味着得跟当地不少野生动物理论一番，然后还要一本书。《阿奎尔之书》。把这些全带到塔纳利斯，翻开那本书，亚奎门塔斯就出来了，一个水元素，站在沙漠正中间。\n\n亚奎门塔斯可不想被召唤。等我们把这事“谈妥”了，那些爪子和那颗心已经变成了亚奎门塔斯的银图腾，我把它带回去交给了林克。\n\n一个水元素，在我知道的最干的地方被召唤出来，就为了给一个记不起自己去过哪儿的侏儒做个图腾。这种事你编都编不出来。我也没编。"
L["Linken had one more job, and it was the reason for the totem. Fire Plume Ridge, just south of the Refuge. That's where Blazerunner lives, wrapped in a protective aura nothing gets through. Nothing except a silver totem made out of a water elemental.\n\nSomebody once said it's dangerous to go alone. I went anyway. I held up the totem, the aura went out like a candle in the rain, and Blazerunner turned out to be a lot less impressive without it. In the cave beyond sat the Golden Flame, and I carried it back to Linken.\n\nHe still doesn't remember everything. But he has his sword, his flame and an adventure to show for it. I have a story nobody believes. Tell it in any tavern and watch them smile at you like you've had one too many."] = "林克还有最后一份活儿，那个图腾就是为它准备的。火羽山，就在营地南边。火焰使者就住在那儿，裹着一层什么都穿不透的保护光环。除了一个用水元素做的银图腾。\n\n有人说过，一个人去很危险。我还是去了。我举起图腾，光环就像雨里的蜡烛一样灭了，没了它，火焰使者也就没那么威风了。再往里的山洞里放着金色火焰，我把它带回去交给了林克。\n\n他到现在也没想起所有的事。但他有了他的剑、他的火焰，还有一段能拿出来说的冒险。我有一个没人信的故事。随便在哪家酒馆讲讲，你看他们冲你笑的样子，就像你多喝了一杯。"
L["Mankrik waits at the Crossroads. A big orc, built for a fight, and he'd lost one: quillboar hit him on the Gold Road, and his wife didn't come back from it. He asked me to find her. That was the whole of it. Find her.\n\nThe Barrens is a great deal of nothing in every direction, and I walked a lot of it. South of the Crossroads, I found her. Too late, by a long way.\n\nI went back and told him. You don't dress that kind of thing up.\n\nThen he asked for tusks. Bristleback tusks, sixty of them. I didn't argue the number. Grief keeps its own count, and Mankrik's came to sixty.\n\nHer name was Olgra. Somebody ought to say it."] = "曼科里克在十字路口等着。一个大块头兽人，天生就是打仗的料，可他输了一仗：野猪人在黄金之路上袭击了他，他的妻子没能回来。他请我去找她。就这么多。找到她。\n\n贫瘠之地往哪个方向都是一大片空荡荡，我走了很多路。在十字路口南边，我找到了她。晚了，晚了太多。\n\n我回去告诉了他。这种事，你不用去修饰。\n\n然后他要獠牙。刺背野猪人的獠牙，六十根。我没跟他争这个数。悲伤有它自己的算法，曼科里克的算出来是六十。\n\n她的名字叫奥尔格拉。总该有人说出来。"
L["Desolace has two kinds of people who'll give you advice about Maraudon, and neither kind tells you why.\n\nThe first was the Centaur Pariah, out in southern Desolace. The Pariah's instructions came written down, and they read like the guest list for a funeral: the Nameless Prophet, the dead khans, and at the end of it all, the Amulet of Union. I went down and collected. Long-dead centaur are no friendlier than the living ones, I can tell you that.\n\nThe second was somebody called Willow, who just wanted carvings. Twenty-five Theradric crystal carvings out of Maraudon. The caves were not short of them, and neither were the things guarding them.\n\nI never did find out what either of them wanted it all for. In Desolace, that counts as a warm welcome."] = "在凄凉之地，会给你出主意去玛拉顿的人有两种，而哪一种都不告诉你为什么。\n\n第一个是半人马贱民，在凄凉之地南边。贱民的指示是写在纸上的，读起来就像一份葬礼的宾客名单：无名预言者，死去的可汗们，最后是联合坠饰。我下去一一收齐了。死了很久的半人马，可一点都不比活着的友好，这我可以告诉你。\n\n第二个是一个叫维洛的人，只想要雕刻品。从玛拉顿里弄二十五个瑟莱德丝水晶雕像。洞里不缺这东西，守着它们的东西也不缺。\n\n他们俩要这些东西到底干什么，我到最后也没弄清楚。在凄凉之地，这已经算是热情欢迎了。"
L["Talendria at Nijel's Point had a cure for what was eating Maraudon, or the start of one. A coated cerulean vial, filled at the orange crystal pool down in the caverns, then splashed on the Vylestem vines. The vines don't care for it. Out comes a Noxxious Scion, all rot and temper, and once you've killed it the plant is clean again. Eight plants.\n\nGardening, but with more killing than usual.\n\nMaraudon was sick, and the rot had Lord Vyletongue's name on it. He was somewhere further down."] = "尼耶尔前哨站的塔琳德莉亚有个办法，能治侵蚀玛拉顿的东西，或者说是治疗的开头。一个涂过层的蔚蓝药瓶，在洞穴深处的橙色水晶池里装满，然后泼在维利斯塔姆藤蔓上。藤蔓可不喜欢这个。会冒出一个诺克赛恩幼体，满身腐烂，脾气还坏，等你把它杀了，那株植物就干净了。一共八株。\n\n就是园艺，只不过杀的比平常多一点。\n\n玛拉顿病了，而那股腐烂上写着维利塔恩领主的名字。他就在更深的地方。"
L["On the side, Archmage Tervosh in Theramore wanted ten shadowshard fragments from the purple end of the caves. Pretty things, if you like your crystals a little sickly. I didn't ask what an archmage wants with them. Archmages get touchy."] = "另外，塞拉摩的大法师特沃什想要十块暗影残片，从洞穴紫色的那一头弄来。挺漂亮的东西，如果你喜欢带点病态的水晶的话。我没问一位大法师要它们干什么。大法师们脾气敏感。"
L["Vark Battlescar at Shadowprey Village had a remedy for the rot in Maraudon, or the start of one. Take a coated cerulean vial down into the caverns, fill it at the orange crystal pool, and splash it on the Vylestem vines. The vines cough up something called a Noxxious Scion. Put the Scion down and the plant comes back clean. Eight of those and you've healed a garden.\n\nWeeding, the hard way.\n\nMaraudon was sick, and the rot had Lord Vyletongue's name on it. He was somewhere further down, waiting."] = "葬影村的瓦克·战痕有个办法，能治玛拉顿的腐烂，或者说是治疗的开头。拿一个涂过层的蔚蓝药瓶下到洞穴里，在橙色水晶池里装满，然后泼在维利斯塔姆藤蔓上。藤蔓会咳出一个叫诺克赛恩幼体的东西。把幼体放倒，那株植物就恢复干净了。弄上八株，你就治好了一座花园。\n\n除草，用的是费劲的办法。\n\n玛拉顿病了，而那股腐烂上写着维利塔恩领主的名字。他就在更深的地方，等着。"
L["Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar wanted ten shadowshard fragments from the purple side of the caves, so I hauled those all the way up to the Valley of Spirits. Heavy, sharp, and apparently worth it."] = "奥格瑞玛的尤塞尔奈想要十块暗影残片，从洞穴紫色的那一边弄来，于是我把它们一路拖上了精神谷。又沉又尖，看来是值的。"
L["Cavindra had a story about Maraudon, and the story was about Celebras, a keeper the caverns had twisted. Fixing him meant the Scepter of Celebras, which had come apart into a rod and a diamond, and two of the nastiest things in Maraudon were holding a piece each. Neither was in a sharing mood, so I didn't ask nicely.\n\nThen there was Celebras himself, cursed and wild, who had to be beaten before he could be talked to. Not a sentence I expected to say about a keeper.\n\nAfterward he was Celebras the Redeemed, calm and himself again, and I helped him put the scepter back together. Handy thing. Opens a shortcut into the deeper caves.\n\nI've had worse rewards than a door I don't have to fight my way through."] = "凯雯德拉讲了个关于玛拉顿的故事，故事的主角是塞雷布拉斯，一位被洞穴扭曲了的守护者。要把他扳回来，得靠塞雷布拉斯节杖，而那根节杖已经散成了一根杖和一颗钻石，玛拉顿里最难缠的两个家伙各拿着一块。哪个都不想分享，所以我也就没客气。\n\n然后是塞雷布拉斯本人，受了诅咒，发了狂，得先把他打服了，才能跟他讲道理。我可从没想过会对一位守护者说出这种话。\n\n之后他成了赎罪的塞雷布拉斯，平静下来，又变回了自己，我帮他把节杖重新拼好。挺好使的东西。能打开一条通往更深处洞穴的捷径。\n\n比起一扇不用我杀出一条路就能通过的门，我拿过更差的奖励。"
L["At the very bottom of Maraudon lives Princess Theradras. She is a great deal of angry rock, more or less, and she did not want company. I'd been sent down to kill her, so that worked out for everyone but her.\n\nWhen she fell, a spirit came to talk. Zaetar. Brother of Remulos, and, with Theradras, father of the centaur, which explains a lot about Desolace. He'd been down there a long time. He didn't ask for revenge. He asked me to take something to his brother, and gave me the Seed of Life for Remulos in Moonglade.\n\nSo I carried a seed out of the deepest hole in Desolace, all the way to Moonglade.\n\nEverything in Maraudon had tried to kill me on the way down. The last thing it did was hand me a gift. Odd place."] = "玛拉顿的最底层住着瑟莱德丝公主。她差不多就是一大堆发怒的石头，而且不想见客。我被派下去就是要杀她的，所以这安排对谁都挺好，除了她。\n\n她倒下以后，有个灵魂过来说话。扎尔塔。雷姆洛斯的兄弟，也是他和瑟莱德丝生下了半人马，这倒解释了凄凉之地的不少事。他在下面待了很久。他没要我报仇。他让我给他兄弟带样东西，把生命之种交给我，让我送到月光林地的雷姆洛斯那儿。\n\n于是我从凄凉之地最深的那个洞里，捧着一颗种子，一路走到了月光林地。\n\n下去的路上，玛拉顿里的一切都想杀我。它做的最后一件事，却是送了我一份礼物。真是个怪地方。"
L["Feathermoon was missing a courier. Raschal, coming from Thalanaar. Latronicus Moonspear had already written him down as missing in action, and once Feathermoon writes you down, you tend to stay written.\n\nGinro Hearthkindle hadn't given up. Ginro had spent a week combing Feralas and come back with nothing but gnoll teeth. So I took a turn along the Forgotten Coast and found the boat. A row boat with the Feathermoon crest on it, torn almost in two.\n\nNo Raschal. No body, either, which was something. Just a knife, lying in the mud by the wreck.\n\nI brought it back to Ginro. A knife can't tell you much, I thought. I was wrong about that, but that's the next part."] = "羽月要塞丢了一个信使。拉斯卡尔，从萨兰纳尔来的。拉托尼库斯·月矛已经把他记成了“作战失踪”，而一旦羽月把你记下来，你多半就一直是这个状态了。\n\n基恩诺·火花还没放弃。基恩诺花了一个星期把菲拉斯翻了个遍，除了一堆豺狼人的牙，什么都没找到。于是我换个班，沿着被遗忘的海岸走了一圈，找到了那条船。一条印着羽月徽记的划艇，几乎被撕成了两半。\n\n没有拉斯卡尔。也没有尸体，这多少算个好消息。只有一把刀，躺在残骸旁边的泥里。\n\n我把它带回去给了基恩诺。一把刀能告诉你什么呢，我想。这点我想错了，不过那是下一段的事了。"
L["Ginro's next idea was a new one on me. Take the knife to Quintis Jonespyre, who can hold a thing and read where it's been.\n\nSo Quintis held the knife and told me what it remembered. Raschal, hauling two big leather backpacks inland. Raschal, fretting about Woodpaw gnolls the whole way. And Raschal, not noticing the water elementals forming up behind him.\n\nThat last part was not encouraging.\n\nHandy trick, psychometry. I'd hate to have it at a dinner party, though. Imagine picking up somebody's fork. Still, it beat a week of turning over rocks, and now we knew where to look: inland, toward the gnolls, after a courier who'd had a worse day than anyone had guessed."] = "基恩诺的下一个主意我还是头一回听说。把刀拿去给奎恩提斯，奎恩提斯拿着一样东西，就能读出它去过哪儿。\n\n于是奎恩提斯握着那把刀，把它记得的事告诉了我。拉斯卡尔，拖着两个大皮背包往内陆走。拉斯卡尔，一路上都在担心木爪豺狼人。还有拉斯卡尔，没注意到身后正在成形的水元素。\n\n最后这一条可不怎么让人宽心。\n\n读物术，挺好使的本事。不过我可不想在宴会上有这本事。想想你拿起别人的叉子会怎样。不管怎么说，这总比翻一个星期的石头强，现在我们知道该往哪儿找了：往内陆，朝豺狼人那边，去找一个这天过得比谁想的都糟的信使。"
L["The Woodpaw camps are about what you'd expect. Gnolls, bones, a smell you take home with you. I went through them looking for anything of Raschal's and found both his packs, pinned to a tree like a trophy, Feathermoon insignia and all.\n\nThe other thing in the packs was a note, and the note changed the whole picture. Raschal had seen strange insect creatures south of the gnoll camps, and gone to have a look.\n\nNot lost, then. Not dragged off by gnolls, either. Our courier had gone looking for trouble on purpose. I liked him already."] = "木爪豺狼人的营地，跟你想的差不多。豺狼人，骨头，还有一股你会带回家的味道。我把营地翻了一遍，找拉斯卡尔的东西，结果找到了他那两个背包，像战利品一样钉在一棵树上，羽月的徽记还在上面。\n\n背包里的另一样东西是一张字条，这张字条把整件事都变了样。拉斯卡尔在豺狼人营地南边看见了奇怪的虫子生物，就跑去看个究竟了。\n\n那就不是迷路了。也不是被豺狼人拖走的。我们的信使是自己故意去找麻烦的。我已经开始喜欢他了。"
L["Inside was a parcel he'd never delivered, meant for Falfindel Waywarder in Thalanaar. I took it there myself. A courier's job ought to get finished, even if the courier can't finish it."] = "里面有一个他一直没送到的包裹，是要交给萨兰纳尔的法芬德尔·维沃德的。我亲自送了过去。信使的活儿就该办完，哪怕信使自己办不完了。"
L["South of the gnolls there's a hole in the ground called the Writhing Deep, and it's full of Zukk'ash. Insects, big ones, all legs and mandibles. Somewhere in there was Raschal, or what was left of him.\n\nWhat was left of him turned out to be all of him, sealed up in a pod. I got him out, and he had a report to make.\n\nBack at Feathermoon, Shandris Feathermoon read that report and sent me straight to Darnassus with it, where somebody finally put a name to what was under Feralas.\n\nSilithid.\n\nI went out looking for one lost courier and came back with a warning for all of Kalimdor. Not bad for a knife in the mud."] = "豺狼人营地南边，地上有个洞，叫痛苦深渊，里面全是祖卡什。虫子，大虫子，满身都是腿和大颚。拉斯卡尔就在里面某个地方，或者说他剩下的部分在里面。\n\n结果他剩下的部分就是他的全部，被封在一个虫茧里。我把他弄了出来，他有一份报告要交。\n\n回到羽月要塞，珊蒂斯·羽月读了那份报告，直接派我带着它去达纳苏斯，在那儿终于有人说出了菲拉斯底下那东西的名字。\n\n异种蝎。\n\n我出门去找一个走丢的信使，回来时带着一个给全卡利姆多的警告。对泥里的一把刀来说，还不赖。"
L["It began with a quiet word outside the cathedral: Bishop DeLavey wanted to see me up in Stormwind Keep. From the way it was said, I gathered it wasn't about my soul.\n\nThe bishop told me exactly as much as I needed and not a word more. A diplomat had gone missing, and it was not to be talked about. A contact in the Valley of Heroes handed me a sealed note for Elling Trias, a man with a cheese shop and, it turns out, a good deal more than that. Trias read it, sealed up a note of his own, and sent me off to a watchman in Duskwood.\n\nThat's how you know it's serious. Nobody says anything out loud. They write it down, seal it, and make you carry it."] = "事情是从大教堂外头一句悄悄话开始的：德拉维主教想在暴风要塞见我。从那句话的口气，我听得出来这跟我的灵魂没关系。\n\n主教告诉我的，不多不少正好是我需要知道的。一位外交官失踪了，而且这事不许声张。英雄谷的一个联络人递给我一张封好的字条，交给埃林·提亚斯，一个开奶酪店的人，后来才知道，他可远不止是个开奶酪店的。提亚斯读完，自己也封好一张字条，打发我去找暮色森林的一个守夜人。\n\n这就是事情严重的标志。没人大声说话。他们把话写下来，封好，让你带着跑。"
L["Watcher Backus walks the road north of Darkshire. Backus read the note and sent me out to Addle's Stead, an old farm in western Duskwood, where a little house had some paperwork in it that the Defias wouldn't want found. The Defias Docket.\n\nHere's a thing about the Defias nobody warns you about. They keep records. Whether that's very organized or very stupid, I've never decided. It does make my job easier.\n\nBackus took one look at it and sent me straight back to Stormwind. Trias read it the way a man reads a bill he already knew was coming, and had my next stop picked out before he'd put it down."] = "守夜人巴库斯在夜色镇北边的路上巡逻。巴库斯读了字条，把我派到腐草农场，暮色森林西边的一座老农场，那里有间小屋，里面有迪菲亚不想让人找到的文件。迪菲亚案卷。\n\n关于迪菲亚，有件事没人提醒过你。他们记账。这到底是很有条理还是很蠢，我一直没想明白。反正让我的活儿好干了不少。\n\n巴库斯看了一眼，就直接把我打发回暴风城。提亚斯读它的样子，就像一个人在读一张他早知道要来的账单，还没放下，就已经替我挑好了下一站。"
L["The next lead was Dashel Stonefist, in Old Town. With a name like that, the conversation was always going to start with fists. Dashel didn't want to talk. Dashel wanted to settle things the old way, so we did, and when it was over Dashel was a good deal more reasonable.\n\nWhat Dashel told me sent me back to Trias, and Trias sent me out of the city altogether: north to the Wetlands, to Menethil Harbor and a contact there named Mikhail.\n\nI've always liked that part of a job. One minute you're trading punches in Old Town, the next you're on the road with a name in your pocket and a long way to go."] = "下一条线索是旧城区的达舍尔·石拳。叫这么个名字，这场谈话注定要从拳头开始。达舍尔不想谈。达舍尔想按老规矩解决，于是我们就按老规矩解决了，完事以后，达舍尔讲理多了。\n\n达舍尔告诉我的事又把我打发回提亚斯那儿，而提亚斯干脆把我送出了城：往北去湿地，去米奈希尔港，找一个叫米克哈尔的联络人。\n\n我一直喜欢差事里的这一段。前一分钟你还在旧城区跟人互殴，下一分钟你就上路了，口袋里揣着一个名字，前面还有很长的路。"
L["Mikhail works out of the Deepwater Tavern in Menethil Harbor and notices things. Lately Mikhail had noticed a fellow who listened to other people's business a little too hard.\n\nThat was Tapoke Jahn. Slim, to his friends, if he has any. The moment Slim saw me coming, he did what guilty men always do. He ran. He didn't get far. I subdued him, and after that Slim was very keen to be helpful.\n\nSlim's confession pointed south, across the sea, to Theramore. So Mikhail sent me to find a commander in Dustwallow Marsh, and I took the next boat out."] = "米克哈尔在米奈希尔港的深水旅店做事，什么都看在眼里。最近米克哈尔注意到一个家伙，偷听别人的事偷听得有点太用力了。\n\n那就是塔伯克·贾恩。朋友们叫他“干柴”，如果他有朋友的话。干柴一看见我过来，就做了心虚的人都会做的事。他跑了。没跑多远。我把他制伏了，之后干柴就变得非常乐于助人。\n\n干柴的供词指向南边，大海对面的塞拉摩。于是米克哈尔让我去尘泥沼泽找一位指挥官，我搭上了下一班船。"
L["Theramore is Jaina Proudmoore's city. The commander there had me search Sentry Point for any sign of a Private Hendel. No Hendel. When a soldier isn't at his post, that tells you plenty.\n\nAn archmage in Jaina's tower knew where to look instead: some tents out northwest of the city. Hendel was there, and Hendel was not in a talking mood, so we had it out. When he finally yielded, Lady Jaina Proudmoore herself was there to take him off my hands, with a quiet word of thanks for me.\n\nQuiet. That was the whole job, start to finish. I never did learn the diplomat's name. But considering who sent me looking and who turned up to say thank you, I have a fair idea."] = "塞拉摩是吉安娜·普罗德摩尔的城。那里的指挥官让我去警戒哨岗搜一搜，找一个叫亨德尔的下士。没有亨德尔。一个士兵不在自己的岗位上，这本身就说明了很多。\n\n吉安娜塔楼里的一位大法师知道该去哪儿找：城西北的几顶帐篷。亨德尔就在那儿，而亨德尔没心情说话，于是我们打了一场。等他终于认输的时候，吉安娜·普罗德摩尔女士亲自来把他从我手里接了过去，还低声向我道了谢。\n\n低声。从头到尾，这整件差事就是这样。我始终不知道那位外交官叫什么名字。不过看看是谁派我去找、又是谁出面来道谢的，我心里大概有数。"
L["The orcs at Stonard had caught themselves a spy. A human, Infiltrator Marksen, who'd seen more than he should. Out at Beggar's Haunt, two of the Forsaken offered to help get the truth out of him: Deathstalker Zraedus and Apothecary Faustin. A truth serum. Very neighborly.\n\nThe recipe called for panther hearts, a rare fungus and a tumor out of a giant. I'll leave the tumor there. Faustin brewed it all up and I carried it to Zraedus, and what came back to me was called Zraedus's Brew.\n\nI took it down to Stonard and gave it to Marksen. Marksen drank it. Marksen didn't have a great deal to say after that.\n\nZraedus was very pleased with how helpful we'd all been."] = "斯通纳德的兽人抓到了一个间谍。一个人类，间谍玛克森，看到了不该看的东西。在乞丐鬼屋，两个被遗忘者主动提出帮忙让他吐出实话：亡灵哨兵莱度斯和药剂师法奥斯丁。一种吐真剂。真是好邻居。\n\n配方要豹子的心脏、一种罕见的真菌，还有一个巨人身上的肿瘤。肿瘤的事我就不多说了。法奥斯丁把这些全熬好，我送去给莱度斯，送回到我手里的东西叫莱度斯的药剂。\n\n我把它带到斯通纳德，交给了玛克森。玛克森喝了。之后玛克森就没什么好说的了。\n\n莱度斯对我们大家这么乐于助人，非常满意。"
L["Morgan's Vigil had a dragonkin problem, and for about an afternoon I was the solution. Then the letters started. The Vigil wrote to the magistrate in Lakeshire, the magistrate wrote to Stormwind, and I carried every one of them up and down the kingdom like a well-armed pigeon.\n\nIn the keep, Lady Katrana Prestor had a little advice for me before the Highlord gave his answer. The answer was no. A very polite no, on very good paper. The magistrate read it twice and stopped being polite himself.\n\nWhich is how I ended up in a cave up north of the Ruins of Thaurissan, listening to a fellow called Ragged John tell me what had become of a marshal named Windsor. The ragged part, I'll say, was earned."] = "摩根的岗哨有龙人的麻烦，有那么一个下午，我就是解决办法。然后信就开始来了。岗哨写信给湖畔镇的镇长，镇长写信给暴风城，我把每一封都在王国里上上下下地送，活像一只全副武装的信鸽。\n\n在要塞里，女伯爵卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托在大领主给出答复之前，先给了我一点小建议。答复是不行。一个非常客气的不行，写在非常好的纸上。镇长读了两遍，自己也不再客气了。\n\n就这样，我最后到了索瑞森废墟北边的一个山洞里，听一个叫狼狈不堪的约翰的家伙给我讲一位叫温德索尔的元帅后来怎么样了。我得说，“狼狈不堪”这几个字，他是实打实挣来的。"
L["Ragged John's tale ended in a Dark Iron prison, so down into Blackrock Depths I went, and there was Marshal Windsor in a cell, finished. They'd taken his proof, and with it whatever had been holding him up. He sent me back to give Maxwell the bad news.\n\nHe'd have stayed finished, too, if a crumpled note hadn't turned up in the Depths. One look at it and the marshal was back. His papers were with a golem lord and a general down there, and neither of them wanted to give anything back. I didn't take it personally.\n\nOnce Windsor had his papers, he wanted his gear and his friends out of their cells, in that order. Blackrock Depths had opinions about that. We got both anyway."] = "狼狈不堪的约翰的故事结束在黑铁矮人的监狱里，于是我下到了黑石深渊，温德索尔元帅就在一间牢房里，已经垮了。他们拿走了他的证据，连同撑着他的那股劲儿一起拿走了。他让我回去把坏消息告诉麦克斯韦尔。\n\n要不是深渊里冒出来一张皱巴巴的字条，他也就一直垮下去了。他看了一眼，元帅就回来了。他的文件在下面的一个石像领主和一个将军手里，两个都不想还。我没往心里去。\n\n温德索尔拿回文件以后，又想要回他的装备，再把他的朋友们从牢房里弄出来，按这个顺序。黑石深渊对此很有意见。我们还是两样都办到了。"
L["A squire at the gates of Stormwind had one job that day: let Marshal Windsor know I'd come. Then Windsor arrived, and we walked into the city together, and I kept him alive all the way up to the keep. That took some doing.\n\nIn the throne room he faced Lady Katrana Prestor, the most trusted voice at court, and called her by her real name. Onyxia. The whole court got a good look at what had been whispering in the Highlord's ear all this time.\n\nShe killed him for it, right there. But the secret was out, and there's no spell in the world that puts that back.\n\nI never got to buy him a drink. So this one's his."] = "暴风城门口的一个侍从那天只有一件事要做：告诉温德索尔元帅我来了。然后温德索尔到了，我们一起走进城里，我一路护着他活着走到了要塞。这可费了不少劲。\n\n在王座大厅里，他直面朝堂上最受信任的那个声音，女伯爵卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托，叫出了她的真名。奥妮克希亚。整个朝堂都看清楚了，这么久以来在大领主耳边低语的到底是什么东西。\n\n她当场为此杀了他。可秘密已经说出来了，这世上没有哪个法术能把它塞回去。\n\n我始终没机会请他喝一杯。所以这一杯敬他。"
L["Afterward the Highlord handed me a fragment of something called the Dragon's Eye and told me to find someone who could restore its power. Who? Nobody knew. Where? Nobody knew that either. All anyone could say for certain was that such a someone existed. I've had better directions from drunks.\n\nThe someone turned out to be Haleh, up at Mazthoril in Winterspring, and Haleh's price for the Drakefire Amulet was the blood of the black dragonflight's champion. General Drakkisath, on his throne at the top of Blackrock Spire.\n\nI went up with friends. Drakkisath had a great many guards and a bad temper, and by the end a lot less blood. Haleh made the amulet. Onyxia keeps a lair down in Dustwallow Marsh, and now I can let myself in."] = "事后，大领主递给我一块叫巨龙之眼的东西的碎片，让我去找个能恢复它力量的人。谁？没人知道。在哪儿？也没人知道。大家唯一能确定的，就是这么个人确实存在。醉汉给我指的路都比这强。\n\n这个人后来证明是冬泉谷麦索瑞尔的哈尔琳，哈尔琳做龙火护符的代价，是黑龙军团勇士的血。达基萨斯将军，坐在黑石塔顶上的王座上。\n\n我叫上朋友一起上去了。达基萨斯手下卫兵很多，脾气很坏，到最后血也少了很多。哈尔琳做好了护符。奥妮克希亚在尘泥沼泽有个巢穴，现在我可以自己开门进去了。"
L["Warlord Goretooth in Kargath doesn't give orders so much as read out a list. Three names in Lower Blackrock Spire, all to be dead, and whatever papers they were sitting on brought back. What was in those papers got me sent straight to Orgrimmar.\n\nThe Warchief's answer was short. Go to Blackrock Spire. Kill Rend Blackhand. Bring back his head. Rend called himself a warchief, and Orgrimmar only has room for one.\n\nSo I went, and Rend's head came home with me. Then Thrall sat me down and told me what the wind had been carrying, and none of it was good. Dragons, mostly. Black ones."] = "卡加斯的军官高图斯与其说是在下命令，不如说是在念清单。黑石塔下层的三个名字，统统要死，他们手里压着的文件一并带回来。那些文件里写的东西，让我直接被派去了奥格瑞玛。\n\n酋长的答复很简短。去黑石塔。杀了雷德·黑手。把他的脑袋带回来。雷德自称酋长，而奥格瑞玛只容得下一个。\n\n于是我去了，雷德的脑袋跟我一起回了家。然后萨尔让我坐下，告诉我风里都传来了些什么，没有一件是好事。主要是龙。黑色的。"
L["Finding Rexxar is a job in itself. He walks the roads of Desolace somewhere between Stonetalon and Feralas, which is a great deal of road. I walked most of it before I caught him walking the rest.\n\nHe sent me with his testament to Myranda the Hag in the Western Plaguelands. Myranda deals in deception, and deception has ingredients. This batch needed twenty eyes off the black dragonspawn in Blackrock Spire. I didn't ask why eyes. Myranda didn't say.\n\nWhat came back was an amulet. Wear it into Emberstrife's den in Dustwallow Marsh, and a black dragon looks at you and sees family. I stood there in somebody else's scales making polite conversation with a dragon. Still one of my better performances."] = "找雷克萨本身就是一份活儿。他在凄凉之地的路上游荡，大概在石爪山脉和菲拉斯之间，那可是好长一段路。我走了其中大半，才赶上正在走剩下那段的他。\n\n他让我带着他的证词去找西瘟疫之地的巫女麦兰达。麦兰达擅长骗术，而骗术是要配料的。这一批需要二十只眼睛，从黑石塔的黑龙人身上取。我没问为什么是眼睛。麦兰达也没说。\n\n送回来的是一个护符。戴着它走进尘泥沼泽埃博斯塔夫的巢穴，黑龙看着你，看到的就是自家人。我披着别人的鳞片站在那儿，跟一条龙客客气气地聊天。到现在都是我演得最好的几场戏之一。"
L["Emberstrife wanted proof, and dragons keep their proof in skulls. Four of them, one from the champion of each of the other flights: blue up in Winterspring, green in the Swamp of Sorrows, red on the road to Grim Batol, and bronze guarding the Caverns of Time. That's a lot of map for one shopping list, and not one of them went down easy.\n\nI hauled the lot back to the Wyrmbog, still wearing my borrowed face, and came away with a dull old amulet and one large problem. The next step was inside Blackrock Spire, and the disguise wouldn't hold up in there.\n\nThe charade was over. So I went to find Rexxar again, which, as you'll remember, takes a while."] = "埃博斯塔夫要证据，而龙把证据放在头骨里。四个，每个其他龙族的勇士各一个：冬泉谷的蓝龙，悲伤沼泽的绿龙，去格瑞姆巴托路上的红龙，还有守着时光之穴的青铜龙。一张购物清单占了这么大一块地图，而且没有一个是好打的。\n\n我把它们全拖回巨龙沼泽，脸上还挂着借来的那张脸，换回了一个黯淡的旧护符和一个大问题。下一步在黑石塔里面，而这身伪装在那里撑不住。\n\n这场戏演完了。于是我又去找雷克萨，而你应该还记得，这得花上一阵子。"
L["Rexxar took one look at the dull amulet and knew what it needed: blood. General Drakkisath's, to be exact, champion of the black dragonflight, who keeps his throne at the very top of Blackrock Spire.\n\nNo disguise this time. We went up the hard way, through everything the Spire had, and into the throne room behind the Halls of Ascension. Drakkisath did not want to part with any of his blood. By the end he'd parted with all of it.\n\nRexxar did the rest and handed me the Drakefire Amulet. Four skulls, twenty eyes, one borrowed face and a dead general went into that thing. If Onyxia ever wonders who's knocking, it's me."] = "雷克萨看了一眼那个黯淡的护符，就知道它缺什么：血。准确地说，是达基萨斯将军的血，黑龙军团的勇士，他的王座就在黑石塔的最顶上。\n\n这次不用伪装。我们用笨办法往上打，穿过黑石塔里的一切，进了晋升大厅后面的王座厅。达基萨斯一滴血都不想给。到最后他全给了。\n\n剩下的雷克萨来办，他把龙火护符交给了我。四个头骨，二十只眼睛，一张借来的脸，再加一个死掉的将军，全都装进了那东西里。要是奥妮克希亚哪天想知道是谁在敲门，那就是我。"
L["On the road into Westfall there's a broken-down wagon, and beside it the Furlbrows, who left their farm in a hurry and couldn't bring much with them.\n\nFarmer Furlbrow wanted one thing. Not the farm, not the furniture. His pocket watch, still sitting in the wardrobe back at the farmhouse. So I walked out to the pumpkin farm and fetched it. Of everything a man could leave behind, that was the one he couldn't stop thinking about.\n\nVerna's worry was Blanchy, their old horse, who was hungry and getting no younger. I went through the fields picking up oats until I had eight handfuls. Blanchy ate every one and looked at me like I'd hung the moon."] = "去西部荒野的路上有一辆坏掉的马车，旁边是法布隆一家，他们匆匆忙忙离开了自家农场，没能带上多少东西。\n\n农夫法布隆只想要一样东西。不是农场，也不是家具。是他的怀表，还放在农舍的衣柜里。于是我走到南瓜农场，把它取了回来。一个人能落下的那么多东西里，他偏偏就是放不下这一样。\n\n弗娜担心的是布兰契，他们家的老马，饿着肚子，而且年纪也不小了。我在田里一把一把地捡燕麦，捡够了八把。布兰契全吃光了，看着我的样子，好像我替它把月亮挂上了天。"
L["Later on I turned up Furlbrow's deed in a Defias camp in Elwynn. Thieves will take anything that isn't nailed down, and a few things that are."] = "后来我在艾尔文森林的一个迪菲亚营地里翻出了法布隆的地契。贼什么都偷，只要没钉死在地上，有些钉死了的也照偷。"
L["If you want to understand Princess Moira, the Royal Historian in Ironforge will explain, and it takes a while. The Dark Irons, the War of the Three Hammers, and how the Burning Steppes came to be burning. Then, so I'd really understand, I was sent out to the Ruins of Thaurissan to read the old relics myself. History lessons, in the hottest classroom in the Eastern Kingdoms.\n\nThat was the warm-up. King Magni wanted me to find Kharan Mighthammer, a prisoner deep in Blackrock Depths. Kharan had a tale about Moira. I listened. It was not the tale Magni wanted.\n\nThen I had to go back to Ironforge and tell him. Here's some free advice. If you're ever handed bad news for a king about his daughter, see if anyone else is going that way."] = "要是你想了解茉艾拉公主，铁炉堡的皇家历史学家会给你讲，得讲好一阵子。黑铁矮人，三锤之战，还有燃烧平原是怎么烧起来的。然后，为了让我真正明白，他们又把我派到索瑞森废墟，自己去读那些古老的遗物。历史课，在东部王国最热的教室里上。\n\n那只是热身。麦格尼国王要我去找卡兰·巨锤，一个关在黑石深渊深处的囚犯。卡兰有个关于茉艾拉的故事。我听了。那不是麦格尼想听的故事。\n\n然后我得回铁炉堡告诉他。给你一句免费的忠告。要是哪天有人让你给一位国王带关于他女儿的坏消息，看看有没有别人正好顺路。"
L["Magni's orders were plain. Back into Blackrock Depths, kill Emperor Dagran Thaurissan, and bring Moira home.\n\nBlackrock Depths is a city, not a cellar, and the emperor sits at the far end of it. We got there. We did the first part. The emperor went down, and I turned around to rescue the princess.\n\nThe princess did not want rescuing. She'd married him, and she was mourning her husband. She also had news. She was carrying his child, and that child would be heir to Ironforge.\n\nThat news went back to her father by way of me. Of every report I've ever made, that's the one where I most wished I'd taken the long road. Magni wanted his daughter back. What he got was a grandchild, and a problem nobody could kill."] = "麦格尼的命令很明白。回黑石深渊，杀了达格兰·索瑞森大帝，把茉艾拉带回家。\n\n黑石深渊是一座城，不是一个地窖，而大帝坐在它的最里头。我们到了。第一部分我们办到了。大帝倒下了，我转身去救公主。\n\n公主不想被救。她嫁给了他，正在为丈夫哀悼。她还有个消息。她怀着他的孩子，而那个孩子将是铁炉堡的继承人。\n\n这个消息是经我的手带回给她父亲的。在我交过的所有报告里，就这一份，我最希望自己当时绕了远路。麦格尼想要回他的女儿。他得到的是一个外孙，还有一个谁都杀不掉的难题。"
L["I was shown a drawing of an orc. Crude, with bars scribbled over the face. That was the whole clue. So I went looking for a prison, and Blackrock Depths has a big one, and in it was Commander Gor'shak.\n\nThe Dark Irons didn't care for us talking, and halfway through they came at us in waves. I made sure the commander lived to finish the story. Another prisoner nearby had the real news: Princess Moira Bronzebeard, kidnapped by the Dark Irons.\n\nThrall heard me out and sent me back in to kill the emperor and free the princess from his spell.\n\nI did the killing. The princess did not look like anyone under a spell. She looked like a widow, carrying the emperor's child, an heir with a claim on Ironforge. I took that back to Orgrimmar and watched the Warchief do some very careful thinking."] = "有人给我看了一幅兽人的画像。画得很粗糙，脸上还胡乱画了几道栏杆。线索就这么多。于是我去找一座监狱，黑石深渊里有一座大的，里面关着指挥官哥沙克。\n\n黑铁矮人不喜欢我们聊天，聊到一半，他们就一波一波地冲了过来。我保住了指挥官的命，让他把故事讲完。旁边的另一个囚犯带来了真正的消息：铁炉堡公主茉艾拉·铜须，被黑铁矮人绑架了。\n\n萨尔听我说完，派我回去杀掉大帝，把公主从他的咒语里解救出来。\n\n人我杀了。可公主看上去一点都不像中了咒语。她看上去像个寡妇，怀着大帝的孩子，一个对铁炉堡有继承权的后代。我把这个消息带回奥格瑞玛，看着酋长陷入了非常谨慎的思考。"
L["Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar was worried about Teronis, who'd gone west looking for some way to stop the furbolg attacks and hadn't come back. Raene asked me to find Teronis. I did, out by Lake Falathim. The murlocs had found Teronis first.\n\nThere was a journal on the body, though, and a glowing gem still to be found. I found it, and brought both back to Astranaar.\n\nRaene read the journal and the job changed. Teronis had been onto something, a way to slow the attacks, and it wasn't finished. The next step was a moonwell to the northeast and someone there called Shael'dryn. So off I went. Errands from the dead are still errands."] = "阿斯特兰纳的莱恩·狼行者在担心特洛尼斯，特洛尼斯往西去找能制止熊怪袭击的办法，一直没回来。莱恩请我去找特洛尼斯。我找到了，在法拉希姆湖边。鱼人比我先找到了特洛尼斯。\n\n不过尸体上有一本日记，还有一颗发光的宝石有待寻找。我找到了，把两样东西都带回了阿斯特兰纳。\n\n莱恩读了那本日记，差事就变了。特洛尼斯当时发现了点什么，一种能减缓袭击的办法，而这事还没做完。下一步是东北边的一座月亮井，那儿有个叫莎尔蒂恩的人。于是我又出发了。死人交代的差事，也是差事。"
L["Shael'dryn, at the moonwell, knew exactly what Teronis had been after: Dartol's Rod, broken into pieces and hidden around the worst corners of Ashenvale. So it was a scavenger hunt, with twisted treants up toward Felwood holding one of the pieces and not in a sharing mood.\n\nThe pommel was the low point. It was down in the Dor'danil barrow den, and I'll spare you exactly where I found it. I washed my hands for a week.\n\nOnce the rod was whole I took it to a hidden shrine to wake it up again, and still nobody had told me what the thing actually did. That came later. It involved fur."] = "月亮井边的莎尔蒂恩，清楚地知道特洛尼斯在找什么：达托尔的变形之杖，碎成了好几块，藏在灰谷最糟糕的那些角落里。所以这就是一场寻宝游戏，费伍德森林那边有些扭曲的树人手里攥着其中一块，而且不想分享。\n\n杖柄那一段是最低谷。它在朵丹尼尔兽穴下面，我在哪儿找到的就不细说了。我洗了一个星期的手。\n\n杖拼好以后，我把它带到一座隐秘的神龛去重新唤醒，可到那时候还是没人告诉我这东西到底能干什么。那是后来的事了。跟毛皮有关。"
L["Here's what Dartol's Rod does: you use it, and you're a furbolg. Raene wanted me to find one of the few furbolg left uncorrupted, and apparently walking up in my own skin was not the way to start that conversation.\n\nKrolg was the one, southeast of Mystral Lake. Krolg had no love for the night elves and blamed them for what had happened to the furbolg. Didn't hide it, either. But Ran Bloodtooth's lot had gone bad, and Krolg wanted Ran dead.\n\nSo I obliged. Four of the Bloodtooth guards, then Ran, and Ran's skull came home with me.\n\nRaene got the skull and the rod back. I kept the memory of having fur. Not my look, honestly. And itchy."] = "达托尔的变形之杖的用法是这样的：你一用，就变成了熊怪。莱恩想让我去找少数几个还没被腐化的熊怪之一，而顶着我自己这张皮走过去，显然不是开启这场谈话的好办法。\n\n要找的就是克罗格，在密斯特拉湖东南边。克罗格对暗夜精灵毫无好感，把熊怪遭的罪都算在他们头上。也没打算藏着。不过兰恩·血牙那一伙已经变坏了，克罗格想要兰恩的命。\n\n于是我就成全了克罗格。四个血牙卫兵，然后是兰恩，兰恩的头骨跟我一起回了家。\n\n莱恩拿回了头骨和那根杖。我留下了长过一身毛的记忆。说实话，不适合我。而且痒。"
L["Nimboya had the kind of problem nobody at Grom'gol wanted to say out loud. The Darkspear chief's youngest son, Yenniku, was gone, and the Bloodscalps were the only trail anyone had.\n\nThe Bloodscalps don't take questions, so I started by collecting. Shrunken heads, twenty of them, so Nimboya could go through every one and make sure none of them was Yenniku. That's a job you remember. None of them was.\n\nOnly the Bloodscalp leaders knew more, and they weren't sharing. Nimboya had an answer for that as well. I brought back both their heads and dropped them in the cauldron at camp.\n\nTurns out a Bloodscalp gets a lot chattier once you've parted the talking end from the rest."] = "尼姆布亚遇上了那种格罗姆高的人谁都不想大声说出来的麻烦。暗矛酋长最小的儿子耶尼库不见了，而大家手上唯一的线索就是血顶巨魔。\n\n血顶巨魔不接受提问，所以我先从收集开始。缩水的人头，二十个，好让尼姆布亚一个个检查，确认里面没有耶尼库。这种活儿你会记一辈子。里面确实没有。\n\n只有血顶的首领知道得更多，而他们不肯说。尼姆布亚对此也有办法。我把他们俩的脑袋都带了回来，扔进了营地的大锅里。\n\n原来，一个血顶巨魔在你把会说话的那一头跟其余部分分开以后，话就多多了。"
L["Here's something nobody tells you about talking heads. They haggle.\n\nNezzliok's head spoke up from the cauldron first and wanted trophies out of the Skullsplitter ruins, one from each. Gan'zulah's wanted Skullsplitters, dead, by the dozen, and somebody's broken armor on top. Being dead hadn't made either of them any less Bloodscalp. If anything, it had given them time to think about what they wanted.\n\nI paid both bills. Only then did they tell me what they knew. The chief's son hadn't died with the Bloodscalps at all. Zanzil the Outcast had him.\n\nI've bargained with goblins in my time. The goblins were easier."] = "关于会说话的人头，有件事没人告诉你。它们会讨价还价。\n\n奈兹里奥克的脑袋先从锅里开口，想要碎颅遗迹里的战利品，每样一件。甘祖拉恩的脑袋想要碎颅巨魔，死的，一打一打地要，最后还要加上某人的破盔甲。死了也没让他们俩少一点血顶的德行。要说有什么变化，就是让他们有了时间琢磨自己到底想要什么。\n\n两笔账我都付了。直到这时，他们才把知道的事告诉我。酋长的儿子根本没跟血顶巨魔一起死。他在流放者赞吉尔手里。\n\n我这辈子跟地精讨过价。跟地精讨价都比这容易。"
L["Nezzliok had one more thing to say, and it wasn't cheerful. Zanzil didn't just have the chief's son. Zanzil had him body and soul, and you can't cut a soul loose with a blade. Believe me, that was my first idea.\n\nKin'weelay, who'd stood beside that cauldron the whole time as if talking heads were nothing new, knew an old Stranglethorn legend about something called the Mind's Eye. The Eye was in the Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound, with an ogre sitting on it who didn't want to share. I made my case. Kin'weelay took the Eye and a few singing crystals I'd dug out of Crystalvein Mine and worked the lot into a Soul Gem.\n\nPretty thing. Not the sort you'd wear."] = "奈兹里奥克还有一件事要说，而且不是什么让人高兴的事。赞吉尔不只是抓了酋长的儿子。赞吉尔连他的身体带灵魂一起攥在手里，而灵魂可不是用刀能割断的。相信我，那是我的第一个念头。\n\n肯维雷一直站在那口锅旁边，好像会说话的人头没什么稀奇的，肯维雷知道一个古老的荆棘谷传说，讲的是一样叫心灵之眼的东西。那只眼睛在莫什奥格食人魔山，上面坐着一个不想分享的食人魔。我陈述了我的理由。肯维雷拿了那只眼睛，再加上几块我从水晶矿洞里挖出来的会唱歌的水晶，把它们做成了一颗灵魂宝石。\n\n挺漂亮的东西。不是你会戴在身上的那种。"
L["I had the Soul Gem and a very short plan. Find Yenniku. Use the gem. Bring it back full.\n\nHe was down at the Ruins of Aboraz, by the Crystal Shore, with Zanzil's people all around him. The chief's son, standing in the jungle with somebody else's will where his own should be. Not easy to look at. I got close enough, I used the gem, and whatever Zanzil had wrapped around his soul let go. The soul went into the stone.\n\nI carried that gem back to Grom'gol the way you'd carry a full cup through a crowded tavern. Nimboya took it, and for once there was no next errand. Just a promise: the Darkspear would remember who brought their chief's son home.\n\nI've been paid in gold plenty of times. That was better."] = "我有了灵魂宝石，还有一个非常简短的计划。找到耶尼库。用宝石。装满了带回来。\n\n他在水晶海岸边的阿博拉兹废墟，周围全是赞吉尔的人。酋长的儿子，站在丛林里，本该是他自己意志的地方，装着别人的意志。看着可不好受。我靠得够近，用了宝石，赞吉尔缠在他灵魂上的东西松开了。灵魂进了石头里。\n\n我捧着那颗宝石回格罗姆高，就像端着一杯满满的酒穿过一间挤满人的酒馆。尼姆布亚接了过去，难得这一次，没有下一个差事了。只有一个承诺：暗矛巨魔会记住是谁把他们酋长的儿子带回了家。\n\n我拿过不少金币当报酬。那一次比金币好。"
L["Deathknell is a graveyard with a town attached, and the Scarlet Crusade had camped right next door. Executor Arren had me thin them out first and wanted their armbands as proof. Executors like a tally.\n\nThe real prize was their messenger, Meven Korgal, sitting in the Crusader camp with papers meant for somebody important. They reached somebody important, all right. Ours.\n\nArren read the documents and didn't care for a word of them. Next thing I'm carrying them up the road to Executor Zygand in Brill at a brisk walk. When an executor wants something delivered, you don't stop to admire the pumpkins."] = "丧钟镇就是一片坟地外加一个镇子，而血色十字军就在隔壁扎了营。执行官阿伦先让我去削减他们的人数，还要他们的臂章当证据。执行官们喜欢数数。\n\n真正的大鱼是他们的信使，迈文·考加尔，坐在十字军营地里，带着要交给某个大人物的文件。文件确实送到了某个大人物手里。我们的大人物。\n\n阿伦读了那些文件，一个字都不喜欢。紧接着，我就带着它们顺着大路快步赶往布瑞尔，交给执行官塞加德。执行官要你送东西的时候，你可别停下来欣赏南瓜。"
L["Brill's war on the Crusade started with pumpkins. I stole ten off a farm up by Deathknell and hauled them to Apothecary Johaan, who did something to one of them that I didn't watch too closely. A laced pumpkin, for the Scarlet Zealot they kept in the tavern cellar. I carried it down myself. The zealot got a pumpkin. That's as far as I'm taking that story.\n\nExecutor Zygand preferred the direct approach, and kept sending me out to the Scarlet camps west of town until there weren't many captains left in them.\n\nOne of the deathguards wanted their rings as proof. My word, apparently, wasn't enough. Ten rings later, it was."] = "布瑞尔对十字军的战争是从南瓜开始的。我从丧钟镇那边的一个农场偷了十个，拖去给药剂师乔汉，他对其中一个做了点什么，我没太仔细看。一个下了料的南瓜，给他们关在旅店地窖里的那个血色狂热者。我亲自送下去的。狂热者得到了一个南瓜。这个故事我就讲到这儿。\n\n执行官塞加德更喜欢直截了当的办法，一直派我去镇子西边的血色营地，直到那些营地里没剩下几个队长。\n\n有个亡灵卫兵要他们的戒指当证据。看来我的话还不够。十枚戒指以后，就够了。"
L["Brother Crowley in the Stormwind Cathedral wanted me to go and see a Brother Anton. In Desolace. You don't just wander over to Desolace, but I went, and at Nijel's Point Anton had a job ready and waiting.\n\nThirty undead ravagers. Not twenty, not a handful. Thirty. I counted, because I knew Anton would.\n\nThat earned me a letter of commendation to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore. That's how it goes with the devout. You do them one favor, they write you a reference, and the reference gets you a bigger favor. Raleigh read it and started talking about a monastery up in Tirisfal Glades, and how badly it needed a visit."] = "暴风城大教堂的克罗雷修士想让我去见一位安东修士。在凄凉之地。凄凉之地可不是随便溜达就能过去的，但我还是去了，而在尼耶尔前哨站，安东早就准备好了一份活儿等着我。\n\n三十个亡灵劫掠者。不是二十个，也不是一小撮。三十个。我数了，因为我知道安东也会数。\n\n这给我换来了一封推荐信，交给南海镇的虔诚的莱雷恩。虔诚的人就是这样。你帮他们一个忙，他们就给你写封推荐信，推荐信又给你换来一个更大的忙。莱雷恩读完，就开始讲提瑞斯法林地的一座修道院，说那地方多么需要有人去拜访一下。"
L["Librarian Mae Paledust works in the Hall of Explorers in Ironforge and wanted one book in particular, the Mythology of the Titans. The copy Mae had in mind was sitting in the library of the Scarlet Monastery, where, as far as I could tell, nobody was reading it.\n\nSo a few of us went in to borrow a book. That's how I put it to myself, anyway. The Library wing is long halls, tall shelves and a great many serious people in red who don't care for visitors. Borrowing took some doing.\n\nWe came out with the book. Mae took it the way most people take a newborn, very carefully and without looking at anyone else in the room. I've had warmer thanks. I've rarely seen anybody happier, though, and I've watched people find gold."] = "图书馆员麦伊·苍尘在铁炉堡的探险者大厅工作，特别想要一本书，《泰坦神话》。麦伊想要的那一本就放在血色修道院的图书馆里，照我看，那儿根本没人在读它。\n\n于是我们几个人进去借一本书。至少我是这么跟自己说的。图书馆那一区全是长长的走廊、高高的书架，还有一大群穿红衣服、一本正经、不欢迎访客的人。借书可费了不少劲。\n\n我们带着书出来了。麦伊接过书的样子，就像大多数人接过一个刚出生的婴儿，小心翼翼，屋里其他人谁都不看一眼。我收到过更热情的道谢。可我很少见过谁有那么高兴，而我是见过有人找到金子的。"
L["There's a prisoner in the Monastery graveyard, Vorrel Sengutz, and Interrogator Vishas had been working on Vorrel for a long while. Vorrel didn't have much left to ask for. Two things: Vishas dead, and Vorrel's wedding ring, which Vishas had kept, taken to Monika Sengutz in Tarren Mill. Same last name. You can work out the rest.\n\nVishas didn't enjoy being interrupted. I took the ring back and walked it all the way to Tarren Mill. Light thing, a ring. Long walk, though.\n\nThe Library had its own customers. Half the scholars in the Horde seem to want a book off those shelves, and the Crusade guards its reading like it's gold. Can't think why. Most of it's about how to kill the rest of us."] = "修道院的墓地里有个囚犯，沃瑞尔·森加斯，审讯员韦沙斯已经在沃瑞尔身上下了很久的功夫。沃瑞尔已经没什么可求的了。只有两件事：韦沙斯死，还有沃瑞尔的结婚戒指——被韦沙斯拿着——送到塔伦米尔的莫尼卡·森古特斯手里。同一个姓。剩下的你自己能想明白。\n\n韦沙斯不喜欢被人打扰。我把戒指拿了回来，一路走到了塔伦米尔。戒指是很轻的东西。路可很长。\n\n图书馆也有它自己的主顾。部落里好像有一半的学者都想从那些书架上弄本书，而十字军守着他们的读物，就像守着金子。想不通为什么。大部分写的都是怎么杀掉我们这些人。"
L["Raleigh the Devout wanted the Scarlet Monastery's leaders dead, in the name of the Light. Funny thing to ask, since they'd tell you they did everything in the name of the Light too. I didn't argue theology. I packed.\n\nThe Armory belonged to Herod, a big man with a bigger axe, who spun like a top and announced he'd been waiting for a real challenge. Happy to oblige. In the Cathedral we put down the Scarlet Commander, and High Inquisitor Whitemane swept in and raised him right back up, which hardly seems fair. So we did it again, both of them this time, and nobody got up.\n\nRaleigh thanked me in the name of the Light as well. The Light, I'm told, was very grateful."] = "虔诚的莱雷恩想以圣光之名，让血色修道院的首领们去死。这要求挺有意思，因为他们也会告诉你，他们做的每件事都是以圣光之名。我没去争论神学。我收拾了行李。\n\n军械库归赫洛德管，一个大块头，手里的斧子更大，转起来像个陀螺，还宣布他一直在等一个真正的挑战。乐意奉陪。在大教堂里，我们放倒了血色指挥官，大检察官怀特迈恩冲进来，又把他复活了，这可不太公平。于是我们又来了一遍，这次两个一起，谁也没再爬起来。\n\n莱雷恩也以圣光之名向我道了谢。据说，圣光非常感激。"
L["When Varimathras asks you for something, you say yes, and you say it quickly. What the dreadlord wanted was the Scarlet Monastery's leadership dead, all four of them, kennel to altar.\n\nThe one I remember is the Cathedral. We put down the Scarlet Commander, and High Inquisitor Whitemane came in behind him and stood him right back up, which I thought was poor sportsmanship. So we knocked them both down together, and this time nobody got up. Herod, back in the Armory, had told us he'd been waiting for a real challenge. I hope we lived up to it.\n\nBack in the Royal Quarter I made my report. Varimathras looked pleased, which is the most worrying thing a dreadlord can do."] = "瓦里玛萨斯要你办事的时候，你就说好，而且要快点说。这位恐惧魔王想要的，是血色修道院的首领们统统去死，四个都要，从狗舍一路到祭坛。\n\n我记得的是大教堂。我们放倒了血色指挥官，大检察官怀特迈恩跟在后面进来，又把他扶了起来，我觉得这很没有体育精神。于是我们把他俩一起撂倒，这次谁也没再爬起来。至于赫洛德，在军械库里的时候就跟我们说过，他一直在等一个真正的挑战。希望我们没让他失望。\n\n回到皇家区，我交了报告。瓦里玛萨斯看上去很满意，这是一个恐惧魔王能做的最让人担心的事。"
L["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff of the Argent Dawn wanted the Scarlet Archive in Stratholme burned and its archivist dead. Fine. Archives burn nicely.\n\nThe part worth telling came after. The Scarlet Bastion answers to the Grand Crusader, holiest man in the city. We hit him hard enough and he came apart into Balnazzar, a dreadlord, who'd been wearing the Grand Crusader the whole time like a borrowed tabard. Explains a few things about the Crusade, that. I brought the duke the head.\n\nThe duke would take Baron Rivendare's head too, from the dead side of town, if anyone was offering. Some folk collect spoons."] = "银色黎明的尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵想把斯坦索姆的血色档案馆烧掉，再干掉那个档案管理员。行。档案烧起来挺好看的。\n\n值得一讲的是后面的事。血色堡垒听命于大十字军战士，全城最神圣的人。我们打得够狠，他就裂开变成了巴纳扎尔，一个恐惧魔王，这么久以来一直把大十字军战士当一件借来的战袍穿着。这倒解释了十字军的不少事。我把那颗脑袋带给了公爵。\n\n要是有人肯送，公爵也愿意收下瑞文戴尔男爵的脑袋，那是从城里死人那半边来的。有些人收集勺子。"
L["Kirsta Deepshadow keeps to the north end of the Western Plaguelands and has a professional interest in the Scarlet Crusade. Unfinished business, Kirsta calls it, which is the kind of phrase that means somebody owes somebody blood. The first few jobs were a sampler of their outer lines, two of everything, like ordering off a menu.\n\nThe one worth telling is Hearthglen. Kirsta wanted the town itself measured, so I walked into a fortress full of Crusaders and went looking for somewhere high to stand and have a good long look. You'd think somebody would wonder what a stranger was doing up there. Nobody did.\n\nI came back with a count of everything they had. It wasn't a garrison. It was an army."] = "科尔斯塔·迪普沙东守在西瘟疫之地的北头，对血色十字军有着职业上的兴趣。科尔斯塔管这叫“未了结的事”，这种说法通常意味着有人欠了谁的血。头几份活儿是他们外围防线的拼盘，每样两个，跟照着菜单点菜似的。\n\n值得一讲的是壁炉谷。科尔斯塔想摸清整座镇子的底，于是我走进一座全是十字军的堡垒，去找个高处站着，好好看个够。你会以为总有人会纳闷，一个陌生人站在上头干什么。没有一个人纳闷。\n\n我带回了他们所有家当的清点数。那不是一支驻军。那是一支军队。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller doesn't do small talk. I'd taken the Grand Crusader's orders off a dead Scarlet courier, and Nathanos had a better idea than reading them.\n\nHe handed me a rotten apple. One bite and I looked every inch a Scarlet Crusader, and off I went to Tyr's Hand to deliver those orders to the Crusader Lord in person. A whole town of zealots, and me strolling through it with the taste of bad fruit in my mouth. Nobody looked twice. The Crusader Lord took the orders and gave me plenty to carry back.\n\nWhat I brought Nathanos put the Scarlet Oracle, Demetria, on the road to Stratholme with an escort. She never got there."] = "纳萨诺斯·凋零者从不闲聊。我从一个死掉的血色信使身上拿到了大十字军战士的命令，而纳萨诺斯想到了一个比读它更好的主意。\n\n他递给我一个烂苹果。咬一口，我就从头到脚都像个血色十字军了，然后我就去了提尔之手，亲手把那些命令交给十字军领主。一整座镇子的狂热者，而我嘴里带着烂果子的味道在里面溜达。没人多看一眼。十字军领主收下命令，又给了我一大堆东西带回去。\n\n我带回给纳萨诺斯的情报，让血色十字军圣者德米提雅在护卫下踏上了去斯坦索姆的路。她始终没到。"
L["Tirion Fordring lives alone in a cottage in the Eastern Plaguelands, and once he starts talking, you sit down. He lost his title and his home for standing up for the wrong orc, and his son Taelan grew up to be a Highlord of the Scarlet Crusade. Tirion wanted him back.\n\nSo I went collecting memories, the best of them a family painting hidden in Stratholme behind a picture of the twin moons. A hag at Uther's Tomb gave me a Scarlet face, and I walked into Hearthglen and handed Taelan his father's gift.\n\nIt worked. Taelan remembered, and we fought our way out together. On the road, Grand Inquisitor Isillien caught us. Taelan died there. Tirion arrived a moment too late, and Isillien didn't last long after."] = "提里奥·弗丁一个人住在东瘟疫之地的一间小屋里，他一开口，你就得坐下来听。他为了替一个“不该帮”的兽人出头，丢了头衔，也丢了家，而他的儿子泰兰长大以后成了血色十字军的大领主。提里奥想把他要回来。\n\n于是我去收集回忆，其中最好的一件，是藏在斯坦索姆一幅双月画后面的一幅全家画像。乌瑟尔之墓的一个巫婆给了我一张血色十字军的脸，我走进壁炉谷，把父亲的礼物交到了泰兰手里。\n\n成功了。泰兰想起来了，我们一起杀了出去。在路上，大检察官伊森利恩截住了我们。泰兰死在了那里。提里奥晚到了一步，而伊森利恩之后也没撑多久。"
L["Scholomance has one front door and nobody hands out keys, so you make your own. Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Camp had the recipe, and it was mostly a tour of the worst corners of the world: bones from the Plaguelands, a lava lake at the top of Fire Plume Ridge, a scarab off a summoner in Andorhal.\n\nThe best stop was Gadgetzan. A goblin called Krinkle Goodsteel would turn my bones into a key mold for fifteen gold. Mold rhymes with gold. I noticed. I paid.\n\nWhen it was all done, Arbington fitted the pieces together, handed me the Skeleton Key, and called it as certain to work as anything could be. Then suggested I go and find out.\n\nThat's an alchemist for you. Confident right up to the door."] = "通灵学院只有一扇正门，而且没人发钥匙，所以你得自己做一把。寒风营地的化学家阿尔比顿有配方，而这配方基本上就是一趟世界最糟角落的观光之旅：瘟疫之地的骨头，火羽山顶的熔岩湖，安多哈尔一个召唤师身上的圣甲虫。\n\n最好的一站是加基森。一个叫克林科·古德斯迪尔的地精，愿意用十五个金币把我的骨头做成钥匙模子。模子，金子，还挺押韵。我听出来了。我付了。\n\n全部弄完以后，阿尔比顿把零件拼在一起，把骷髅钥匙交给我，说它管用的把握大得不能再大。然后建议我自己去试试。\n\n炼金师就是这样。一直自信到门口。"
L["High Executor Derrington wanted me inside Scholomance, and Apothecary Dithers explained the catch. The door is locked, and the only key is one you build yourself, out of bones from the Plaguelands, a lava lake at the top of Fire Plume Ridge and a scarab from a summoner in Andorhal.\n\nThe bit I remember is Gadgetzan. A goblin called Krinkle Goodsteel would make the key mold, for fifteen gold. Mold, gold. I noticed. I paid anyway. You don't haggle with a goblin over something you can't make yourself.\n\nDithers put the pieces together and handed over the Skeleton Key, with a send-off about fame and power and laying waste to Scholomance.\n\nNow that's how you see somebody out the door."] = "高级执行官德灵顿想让我进通灵学院，药剂师迪瑟斯解释了其中的难处。门是锁着的，唯一的钥匙得你自己做，材料是瘟疫之地的骨头、火羽山顶熔岩湖里的东西，还有安多哈尔一个召唤师身上的圣甲虫。\n\n我记得的是加基森。一个叫克林科·古德斯迪尔的地精愿意做钥匙模子，收十五个金币。模子，金子。我听出来了。我照样付了。自己做不出来的东西，别跟地精讨价还价。\n\n迪瑟斯把零件拼好，把骷髅钥匙交给了我，临别还讲了一通名望、力量和荡平通灵学院的话。\n\n这才叫送人出门。"
L["Caer Darrow is a town of ghosts, and one of the sadder ones is Eva Sarkhoff. Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher, had killed her family, and he was still at work in Scholomance.\n\nEva wanted him dead. Then she wanted her own remains burned, and her family's beside them. That's a strange thing to be asked by the person whose bones you'll be burning. I did it. It seemed to matter to her.\n\nHer last request came with a vial, the Blood of Innocents, and instructions: find the porch, put the blood in the brazier, and Kirtonos the Herald would come to feast upon my soul.\n\nKirtonos came. My soul is still with me. Kirtonos isn't."] = "凯尔达隆是个鬼魂之镇，其中比较让人难过的一个是艾瓦·萨克霍夫。“屠夫”瑟尔林·卡斯迪诺夫教授杀了她的家人，而他还在通灵学院里干着老本行。\n\n艾瓦想要他死。然后她想让我把她自己的遗骸烧掉，再把她家人的遗骸放在旁边一起烧。被骨头的主人亲自拜托去烧她的骨头，这可是件怪事。我照做了。这事对她来说好像很重要。\n\n她最后的请求附带一瓶无辜者之血，外加指示：找到门廊，把血倒进火盆，传令官基尔图诺斯就会前来吞噬我的灵魂。\n\n基尔图诺斯来了。我的灵魂还在我身上。基尔图诺斯不在了。"
L["Ras Frostwhisper haunts Scholomance, and Ras is a lich. Magistrate Marduke, another of Caer Darrow's ghosts, had a theory about liches. You don't kill one. You remind it that it used to be a man, and then you kill the man.\n\nSo I went looking for the man. In the ruins of Stromgarde I found his Keepsake of Remembrance. Leonid Barthalomew at Light's Hope knew what to do with it, and what to do was carry it into Stratholme and set it on the unholy ground called Menethil's Gift. I won't describe that place. You've either been or you're lucky.\n\nBack in Scholomance, I held the Soulbound Keepsake up to the lich, and for one moment Ras Frostwhisper was a mortal again.\n\nIt was a short moment. Marduke got the head."] = "莱斯·霜语在通灵学院里作祟，而莱斯是个巫妖。马杜克镇长，凯尔达隆的另一个鬼魂，对巫妖有一套理论。巫妖是杀不死的。你得提醒它，它曾经是个人，然后你再杀了那个人。\n\n于是我去找那个人。在激流堡的废墟里，我找到了他的纪念遗物。圣光之愿礼拜堂的莱尼德·巴萨罗梅知道该拿它怎么办，而该做的就是把它带进斯坦索姆，放在那块叫米奈希尔的礼物的邪恶之地上。那地方我就不描述了。要么你去过，要么你走运。\n\n回到通灵学院，我把禁锢灵魂的遗物举到巫妖面前，有那么一瞬间，莱斯·霜语又变回了凡人。\n\n就那么一瞬间。脑袋归了马杜克。"
L["Weldon Barov waits at Chillwind Camp for his family's fortune to come back to him. The fortune was in Scholomance, as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Imagine owning Brill. Imagine wanting to.\n\nI brought him the deeds, and then he had one small family matter left over. His brother Alexi wanted the same fortune and was living at the Bulwark, in Horde territory. Weldon wanted Alexi's head. Alexi, he warned me, would be well protected by Horde filth.\n\nAlexi was, a bit. Not enough.\n\nI carried the head back to Chillwind, and that made Weldon the last Barov. Sounds grand. Mostly it means a smaller table at family dinners."] = "维尔顿·巴罗夫在寒风营地等着他家的家产回到他手里。那份家产在通灵学院里，是四张地契：凯尔达隆、布瑞尔、塔伦米尔和南海镇。想象一下拥有布瑞尔。再想象一下居然想要。\n\n我把地契带给了他，然后他还剩一桩小小的家务事。他的兄弟阿莱克斯也想要这份家产，住在部落地盘上的亡灵壁垒。维尔顿想要阿莱克斯的脑袋。他提醒我，阿莱克斯会有部落的渣滓们严加保护。\n\n阿莱克斯确实有人保护，有那么一点。不够。\n\n我把脑袋带回了寒风营地，这让维尔顿成了最后一个巴罗夫。听着挺气派。其实主要就是家宴的桌子小了一号。"
L["Alexi Barov keeps to the Bulwark these days, and Alexi had a business proposal. The Barov fortune was lying about in Scholomance as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Bring them home and the fortune was Alexi's again. Southshore included, for what that's worth.\n\nI brought them home. Then came the other half of the job. There was a brother, Weldon, down at Chillwind Camp with a claim to the very same papers, and Alexi wanted his head. Weldon, I was told, would be well protected by Alliance scum.\n\nLovely family. You could tell they were related.\n\nI walked into Chillwind and came out with the head, and Chillwind had some loud opinions about that. The last Barov. Alexi liked the sound of it."] = "阿莱克斯·巴罗夫如今待在亡灵壁垒，阿莱克斯有个生意上的提议。巴罗夫家的家产散落在通灵学院里，是四张地契：凯尔达隆、布瑞尔、塔伦米尔和南海镇。把它们带回来，家产就又归阿莱克斯了。南海镇也算在内，虽然那地方也不值什么。\n\n我把地契带回来了。然后是差事的另一半。有个兄弟，维尔顿，在南边的寒风营地，对同一批文件也有继承权，阿莱克斯想要他的脑袋。有人告诉我，维尔顿会有联盟的人渣们严加保护。\n\n真是相亲相爱的一家人。一看就知道是亲兄弟。\n\n我走进寒风营地，带着脑袋出来了，寒风营地对此可是大声发表了不少意见。最后一个巴罗夫。阿莱克斯很喜欢这个说法。"
L["Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow had a problem with wolves. Wolves on two legs, up in the Howling Vale, where they had no business being. Worgen, in Ashenvale. The Sentinel thought an old book might explain it, the Tome of Mel'Thandris, and the book was right there in the Vale with the worgen.\n\nSo I went and read it. Not the most relaxing reading I've ever done.\n\nIt told a story, and not a happy one. A priestess named Velinde Starsong prayed for help against the demons, and the help she was given was the Scythe of Elune. Whatever she did with it, the worgen came after. Melyria liked that story about as much as I did, which is to say not at all."] = "哨兵梅丽瑞亚·霜影遇上了狼的麻烦。用两条腿走路的狼，在狼嚎谷，那地方本不该有它们。狼人，在灰谷。哨兵觉得一本古书或许能解释这件事，《麦尔莎迪丝之书》，而那本书就在山谷里，跟狼人待在一起。\n\n于是我去读了。这可不是我读过最轻松的东西。\n\n书里讲了一个故事，不是什么开心的故事。一个叫维琳德·星歌的女祭司祈求帮助对抗恶魔，她得到的帮助就是月神镰刀。不管她拿它做了什么，狼人随后就来了。梅丽瑞亚对这个故事的喜欢程度跟我差不多，也就是说，一点都不喜欢。"
L["Darnassus remembered Velinde fondly. Melyria sent me to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver on the Warrior's Terrace, and Thyn'tel handed me the key to Velinde's chest, which had sat in storage since she left.\n\nGoing through somebody else's chest feels like burglary, even with the key. I found what I was after, Velinde's journal, and brought it back with the key.\n\nIt wasn't a confession, exactly. Velinde had used the scythe and the worgen had come, and then she couldn't hold them. So she'd gone looking for help, somewhere a long way from Ashenvale. The journal knew where she'd meant to go. It didn't know whether she'd got there. Neither did anybody in Darnassus."] = "达纳苏斯对维琳德的记忆是美好的。梅丽瑞亚让我去战士区找塞恩提尔·刃纹，塞恩提尔递给我维琳德箱子的钥匙，那只箱子从她离开以后就一直放在库房里。\n\n翻别人的箱子，就算有钥匙，感觉也像在入室盗窃。我找到了要找的东西，维琳德的日记，把它和钥匙一起带了回来。\n\n那算不上一份忏悔。维琳德用了那把镰刀，狼人就来了，然后她控制不住它们了。于是她去找帮手，去了一个离灰谷很远的地方。日记里写着她打算去哪儿。却没写她到没到。达纳苏斯也没人知道。"
L["Velinde's trail started at the docks. Thyn'tel sent me to Ratchet, and the wharfmaster there remembered Velinde taking passage to Booty Bay. So I took passage to Booty Bay. Following a priestess's travel plans across the world is a strange way to spend your days.\n\nIn Booty Bay the caravan records had her on the road north. Up through Stranglethorn. Toward Duskwood.\n\nNobody goes to Duskwood on purpose. Velinde apparently did, so I did too, and the road north was as friendly as it always is, which is not at all. At the end of it was Darkshire, where the sun doesn't bother."] = "维琳德的踪迹从码头开始。塞恩提尔派我去棘齿城，那儿的码头管理员记得维琳德搭船去了藏宝海湾。于是我也搭船去了藏宝海湾。跟着一位女祭司的旅行路线横跨整个世界，可真是种奇怪的过日子方式。\n\n在藏宝海湾，商队记录显示她往北走了。穿过荆棘谷。朝暮色森林去。\n\n没人会特意去暮色森林。维琳德显然去了，所以我也去了，往北的路还是跟往常一样友好，也就是一点都不友好。路的尽头是夜色镇，那儿的太阳都懒得出来。"
L["Clerk Daltry had no Velinde in any of the Darkshire records. What Daltry did have was a name: Jonathan Carevin. The Carevins hunt the things in Duskwood's woods and have done for a long while, and if anybody in town knew about worgen, it'd be them.\n\nCarevin wasn't thrilled to have a stranger asking about the Scythe of Elune. Fair enough. But we came to an arrangement: whatever I found out there, Darkshire would hear about it too.\n\nWhat I found was in Roland's Doom, an old mine I'd rather not go back to, under a mound of dirt. Not the scythe. Evidence of it. Proof it had been there, in Duskwood, a very long way from home. I took it back to Carevin as promised."] = "书记员达尔塔在夜色镇的所有记录里都没找到维琳德。达尔塔手上有的是一个名字：乔纳森·卡尔文。卡尔文家族在暮色森林的林子里猎杀那些东西，已经很多年了，要是镇上有谁了解狼人，那就是他们。\n\n卡尔文对一个陌生人打听月神镰刀的事不怎么高兴。这很合理。不过我们达成了一个约定：不管我在外头发现了什么，夜色镇也得知道。\n\n我发现的东西在罗兰之墓，一座我不想再回去的老矿洞，就在一堆土底下。不是镰刀。是镰刀留下的痕迹。证明它曾经在这儿，在暮色森林，离家非常非常远。我照约定把它带回去交给了卡尔文。"
L["Darnassus again. Carevin sent me back to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver with what I'd found, and that's a long way to carry an answer nobody's going to like.\n\nThyn'tel heard me out. The scythe had been in Duskwood. Velinde's trail had come apart somewhere around Roland's Doom. And whatever she'd called up with it was still loose in the world, in more forests than one.\n\nThyn'tel thanked me and meant it, and looked as uneasy as I've ever seen anyone look while saying thank you. I understood. We had answers now. That was the trouble. None of them came with the scythe attached, and the scythe was still out there somewhere.\n\nI've followed a lot of trails. That's the only one that crossed the whole world and finished on a question."] = "又回到达纳苏斯。卡尔文让我带着我发现的东西回去找塞恩提尔·刃纹，带着一个谁都不会喜欢的答案走这么远，路可真长。\n\n塞恩提尔听我说完。镰刀曾经在暮色森林。维琳德的踪迹在罗兰之墓附近断了。而她用它召来的东西还在这世上游荡，而且不止一片森林里有。\n\n塞恩提尔向我道谢，是真心的，可道谢时那副不安的样子，是我见过最不安的。我明白。我们现在有了答案。麻烦就出在这儿。没有一个答案附带着镰刀，而镰刀还在外面的某个地方。\n\n我追过很多条线索。只有这一条横跨了整个世界，最后停在一个问号上。"
L["The Shady Rest was an inn on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow Marsh, and by the time I saw it, it was a black heap. Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore wanted to know who'd done it. So did everyone else, and everyone else already had a theory.\n\nIn the mud outside were hoofprints. Not a horse's. Bring that back to Theramore and you can hear the room decide what happened before you've finished the sentence.\n\nVimes listened, though, and didn't decide anything. Good instinct, as it turned out. There was a lot more in that ash than hoofprints, and none of it agreed with the rest."] = "树荫旅店本来是贫瘠之地和尘泥沼泽之间路上的一家旅店，等我看到它的时候，它已经是一堆黑灰了。塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长想知道是谁干的。其他人也都想知道，而其他人早就有了自己的说法。\n\n外面的泥地里有蹄印。不是马的。把这个带回塞拉摩，你话还没说完，就能听见满屋子的人已经替你下了结论。\n\n不过维米斯听着，什么结论都没下。后来证明，这直觉挺准。那堆灰里可不只有蹄印，而且哪一样都跟别的对不上。"
L["In what was left of the fireplace sat a shield. Black iron, scorched through, and far too big for a human arm. You can imagine how that went down in Theramore.\n\nVimes didn't jump at it. Instead I was sent across town to Caz Twosprocket at the smithy, to see what the metal had to say for itself. Caz turned it over and over, gave it the long look smiths save for other people's work, and the verdict was: not made here. Not in Theramore. Past that, nobody would swear to anything.\n\nI carried the verdict back to Vimes. It looked bad for the Horde, and that was what bothered me. A shield that big, left lying right where the first person to poke the ashes would find it. It felt like somebody wanted it found."] = "壁炉的残骸里放着一面盾牌。黑铁的，烧穿了，对人类的胳膊来说大得离谱。你可以想象这东西在塞拉摩引起了什么反应。\n\n维米斯没有急着下结论。我反倒被打发穿过镇子，去铁匠铺找卡兹·双链，看看这块金属自己怎么说。卡兹把它翻过来翻过去，用铁匠专门留给别人作品的那种眼神看了很久，最后的结论是：不是这儿造的。不是塞拉摩造的。再往下，谁都不敢打包票。\n\n我把结论带回去给了维米斯。这看起来对部落很不利，而让我在意的正是这一点。那么大一面盾牌，偏偏就扔在第一个扒拉灰堆的人一定会发现的地方。感觉像是有人就想让它被找到。"
L["The badge in the ashes belonged to Lieutenant Paval Reethe of the Theramore Guard. The records said Reethe had been one of Daelin's men. Admiral Proudmoore's, that is, from before his daughter made peace with the orcs. Plenty of those fellows never forgave her for it, and Reethe had walked off the job.\n\nWhere do deserters go in Dustwallow? Lost Point, it turns out, to a crew of former Theramore soldiers with no love left for their old command. Their leader gave me Reethe's story in the end.\n\nI brought it back to Vimes. Reethe had reasons to hate the Horde, and Reethe's badge had been at the inn. On paper, that's a case. In person it was too neat. Nobody makes lieutenant by dropping a badge at the scene."] = "灰里那枚徽章属于塞拉摩卫兵的帕瓦尔·雷瑟上尉。记录上说，雷瑟曾经是戴林的人。我是说普罗德摩尔上将的人，那是在他女儿跟兽人讲和之前。那些家伙里有不少人从来没原谅她，而雷瑟丢下差事走了。\n\n逃兵在尘泥沼泽能去哪儿？结果是去了废弃哨塔，那里有一伙前塞拉摩士兵，对他们的老长官已经没有半点好感。他们的头目最后把雷瑟的事告诉了我。\n\n我把它带回去给了维米斯。雷瑟有理由恨部落，雷瑟的徽章又出现在旅店里。纸面上看，这就是一桩案子。可当面一看，又太整齐了。在现场掉徽章的人，是当不上上尉的。"
L["Vimes had one more lead, and it went north to the captain at North Point Tower, who had a nasty suspicion about the Grimtotem. That's the tauren clan that hates everybody. A battle plan, a note and an armful of armaments out of Blackhoof Village later, the suspicion had teeth. The Grimtotem had burned the Shady Rest and dressed it up to look like the Horde, then sat back to watch Theramore and the Horde go for each other.\n\nTabetha, out at her farm, knew where to hit back: Direhorn Post. I burned three tents there and slept fine that night.\n\nAfterwards Vimes gave me a wreath, and I laid it at the Hyal family monument. Quiet spot. I stayed a minute."] = "维米斯还有最后一条线索，往北通到北点哨塔的队长那儿，队长对恐怖图腾有个很不妙的怀疑。那是个谁都恨的牛头人部族。从黑蹄村弄来一份作战计划、一张字条和一大抱武器之后，这个怀疑就有了牙齿。是恐怖图腾烧了树荫旅店，还把它伪装成部落干的，然后坐等塞拉摩和部落互相开打。\n\n农场里的塔贝萨知道该往哪儿还手：恐角岗哨。我在那儿烧了三顶帐篷，当晚睡得很香。\n\n事后维米斯给了我一个花环，我把它放在了希亚尔家的纪念碑前。安静的地方。我在那儿待了一会儿。"
L["Word travels fast when an inn burns down and somebody says the Horde did it. The Shady Rest sat on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow, and when I got there it was ash and a few black beams.\n\nIn the mud outside were hoofprints. Tauren-sized. Exactly what you'd want to find, if you wanted Theramore to blame the Horde. I took that to Krog in Brackenwall Village, who had orders to look into the fire and no intention of letting Theramore tell the story first.\n\nThere was more in those ashes, too. A blackened shield. A Theramore guard's badge. Every clue pointed somewhere different, and every one of them pointed somewhere awfully convenient."] = "一家旅店烧了，又有人说是部落干的，这种消息传得飞快。树荫旅店在贫瘠之地和尘泥沼泽之间的路上，等我到的时候，只剩下灰和几根烧黑的房梁。\n\n外面的泥地里有蹄印。牛头人的尺寸。如果你想让塞拉摩怪到部落头上，这正是你想找到的东西。我把这个带给了蕨墙村的克罗格，克罗格奉命调查这场火，而且没打算让塞拉摩抢先把故事讲了。\n\n那堆灰里还有别的东西。一面烧黑的盾牌。一枚塞拉摩卫兵的徽章。每一条线索都指向不同的地方，而每一个地方都指得未免太方便了。"
L["Black iron, scorched, heavy enough to stop a charging kodo: that was the shield in the fireplace. Krog sent me to Do'gol with it, and Do'gol wanted six acidic venom sacs before anything else happened. I fetched them. Do'gol did whatever you do to a shield with acid, and I carried the thing back to Krog.\n\nKrog wanted another opinion and sent me all the way to Thunder Bluff to show it to Mosarn. That's a long way to carry a shield. You get attached.\n\nMosarn knew the craft, and that should have settled it. It didn't, for me. A shield can be carried into an inn by anybody. It can be left behind by anybody, too, right where somebody's bound to find it."] = "黑铁的，烧焦了，沉得能挡住一头冲锋的科多兽：这就是壁炉里那面盾牌。克罗格让我拿着它去找杜高尔，而杜高尔在做任何事之前，先要六个酸性毒囊。我取来了。杜高尔对盾牌做了些拿酸能做的事，然后我把那东西扛回去给了克罗格。\n\n克罗格还想听听别人的意见，就一路把我打发到雷霆崖，拿给莫萨恩看。扛着一面盾牌走这么远。扛着扛着就有感情了。\n\n莫萨恩懂这门手艺，这本该让事情有个定论。对我来说却没有。一面盾牌，谁都能把它扛进旅店。谁也都能把它留下，就留在一定会有人发现的地方。"
L["There was a badge in the ashes as well, Theramore Guard, belonging to a Lieutenant Paval Reethe. I brought it to Krog, and the next thing I knew I was out in the marsh with Ogron, going to ask Reethe a few questions.\n\nOgron did the asking, after a fashion. Reethe was cornered and jumpy and in no mood to chat, and it went the way these things go when everybody in the conversation is armed. Reethe didn't walk away from it.\n\nSo that was our suspect: dead, and quickly. Very tidy. A bit too tidy for my liking. If you wanted a case closed before anyone asked the next question, you couldn't have arranged it better."] = "灰里还有一枚徽章，塞拉摩卫兵的，属于一个叫帕瓦尔·雷瑟的上尉。我把它带给了克罗格，转眼间我就跟奥格隆一起出了沼泽，去问雷瑟几个问题。\n\n问话是奥格隆来的，算是问话吧。雷瑟被逼到了角落里，神经紧绷，没心情聊天，于是事情就照着谈话双方都带着武器时的老路子发展了。雷瑟没能活着走开。\n\n这就是我们的嫌犯：死了，死得还挺快。非常利落。对我来说有点太利落了。要是你想在别人问出下一个问题之前就把案子结了，可安排不出比这更好的了。"
L["Mosarn remembered something about that shield and sent me back to Krog with it. Krog had me fetch Blackhoof armaments and a Grimtotem battle plan, and laid side by side, it all came together. The Grimtotem had burned the Shady Rest and left the Horde holding the torch, so that Theramore and Brackenwall would go for each other while the Grimtotem sat back and watched.\n\nTabetha, of all people, knew where the attack had come from: Direhorn Post. A human mage pointing me at a tauren camp. Strange times. I burned the north tent, the east tent and the northeast tent, and walked off with the smoke at my back.\n\nKrog called it justice. I called it a long week."] = "莫萨恩想起了关于那面盾牌的一些事，让我带着它回去找克罗格。克罗格让我去取黑蹄村的武器和一份恐怖图腾的作战计划，并排一放，一切就都对上了。是恐怖图腾烧了树荫旅店，再让部落背了这个黑锅，好让塞拉摩和蕨墙村互相开打，恐怖图腾自己坐着看戏。\n\n偏偏是塔贝萨知道袭击是从哪儿来的：恐角岗哨。一个人类法师给我指一座牛头人营地。真是奇怪的年头。我烧了北边的帐篷、东边的帐篷和东北边的帐篷，背着一身烟走了。\n\n克罗格管这叫正义。我管这叫漫长的一周。"
L["It started with a crumpled map in the Badlands and a note on it saying Hammertoe Grez was alive. Hammertoe was, too, down in Uldaman, and missing an amulet. I got it back.\n\nThen the amulet went on tour: to a prospector in the Badlands, to a historian in Ironforge, to an advisor by way of a note, and back to the historian again. Every leg of it, I should say, walked by me.\n\nAt the end of all that walking, somebody finally handed me a proper job. Kill Ambassador Infernus in Angor Fortress, bring back proof, then go down into Uldaman again for the Tablet of Will before the Shadowforge got to it.\n\nCourier, soldier, treasure hunter. I'd never been all three on one errand before."] = "事情从荒芜之地的一张皱巴巴的地图开始，上面有张字条，说铁趾格雷兹还活着。铁趾也确实活着，在奥达曼底下，丢了一个护符。我把它找了回来。\n\n然后这个护符就开始巡回了：去荒芜之地找一个勘探者，去铁炉堡找一个历史学家，凭一张字条去找一个顾问，再回到历史学家那儿。我得说一句，每一段路都是我走的。\n\n走完了这么多路，终于有人给了我一份正经差事。去苦痛堡垒杀掉因弗努斯大使，带回证据，然后再下一趟奥达曼，赶在影炉之前拿到意志石板。\n\n信使、士兵、寻宝人。我以前还从来没在一份差事里同时当过这三样。"
L["Somewhere in Uldaman I picked up a shattered necklace. Fine work, badly broken. A thing like that has a maker, so I went looking and found him in Ironforge: Talvash del Kissel. He'd tell me all about it, for five silver bars.\n\nI paid a man to tell me about his own necklace. Moving on.\n\nHis story sent me back into Uldaman, to what was left of a paladin and a journal saying where the gems had gone. Three gems, three corners of the dig, one of them in the fist of the trogg leader, who didn't let go easily. Talvash had given me a Phial of Scrying, so I could report from down there without the walk.\n\nLast, he wanted a power source off the strongest construct in the place. That was Archaedas. Talvash got his necklace back together. I got a story."] = "在奥达曼的某个地方，我捡到一条碎掉的项链。做工精细，碎得很惨。这种东西总有个做它的人，于是我去找，在铁炉堡找到了他：塔瓦斯德·基瑟尔。他愿意把来龙去脉都告诉我，代价是五根银锭。\n\n我花钱请一个人给我讲他自己的项链。不提了。\n\n他的故事又把我打发回奥达曼，去找一个圣骑士的遗骸，还有一本写着宝石下落的日记。三颗宝石，分别在挖掘场的三个角落，其中一颗攥在穴居人首领的拳头里，那家伙可不轻易松手。塔瓦斯德给了我一瓶占卜药水，好让我在下面就能汇报，不用来回跑。\n\n最后，他想要那地方最强的构造体身上的一个能量源。那就是阿扎达斯。塔瓦斯德把他的项链拼回去了。我得到了一个故事。"
L["Dran Droffers runs a salvage business in Orgrimmar, Droffers and Son, and had heard about a valuable necklace somewhere in the Uldaman dig site. Probably damaged. Droffers didn't mind damaged.\n\nI found it, and it was. No gems. Down in the depths I found what was left of a paladin, and a journal that said where the gems had gone, and I couldn't read a word of it. The nearest translator was Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath, who'd do it in exchange for borrowing the necklace. Everybody wants a little something.\n\nThree gems and a power source later, the last of them pried off the strongest construct in Uldaman, I'd worn a groove in the road between Kargath and Orgrimmar, and Droffers had the necklace and the gem salvage.\n\nIn that trade, everything's salvage eventually."] = "德兰·杜佛斯在奥格瑞玛开了家回收铺子，叫杜佛斯父子，听说奥达曼的挖掘场里有条值钱的项链。多半是坏的。杜佛斯不介意坏的。\n\n我找到了，确实是坏的。宝石都没了。在深处，我找到了一个圣骑士的遗骸，还有一本写着宝石下落的日记，可我一个字都看不懂。最近的翻译是卡加斯的加卡尔，条件是把项链借去用用。人人都想要点小好处。\n\n三颗宝石加一个能量源之后——最后那个是从奥达曼最强的构造体身上撬下来的——我在卡加斯和奥格瑞玛之间的路上都踩出了一道沟，而杜佛斯拿到了项链和回收来的宝石。\n\n干那一行的，什么东西早晚都是回收品。"
L["Past Archaedas, at the very bottom of Uldaman, sits a stone watcher that has been waiting a very long time for someone to ask it a question. I asked. It answered at length. Then I woke the Discs of Norgannon, and they answered at greater length.\n\nThe short of it: the titans shaped the world, and they made the earthen out of stone to look after it. Over the ages the earthen went soft and became something else. You've met the result. They run Ironforge.\n\nI came away with a miniature copy of the discs and took it to the Explorers' League in Ironforge. Proof of where the dwarves came from, small enough to carry under one arm.\n\nMy reward was a voucher for Dinita Stonemantle in the Vault. I found out where a whole people came from and got paid by the bank."] = "过了阿扎达斯，在奥达曼的最底层，坐着一个石头守望者，它已经等了很久很久，就等有人来问它一个问题。我问了。它答了很长一段。然后我唤醒了诺甘农圆盘，圆盘答得更长。\n\n简单说：泰坦塑造了这个世界，又用石头造出了土灵来照看它。年深日久，土灵变软了，变成了别的东西。结果你们都见过。他们管着铁炉堡。\n\n我带着一份圆盘的缩小复制品离开，交给了铁炉堡的探险者协会。矮人从哪儿来的证据，小到能夹在胳膊底下。\n\n我的奖励是一张交给宝库里丁尼塔·石衣的兑换券。我弄清了一整个民族的来历，然后是银行给我付的钱。"
L["Behind Archaedas, at the bottom of Uldaman, a stone watcher sits waiting for someone with questions. I had a few. It had very old answers, and when it ran out, I woke the Discs of Norgannon for the rest.\n\nHere's the gist. The titans shaped the world and made the earthen out of stone to tend it, and over the ages the earthen softened into flesh. Into dwarves, as it happens. All those dwarves digging up the Badlands were digging up their own family history and didn't know it.\n\nI came away with a miniature copy of the discs and took it to Thunder Bluff, to Sage Truthseeker, who understood exactly what it was.\n\nThen I was handed a voucher for Bena Winterhoof. Secrets of creation, paid out in a slip of paper. I took it. Paper spends."] = "在阿扎达斯后面，奥达曼的最底层，坐着一个石头守望者，等着有人带着问题来。我正好有几个。它的答案非常古老，等它说完了，剩下的我就去唤醒诺甘农圆盘来问。\n\n大意是这样的。泰坦塑造了这个世界，用石头造出了土灵来照料它，年深日久，土灵软化成了血肉之躯。也就是矮人。所有那些在荒芜之地挖来挖去的矮人，其实都是在挖自己的家谱，只是自己不知道。\n\n我带着一份圆盘的缩小复制品离开，送到了雷霆崖，交给圣者图希克，图希克完全明白这是什么。\n\n然后我拿到了一张交给本娜·冰蹄的兑换券。创世的秘密，用一张纸条结了账。我收下了。纸条也能花。"
L["Your trainer says the call has come: the spirit of the bear will see you. Spirits are never in a hurry, and a bear's spirit least of all. Go where you're sent, and take your time. It will."] = "你的训练师说召唤来了：巨熊之灵要见你。灵魂从来不着急，熊的灵魂尤其如此。让你去哪儿就去哪儿，慢慢来。反正它肯定会慢慢来。"
L["Your trainer sends you to Moonglade, where Dendrite Starblaze has a new lesson waiting. This one is about healing, and the Circle doesn't teach healing from a book. Bring patience, and good boots."] = "你的训练师派你去月光林地，德迪利特·星焰在那儿给你准备了新的一课。这一课讲的是治疗，而塞纳里奥议会可不照着书本教治疗。带上耐心，还有一双好靴子。"
L["Your trainer has another lesson for you, and Dendrite Starblaze in Moonglade will give it. This one is about water, so you will get wet. Druids teach the way water moves: slowly, and never in a straight line."] = "你的训练师又给你安排了一课，由月光林地的德迪利特·星焰来教。这一课讲的是水，所以你会被弄湿。德鲁伊教东西就像水在流：慢悠悠的，而且从不走直线。"
L["Dendrite Starblaze wants you in Moonglade. There's someone to meet: the spirit of a great cat, out in the southern hills. Cats are particular about whom they teach, and they take their time deciding."] = "德迪利特·星焰要你去月光林地。有一位得去见见：一只巨豹的灵魂，就在南边的山里。猫挑学生很讲究，而且决定起来不紧不慢。"
L["Your trainer says a hunter shouldn't hunt alone, and knows who has a taming rod for you. There are beasts to try it on, and none of them asked to be tamed. Whether any of them follows you home is up to you."] = "你的训练师说，猎人不该独自狩猎，还知道谁那儿有给你的驯兽棒。有些野兽等着你拿它来试，而它们谁都没说过想被驯服。至于有没有哪只愿意跟你回家，就看你的了。"
L["If you ever bring the Ancient Petrified Leaf out of Molten Core, know that it belongs to someone. It looks like nothing much, and it's a big world. Start your search in Felwood."] = "如果你从熔火之心里带出了古树的石化叶片，要知道它是有主人的。它看着不起眼，世界又这么大。从费伍德森林开始找吧。"
L["Belann Windwood in Valanaar has made staves and wands for the High Order's mages for more than a century, and now it's your turn to visit. Belann keeps one of the order's oldest traditions. It asks for a fallen bough, and Belann is particular."] = "瓦拉纳尔的贝兰·风木为至高教团的法师打造法杖和魔杖已经一百多年了，现在轮到你去拜访了。贝兰守着教团最古老的传统之一。这个传统要一根掉落的树枝，而贝兰很挑剔。"
L["Your trainer says it's time you met Tabetha. She lives out in Dustwallow Marsh, far from any library, and she's where trainers send a mage once book learning stops being enough."] = "你的训练师说，是时候去见见塔贝萨了。她住在尘泥沼泽，离哪座图书馆都很远；等书本上的学问不够用了，训练师就会把法师送到她那儿去。"
L["Archmage Xylem lives in a tower atop the cliffs of Azshara, about as far from anyone as a tower can get. Xylem wants a Prismatic Shell, and a warlord named Krellian has one. Archmages call this research."] = "大法师克希雷姆住在艾萨拉悬崖顶上的一座塔里，那座塔离谁都远得不能再远了。克希雷姆想要一个虹彩贝壳，而一个叫克雷利安的军阀手里就有一个。大法师们管这叫“研究”。"
L["Deep in Dire Maul, Lorekeeper Lydros still keeps the Athenaeum, and still knows a spell or two worth learning. The price is the essence of Hydrospawn, a water elemental loose in the Warpwood Quarter. Lydros calls that a fair trade."] = "在厄运之槌深处，博学者莱德罗斯仍然守着图书馆，也仍然懂一两个值得一学的法术。代价是海多斯博恩的精华，那是一个在扭木广场里乱窜的水元素。莱德罗斯觉得这买卖很公道。"
L["In Deathknell, Aramis Hammerhand teaches what the Light still asks of a paladin, and Aramis isn't one for long lectures. The Deathguard nearby are hurt, the Light heals, and you know the words. Start there."] = "在丧钟镇，阿拉米斯·锤手教的是圣光仍然要求圣骑士做些什么，而阿拉米斯不爱长篇大论。附近的亡灵卫兵受了伤，圣光能治愈，而你知道该念什么。就从那儿开始。"
L["Shari Stilwell in Brill has directions for you: head west until Tirisfal runs out, and look for Bandarion Keep. Paladins are making a home there. Report to Breton Samuels when you arrive."] = "布瑞尔的莎莉·斯迪威尔给你指了路：一直往西走，走到提瑞斯法的尽头，找班达里安堡。圣骑士们正在那儿安家。到了以后向布雷顿·萨缪尔斯报到。"
L["Danitha Morr has a lesson for you about doing good for its own sake, with nobody watching and nothing to gain. It begins in the Undercity, where Tanis Alderwood could use a hand."] = "丹妮莎·莫尔要给你上一课，讲的是为了行善而行善，没人看着，也没好处可拿。这一课从幽暗城开始，塔尼斯·桤木那儿正需要人帮把手。"
L["Danitha Morr sees a chance for Bandarion Keep to prove its worth to the Horde: two Earthen Ring travelers have gone missing in Silverpine Forest. Go to the Sepulcher and ask Trevan Rol what's known."] = "丹妮莎·莫尔看到了让班达里安堡向部落证明自己的机会：两名大地之环的旅人在银松森林失踪了。去瑟伯切尔，问问特雷凡·罗尔都知道些什么。"
L["Duthorian Rall at Stormwind's Cathedral of Light has a tome for you, and a question to go with it: when evil walks into your lands, will you be strong enough? Rall means to find out."] = "暴风城光明大教堂的达索瑞恩·拉尔有一本书要给你，还附带一个问题：当邪恶闯进你的土地时，你够不够强？拉尔打算弄个明白。"
L["Your trainer has another test for you, and it waits at Jordan Stilwell's forge, just outside the gates of Ironforge. Jordan needs a paladin who doesn't mind a long road and a heavy pack."] = "你的训练师又给你准备了一场考验，就在铁炉堡大门外乔丹·斯迪威尔的铁匠炉那儿等着你。乔丹需要一个不介意长途跋涉、背着重包的圣骑士。"
L["A summons from Danitha Morr: come home to Bandarion Keep. You've covered a lot of ground in the Light's service by now, and Danitha has noticed. So, it seems, have your boots."] = "丹妮莎·莫尔召你回班达里安堡。你为圣光奔走至今，已经走过了很多地方，丹妮莎注意到了。看来你的靴子也注意到了。"
L["Your trainer sends you to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District. Grayson keeps an old rite for paladins who have carried the Light a long way. It asks a great deal, and Grayson will want to see you're ready."] = "你的训练师派你去暴风城教堂区找格雷森·沙东布瑞克公爵。格雷森为那些背负圣光走过漫长道路的圣骑士保留着一个古老的仪式。它要求很多，而格雷森会想确认你已经准备好了。"
L["Danitha Morr has sent for you again. Your warhorse has carried you a long way, but the order keeps an older rite for paladins who have proven themselves, and Danitha thinks it's your turn. Bandarion Keep, then."] = "丹妮莎·莫尔又派人来叫你了。你的战马已经驮着你走了很远，但骑士团还为证明过自己的圣骑士保留着一个更古老的仪式，丹妮莎觉得这回轮到你了。那就回班达里安堡吧。"
L["If you ever bring the Eye of Divinity out of Molten Core, carry it to the Eastern Plaguelands. Eris Havenfire waits there for a priest who has it, with a trial that asks for more than bright prayers."] = "如果你从熔火之心里带出了神圣之眼，就把它带到东瘟疫之地去。艾瑞斯·哈文法在那里等着拿到它的牧师，还准备了一场试炼，光靠漂亮的祷词可过不了关。"
L["Master Mathias Shaw at SI:7 has a job for you in Westfall. Find Agent Kearnen out there for a briefing. Kearnen has been watching the Defias, and Shaw wants to see how you handle yourself."] = "军情七处的马迪亚斯·肖尔大师在西部荒野有份活儿给你。去那儿找密探吉尔妮听取简报。吉尔妮一直在盯着迪菲亚，而肖尔想看看你的身手。"
L["Shenthul, down in the Cleft of Shadow in Orgrimmar, has Shattered Hand work for a rogue. Before anything else, you learn the salute. The Shattered Hand likes its business quiet and its greetings complicated."] = "奥格瑞玛暗影裂口的申苏尔有碎手的活儿要交给潜行者。在一切开始之前，你得先学会敬礼。碎手喜欢把生意做得悄无声息，把招呼打得繁琐复杂。"
L["A letter turns up in your mailbox. No name. Just a cabin outside Pyrewood Village and one letter at the bottom: C. Somebody wants a rogue who works alone."] = "你的邮箱里冒出一封信。没有署名。只有焚木村外的一间小屋，和信末的一个字母：C。有人想找一个独来独往的潜行者。"
L["Your trainer slips you a seal with a raven on it. Take it to Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor, hidden in the hills of Hillsbrad. Be ready: your cunning gets tested on the way."] = "你的训练师悄悄塞给你一枚刻着渡鸦的印章。把它交给希尔斯布莱德山中隐秘的拉文霍德庄园里的法拉德。做好准备：进门的路上，你的机敏会受到考验。"
L["Your trainer slips you a seal with a raven on it, for Fahrad at Ravenholdt Manor in the hills of Hillsbrad. Mind the test on the way in. Inside, Myrokos Silentform has a quarrel with the Syndicate, and work."] = "你的训练师悄悄塞给你一枚刻着渡鸦的印章，要交给希尔斯布莱德山中拉文霍德庄园的法拉德。留神进门路上的考验。进了门，麦洛克斯跟辛迪加有笔账要算，也有活儿给你。"
L["A letter from Ravenholdt this time. Fahrad wants a word about the jobs you've been taking. He doesn't say why."] = "这次是拉文霍德来的信。法拉德想就你最近接的那些活儿跟你谈谈。他没说为什么。"
L["Your trainer thinks you're ready to meet the earth. The earth is patient and expects the same of you, so there will be an errand or two before it has anything to say."] = "你的训练师认为你已经准备好去见大地了。大地很有耐心，也指望你同样有耐心，所以在它开口之前，你得先跑一两趟差事。"
L["Your trainer says it's time to call fire. Fire is the least patient of the elements and the quickest to test you, so keep your wits about you. Your trainer will tell you who to find first."] = "你的训练师说，是时候召唤火了。火是最没耐心的元素，也最快考验你，所以保持清醒。先去找谁，你的训练师会告诉你。"
L["Water is next, and the way to it starts with Norric Lochthane in Loch Modan. Of the four elements, water is the patient one, and it likes its students patient too. Pack for a long trip."] = "接下来是水，通往它的路从洛克莫丹的诺里克·洛克塞恩开始。四种元素里，水是有耐心的那个，它也喜欢有耐心的学生。准备出趟远门吧。"
L["Your trainer says water is next and sends you to Islen Waterseer in the Barrens. Of the four elements, water is the patient one, and it likes its students patient too. Pack for a long trip."] = "你的训练师说接下来是水，派你去贫瘠之地找水之先知伊斯伦。四种元素里，水是有耐心的那个，它也喜欢有耐心的学生。准备出趟远门吧。"
L["Air is the last of the four elements, and the hardest to pin down. Your road to it starts with Veyric Thunderhame in the Arathi Highlands, who has work for a shaman."] = "风是四种元素中的最后一种，也是最难捉摸的一种。你通往它的路从阿拉希高地的维里克·雷锤开始，维里克手头有给萨满祭司的活儿。"
L["Air is the last of the four elements, and your trainer sends you to Thousand Needles to find Prate Cloudseer. Air goes where it likes and listens when it feels like it. Go and see if it feels like it."] = "风是四种元素中的最后一种，你的训练师派你去千针石林找普拉特·白云。风想去哪儿就去哪儿，高兴了才听你的。去看看它高不高兴吧。"
L["Kardris Dreamseeker in Orgrimmar thinks you're ready for the hardest lesson yet: all four elements at once. That lesson belongs to Bath'rah the Windwatcher in the Alterac Mountains, who will want a sample of each."] = "奥格瑞玛的卡德里斯认为你已经准备好上最难的一课了：同时驾驭四种元素。这一课归奥特兰克山脉的捕风者巴斯拉管，巴斯拉会要每种元素的样本各一份。"
L["Eldrun Stormbreaker in Ironforge is building a scryer meant to see into the Great Ossuary beneath Scholomance. First it needs two fine diamonds. After that, it needs someone willing to take it down there."] = "铁炉堡的埃尔德伦·风暴破坏者正在造一个预言水晶球，好看进通灵学院底下的大藏骨堂。首先它需要两颗上好的钻石。然后，它需要一个愿意把它带下去的人。"
L["Your trainer passes along a summons from a warlock in the city. It's time you called something out of the void and put it to work. It won't want to. They never do."] = "你的训练师转达了城里一位术士的召唤。是时候从虚空里召唤点什么出来，让它干活了。它不会乐意的。它们从来都不乐意。"
L["Your trainer thinks you're ready for a subtler demon than the voidwalker. A succubus takes more than a strong will to bind, and your trainer knows who can tell you what else it takes. Subtle things rarely come cheap."] = "你的训练师认为你可以对付比虚空行者更微妙的恶魔了。束缚魅魔光靠意志坚强可不够，至于还需要什么，你的训练师知道该找谁问。微妙的东西很少便宜。"
L["Your trainer sends you down to Ratchet to find Strahad Farsan, who knows how to bind a felhunter. A felhunter eats magic. You'll want to be very sure of the binding before you try it."] = "你的训练师派你南下棘齿城，去找斯坦哈德·法尔杉，斯坦哈德懂得怎么束缚地狱猎犬。地狱猎犬吃魔法。动手之前，你最好对你的束缚有十足的把握。"
L["Your trainer sends you down to Ratchet, to Strahad Farsan, who knows how a warlock's mount is called. No stable sells one. It comes from somewhere a good deal warmer than Ratchet."] = "你的训练师派你南下棘齿城，去找斯坦哈德·法尔杉，斯坦哈德知道术士的坐骑是怎么召唤来的。没有哪个马厩卖这种马。它来自一个比棘齿城热得多的地方。"
L["The demon trainer in the city has a name for you: Mor'zul Bloodbringer, out in the Burning Steppes. Mor'zul knows how to call a dreadsteed of Xoroth, and doesn't share that with just anyone."] = "城里的恶魔训练师给了你一个名字：燃烧平原的莫苏尔·召血者。莫苏尔知道怎么召唤克索诺斯恐惧战马，而且不是谁都肯教。"
L["Your trainer says you swing well enough. Time for your first real trial. Your trainer will tell you who to see, and like most warrior business, it ends with somebody on the ground. Make sure it isn't you."] = "你的训练师说你挥得还算像样。是时候迎接你第一场真正的试炼了。该去见谁，训练师会告诉你；和大多数战士的事一样，最后总有人躺在地上。别让那人是你。"
L["Your trainer sends you to Klannoc Macleod, the Islander, who runs a fighting pit on Fray Island in the Barrens. Warriors go there to find out what they're made of. Bring a good weapon and a thick skull."] = "你的训练师派你去找克兰诺克·马克雷德，那位在贫瘠之地勇士岛上开格斗场的“岛民”。战士们去那儿弄清楚自己是块什么料。带上一把好武器和一颗硬脑壳。"
L["Master Mathias Shaw at SI:7 in Stormwind is curious. Jaina's marines found a man washed up on the shore near Theramore, and whatever he's telling them, Shaw wants to hear it too."] = "暴风城军情七处的马迪亚斯·肖尔大师很好奇。吉安娜的陆战队在塞拉摩附近的海岸上发现了一个被冲上岸的男人，不管他在跟他们说什么，肖尔都想听听。"
L["Eitrigg in Grommash Hold is worried. A band of Kor'kron went into Dustwallow Marsh and never came back."] = "格罗玛什要塞的伊崔格很担心。一队库卡隆进了尘泥沼泽，再也没有回来。"
L["All the talk in Jaina's tower kept coming back to one place: Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast. Sully McCleary, behind the graveyard outside Theramore, wants you to go and see what's hidden under its keep."] = "吉安娜塔楼里的谈话总是绕回同一个地方：奥卡兹岛，沼泽海岸外的一座古老废墟。塞拉摩城外墓地后面的苏利·麦克莱利希望你去看看，那座要塞底下藏着什么。"
L["Sergeant Ulka, wounded and waiting by the water near Alcaz Island, has a job for you after all. Commander Folkar took the rest of the Kor'kron into the prison under the island's old keep. Somebody has to go in after them."] = "在奥卡兹岛附近的水边，受了伤的乌尔卡中士还在等着，终究还是有活儿给你。指挥官弗卡尔带着其余的库卡隆进了岛上旧要塞底下的监狱。总得有人进去找他们。"
L["Sully McCleary has one request: tell no one what you found under Alcaz but Master Shaw in Stormwind. And the prisoner you freed pressed a note into your hand on the way out, promising a treasure worth more than gold."] = "苏利·麦克莱利只有一个请求：你在奥卡兹底下发现的事，除了暴风城的肖尔大师，谁都别告诉。另外，你救出来的那个囚犯在你离开时往你手里塞了一张字条，许诺有一笔比黄金还值钱的宝藏。"
L["Commander Folkar is in no shape to travel, so it falls to you to tell Thrall in Orgrimmar what you found under Alcaz. And the prisoner you freed pressed a note into your hand, promising a treasure worth more than gold."] = "指挥官弗卡尔的身体没法赶路，所以得由你把在奥卡兹底下发现的事告诉奥格瑞玛的萨尔。另外，你救出来的那个囚犯往你手里塞了一张字条，许诺有一笔比黄金还值钱的宝藏。"
L["Sentinel Dalia Sunblade in Darnassus hasn't heard from her sister Keldara in far too long. Keldara is posted to Talrendis Point in Azshara, where the sentinels fight the naga for the old ruins. Commander Truesong there should know where she is."] = "达纳苏斯的哨兵达莉亚·炎刃已经太久没收到姐妹凯尔达拉的消息了。凯尔达拉驻扎在艾萨拉的塔伦迪斯营地，哨兵们在那里跟纳迦争夺古老的废墟。那里的指挥官真歌应该知道她在哪儿。"
L["One of Commander Truesong's sentinels has spotted a kaldorei woman alone on the Shattered Strand, plainly no fighter, with naga on every side. Truesong at Talrendis Point wants to know who she is and what she's doing out there."] = "指挥官真歌手下的一名哨兵发现，破碎海岸上有个卡多雷女人独自待着，一看就不是战士，四面八方全是纳迦。塔伦迪斯营地的真歌想知道她是谁，在那儿干什么。"
L["Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar sent a dozen warriors to Azshara to guard Magus Rimtori, a blood elf mage who had promised him the riches of the highborne. That bargain has gone badly. Take Belgrom's sealed letter to Ag'tor Bloodfist at Valormok."] = "奥格瑞玛的贝尔戈洛姆·石槌派了十几个战士去艾萨拉，护卫魔导师里姆托里，一个曾向他许诺上层精灵财富的血精灵法师。这笔交易出了岔子。把贝尔戈洛姆的密封信件带给瓦罗莫克的阿格图·血拳。"
L["In the Ruins of Eldarath, a Blackmaw furbolg named Ekkal has a score to settle with the Legashi satyr, who drove the tribe from its home. The Blackmaw are short of friends. Their gatekeeper, Rageroar, is camped to the north at Ursolan."] = "在埃达拉斯废墟，一个叫艾卡尔的黑喉熊怪跟雷加希萨特有笔账要算，正是萨特把部族赶出了家园。黑喉没什么朋友。他们的护门者拉格罗尔就在北边的乌索兰扎营。"
L["Furze, a Blackmaw at Ursolan, is burning up with a fever that seems to unmake its victims from the inside, and Furze isn't the first to catch it. Tell Elder Bramblesnap. If anyone knows a cure, it's the elder."] = "乌索兰的黑喉熊怪弗尔兹发着高烧，这病似乎会从里往外把人拆散，而弗尔兹不是第一个染上的。去告诉长者棘咬。要是有谁知道怎么治，那就是长者。"
L["Gatekeeper Rageroar is ready to take the fight to the Legashi, but the Blackmaw don't have the warriors for it. The Timbermaw might. Go to Timbermaw Hold in Felwood and ask Gorn One Eye for help."] = "护门者拉格罗尔准备好向雷加希开战了，可黑喉没有足够的战士。木喉也许有。去费伍德森林的木喉要塞，请独眼高恩帮忙。"
L["In Westfall there's a burned-out wreck nobody looks at twice, and in the ash there's a note. Charred, mostly gone, but someone plainly meant it to be found. Read what's left and see where it points."] = "西部荒野有一处没人多看一眼的烧毁残骸，灰烬里有一张字条。烧焦了，几乎不剩什么，但显然有人存心要让它被找到。读读剩下的部分，看它指向哪里。"
L["Out in the Barrens there's a burned-out wreck nobody looks at twice, and in the ash there's a note. Charred, mostly gone, but someone plainly meant it to be found. Read what's left and see where it points."] = "贫瘠之地有一处没人多看一眼的烧毁残骸，灰烬里有一张字条。烧焦了，几乎不剩什么，但显然有人存心要让它被找到。读读剩下的部分，看它指向哪里。"
L["Beside the burned-out remains in the Barrens, someone has nailed up a plank with a note on it. More directions, and this time they point up into the Stonetalon Mountains. Whoever left this trail went to a lot of trouble."] = "在贫瘠之地那片烧毁的残骸旁边，有人钉了一块写着字的木板。又是指路，这次指向石爪山脉的高处。留下这条线索的人可费了不少工夫。"
L["Beside the burned-out remains in Westfall, someone has nailed up a plank with a note on it. More directions, and this time they point up into the Stonetalon Mountains. Whoever left this trail went to a lot of trouble."] = "在西部荒野那片烧毁的残骸旁边，有人钉了一块写着字的木板。又是指路，这次指向石爪山脉的高处。留下这条线索的人可费了不少工夫。"
L["On the ledge below the abandoned camp in the Stonetalon Mountains sits a mound of fresh dirt. Somebody was digging here not long ago. You've followed this trail across an ocean. A pile of dirt isn't going to stop you."] = "石爪山脉那座废弃营地下方的岩架上，有一堆新翻的土。不久前有人在这儿挖过。你已经跟着这条线索跨过了一片大洋。一堆土可拦不住你。"
L["Fel taint keeps washing down off Mount Hyjal into Felwood, and Greta Mosshoof at the Emerald Sanctuary wants to know where it starts. Up on the mountain's lower slopes lives a hermit druid called Ketharas. Start with him."] = "邪能污染不断从海加尔山流进费伍德森林，翡翠圣地的格雷塔·苔蹄想知道源头在哪儿。山的低坡上住着一个叫凯萨拉斯的隐士德鲁伊。先去找他。"
L["The bird the ancients sent you after is a crow, perched by the road below the Felblood Scar. It has strong opinions about the Ashen Reign, the warlocks working fel ash nearby. It also has a plan, and the plan starts with pinecones."] = "古树们让你去找的那只鸟是只乌鸦，就栖在邪血伤痕下方的路边。它对灰烬王权——附近那帮摆弄邪能灰烬的术士——意见很大。它还有个计划，计划从松果开始。"
L["West of the Felblood Scar, out in the ash, a Wild God named Velician lies dying, with a faintly glowing branch close at hand. Velician has one last errand, and you're the only one near enough to hear it."] = "在邪血伤痕以西的灰烬里，一位名叫维里希安的荒野之神奄奄一息，手边有一根微微发光的枝条。维里希安还有最后一件差事，而你是唯一离得够近、听得见的人。"
L["Ketharas has an idea for turning Ve'han Talongrasp's stolen power back on him, but a hermit's magic won't stretch that far. It will take gifts from the Wild Gods themselves. Ketharas sends you back to the crow, who knows how to ask."] = "凯萨拉斯有个主意，要把维汉·爪握偷来的力量反过来对付他，可一个隐士的魔法够不到那么远。这需要荒野之神们亲手赐予的礼物。凯萨拉斯让你回去找那只乌鸦，它知道该怎么开口。"
L["Ketharas has bound the Wild Gods' gifts into the branch and made something new of it: the Staff of the Mountain. Carry it up to Tiala Whitemane at the Summit of Eternity. Ve'han Talongrasp has had his stolen power long enough."] = "凯萨拉斯把荒野之神的礼物封进了那根枝条，做成了一样新东西：山岳法杖。把它带上永恒之巅，交给提亚拉·白鬃。维汉·爪握霸占偷来的力量已经够久了。"
L["Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port needs a crate carried inland to Knight Commander Demar Brant at Farholde Keep. The keep has bigger worries than goblin deliveries: the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade, and nobody knows why."] = "爆破引线港的弗里兹·法拉兹斯帕克需要有人把一个货箱运往内陆，交给法霍德要塞的骑士指挥官德玛尔·布兰特。要塞要操心的事可比地精送货大多了：暮光之锤烧了阳光林地村，而没人知道为什么。"
L["Friz Frazzlespark at Powderfuse Port needs a crate carried up to Krom'rosh at Rog'mar. The orcs there have fought Farholde's humans over the Riverglades for years, and now there's a third party: the Twilight's Hammer has burned the human village of Sunnyglade."] = "爆破引线港的弗里兹·法拉兹斯帕克需要有人把一个货箱送上洛格玛，交给克罗姆罗什。那里的兽人为了河林跟法霍德的人类打了好多年，现在又冒出了第三方：暮光之锤烧了人类的村庄阳光林地。"
L["The Twilight's Hammer didn't burn Sunnyglade for the view. There are caves under the village, and the cult is busy in them. Apprentice Claire of Farholde Keep is already down there, and could use a hand."] = "暮光之锤烧掉阳光林地可不是为了看风景。村子底下有洞穴，教派正在里面忙活。法霍德要塞的学徒克莱尔已经下去了，正需要帮手。"
L["Tran'gul is sure the Twilight's Hammer came to the Riverglades to dig, and the digging is under Sunnyglade. Down in the caves there, an ogre miner named Clubtoe has lost some friends and wants them found."] = "特兰古尔确信暮光之锤来河林是为了挖东西，而挖的地方就在阳光林地底下。在那里的洞穴中，一个叫棍趾的食人魔矿工丢了几个朋友，想把他们找回来。"
L["Tran'gul has an ogre's head and a use for it. Carry it north to Bolder'ok, where the ogres who walked out on the Twilight's Hammer live by one rule: whoever hits hardest is right. Their leader, Clugfist, will take some convincing."] = "特兰古尔有一颗食人魔的脑袋，也想好了它的用处。把它往北带到博尔德罗克，那些离开暮光之锤的食人魔就住在那儿，只认一条规矩：谁打得最狠，谁就有理。他们的首领克鲁格菲斯特可不好说服。"
L["West of Sunnyglade the cult has raised a fortress, the Twilight's Shroud, and Sergeant Riftan of Farholde has been holding the line in front of it with no word from home. Knight Commander Demar Brant at Farholde Keep sends you to find the sergeant."] = "教派在阳光林地以西筑起了一座堡垒，暮光之帷，法霍德的里夫坦中士一直在堡垒前守着防线，家里音讯全无。法霍德要塞的骑士指挥官德玛尔·布兰特派你去找这位中士。"
L["Da'grosh, one of Rog'mar's warriors, has gone west to take a swing at the cult's new fortress, the Twilight's Shroud. Krom'rosh would like to know how that's going. Find Da'grosh in the hills west of Rog'mar."] = "洛格玛的战士达格罗什向西去了，要给教派的新堡垒暮光之帷来上一下。克罗姆罗什想知道进展如何。去洛格玛以西的山丘里找达格罗什。"
L["Overlord Kilgar is dead, and the Twilight's Hammer keeps coming anyway. Ashe Amberhall at Farholde Keep wants to know where from, and has a soulstone and an idea. All it needs is a small favor from you."] = "霸主基尔加死了，可暮光之锤还是源源不断地来。法霍德要塞的艾什·安伯霍尔想知道他们从哪儿来，手上有一块灵魂石和一个主意。只需要你帮个小忙。"
L["Overlord Kilgar is dead, and the Twilight's Hammer keeps coming anyway, out of Krol'dok, a stronghold hidden in the mountains. Da'grosh is waiting outside it with a job for whoever goes in."] = "霸主基尔加死了，可暮光之锤还是源源不断地从克罗多克涌出来，那是一座藏在山里的要塞。达格罗什就在要塞外面等着，手上有件差事要交给进去的人。"
L["Farholde Keep has been writing to Stormwind for years and hearing nothing back. Time for a different sort of letter: Overlord Kilgar's head, for Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep. A letter is easy to ignore. A head, less so."] = "法霍德要塞给暴风城写了好多年信，一直没有回音。是时候换一种信了：霸主基尔加的脑袋，送给暴风要塞的伯瓦尔·弗塔根。信很容易被当作没看见。脑袋就没那么容易了。"
L["Two centaur clans, the Magram and the Gelkis, have feuded for generations. Captain Pentigast at Nijel's Point wants the Alliance to have a friend in one of them. Which one is up to you. Either way, the road leads to the Valley of Bones."] = "玛格拉姆和吉尔吉斯这两个半人马部族已经世代结仇。尼耶尔前哨站的本迪加斯上尉希望联盟能在其中一方交个朋友。选哪一方由你决定。不管怎样，路都通往白骨之谷。"
L["Two centaur clans, the Magram and the Gelkis, have feuded for generations. Gurda Wildmane at Ghost Walker Post wants the Horde to have a friend in one of them. Which one is up to you. Either way, the road leads to the Valley of Bones."] = "玛格拉姆和吉尔吉斯这两个半人马部族已经世代结仇。幽灵岗哨的古尔达·蛮鬃希望部落能在其中一方交个朋友。选哪一方由你决定。不管怎样，路都通往白骨之谷。"
L["Neither clan is finished with the Valley of Bones. Ride with the Magram, and Orgrul has work for you at the valley's northern entrance. Ride with the Gelkis, and Nerlokh waits at the southern one. The feud is far from settled."] = "两个部族都还没跟白骨之谷了结。跟着玛格拉姆走，奥格鲁尔在山谷北入口有活儿给你。跟着吉尔吉斯走，纳洛克在南入口等着。这场世仇远没有了结。"
L["A cracked crystal pylon stands among the elven ruins of Shen'dralas, past the centaur battle lines, and it's still humming. Ruins don't usually hum. Look for others like it, and for whoever still looks after them."] = "在辛德拉拉斯的精灵废墟中，越过半人马的战线，立着一座裂了缝的水晶晶塔，至今还在嗡嗡作响。废墟一般可不会嗡嗡响。去找找其他类似的晶塔，还有仍在照看它们的人。"
L["Mithera, at the temple in Shen'dralas, once kept a garden nearby and left treants to guard the flowers. Now Mithera wonders what became of them. Go and look in on the Forlorn Gardens. The name isn't encouraging."] = "辛德拉拉斯神殿的米瑟拉曾在附近照料一座花园，还留下了树人看守花朵。如今米瑟拉想知道它们怎么样了。去荒弃花园看看。这名字听着可不怎么让人放心。"
L["Today you come of age in Thendal Grove, on an island that floats in the sky. Ailee Farheart in Thendal Village sends you to Rorian the Dayseeker. The grove has work saved up for you, and wants to see what you're made of."] = "今天，你在森达尔林地成年了，在一座漂浮于天空中的岛上。森达尔村的艾莉·远心让你去找逐日者罗里安。林地给你攒了一堆活儿，也想看看你是块什么料。"
L["Your trial is behind you, and the grove has taught you what it can. Aetheen of the Gales sends you south to report to Constable Aonda in Shen'dar Village. The Al'Aketh have been busy on the road between."] = "你的试炼已经过去，林地能教你的也都教了。烈风之埃瑟恩派你往南，去申达尔村向治安官阿翁达报到。奥拉凯斯教派最近在两地之间的路上很活跃。"
L["The Al'Aketh have a missionary preaching in Shen'dar Village, and Constable Aonda is tired of it. Aonda wants someone inside the cult. Sania Silverstream, also in Shen'dar, can make you look like one of the faithful."] = "奥拉凯斯教派派了个传教士在申达尔村布道，治安官阿翁达已经烦透了。阿翁达想在教派里安插一个人。同在申达尔的萨妮亚·银流能把你打扮得像个信徒。"
L["In Valanaar, the island's port, Valennia Stormfist sends you to the head of your order: Elaadrin Evengale, Supreme Magister of the High Order. The Magister has a grand plan for saving Zephras, and a part in it for you."] = "在岛上的港城瓦拉纳尔，瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳让你去见你所属教团的首领：至高教团的至高魔导师伊拉德林·晚风。魔导师有一个拯救泽风岛的宏伟计划，其中有你的一份。"
L["In Valanaar, the island's port, Valennia Stormfist sends you to the head of your order: Ayessa Dawnsinger, Grand Skyseer of the Windshapers. The Skyseer has a grand plan for saving Zephras, and a part in it for you."] = "在岛上的港城瓦拉纳尔，瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳让你去见你所属教团的首领：塑风者的大观天者阿耶莎·晨歌。观天者有一个拯救泽风岛的宏伟计划，其中有你的一份。"
L["Lotheluum Starbreeze in Valanaar hasn't heard from the druids of Shadowgale Forest in too long, and in a forest that haunted, quiet is a bad sign. Go north and find Elegael Thornpaw, in the northeast of the woods."] = "瓦拉纳尔的洛瑟鲁姆·星风已经太久没收到影风森林德鲁伊们的消息了，在那么一片闹鬼的森林里，安静可不是好兆头。往北去，在树林东北部找到艾勒盖尔·棘爪。"
L["You saw what the cult left of the western watchtower. Now it has turned on the eastern one. Valennia Stormfist sends you to Yorana Windyreed there, in the Gustberry Lowlands, while the tower is still standing."] = "你见过教派把西边的瞭望塔弄成了什么样。现在它又盯上了东边那座。趁塔还没倒，瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳派你去阵风浆果低地找那里的约拉娜·风苇。"
L["No more caution. The peacekeepers and both orders are marching on the Shrine of Akir, High Priestess Lorthuna's seat, together for once, and they want you with them. Join Valennia Stormfist in the Gustberry Lowlands before the march begins."] = "不用再谨慎了。维和者和两大教团难得联手，正向高阶女祭司洛苏娜的驻地阿基尔神殿进军，他们希望你一起去。进军开始之前，到阵风浆果低地与瓦伦妮娅·风暴之拳会合。"
L["Apothecary Johaan, at the Gallows' End Tavern in Brill, needs darkhound blood. Then other things. He's working on something new for the Royal Apothecary Society, and he hums while he works, which is never a good sign."] = "布瑞尔恐惧之末旅店的药剂师乔汉需要黑暗猎犬的血。然后还要别的东西。他正在为皇家药剂师协会研究一样新东西，而且边干活边哼小曲，这可从来不是好兆头。"
L["Johaan's findings are with Apothecary Renferrel now, at the Sepulcher in Silverpine Forest. Renferrel has a shopping list of bear hearts and spider blood, all bound for Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity. Don't ask what for."] = "乔汉的研究成果现在在银松森林瑟伯切尔的药剂师伦弗利尔手里。伦弗利尔有一张购物清单，上面是熊心和蜘蛛血，全都要送到幽暗城的大药剂师法拉尼尔那儿。别问干什么用。"
L["Apothecary Lydon, in Tarren Mill, wants gray bear tongues and creeper ichor for a new elixir. Lydon likes to see his work tested, on somebody other than Lydon. That's where you come in."] = "塔伦米尔的药剂师林度恩想要灰熊舌头和食苔蛛的毒液来调一种新药剂。林度恩喜欢看到自己的成果接受测试，只要测试对象不是林度恩自己。这就轮到你了。"
L["Apothecary Lydon, in Tarren Mill, has his eye on a greater work: the Elixir of Agony. It starts with mudsnout blossoms. It does not end there. Lydon's recipes never do."] = "塔伦米尔的药剂师林度恩盯上了一件更了不起的作品：苦楚药剂。它从泥鼻花开始。但不会到此为止。林度恩的配方从来都不会。"
L["Theodore Griffs, in the Undercity's Apothecarium, has heard of a spider in the ruins above the city, Witherfang, whose venom eats through undead flesh. He wants a sample. In the Undercity, that isn't a rumor. It's a job offer."] = "幽暗城炼金房的萨多雷·格雷夫听说城上方的废墟里有只蜘蛛，叫枯牙，它的毒液能蚀穿亡灵的血肉。他想要一份样本。在幽暗城，这可不是什么传闻。这是一份工作邀约。"
L["The Scourge are trying to dig in at the Agamand Mills, northwest of Brill, and Deathguard Dillinger wants them beaten back. Coleman Farthing, at the Gallows' End Tavern, once worked those mills and has his own business with the family that owned them."] = "天灾军团正试图在布瑞尔西北的阿加曼德磨坊扎下根来，亡灵卫兵迪林格尔想把他们打回去。恐惧之末旅店的库勒曼·法席恩曾在那些磨坊干过活，跟拥有磨坊的那家人也有一笔私账。"
L["Coleman Farthing has had his revenge on the Agamands, but says the mills still threaten every Forsaken in Tirisfal. Magistrate Sevren in Brill has heard about your work out there and wants a word."] = "库勒曼·法席恩已经向阿加曼德家族报了仇，但他说那些磨坊仍然威胁着提瑞斯法的每一个被遗忘者。布瑞尔的执政官塞弗伦听说了你在那边的作为，想跟你谈谈。"
L["Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze in Auberdine sent a scout, Balthule Shadowstrike, to watch some strange goings-on at the Tower of Althalaxx to the northeast. Balthule should have been back by now. Elissa would like someone to go and look."] = "奥伯丁的哨兵艾莉萨·星风派了一名斥候，巴苏尔·影击，去监视东北方奥萨拉克斯之塔的一些怪事。巴苏尔早该回来了。艾莉萨希望有人去看看。"
L["Delgren the Purifier, at Maestra's Post in Ashenvale, has read Balthule's letter and calls it dire. The Dark Strand has cultists at Ordil'Aran, and one of them carries a soul gem Delgren would very much like to study."] = "灰谷迈斯特拉岗哨的净化者德尔格伦读了巴苏尔的信，认为情况危急。黑暗之链在奥迪拉兰有教徒，其中一个带着一颗灵魂宝石，德尔格伦非常想研究研究。"
L["Balthule Shadowstrike, back at the Tower of Althalaxx, says the time to strike is now. Athrikus Narassin is at the top of the tower, and the warlocks around him are deadlier than any you've met so far."] = "回到奥萨拉克斯之塔的巴苏尔·影击说，现在正是出手的时候。埃瑟里克斯·纳拉辛就在塔顶，他身边的术士比你迄今遇到的任何术士都要致命。"
L["Silverpine Forest is crawling with worgen, and Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher calls it Arugal's mess. Dalar means to clean it up for the Dark Lady and needs a capable aide. First, you'll have to prove you are one."] = "银松森林到处都是狼人，瑟伯切尔的达拉尔·道恩维沃尔说这都是阿鲁高惹的祸。达拉尔打算替黑暗女王收拾这个烂摊子，需要一个得力的助手。首先，你得证明自己就是。"
L["Shadow Priest Allister at the Sepulcher has a new worry: Dalaran. Its wizards have taken an interest in Ambermill, and their crates keep turning up at a camp north of Pyrewood Village. Allister wants to know what's inside."] = "瑟伯切尔的暗影牧师奥利斯特有了新的担忧：达拉然。那里的巫师对安伯米尔产生了兴趣，他们的箱子不断出现在焚木村以北的一个营地里。奥利斯特想知道里面装着什么。"
L["Everyone at the Sepulcher has business in Shadowfang Keep. High Executor Hadrec sent two deathstalkers in, and they haven't come back. Dalar Dawnweaver wants Arugal's head. In the Undercity's Apothecarium, Keeper Bel'dugur wants a book."] = "瑟伯切尔的每个人都在影牙城堡有事要办。高级执行官哈德瑞克派了两个亡灵哨兵进去，至今没回来。达拉尔·道恩维沃尔想要阿鲁高的脑袋。幽暗城炼金房的看守者贝尔杜加则想要一本书。"
L["High Executor Darthalia runs Tarren Mill like a war room. Down the hill, the humans of Hillsbrad still farm and trade as if the Forsaken weren't there. Darthalia means to change that, and the farms come first."] = "高级执行官达萨利亚把塔伦米尔当作战室来管。山下，希尔斯布莱德的人类照样种地做买卖，好像被遗忘者根本不存在。达萨利亚打算改变这一点，先从农场开始。"
L["Darthalia's list moves on to Hillsbrad itself: the blacksmith, the town hall, and the mine that keeps the town supplied. Report to the High Executor in Tarren Mill for the next set of orders."] = "达萨利亚的清单转向了希尔斯布莱德镇本身：铁匠、镇公所，还有给镇子供货的矿井。去塔伦米尔向高级执行官领取下一批命令。"
L["Next on Darthalia's map is Dun Garok, the dwarven fort in the south of the foothills. Dwarves dig in deep and shoot straight, and these have had years of practice. The High Executor in Tarren Mill has your orders."] = "达萨利亚地图上的下一站是丹加洛克，丘陵南边的矮人要塞。矮人挖得深，打得准，而这些矮人已经练了好些年。塔伦米尔的高级执行官那儿有你的命令。"
L["Aboard one of the Bloodsail ships off Stranglethorn's Wild Shore lies a small scroll with a riddle on it, signed Cortello. Nobody seems to know who Cortello was. Nobody writes a riddle about nothing, either."] = "荆棘谷蛮荒海岸外的一艘血帆海盗船上，放着一小卷写着谜语的纸，署名科泰罗。似乎没人知道科泰罗是谁。不过，也没人会为了什么都没有写一个谜语。"
L["Under a bridge west of Stonard, in the Swamp of Sorrows, Cortello left another scroll. The swamp has not been kind to it. The verse is still readable, just about, and it has somewhere new in mind."] = "在悲伤沼泽斯通纳德以西的一座桥底下，科泰罗又留下了一卷纸。沼泽可没善待它。上面的诗勉强还能读，而且它又看中了一个新地方。"
L["The musty scroll from Bloodfen Burrow has another verse on it. By now you've boarded a pirate ship, crawled under a bridge and walked into a raptor den on Cortello's say-so. Why stop now?"] = "鲜血沼泽墓穴里那卷发霉的纸上又有一首诗。到现在，你已经凭着科泰罗的一句话登过海盗船、钻过桥底、走进过迅猛龙的窝。何必现在停下？"
L["When the battle of Darrowshire began, Marlene Redpath hid her niece Pamela, and never learned what became of her. Marlene, at Sorrow Hill in the Western Plaguelands, wants someone to go and look. So does Pamela's sister Jessica, in Everlook."] = "达隆郡之战开始时，玛莱恩·雷德帕斯把侄女帕米拉藏了起来，从此再也不知道她怎么样了。住在西瘟疫之地悔恨岭的玛莱恩希望有人去看看。帕米拉的姐妹杰西卡也这么想，她在永望镇。"
L["In Darrowshire, Pamela Redpath is lonely. Auntie Marlene told her to stay put and never came back, and her father hasn't come home either. Maybe Marlene knows where he is. She lives on a hill south of Andorhal."] = "在达隆郡，帕米拉·雷德帕斯很孤单。玛莱恩姑妈让她待在原地，却再也没回来，她的父亲也没回家。也许玛莱恩知道他在哪儿。她住在安多哈尔南边的一座山上。"
L["Carlin Redpath, at Light's Hope Chapel, has read the strange new pages at the end of the Annals of Darrowshire and wants the truth of them. The annals also say where the heroes and villains of that last battle left their relics."] = "圣光之愿礼拜堂的卡林·雷德帕斯读了《达隆郡的历史》末尾那几页奇怪的新内容，想弄清其中的真相。史书里也写着，那最后一战中的英雄和恶棍们把遗物留在了哪里。"
L["Chromie, at the ruined inn in Andorhal, has bound the relics you gathered into one powerful spell and believes Joseph Redpath can still be saved. The bundle has to go to Darrowshire's town square, and you're the one carrying it."] = "安多哈尔旅店废墟里的克罗米把你收集的遗物封进了一个强大的法术，相信约瑟夫·雷德帕斯还有救。这个包裹得送到达隆郡的镇广场去，而背着它的就是你。"
L["Deputy Willem, outside Northshire Abbey, has a new gang of thieves on his hands. They call themselves the Defias Brotherhood, they've been seen across the river to the east, and nobody knows what they're up to."] = "北郡修道院外的维里副队长遇上了一伙新的盗贼。他们自称迪菲亚兄弟会，有人在东边的河对岸见过他们，没人知道他们想干什么。"
L["Westfall's farmers have been driven off their land, and Gryan Stoutmantle means to win it back. He's raising a People's Militia in the stone tower on Sentinel Hill, and he'll take every recruit who turns up."] = "西部荒野的农民被赶出了自己的土地，格里安·斯托曼打算把它夺回来。他正在哨兵岭的石塔里组建人民军，来多少新兵他都收。"
L["Gryan Stoutmantle knows a good deal more about the Defias now, but not where they hide. One of his scouts has spotted a Defias messenger on the roads around Moonbrook, and messengers carry things."] = "格里安·斯托曼如今对迪菲亚了解多了，但还不知道他们藏在哪儿。他的一名斥候在月溪镇附近的路上发现了一个迪菲亚信使，而信使身上总会带着东西。"
L["Thanks to a turncoat, Gryan Stoutmantle knows where the Defias hide: the old mine under Moonbrook. Back on Sentinel Hill, Gryan has one task left for you, and it has a name on it. Edwin VanCleef."] = "多亏了一个叛徒，格里安·斯托曼知道了迪菲亚藏在哪儿：月溪镇底下的老矿井。回到哨兵岭，格里安还有最后一项任务给你，上面写着一个名字。艾德温·范克里夫。"
L["Edwin VanCleef was carrying a letter, sealed and never sent. It's addressed to Baros Alexston, the City Architect, at City Hall in Stormwind's Cathedral Square. Somebody ought to deliver it."] = "艾德温·范克里夫身上带着一封信，封好了却一直没寄出去。收信人是巴隆斯·阿历克斯顿，城市建筑师，在暴风城教堂广场的市政厅。总该有人把它送到。"
L["Bazil Thredd had a regular visitor in the Stockade lately: a quiet man whose papers said Maelik. Warden Thelwater had suspicions, wrote down what he looked like, and sealed it for Baros Alexston."] = "巴基尔·斯瑞德最近在监狱里有个常客：一个沉默寡言的男人，证件上写着马里克。典狱官塞尔沃特起了疑心，把他的模样记了下来，封好，要交给巴隆斯·阿历克斯顿。"
L["Up at Stormwind Keep, Tyrion's spybot has its disguise and Tyrion has arranged a meeting. Lord Gregor Lescovar will be waiting in the castle garden for Marzon the Silent Blade. Tyrion wants you close enough to hear every word."] = "在暴风要塞，泰里恩的侦察机器人已经伪装就绪，泰里恩也安排好了一场会面。葛瑞格·莱斯科瓦公爵会在城堡花园里等沉默之刃马尔松。泰里恩希望你靠得够近，一字不漏地听清楚。"
L["Deliana, in Ironforge, has an earnest proposition for anyone whose old dungeon bracers have seen better days. Bring them along, with twenty gold and fifteen blood samples from Winterspring, and hear the rest."] = "铁炉堡的德莉亚娜有一个诚恳的提议，给那些旧地下城护腕已经今非昔比的人。把护腕带来，再加二十金币和十五份冬泉谷的血样，然后听听剩下的内容。"
L["Mokvar, in Orgrimmar, has an earnest proposition for anyone whose old dungeon bracers have seen better days. Bring them along, with twenty gold and fifteen venom samples from Silithus, and hear the rest."] = "奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔有一个诚恳的提议，给那些旧地下城护腕已经今非昔比的人。把护腕带来，再加二十金币和十五份希利苏斯的毒液样本，然后听听剩下的内容。"
L["Mux Manascrambler, a goblin in Gadgetzan, has a supernatural device in mind. Like every goblin plan, it starts with your money: forty gold, and a pile of reagents to go with it."] = "加基森的地精穆克斯·玛纳斯卡波构想了一个超自然装置。和所有地精的计划一样，它从你的钱开始：四十金币，外加一堆施法材料。"
L["Deliana in Ironforge wants Mux's new Ghost Revealer put to work. Take it to the gates of Stratholme, switch it on, and see whether the ghost of Anthion Harmon has anything to say."] = "铁炉堡的德莉亚娜想让穆克斯的新幽灵显形器派上用场。把它带到斯坦索姆的大门口，打开，看看安泰恩·哈尔蒙的鬼魂有没有什么话要说。"
L["Mokvar in Orgrimmar wants Mux's new Ghost Revealer put to work. Take it to the gates of Stratholme, switch it on, and see whether the ghost of Anthion Harmon has anything to say."] = "奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔想让穆克斯的新幽灵显形器派上用场。把它带到斯坦索姆的大门口，打开，看看安泰恩·哈尔蒙的鬼魂有没有什么话要说。"
L["Anthion's unfinished banner is in the hands of Falrin Treeshaper, in the Athenaeum at Dire Maul. Before anything else, Falrin has a vendetta against the ogres to settle, and it runs to twenty-five warbeads."] = "安泰恩那面未完成的旗帜在厄运之槌图书馆的法尔林·树影手里。在一切开始之前，法尔林要先跟食人魔算一笔血仇，算下来是二十五串食人魔珠串。"
L["The Banner of Provocation is ready, and Falrin Treeshaper knows where it belongs: the middle of the Ring of Law in Blackrock Depths, planted while the Dark Irons sentence you. Somebody is bound to take offense."] = "挑战之旗已经做好了，法尔林·树影知道它该插在哪儿：黑石深渊法律之环的正中央，就在黑铁矮人给你宣判的时候插。肯定有人会被激怒。"
L["Deliana in Ironforge has one more name for you: Bodley. Look near Blackrock Spire, in Blackrock Mountain, with the Ghost Revealer switched on. Without it, you won't see Bodley at all."] = "铁炉堡的德莉亚娜还有一个名字要给你：伯德雷。去黑石山里的黑石塔附近找，记得打开幽灵显形器。不开的话，你根本看不见伯德雷。"
L["Mokvar in Orgrimmar has one more name for you: Bodley. Look near Blackrock Spire, in Blackrock Mountain, with the Ghost Revealer switched on. Without it, you won't see Bodley at all."] = "奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔还有一个名字要给你：伯德雷。去黑石山里的黑石塔附近找，记得打开幽灵显形器。不开的话，你根本看不见伯德雷。"
L["Bodley, in Blackrock Mountain, wants Lord Valthalak's amulet whole again. You have the top piece; the left and right are still missing. Bodley's plan for finding them begins, as these things do, with fetching something old."] = "黑石山的伯德雷想让瓦塔拉克公爵的护符重新完整。你手上有顶部那块；左右两块还没着落。伯德雷找它们的计划，照例从去取一件老东西开始。"
L["Lord Valthalak's amulet is whole again, and Bodley isn't finished with it. First come the final preparations: forty Blackrock bracers and a Flask of Supreme Power, carried back to Blackrock Mountain."] = "瓦塔拉克公爵的护符重新完整了，可伯德雷还没打算就此罢手。先要做最后的准备：四十副黑石护腕和一瓶超级能量合剂，带回黑石山。"
L["Back where it all began. Deliana in Ironforge is waiting for the last pieces of your old dungeon set, the cap and the tunic. After everything since the bracers, it seems a small thing to ask."] = "回到一切开始的地方。铁炉堡的德莉亚娜在等你那套旧地下城装备的最后两件：帽子和外衣。从护腕到现在经历了那么多，这要求似乎不算什么。"
L["Back where it all began. Mokvar in Orgrimmar is waiting for the last pieces of your old dungeon set, the cap and the tunic. After everything since the bracers, it seems a small thing to ask."] = "回到一切开始的地方。奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔在等你那套旧地下城装备的最后两件：帽子和外衣。从护腕到现在经历了那么多，这要求似乎不算什么。"
L["Stormwind has pulled its guards out of Darkshire, and Commander Althea Ebonlocke's Night Watch is all the town has left. The commander needs volunteers. Duskwood's dead have stopped staying in their graves."] = "暴风城已经把卫兵从夜色镇撤走了，指挥官阿尔泰娅·埃伯洛克的守夜人是镇上仅剩的力量。指挥官需要志愿者。暮色森林的死人已经不肯老实待在坟里了。"
L["Sven Yorgen lost his family to the Dark Riders of Deadwind Pass. Coming home, he saw a shadowy figure burying something behind the stump by his barn, and never found out what. Sven is camped at the far western edge of Duskwood."] = "斯温·约根的家人死在了逆风小径的黑暗骑士手里。他回家时，看见一个黑影在谷仓边的树桩后面埋了什么东西，却始终不知道那是什么。斯温在暮色森林的最西边扎营。"
L["Sirra Von'Indi keeps the library in Darkshire Town Hall, and it has next to nothing on Raven Hill. The village's history died with its people. If you turn up anything in the ruins, Sirra would like to see it."] = "希拉·沃宁迪管理着夜色镇大厅里的图书馆，可那里关于乌鸦岭的记载几乎为零。村子的历史跟村民一起死了。要是你在废墟里翻出了什么，希拉很想看看。"
L["On the hill north of Raven Hill Cemetery stands a weathered grave marked Morgan Ladimore, and someone has disturbed the dirt on it. Sirra Von'Indi in Darkshire might remember the name."] = "乌鸦岭墓地北边的山上，有一座饱经风霜的坟，上面刻着摩根·拉迪莫尔，而有人动过坟上的土。夜色镇的希拉·沃宁迪也许记得这个名字。"
L["Madame Eva read the cards in Darkshire last night, and Death stared back. Eva fears for her granddaughter, and the trance gave up only one clue: a name, Stalvan. Clerk Daltry at the Town Hall might know it."] = "昨晚，伊瓦夫人在夜色镇占卜，结果死神从牌里盯着她。伊瓦担心她的孙女，而那场出神只给出了一条线索：一个名字，斯塔文。镇大厅的书记员达尔塔也许知道。"
L["Calor, in Darkshire, gave up on the Night Watch and joined Master Carevin, who goes after Duskwood's evil instead of waiting for it. If you want in, Calor says, prove it on the worgen in Brightwood Grove."] = "夜色镇的卡洛尔不再指望守夜人，转投了卡雷文大师，卡雷文主动去追剿暮色森林的邪恶，而不是坐等它上门。卡洛尔说，如果你想加入，就去阳光树林拿狼人证明自己。"
L["An old man who lives in a shack above Raven Hill Cemetery used to come into Darkshire for supplies. Elaine Carevin hasn't seen him in a long while and thinks somebody should make sure nothing's wrong."] = "乌鸦岭墓地上方的小屋里住着一个老人，他以前常来夜色镇买东西。艾莱尼·卡尔文已经很久没见到他了，觉得应该有人去看看他是不是出了什么事。"
L["A ghost waits on the road where the Swamp of Sorrows gives way to the Blasted Lands. The Fallen Hero of the Horde, they call him, and he has a story for anyone willing to stop and listen."] = "在悲伤沼泽和诅咒之地交界的路上，有个鬼魂在等着。人们管他叫部落英雄的灵魂，谁愿意停下来听，他就有个故事要讲。"
L["Ambassador Ardalan at Nethergarde Keep has an odd errand for you: go and hear out a Horde ghost. The Fallen Hero of the Horde waits on the road where the Blasted Lands meet the swamp, with a story to tell."] = "守望堡的奥达兰大使有一份奇怪的差事给你：去听一个部落鬼魂把话说完。部落英雄的灵魂就在诅咒之地和沼泽交界的路上等着，有一个故事要讲。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde isn't done talking. On his road at the edge of the Blasted Lands, he has the rest of his story to tell: what became of the soldiers who crossed over."] = "部落英雄的灵魂还没说完。在诅咒之地边缘他的那条路上，他还有后半个故事要讲：那些越过边界的士兵后来怎么样了。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde has two names for you. Corporal Thund Splithoof is waiting near the road into the Blasted Lands. Lieutenant Kirith is another matter: nobody knows what became of the lieutenant."] = "部落英雄的灵魂有两个名字要给你。桑德·裂蹄下士在通往诅咒之地的路边等着。基利斯中尉就是另一回事了：没人知道这位中尉后来怎么样了。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde has a name for you, and it's a long way off: Loramus Thalipedes, a demon hunter who lives by the Bay of Storms in Azshara. Loramus has a story of his own."] = "部落英雄的灵魂给了你一个名字，而那人远在天边：洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯，住在艾萨拉风暴海湾边上的一位恶魔猎手。洛拉姆斯也有他自己的故事。"
L["Loramus Thalipedes has packed your Azsharite into a shipment for Galvan the Ancient, in northern Stranglethorn Vale. It's most of the world away from Azshara, and Loramus has very particular plans for what's inside."] = "洛拉姆斯·萨里比迪斯把你的艾萨拉水晶打包成一批货，要送给荆棘谷北部的“古人”加尔文。那里离艾萨拉差不多隔着大半个世界，而洛拉姆斯对箱子里的东西有着非常具体的打算。"
L["The Fallen Hero of the Horde has a use for Felbane. Razelikh the Defiler keeps three lieutenants in the Blasted Lands, each wearing a piece of a shattered amulet, and ordinary steel won't finish any of them."] = "部落英雄的灵魂有用得着邪能克星的地方。污染者拉瑟莱克在诅咒之地手下有三个副官，每个都戴着一块破碎护符的碎片，普通的钢铁杀不死他们中的任何一个。"
L["Yeh'kinya, a troll at Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris, has the oddest little job on the coast: go to Feralas and catch the spirits of three dead screechers. Yeh'kinya supplies the bramble. You supply the legs."] = "塔纳利斯热砂港的巨魔叶基亚，有一份全海岸最古怪的小差事：去菲拉斯抓三只死掉的尖啸者的灵魂。叶基亚提供荆棘。你负责跑腿。"
L["Whatever the screecher spirits told Yeh'kinya, it had to do with an old troll prophecy written on tablets. The first two Mosh'aru tablets are in Zul'Farrak, among the sand trolls, and Yeh'kinya would very much like to read them."] = "不管尖啸者的灵魂跟叶基亚说了什么，都跟一个写在石板上的古老巨魔预言有关。前两块摩沙鲁石板在祖尔法拉克，在沙怒巨魔中间，叶基亚非常想读一读。"
L["Yeh'kinya has the ancient egg from Jintha'Alor and now wants it filled with the essence of Hakkar. That means the very bottom of the sunken Temple of Atal'Hakkar, in the Swamp of Sorrows. Don't go alone."] = "叶基亚拿到了辛萨罗的那颗古老的蛋，现在想用哈卡的精华把它装满。这意味着得下到悲伤沼泽里那座沉没的阿塔哈卡神庙的最底层。别一个人去。"
L["Prospector Ironboot at Steamwheedle Port has a question about the Mosh'aru tablets: how many do you think there are? Two more lie in Zul'Mashar, in the Eastern Plaguelands, and the prospector would like them brought back."] = "热砂港的勘查员铁靴对摩沙鲁石板有个疑问：你觉得一共有几块？东瘟疫之地的祖玛沙尔还有两块，勘查员希望有人把它们带回来。"
L["Prospector Ironboot has read all six Mosh'aru tablets and thinks it's time you and Yeh'kinya had a talk. Yeh'kinya is still at Steamwheedle Port, just down the way. The walk is the easy part."] = "勘查员铁靴读完了全部六块摩沙鲁石板，认为你该跟叶基亚谈一谈了。叶基亚还在热砂港，就在不远处。走过去是容易的部分。"
L["There's a wanted poster outside Westbrook Garrison. A huge gnoll called Hogger is prowling the woods of southwestern Elwynn, and he has beaten every attempt to catch him. Marshal Dughan in Goldshire pays the bounty."] = "西泉要塞外贴着一张通缉令。一个叫霍格的巨型豺狼人在艾尔文森林西南部的树林里游荡，每次围捕都被他打退了。闪金镇的治安官杜汉负责发赏金。"
L["Under the broken Thandol Span, where few travelers think to look, lie a dwarf's remains and a waterlogged envelope. It's addressed to Sara Balloo in Ironforge. It never got there."] = "在断掉的萨多尔大桥底下，在很少有旅人会想到去看的地方，躺着一个矮人的遗骸和一个泡透了的信封。收信人是铁炉堡的萨拉·巴鲁。信始终没送到。"
L["Sara Balloo's plea is in King Magni's hands now, up on the High Seat in Ironforge. The king has read it and made up his mind. It involves the Grand Mason, and it involves you."] = "萨拉·巴鲁的请求现在到了铁炉堡王座大厅的麦格尼国王手里。国王读过了，也拿定了主意。这事跟大石匠有关，也跟你有关。"
L["There's a wrecked raft in a pond in Un'Goro Crater, out in the southeastern marshes. Nobody aboard, nobody waiting nearby. Poke around in the water and you might learn whose it was."] = "安戈洛环形山东南部的沼泽里，一个池塘中有一只破木筏。筏上没人，附近也没人等着。在水里翻翻，你也许能弄清它是谁的。"
L["Donova Snowden at Frostfire Hot Springs in Winterspring has an idea about Linken's sword, and it needs a rare brew, the Videre Elixir. Gregan Brewspewer, in northern Feralas, knows how to come by one."] = "冬泉谷冰火温泉的多诺瓦·雪山对林克的剑有个想法，而这需要一种罕见的药剂：视灵药剂。菲拉斯北部的格雷甘·山酒知道怎么弄到。"
L["Eridan Bluewind, at the Emerald Sanctuary in southern Felwood, has the next piece of Linken's story. It starts with a silver heart, made from silvery claws and an irontree heart. Felwood's wildlife is still using both."] = "费伍德森林南部翡翠圣地的艾瑞丹·蓝风知道林克故事的下一段。它从一颗银色的心开始，用银色的爪子和一颗铁树之心做成。只不过这两样东西，费伍德森林的野生动物们还在用着。"
L["Linken, back at Marshal's Refuge, has one last job, and it's what the Silver Totem is for. On Fire Plume Ridge, Blazerunner guards a cave behind an aura nothing gets through. Nearly nothing. It's dangerous to go alone."] = "回到马绍尔营地的林克还有最后一件差事，这正是银图腾的用处。在火羽山，火焰使者守着一个山洞，身上的光环什么都穿不透。几乎什么都穿不透。一个人去很危险。"
L["Quillboar fell on Mankrik and his wife at a small tauren camp, and the fighting split them up. Mankrik woke on the Gold Road with a tauren druid tending his wounds. Now he waits at the Crossroads, asking for any sign of her."] = "野猪人在一个牛头人小营地袭击了曼科里克和他的妻子，混战中两人失散了。曼科里克在黄金之路上醒来时，一个牛头人德鲁伊正在照料他的伤。如今他在十字路口等着，打听她的任何消息。"
L["The Centaur Pariah, an outcast camped in southern Desolace, has a job for you in Maraudon, written out in full. Up near Kormek's Hut, Willow wants something from the same caves: crystal carvings, and plenty of them."] = "半人马贱民，一个在凄凉之地南部扎营的流亡者，有一份去玛拉顿的差事给你，写得清清楚楚。北边考米克小屋附近的维洛也想从同一片洞穴里弄点东西：水晶雕像，越多越好。"
L["Something is corrupting the plants of Maraudon. Talendria at Nijel's Point has a remedy to try, a coated vial to fill at the caverns' orange crystal pool. Archmage Tervosh in Theramore wants shadowshards from the purple side, too."] = "有什么东西在腐化玛拉顿的植物。尼耶尔前哨站的塔琳德莉亚有个办法想试试：一个涂过层的药瓶，要在洞穴的橙色水晶池里装满。塞拉摩的大法师特沃什还想要紫色那一边的暗影残片。"
L["Something is corrupting the plants of Maraudon. Vark Battlescar at Shadowprey Village has a remedy to try, a coated vial to fill at the caverns' orange crystal pool. Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar wants shadowshards from the purple side, too."] = "有什么东西在腐化玛拉顿的植物。葬影村的瓦克·战痕有个办法想试试：一个涂过层的药瓶，要在洞穴的橙色水晶池里装满。奥格瑞玛的尤塞尔奈还想要紫色那一边的暗影残片。"
L["Just inside Maraudon's orange passage, Cavindra tells a legend of the caves: Celebras, and his scepter, now in two pieces. Find the rod and the diamond, then find a way to speak with Celebras himself."] = "就在玛拉顿橙色通道的入口里面，凯雯德拉讲述着一个关于这些洞穴的传说：塞雷布拉斯，和他那根如今断成两截的节杖。找到杖身和钻石，然后想办法跟塞雷布拉斯本人说上话。"
L["Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point wants Princess Theradras dead. The princess waits at the very bottom of Maraudon, and everything between here and there would rather you stayed home."] = "尼耶尔前哨站的守护者玛兰迪斯想要瑟莱德丝公主的命。公主就在玛拉顿的最底层等着，而从这儿到那儿的一路上，所有东西都巴不得你待在家里别来。"
L["Selendra, camped near Shadowprey Village, wants Princess Theradras dead. The princess waits at the very bottom of Maraudon, and everything between here and there would rather you stayed home."] = "在葬影村附近扎营的瑟琳德拉想要瑟莱德丝公主的命。公主就在玛拉顿的最底层等着，而从这儿到那儿的一路上，所有东西都巴不得你待在家里别来。"
L["Feathermoon Stronghold is missing a courier. Raschal set out from Thalanaar and never arrived. Latronicus Moonspear has already marked him missing in action, but upstairs in the stronghold, Ginro Hearthkindle hasn't given up."] = "羽月要塞丢了一个信使。拉斯卡尔从萨兰纳尔出发，却再也没有到达。拉托尼库斯·月矛已经把他记为作战失踪，可在要塞楼上，基恩诺·火花还没有放弃。"
L["All the wreck gave up was a knife, and Ginro Hearthkindle thinks it can still tell you something. Take it to Quintis Jonespyre, up in Feathermoon's treehouse, who can read where a thing has been."] = "残骸里只找到一把刀，而基恩诺·火花认为它还能告诉你些什么。把它拿给羽月要塞树屋上的奎恩提斯，奎恩提斯能读出一样东西去过哪里。"
L["The knife points inland, to the Woodpaw gnolls of southern Feralas. Ginro Hearthkindle wants their camps searched for Raschal's belongings, or for Raschal. Gnolls are not known for returning lost property."] = "那把刀指向内陆，指向菲拉斯南部的木爪豺狼人。基恩诺·火花想让人去搜他们的营地，找拉斯卡尔的东西，或者找拉斯卡尔本人。豺狼人可不以归还失物著称。"
L["Raschal's note points south of the Woodpaw camps, to a place called the Writhing Deep. Whatever he went to look at down there, he hasn't come back from it. Go and find him, or what's left of him."] = "拉斯卡尔的字条指向木爪营地的南边，一个叫痛苦深渊的地方。不管他到那下面去看什么，他都还没回来。去找到他，或者他剩下的部分。"
L["Thomas, in Cathedral Square in Stormwind, has a message for someone who can keep quiet: Bishop DeLavey would like to see you in Stormwind Keep. The bishop isn't saying why. Not out loud, anyway."] = "暴风城教堂广场的托马斯有一条消息，要带给一个嘴严的人：德拉维主教想在暴风要塞见你。主教没说为什么。至少没大声说。"
L["Elling Trias's sealed note has brought you to Watcher Backus, on the road north of Darkshire. Now the watcher wants you out at Addle's Stead in western Duskwood, where the Defias may have left some paperwork lying around."] = "埃林·提亚斯的密封字条把你带到了夜色镇北边路上的守夜人巴库斯那儿。现在守夜人要你去暮色森林西部的腐草农场，迪菲亚可能在那儿落下了些文件。"
L["Elling Trias, back at the cheese shop in Stormwind's Trade District, has read the Defias docket and picked your next stop before putting it down: Dashel Stonefist, in Old Town."] = "回到暴风城贸易区奶酪店的埃林·提亚斯读了迪菲亚案卷，还没放下，就已经替你挑好了下一站：旧城区的达舍尔·石拳。"
L["Mikhail, at the Deepwater Tavern in Menethil Harbor, has had an eye on a patron called Tapoke Jahn. Slim, to his friends. Slim takes a great interest in other people's business, and Mikhail thinks it's time someone returned the favor."] = "米奈希尔港深水旅店的米克哈尔一直在留意一个叫塔伯克·贾恩的客人。朋友们叫他“干柴”。干柴对别人的事兴趣浓厚，米克哈尔觉得是时候有人礼尚往来一下了。"
L["Commander Samaul, at Foothold Citadel in Theramore, has heard what brought you all this way. The commander sends you to Sentry Point, in Dustwallow Marsh, to look for any sign of a Private Hendel."] = "塞拉摩堡垒的指挥官萨穆尔听说了你千里迢迢来这儿的原因。指挥官派你去尘泥沼泽的警戒哨岗，找找一个叫亨德尔的下士的踪迹。"
L["Deathstalker Zraedus keeps a quiet Forsaken camp at Beggar's Haunt in Duskwood. A human spy was watching it, but the orcs got to him first and hauled him off to Stonard. Zraedus would like to help them get the truth out of him."] = "亡灵哨兵莱度斯在暮色森林的乞丐鬼屋守着一个不起眼的被遗忘者营地。有个人类间谍一直在监视它，但兽人先下手抓住了他，把他拖去了斯通纳德。莱度斯很乐意帮他们从他嘴里掏出实话。"
L["Black dragonkin are gathering in the Burning Steppes, uncomfortably close to Morgan's Vigil. Helendis Riverhorn at the Vigil wants their numbers thinned, from the smallest broodling right up to a drake."] = "黑龙人正在燃烧平原集结，离摩根的岗哨近得让人不安。岗哨的赫林迪斯·河角想让它们少一些，从最小的小龙一直到幼龙。"
L["Ragged John's tale ended with Marshal Windsor dragged off to a prison. Marshal Maxwell at Morgan's Vigil wants to know what became of him, and the trail leads into Blackrock Depths, under Blackrock Mountain."] = "狼狈不堪的约翰的故事，结束在温德索尔元帅被拖进一座监狱。摩根的岗哨的麦克斯韦尔元帅想知道他后来怎么样了，线索通往黑石山底下的黑石深渊。"
L["Marshal Maxwell at Morgan's Vigil has word from Marshal Windsor: he's bound for Stormwind and wants you there when he arrives. Go to the city gates and find Squire Rowe, who will let Windsor know you've come."] = "摩根的岗哨的麦克斯韦尔元帅收到了温德索尔元帅的消息：他正前往暴风城，希望他到达时你也在场。去城门口找侍从罗维，侍从会通知温德索尔你已经来了。"
L["Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep hands you a fragment of the Dragon's Eye. Someone out there can restore its power. That is the whole of what anyone knows about them, so the search may take a while."] = "暴风要塞的大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根交给你一块巨龙之眼的碎片。外面某个地方有人能恢复它的力量。关于那人，大家知道的就只有这么多，所以这趟寻找可能要花点时间。"
L["Warlord Goretooth in Kargath, out in the Badlands, has three names in Lower Blackrock Spire and wants every one of them dead. Whatever papers they're keeping, the warlord wants those brought back too."] = "荒芜之地卡加斯的军官高图斯在黑石塔下层有三个名字，要他们统统去死。他们手里保管的任何文件，军官也都要带回来。"
L["Thrall, in Grommash Hold, wants you to find Rexxar, the Champion of the Horde. Rexxar walks the paths of Desolace somewhere between Stonetalon and Feralas and doesn't wait for visitors. Expect to walk."] = "格罗玛什要塞的萨尔要你去找部落的勇士雷克萨。雷克萨在凄凉之地的小路上游荡，大概在石爪山脉和菲拉斯之间，从不等访客。做好走路的准备。"
L["Emberstrife, in a den deep in the Wyrmbog of Dustwallow Marsh, won't take you on faith. The test is skulls: one from a champion of each of the blue, green, bronze and red dragonflights."] = "尘泥沼泽巨龙沼泽深处巢穴里的埃博斯塔夫，不会凭空相信你。考验是头骨：蓝龙、绿龙、青铜龙和红龙军团的勇士，各一个。"
L["Rexxar, back on the roads of Desolace, knows what the amulet still lacks: the blood of General Drakkisath, champion of the black dragonflight. The general keeps his throne at the top of Blackrock Spire, and a great many guards around it."] = "回到凄凉之地路上的雷克萨知道护符还缺什么：达基萨斯将军的血，黑龙军团的勇士。将军的王座在黑石塔顶上，周围还有一大群卫兵。"
L["Hooligans overran the Furlbrows' fields one night, and the couple fled in a rush. Now their wagon has broken down by the road near Jansen Stead in Westfall. Farmer Furlbrow left something precious behind, and Verna is fretting over their tired old horse."] = "一天夜里，一帮流氓占了法布隆家的田地，夫妻俩仓皇出逃。现在他们的马车在西部荒野詹森农场附近的路边坏了。农夫法布隆落下了一样珍贵的东西，而弗娜正为他们那匹疲惫的老马发愁。"
L["Royal Historian Archesonus, by the High Seat in Ironforge, has a long history of the Dark Iron dwarves to tell. Hear it out. King Magni has questions about his daughter, Moira, and the answers lie in Blackrock Depths."] = "铁炉堡王座大厅旁的皇家历史学家阿克瑟努斯有一段关于黑铁矮人的长长历史要讲。耐心听完。麦格尼国王对他的女儿茉艾拉有些疑问，而答案就在黑石深渊里。"
L["King Magni has heard enough. His orders from the High Seat are plain: back into Blackrock Depths, through the Dark Iron city to Emperor Dagran Thaurissan, and bring Princess Moira home."] = "麦格尼国王听够了。他从王座大厅发出的命令很明白：回到黑石深渊，穿过黑铁矮人的城市找到达格兰·索瑞森大帝，把茉艾拉公主带回家。"
L["Galamav the Marksman in Kargath shows you a crude drawing of an orc, bars scrawled across the face. The orc is Commander Gor'shak, and the bars suggest a prison. Blackrock Depths has a big one."] = "卡加斯的神射手贾拉玛弗给你看了一幅粗糙的兽人画像，脸上胡乱画着几道栏杆。那个兽人是指挥官哥沙克，而那几道栏杆暗示着一座监狱。黑石深渊里正好有一座大的。"
L["Raene Wolfrunner, in Astranaar, is worried about Teronis, who went west looking for a way to stop the furbolg attacks and hasn't come back. Raene would like Teronis found. Ashenvale is a big forest."] = "阿斯特兰纳的莱恩·狼行者在担心特洛尼斯，特洛尼斯往西去找制止熊怪袭击的办法，一直没回来。莱恩希望有人找到特洛尼斯。灰谷可是一片很大的森林。"
L["Raene has read Teronis' journal, and it points to Shael'dryn, who keeps a moonwell east of Iris Lake. Shael'dryn knows what Teronis was after. Getting it will take you into some of Ashenvale's less pleasant corners."] = "莱恩读了特洛尼斯的日记，日记指向莎尔蒂恩，莎尔蒂恩守着伊瑞斯湖东边的一座月亮井。莎尔蒂恩知道特洛尼斯在找什么。要拿到它，你得去灰谷一些不那么愉快的角落。"
L["Raene Wolfrunner, back in Astranaar, has a use for Dartol's Rod. A few of Ashenvale's furbolg still aren't corrupted, and Raene wants you to talk to one. The rod, apparently, will help with the introductions."] = "回到阿斯特兰纳的莱恩·狼行者想到了达托尔的变形之杖的用处。灰谷还有少数熊怪没被腐化，莱恩想让你去跟其中一个谈谈。看来那根杖能帮你做个自我介绍。"
L["Yenniku, youngest son of the Darkspear chief, has been taken somewhere in Stranglethorn. Nimboya at Grom'gol Base Camp is searching for him, and the Bloodscalp trolls in the ruins north of camp are the only trail there is."] = "暗矛酋长最小的儿子耶尼库在荆棘谷的某个地方被抓走了。格罗姆高营地的尼姆布亚正在找他，而营地北边废墟里的血顶巨魔是唯一的线索。"
L["The heads of the two Bloodscalp leaders sit in the cauldron at Grom'gol, and death hasn't stopped them talking. It hasn't made them generous either. Before they say a word about Yenniku, they want paying."] = "两个血顶首领的脑袋泡在格罗姆高的大锅里，死亡也没能让他们闭嘴。也没让他们变大方。在说出关于耶尼库的一个字之前，他们要先收钱。"
L["Nezzliok's head has one last thing to say about the fate of Yenniku. After that it's over to Kin'weelay, who stands beside the cauldron at Grom'gol and doesn't seem the least bit bothered by talking heads."] = "奈兹里奥克的脑袋对耶尼库的命运还有最后一件事要说。之后就轮到肯维雷了，肯维雷站在格罗姆高的大锅旁边，对会说话的人头似乎一点都不在意。"
L["Kin'weelay's Soul Gem is ready, and it's no good to anyone sitting in your pack. Yenniku is somewhere out in the jungle, in Zanzil's hold. Nimboya waits at Grom'gol for whatever you bring back."] = "肯维雷的灵魂宝石已经做好了，躺在你的背包里对谁都没用。耶尼库就在丛林里某处，在赞吉尔的据点里。尼姆布亚在格罗姆高等着你带回来的东西。"
L["Executor Arren, in Deathknell, has work for the newly risen. Spiders first. But the Scarlet Crusade has made camp at the edge of the valley, and Arren hasn't forgotten them for a moment."] = "丧钟镇的执行官阿伦有活儿交给新近复生的人。先是蜘蛛。但血色十字军已经在山谷边上扎了营，阿伦可是一刻也没忘了他们。"
L["Brill is at war with the Scarlet Crusade camps west of town, and everyone in Brill has a part for you. Deathguard Simmer starts small: steal some pumpkins off a farm north of Deathknell. Executor Zygand thinks bigger."] = "布瑞尔正在跟镇子西边的血色十字军营地开战，布瑞尔的每个人都有一份活儿给你。亡灵卫兵希米尔从小事做起：去丧钟镇北边的农场偷几个南瓜。执行官塞加德想得更大。"
L["Brother Crowley, in Stormwind's Cathedral Square, wants you to call on Brother Anton. Anton is at Nijel's Point in Desolace, which is a long way to go for a conversation. Crowley doesn't say what it's about. Anton will."] = "暴风城教堂广场的克罗雷修士想让你去拜访安东修士。安东在凄凉之地的尼耶尔前哨站，为了一次谈话跑那么远可真不近。克罗雷没说是为了什么。安东会说的。"
L["Librarian Mae Paledust, in Ironforge's Hall of Explorers, wants one book: the Mythology of the Titans. The copy Mae has in mind sits in the library of the Scarlet Monastery in Tirisfal Glades, and the Crusade doesn't lend."] = "铁炉堡探险者大厅的图书馆员麦伊·苍尘想要一本书：《泰坦神话》。麦伊惦记的那一本，放在提瑞斯法林地血色修道院的图书馆里，而十字军从不外借。"
L["Deep in the Scarlet Monastery's graveyard, in Tirisfal Glades, a prisoner named Vorrel Sengutz is waiting for someone to get that far. The library has customers too: Sage Truthseeker, in Thunder Bluff, wants a book off its shelves."] = "在提瑞斯法林地血色修道院墓地的深处，一个叫沃瑞尔·森加斯的囚犯在等着有人能走到那么远。图书馆也有主顾：雷霆崖的圣者图希克想从那些书架上弄本书。"
L["Raleigh the Devout, in Southshore, wants the leaders of the Scarlet Monastery dead, in the name of the Light. They would say they do everything in its name too. There are four of them, from the kennels to the Cathedral."] = "南海镇的虔诚的莱雷恩想以圣光之名，让血色修道院的首领们去死。他们也会说自己做的每件事都是以圣光之名。他们一共四个，从狗舍一路排到大教堂。"
L["Varimathras wants a word in the Undercity's Royal Quarter. The dreadlord has four names for you, the leaders of the Scarlet Monastery from the kennels to the Cathedral, and wants every one of them dead. Say yes quickly."] = "瓦里玛萨斯要在幽暗城的皇家区跟你谈谈。这位恐惧魔王给了你四个名字，血色修道院从狗舍到大教堂的四个首领，要他们统统去死。赶紧答应。"
L["Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff of the Argent Dawn, at Light's Hope Chapel, wants a fire started. The Scarlet Crusade keeps an archive in Stratholme, and the duke wants it burned, along with the archivist who keeps it."] = "圣光之愿礼拜堂的银色黎明的尼古拉斯·瑟伦霍夫公爵想放一把火。血色十字军在斯坦索姆有一座档案馆，公爵想把它烧掉，连同看管它的档案管理员一起。"
L["Kirsta Deepshadow, in the north of the Western Plaguelands, has unfinished business with the Scarlet Crusade and could use a hand with it. Their outer lines are close by. Behind them sits Hearthglen."] = "西瘟疫之地北部的科尔斯塔·迪普沙东跟血色十字军有些未了结的事，需要人搭把手。他们的外围防线就在附近。防线后面就是壁炉谷。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller keeps to Marris Stead in the Eastern Plaguelands and doesn't do small talk. He has orders for you, and they start with a trip home: Varimathras, in the Undercity, is expecting you."] = "纳萨诺斯·凋零者守在东瘟疫之地的玛瑞斯农场，从不闲聊。他有命令给你，而命令从一趟回家之旅开始：幽暗城的瓦里玛萨斯在等你。"
L["At the western edge of the Eastern Plaguelands, an old man named Tirion Fordring lives alone in a cottage, a long way from anybody. He has a story to tell and a favor to ask. Sit down for the story."] = "在东瘟疫之地的西缘，一个叫提里奥·弗丁的老人独自住在一间小屋里，离谁都很远。他有一个故事要讲，还有一个忙要请你帮。听故事的时候，坐下来。"
L["High Executor Derrington, at the Bulwark, wants the Scarlet Crusade busy fighting somebody other than the Forsaken, starting with their camp near Felstone Field. Over in the Eastern Plaguelands, Tirion Fordring lives alone in a cottage and has a favor to ask."] = "亡灵壁垒的高级执行官德灵顿想让血色十字军忙着跟被遗忘者以外的人打仗，先从费尔斯通农场附近的营地开始。而在东瘟疫之地，提里奥·弗丁独自住在一间小屋里，有个忙要请你帮。"
L["Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp wants someone inside Scholomance, the Scourge's school on Caer Darrow. The door is locked, and nobody hands out keys. Alchemist Arbington, in the same camp, thinks you can make one."] = "寒风营地的指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特想派人进入通灵学院，那是天灾军团在凯尔达隆的学校。门是锁着的，没人发钥匙。同在营地的化学家阿尔比顿认为你可以自己做一把。"
L["High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark wants someone inside Scholomance, the Scourge's school on Caer Darrow. The door is locked, and nobody hands out keys. Apothecary Dithers, at the Bulwark too, thinks you can make one."] = "亡灵壁垒的高级执行官德灵顿想派人进入通灵学院，那是天灾军团在凯尔达隆的学校。门是锁着的，没人发钥匙。同在亡灵壁垒的药剂师迪瑟斯认为你可以自己做一把。"
L["Caer Darrow is full of ghosts, and Eva Sarkhoff is one of the saddest. She has unfinished business with Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher, who is still at work somewhere inside Scholomance."] = "凯尔达隆到处都是鬼魂，艾瓦·萨克霍夫是其中最悲伤的一个。她和“屠夫”瑟尔林·卡斯迪诺夫教授之间有一桩未了的事，而这位屠夫还在通灵学院里的某处干着老本行。"
L["Magistrate Marduke, another of Caer Darrow's ghosts, wants the lich Ras Frostwhisper destroyed, and has some advice: before you fight a lich, find out who it used to be. That trail starts in the ruins of Stromgarde."] = "马杜克镇长，凯尔达隆的另一个鬼魂，想要摧毁巫妖莱斯·霜语，还给了你一条忠告：在跟巫妖开打之前，先弄清楚它以前是谁。那条线索从激流堡的废墟开始。"
L["Weldon Barov at Chillwind Camp wants the family fortune back. It's somewhere in Scholomance, as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Somebody has to go in after them. Weldon has someone in mind."] = "寒风营地的维尔顿·巴罗夫想要回家族财产。它就在通灵学院里的某处，是四张地契：凯尔达隆、布瑞尔、塔伦米尔和南海镇。总得有人进去取。维尔顿心里已经有人选了。"
L["Alexi Barov, near the Bulwark, has a business proposal. The Barov fortune is lying in Scholomance as four deeds: Caer Darrow, Brill, Tarren Mill and Southshore. Alexi wants them home, and would rather not fetch them personally."] = "亡灵壁垒附近的阿莱克斯·巴罗夫有个生意上的提议。巴罗夫家的财产散落在通灵学院里，是四张地契：凯尔达隆、布瑞尔、塔伦米尔和南海镇。阿莱克斯想把它们拿回来，但不太想亲自去取。"
L["Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow, at the Shrine of Aessina in Ashenvale, has a wolf problem. These wolves walk on two legs and roam the Howling Vale, where they have no business being. An old book there, the Tome of Mel'Thandris, may explain them."] = "灰谷艾森娜神殿的哨兵梅丽瑞亚·霜影遇上了狼的麻烦。这些狼用两条腿走路，在狼嚎谷里游荡，而那地方本不该有它们。那里有一本古书，《麦尔莎迪丝之书》，也许能解释它们的来历。"
L["The Tome of Mel'Thandris gave Sentinel Melyria a name: Velinde Starsong. Melyria wants to know what became of Velinde, and sends you to Darnassus to ask Thyn'tel Bladeweaver on the Warrior's Terrace."] = "《麦尔莎迪丝之书》给了哨兵梅丽瑞亚一个名字：维琳德·星歌。梅丽瑞亚想知道维琳德后来怎么样了，派你去达纳苏斯，问问战士区的塞恩提尔·刃纹。"
L["Velinde Starsong left Ashenvale to find help a long way off, and Darnassus hasn't heard from Velinde since. Thyn'tel Bladeweaver thinks the trail starts at the docks. Wharfmaster Dizzywig, in Ratchet, might remember a passenger."] = "维琳德·星歌离开灰谷，去很远的地方寻求帮助，从那以后达纳苏斯就再没收到过维琳德的消息。塞恩提尔·刃纹认为线索从码头开始。棘齿城的码头管理员迪兹维格也许记得一位乘客。"
L["Velinde's trail has come all the way to Darkshire, in Duskwood, where the sun doesn't bother. Clerk Daltry, at the town hall, keeps the records. Somebody here must remember a night elf priestess passing through."] = "维琳德的踪迹一路来到了暮色森林的夜色镇，那里的太阳都懒得出来。镇大厅的书记员达尔塔保管着记录。这里总该有人记得一位路过的暗夜精灵女祭司。"
L["What you dug out of Roland's Doom belongs in Darnassus. Jonathan Carevin, in Darkshire, wants Thyn'tel Bladeweaver to see it, and that means crossing the sea again. Mind it on the boat."] = "你从罗兰之墓挖出来的东西应该送到达纳苏斯去。夜色镇的乔纳森·卡尔文想让塞恩提尔·刃纹看看它，这意味着又要渡海了。在船上看好它。"
L["The Shady Rest Inn, on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow Marsh, has burned to the ground. Everyone has a theory about who did it. Captain Garran Vimes in Theramore would rather have evidence. Start at the ruins."] = "贫瘠之地和尘泥沼泽之间路上的树荫旅店被烧成了平地。每个人都有一套说法，认定是谁干的。塞拉摩的盖兰·维米斯队长更想要证据。从废墟开始。"
L["In what's left of the Shady Rest's fireplace lies a shield: black iron, scorched, and far too big for a human arm. Theramore will jump to conclusions. Captain Vimes would rather know where it was made."] = "树荫旅店壁炉的残骸里有一面盾牌：黑铁打的，烧焦了，对人类的胳膊来说大得离谱。塞拉摩肯定会急着下结论。维米斯队长更想知道它是在哪儿造的。"
L["There's a badge in the ashes as well, Theramore Guard, with a name on it: Lieutenant Paval Reethe. A Theramore officer's badge has no business at a burned inn. Captain Vimes will want to check the records."] = "灰烬里还有一枚徽章，塞拉摩卫兵的，上面有个名字：帕瓦尔·雷瑟上尉。一个塞拉摩军官的徽章，可不该出现在一家被烧毁的旅店里。维米斯队长会想查查记录。"
L["Captain Vimes isn't satisfied yet. One more lead goes north, to Captain Darill at North Point Tower, who has a suspicion about the fire at the Shady Rest and needs someone to go and test it."] = "维米斯队长还不满意。还有一条线索往北，通向北点哨塔的达利尔上尉，上尉对树荫旅店的那场火有个怀疑，需要有人去验证一下。"
L["The Shady Rest Inn, on the road between the Barrens and Dustwallow Marsh, has burned down, and the talk is that the Horde did it. Krog in Brackenwall Village would like the truth first. Start at the ruins."] = "贫瘠之地和尘泥沼泽之间路上的树荫旅店被烧毁了，传言说是部落干的。蕨墙村的克罗格想先弄清真相。从废墟开始。"
L["Word of a burned inn has reached Camp Taurajo, and with it Alliance soldiers who blame the Horde. Grunt Logmar wants them seen off. The inn, the Shady Rest, is just over the border in Dustwallow Marsh."] = "一家旅店被烧的消息传到了陶拉祖营地，随之而来的还有把账算在部落头上的联盟士兵。步兵劳格玛想把他们打发走。那家旅店，树荫旅店，就在边界另一边的尘泥沼泽里。"
L["A blackened iron shield sits in the Shady Rest's fireplace, heavy enough to stop a charging kodo. Krog in Brackenwall Village will want to see it before anyone starts drawing conclusions."] = "树荫旅店的壁炉里有一面烧黑的铁盾，沉得能挡住一头冲锋的科多兽。在谁开始下结论之前，蕨墙村的克罗格会想先看看它。"
L["A Theramore Guard badge turns up in the ashes, with a name on it: Lieutenant Paval Reethe. Krog in Brackenwall Village will want to know what a Theramore badge was doing at the Shady Rest."] = "灰烬里翻出一枚塞拉摩卫兵的徽章，上面有个名字：帕瓦尔·雷瑟上尉。蕨墙村的克罗格会想知道，一枚塞拉摩的徽章跑到树荫旅店干什么。"
L["Mosarn, in Thunder Bluff, has remembered something about that black shield, and Krog ought to hear it. Back to Brackenwall Village, then. It's a long way to carry a thought."] = "雷霆崖的莫萨恩想起了关于那面黑盾的一些事，克罗格应该听听。那就回蕨墙村吧。为了一个念头跑这么远。"
L["There's a crumpled map lying at Hammertoe's Digsite in the Badlands, and the note on it says Hammertoe Grez is alive. Prospector Ryedol, camped just down the road, will want to hear that."] = "荒芜之地的铁趾挖掘场有一张皱巴巴的地图，上面的字条说铁趾格雷兹还活着。就在路那头扎营的勘察员雷杜尔会想听到这个消息。"
L["Somewhere in Uldaman, a shattered necklace is waiting to be found. Broken, but fine work. Track down whoever made it and you might learn what it's worth."] = "在奥达曼的某个地方，一条碎掉的项链等着被人找到。坏了，但做工精细。找到做它的人，你也许就能知道它值多少。"
L["Dran Droffers, of Droffers and Son Salvage in Orgrimmar, has heard about a valuable necklace somewhere in the Uldaman dig site. Possibly damaged. Droffers doesn't mind damaged, as long as somebody brings it back."] = "奥格瑞玛杜佛斯父子回收站的德兰·杜佛斯，听说奥达曼挖掘场里有一条值钱的项链。可能坏了。杜佛斯不介意坏的，只要有人把它带回来。"
L["At the very bottom of Uldaman, behind the last of its guardians, a stone watcher keeps the Discs of Norgannon. It has been waiting a very long time for someone to come and ask it questions."] = "在奥达曼的最底层，越过最后一批守护者，一个石头守望者守着诺甘农圆盘。它已经等了很久很久，就等有人来问它问题。"
L["Years after Archimonde fell, Mount Hyjal is still scarred. Fel ash poisons its slopes, warlocks pick through the ruins of the war, and the Wild Gods who watch over the mountain have begun to falter.\n\nWhen a dying god presses a corrupted branch of the World Tree into your hands, a hermit druid, a meddling crow and the wild spirits of the mountain all have questions about it, and none of them are simple."] = "阿克蒙德陨落多年之后，海加尔山依然伤痕累累。邪能灰烬毒害着山坡，术士们在战争的废墟里翻翻拣拣，守护这座山的荒野之神也开始衰弱。\n\n当一位垂死的神祇把一根被腐化的世界之树枝条塞到你手里时，一位隐士德鲁伊、一只爱管闲事的乌鸦和山中的野性之灵都对它有一肚子疑问，而且没有一个问题是简单的。"
L["At Steamwheedle Port, Yeh'kinya asks for help with old troll spirits and older tablets. It sounds like simple archaeology, and Yeh'kinya is very polite about it.\n\nFollow the tablets from Feralas and Zul'Farrak into older and darker places, and see where an old troll's errand leads."] = "在热砂港，叶基亚请你帮忙对付古老的巨魔灵魂，还有更古老的石板。听起来像是简单的考古活儿，而且叶基亚对此客气得很。\n\n跟着这些石板，从菲拉斯和祖尔法拉克走进更古老、更黑暗的地方，看看一个老巨魔的差事最后会把你带到哪儿。"
L["The crystal caverns beneath Desolace are holy ground, burial ground, and wound all at once. Satyrs, centaur spirits and corrupted plants all pull at the same buried story.\n\nEnter Maraudon from the orange and purple passages and follow its old stories as far down as they go."] = "凄凉之地底下的水晶洞穴，既是圣地，也是墓地，还是一道伤口。萨特、半人马的灵魂和被腐化的植物，都在拉扯着同一个埋在地下的故事。\n\n从橙色和紫色通道进入玛拉顿，跟着它古老的故事，一路往下走到尽头。"
L["North of the road into Deadwind Pass, two Forsaken agents keep a quiet post at Beggar's Haunt. A human infiltrator has seen too much, and Stonard's orcs have taken him alive before the matter could be settled.\n\nWork with Deathstalker Zraedus and Apothecary Faustin on a serum meant to draw out the truth."] = "在通往逆风小径的路北边，两名被遗忘者特工在乞丐鬼屋守着一个不起眼的据点。一个人类间谍看到了太多东西，而斯通纳德的兽人赶在事情了结之前把他活捉了。\n\n和亡灵哨兵莱度斯与药剂师法奥斯丁一起，调制一种能逼出实话的药剂。"
L["Caer Darrow's ruined school is locked behind more than a door. The Scourge has made Scholomance a place of experiments, ghosts and old family secrets that refuse to stay buried.\n\nForge the Skeleton Key, then follow the stories Caer Darrow's ghosts still want told."] = "凯尔达隆那座破败的学校，锁住它的可不只是一扇门。天灾军团把通灵学院变成了一个满是实验、鬼魂和不肯安息的家族旧秘密的地方。\n\n打造骷髅钥匙，然后去追寻凯尔达隆的鬼魂们仍想讲述的那些故事。"
L["On the road between Dustwallow Marsh and the Barrens, the Shady Rest Inn is nothing but ash, hoofprints, a scorched shield, and a guard badge that should not be there.\n\nFollow the clues before faction blame buries the truth."] = "在尘泥沼泽和贫瘠之地之间的路上，树荫旅店只剩下灰烬、蹄印、一面烧焦的盾牌，还有一枚本不该出现在那里的卫兵徽章。\n\n在阵营之间的互相指责把真相埋掉之前，追查这些线索。"
L["Aramis Hammerhand in Tirisfal Glades believes the Light still answers you, whatever anyone else thinks. A paladin's lessons are not only prayers; they ask for aid given, judgment shown, and materials gathered with care.\n\nFollow the order's tests from your first doubts to the rites reserved for those who have carried the Light long enough to be trusted with more."] = "提瑞斯法林地的阿拉米斯·锤手相信，不管别人怎么想，圣光仍然回应着你。圣骑士的课程不只是祈祷；它们要求你伸出援手、做出裁决，还要用心收集材料。\n\n从你最初的疑虑开始，一路走过骑士团的考验，直到那些专为背负圣光足够久、值得托付更多的人保留的仪式。"
L["Master Mathias Shaw does not teach by lecture. SI:7 sends its rogues into guarded places, locked boxes, and situations where an antidote matters as much as a blade.\n\nBegin with the work Shaw hands you, then follow the hints that lead beyond city trainers into a wider trade of signals and reputation."] = "马迪亚斯·肖尔大师不靠讲课教人。军情七处把它的潜行者派进戒备森严的地方、上了锁的箱子，以及解药和刀刃一样要紧的局面里。\n\n从肖尔交给你的活儿开始，然后跟着那些线索，走出城里的训练师那一亩三分地，进入一个靠暗号和名声做生意的更大的行当。"
L["Shenthul does not teach by lecture. The Shattered Hand sends its rogues into guarded places, locked boxes, and situations where an antidote matters as much as a blade.\n\nBegin with the work Shenthul hands you, then follow the hints that lead beyond city trainers into a wider trade of signals and reputation."] = "申苏尔不靠讲课教人。碎手把它的潜行者派进戒备森严的地方、上了锁的箱子，以及解药和刀刃一样要紧的局面里。\n\n从申苏尔交给你的活儿开始，然后跟着那些线索，走出城里的训练师那一亩三分地，进入一个靠暗号和名声做生意的更大的行当。"
L["Jaina Proudmoore's marines have brought in a man found washed up on the shore, and his claim is one SI:7 cannot ignore. Master Mathias Shaw wants someone discreet in Theramore to learn the truth.\n\nThe trail bends toward Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast that hardly anyone thinks about. Whatever waits beneath its keep, someone has gone to great lengths to hide it."] = "吉安娜·普罗德摩尔的陆战队带回了一个被冲上岸的男人，而他的说法让军情七处无法置之不理。马迪亚斯·肖尔大师需要一个行事低调的人前往塞拉摩查明真相。\n\n线索指向奥卡兹岛，沼泽海岸外一座几乎无人在意的古老废墟。无论它的要塞底下藏着什么，都有人费尽心机把它藏了起来。"
L["In Orgrimmar, Eitrigg has a worry: a band of Kor'kron Elite sent into Dustwallow Marsh is long overdue, and nobody has heard a word from them.\n\nThe trail bends toward Alcaz Island, an old ruin off the marsh's coast that hardly anyone thinks about. Whatever waits beneath its keep, someone has gone to great lengths to hide it."] = "在奥格瑞玛，伊崔格有件心事：一支被派往尘泥沼泽的库卡隆精英小队早已逾期未归，至今音讯全无。\n\n线索指向奥卡兹岛，沼泽海岸外一座几乎无人在意的古老废墟。无论它的要塞底下藏着什么，都有人费尽心机把它藏了起来。"
L["Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. Night elf sentinels at Talrendis Point fight the Spitelash naga for the ruins of Eldarath.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."] = "艾萨拉残破的高塔里仍藏着上层精灵的秘密，所有人都赶来挖掘。暗夜精灵哨兵在塔伦迪斯营地与激浪纳迦争夺埃达拉斯废墟。\n\n北边，黑喉熊怪栖身在乌索兰的营地里。他们被雷加希萨特赶出了家园，又因恶魔散播的腐化而染病。他们的护门者正在寻找盟友。"
L["Azshara's broken towers still hold the secrets of the highborne, and everyone has come to dig for them. At Valormok, the Horde has paid in blood for trusting a blood elf mage.\n\nTo the north, the Blackmaw furbolgs shelter in the camps of Ursolan, driven from their home by the Legashi satyr and sickening from the corruption the demons spread. Their gatekeeper is looking for allies."] = "艾萨拉残破的高塔里仍藏着上层精灵的秘密，所有人都赶来挖掘。在瓦罗莫克，部落因为轻信一个血精灵法师而付出了血的代价。\n\n北边，黑喉熊怪栖身在乌索兰的营地里。他们被雷加希萨特赶出了家园，又因恶魔散播的腐化而染病。他们的护门者正在寻找盟友。"
L["No one has held the Riverglades for long. The humans of Farholde Keep, who feel Stormwind has forgotten them, have fought the orcs of Rog'mar across the river for years. Now the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade and started digging under the hills.\n\nFarholde needs to know what the cult is looking for."] = "从没有人能长久占据河林。法霍德要塞的人类觉得暴风城已经遗忘了他们，多年来一直隔河与洛格玛的兽人交战。如今，暮光之锤烧毁了阳光林地村，还开始在山丘底下挖掘。\n\n法霍德需要知道这个教派在找什么。"
L["No one has held the Riverglades for long. The orcs of Rog'mar have fought the humans of Farholde Keep across the river for years. Now the Twilight's Hammer has burned the village of Sunnyglade and started digging under the hills.\n\nRog'mar needs to know what the cult is looking for, and the answer may lie with ogres who have already turned their backs on it."] = "从没有人能长久占据河林。多年来，洛格玛的兽人一直隔河与法霍德要塞的人类交战。如今，暮光之锤烧毁了阳光林地村，还开始在山丘底下挖掘。\n\n洛格玛需要知道这个教派在找什么，而答案也许就在那些已经背弃了它的食人魔身上。"
L["When your old dungeon armor has seen enough battle, Deliana in Ironforge will offer work that sounds simple enough: bring the right pieces, prove you are ready, and keep following instructions.\n\nThe errands soon reach far beyond a single set of bracers. Expect old dungeons, stranger patrons, expensive favors, and a brazier whose purpose is not explained all at once."] = "当你的旧地下城护甲已经身经百战，铁炉堡的德莉亚娜会给你一份听上去挺简单的活儿：带来对的部件，证明你已经准备好，然后一直照着指示做。\n\n这些差事很快就远远超出了一副护腕的范围。准备好面对古老的地下城、更古怪的委托人、代价高昂的人情，还有一个用途不会一下子讲清楚的火盆。"
L["When your old dungeon armor has seen enough battle, Mokvar in Orgrimmar will offer work that sounds simple enough: bring the right pieces, prove you are ready, and keep following instructions.\n\nThe errands soon reach far beyond a single set of bracers. Expect old dungeons, stranger patrons, expensive favors, and a brazier whose purpose is not explained all at once."] = "当你的旧地下城护甲已经身经百战，奥格瑞玛的莫克瓦尔会给你一份听上去挺简单的活儿：带来对的部件，证明你已经准备好，然后一直照着指示做。\n\n这些差事很快就远远超出了一副护腕的范围。准备好面对古老的地下城、更古怪的委托人、代价高昂的人情，还有一个用途不会一下子讲清楚的火盆。"
L["In the Burning Steppes, Helendis Riverhorn has orders against the black dragonkin gathering near Morgan's Vigil.\n\nTake the first report and follow the chain of summons, proofs, and dangerous names wherever it leads. The amulet at the end of the road is not given to anyone who has only heard rumors of dragons."] = "在燃烧平原，赫林迪斯·河角接到命令，要对付聚集在摩根的岗哨附近的黑龙人。\n\n接下第一份报告，然后沿着那一连串的召唤、证明和危险的名字，一路追下去。路的尽头那枚护符，可不会交给只听过龙的传闻的人。"
L["In Kargath, Warlord Goretooth has a command that points into Blackrock Spire.\n\nTake the first order and follow the chain of summons, proofs, and dangerous names wherever it leads. The amulet at the end of the road is not given to anyone who has only heard rumors of dragons."] = "在卡加斯，军官高图斯有一道指向黑石塔的命令。\n\n接下第一道命令，然后沿着那一连串的召唤、证明和危险的名字，一路追下去。路的尽头那枚护符，可不会交给只听过龙的传闻的人。"
