L["Lorekeeper Nok at Ursolan wanted two totems brought out of Blackmaw Hold, one for Ursoc and one for Ursol, the twin bears every furbolg looks up to. I found both and carried them very carefully. Losing a fight in there is one thing. Dropping a demigod on the way home is another."] = "乌索兰的博学者诺克想让我从黑喉要塞带回两个图腾，一个属于乌索克，一个属于乌索尔，就是每个熊怪都敬仰的那对双生熊神。两个我都找到了，一路上拿得小心翼翼。在里面打输一场架是一回事。回家路上把一位半神摔了，那可是另一回事。"
L["Ekkal wanted five Blackmaw pouches fetched out of the hold. Not weapons, not treasure. Pouches. I didn't look inside. Some things you carry without asking, and a furbolg's pouch is one of them."] = "艾卡尔要我从要塞里取回五个黑喉袋子。不是武器，不是财宝。是袋子。我没往里看。有些东西拿着就好，别多问，熊怪的袋子就是其中之一。"
L["Ogtinc, out by the Ruins of Eldarath, wanted the claws of the Great Bear and the tusks of the Unbroken from inside the hold. Both came attached to their owners, who had opinions about that. Claws that rend and tusks that gore, I'd been warned. I can confirm both."] = "埃达拉斯废墟那边的奥汀克，想要要塞里巨熊的爪子和不屈者的獠牙。这两样东西都还长在主人身上，而主人对此颇有意见。有人提醒过我，爪能撕裂，牙能刺骨。两样我都可以作证。"
L["In the hold I came across a feathered charm necklace that plainly belonged to somebody. Somebody turned out to be Unele, back at Ursolan, so I gave it back. Some loot is worth more returned than sold."] = "我在要塞里翻到一条羽饰护符项链，一看就是有主的东西。失主原来是乌索兰的乌尼勒，于是我物归原主。有些战利品，还回去比卖掉更值。"
L["Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus wanted ten Nordrassil root caps, and the place to pick them, of all places, was Blackmaw Hold. I picked ten. I didn't ask what a druid wants with them. Ask a druid a question and the answer takes the rest of the afternoon."] = "达纳苏斯的玛斯雷·驭熊者想要十个诺达希尔根帽，而能采到它们的地方，偏偏是黑喉要塞。我采了十个。我没问德鲁伊要这些干什么。问德鲁伊一个问题，答案能占掉你一整个下午。"
L["Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff wanted ten Nordrassil root caps, and the place to pick them, of all places, was Blackmaw Hold. I picked ten, between fights. I didn't ask what they were for. Up on the Elder Rise a question turns into a lesson, and the lesson turns into the evening."] = "雷霆崖的纳拉·蛮鬃想要十个诺达希尔根帽，而能采到它们的地方，偏偏是黑喉要塞。我边打边采，凑够了十个。我没问要来干什么。在长者高地上，一个问题会变成一堂课，一堂课会变成一整晚。"
L["Archmage Timear of the Kirin Tor wanted a Blackmaw ritual totem brought out of the hold. I found one and carried it all the way to Dalaran. Mages will study anything that sits still long enough. Totems are very good at sitting still."] = "肯瑞托的大法师提迈尔想要一个黑喉仪祭图腾，得从要塞里带出来。我找到一个，一路扛回了达拉然。法师什么都肯研究，只要它老老实实待着不动就行。图腾最擅长的就是待着不动。"
L["Muln Earthfury of the Earthen Ring wanted a Blackmaw ritual totem brought out of the hold. I found one and carried it home to Mulgore. I didn't ask what it had to say. With the Earthen Ring, the totems do most of the talking."] = "大地之环的穆恩·大地之怒想要一个黑喉仪祭图腾，得从要塞里带出来。我找到一个，带回了莫高雷。我没问它有什么话要说。在大地之环，大部分话都是图腾在说。"
L["Ashe Amberhall had one more use for the satchel of cult trinkets from Krol'dok: send it across the keep to Melanie Sable, the enchanter. Curios, Ashe called them. I'd have called them evidence. I suppose to an enchanter it's all just material."] = "艾什·安伯霍尔对那包从克罗多克弄来的教派小玩意儿还有一个用处：送到要塞另一头，交给附魔师梅兰妮·萨布尔。艾什管它们叫珍玩。换我就叫证物。我猜在附魔师眼里，这些全都只是材料。"
L["Before I went into Krol'dok, Ranath Nightstride in Dalaran gave me a name to look for: Zalfan Moonshadow. Ranath is Highborne, and undead, and called it vengeance. I didn't ask for the history. With the Highborne there's always history, and it's always long. Zalfan didn't come out of Krol'dok."] = "我进克罗多克之前，达拉然的拉纳斯·夜路给了我一个名字，让我留意：扎尔凡·月影。拉纳斯是上层精灵，还是个亡灵，管这叫复仇。我没问来龙去脉。跟上层精灵打交道，总有来龙去脉，而且总是很长。扎尔凡没能从克罗多克出来。"
L["Deathguard Kristof had reports of an unholy fog over the ruins, with the Scourge moving about inside it and a new necromancer called Rath'mael behind it all. I took friends, and we put Rath'mael down. Kristof expects another one along soon, because deathguards are not optimists."] = "亡灵卫兵克里斯托弗接到报告，说废墟上笼罩着一层邪恶的雾，天灾军团在雾里来回走动，背后还有一个叫拉斯玛尔的新亡灵巫师在主使。我叫上几个朋友，把拉斯玛尔解决了。克里斯托弗估计很快还会再来一个，因为亡灵卫兵可不是什么乐观主义者。"
L["Tabitha Heartweaver at the Sepulcher had a husband, Edward, who walked to a graveyard in the ruins every week to look for the son they lost when the city fell. One week he didn't come home. I went in and found out why, and that part stays between Tabitha and me."] = "瑟伯切尔的塔比莎·织心有个丈夫叫爱德华，他每周都会走到废墟里的一处墓地，寻找城破那天他们失去的儿子。有一周，他没有回家。我进去查明了原因，至于那部分，就留在塔比莎和我之间吧。"
L["Morbin Lightbane serves the Light and the Dark Lady both and sees no trouble in it. What Morbin wanted was twenty-five intact limbs off the Scourge in the ruins: spare parts, for Forsaken whose own were wearing out. The Scourge had no further use for theirs by the time I left."] = "莫宾·圣光之灾同时侍奉圣光和黑暗女王，而且一点也不觉得有什么矛盾。莫宾想要的，是从废墟里的天灾军团身上弄来二十五条完好的肢体：备用零件，给那些自己的胳膊腿快用坏了的被遗忘者。等我离开的时候，天灾军团已经用不上它们了。"
L["Somewhere in the ruins I picked up an old crest with Lordaeron's mark on it, and Oran Snakewrithe in the Undercity was glad to have it. Oran checked it was genuine by biting it. I've seen people test gold that way, never history."] = "我在废墟里捡到一枚印着洛丹伦标记的旧纹章，幽暗城的奥兰·斯内克威瑟很乐意收下。奥兰咬了一口来验真假。我见过有人这么验金子，验历史的还是头一回。"
L["The thing I put down in the ruins lost its head, and Faranell knew whose it was: a grand marshal the Dark Lady had killed personally. Faranell found the head a new body, and it woke up calling me an abomination, which was rich, coming from it. I put a serum in the drip above it, and now it simmers in its new home while Faranell makes plans."] = "我在废墟里解决掉的那个东西掉了脑袋，而法拉尼尔认得那是谁的：一位被黑暗女王亲手杀死的大元帅。法拉尼尔给这颗脑袋找了副新身体，它一醒来就骂我是憎恶，这话从它嘴里说出来可真够讽刺的。我往它头顶的滴管里加了一剂血清，现在它就在新家里慢慢熬着，法拉尼尔则在一旁筹划着什么。"
L["Alba Fairmoon at Sentinel Hill had traced the poison in Westfall's soil to a forge hidden in the Deadmines, and handed me something labeled Extra-Destructive Explosives. I found the forge and tucked them in close. Then I walked back out at a very respectful pace."] = "哨兵岭的阿尔巴·晴月追查西部荒野土壤里的毒，一路查到死亡矿井里藏着的一座熔炉，然后塞给我一包写着“强效炸药”的东西。我找到熔炉，把炸药贴着它放好。然后我以一种非常恭敬的步速走了出来。"
L["Wilder Thistlenettle got out when the tunnel came down in the mine under Moonbrook, but the foreman, Wilder's brother, didn't. Wilder asked me for the Explorers' League badge the foreman never went anywhere without. I brought the badge back, and Wilder had already guessed what that meant."] = "月溪镇底下那座矿井的隧道塌方时，维尔德·蓟草逃了出来，可工头，也就是维尔德的兄弟，没能出来。维尔德请我去找那枚探险者协会徽章，工头走到哪儿都带着它。我把徽章带了回来，而维尔德早就猜到这意味着什么了。"
L["Wilder Thistlenettle lost a good many workmates in the collapsed wing of the mine under Moonbrook, and wanted their Miners' Union Cards brought out so the families would know. I brought out four. Wilder took them like letters nobody wants to deliver."] = "维尔德·蓟草在月溪镇底下矿井的塌方区失去了不少工友，想把他们的矿业工会会员卡带出来，好让家属们知道。我带出来四张。维尔德接过去的样子，就像接过几封谁都不想送的信。"
L["Motley Garmason at Dun Modr hates the Dark Irons in general and Kam Deepfury in particular, since Deepfury helped plan the attack on the Thandol Span. Stormwind kept Deepfury tucked away in the Stockade for reasons of politics. Motley had no use for politics, and after my visit, neither did Deepfury."] = "丹莫德的莫特雷·加玛森恨所有黑铁矮人，尤其恨卡姆·深怒，因为深怒参与策划了对萨多尔大桥的袭击。暴风城出于政治原因，把深怒好好地关在监狱里。莫特雷才不管什么政治，而在我去过一趟之后，深怒也不用再管了。"
L["Councilman Millstipe of Darkshire wanted Dextren Ward's hand. Ward had sold bodies out of Duskwood's cemetery, and Darkshire sentenced him to death, but the nobles in Stormwind kept him in the Stockade instead. I carried out Darkshire's sentence, and the councilman took the hand as a message to the nobles."] = "夜色镇的米尔斯迪普议员想要迪克斯特·瓦德的手。瓦德把暮色森林墓地里的尸体拿去卖，夜色镇判了他死刑，可暴风城的贵族却只把他关进了监狱。我执行了夜色镇的判决，议员收下那只手，当作捎给贵族们的一句话。"
L["Nikova Raskol's grandson Mac was fourteen and a guard in the Stockade, and he got a knife in the back for telling the Defias to stop tearing their blankets into bandanas. Nikova wanted ten of those bandanas, and I brought them. They didn't bring Mac back, and Nikova knew that better than I did."] = "尼科瓦·拉斯克的孙子麦克才十四岁，是监狱的看守，就因为叫迪菲亚的人别再把毯子撕成头巾，背后挨了一刀。尼科瓦要十条那种头巾，我带回来了。它们换不回麦克，这一点尼科瓦比我清楚。"
L["Guard Berton in Lakeshire remembered Targorr the Dread, who tortured Stormwind's soldiers for Gath'Ilzogg, and didn't trust the noble who kept putting off the execution. So Berton skipped the courts and sent me. Berton called it justice beyond the reach of politics, and Targorr didn't get a say."] = "湖畔镇的卫兵伯尔顿记得可怕的塔格尔，那家伙曾替加塞尔佐格折磨暴风城的士兵；伯尔顿也信不过那个一再拖延行刑的贵族。所以伯尔顿绕开了法庭，直接派我去。伯尔顿说这叫政治管不着的正义，而塔格尔没有发言权。"
L["Lethtendris had built a web in Dire Maul to soak up the magic leaking out of the place, and fancied herself its master. Latronicus Moonspear at Feathermoon thought otherwise and wanted the web, to let the magic out over the wilds and then smash the thing. I settled the argument for them."] = "蕾瑟塔蒂丝在厄运之槌织了一张网，用来吸收那里泄漏出来的魔法，还自以为是它的主人。羽月要塞的拉托尼库斯·月矛可不这么想，他要那张网，好把魔法释放到荒野上，然后把那东西砸了。我替他们把这场争论了结了。"
L["Lethtendris had built a web in Dire Maul to soak up the magic leaking out of the place, and meant to aim it at her enemies. Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache reckoned she'd never hand it over alive, and Talo was right. The web went off to someone more responsible, which by then was nearly anybody."] = "蕾瑟塔蒂丝在厄运之槌织了一张网，用来吸收那里泄漏出来的魔法，还打算拿它对付她的敌人。莫沙彻营地的塔罗·刺蹄认为，她只要活着就绝不会交出来，塔罗说得没错。那张网最后交给了更靠谱的人，而到了那时候，几乎谁都比她靠谱。"
L["Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon was after an old elven master whose trail ran from Quel'Thalas all the way to Dire Maul, along with a cartload of lost artifacts. I found where the trail ended. Runethorn took the news hard, and the lack of artifacts harder."] = "羽月要塞的学者卢索恩·纹角在寻找一位古老的精灵大师，他的踪迹从奎尔萨拉斯一路延伸到厄运之槌，还带着一整车失落的神器。我找到了踪迹的尽头。卢索恩听到消息很难过，听说神器没了更难过。"
L["Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache was after an old elven master whose trail ran from Quel'Thalas all the way to Dire Maul, along with a cartload of lost artifacts. I found where the trail ended. Korolusk took the news hard, and the lack of artifacts harder."] = "莫沙彻营地的先知科鲁拉克在寻找一位古老的精灵大师，他的踪迹从奎尔萨拉斯一路延伸到厄运之槌，还带着一整车失落的神器。我找到了踪迹的尽头。科鲁拉克听到消息很难过，听说神器没了更难过。"
L["Azj'Tordin, an old Shen'dralar lying low at the Lariss Pavilion, had been robbed by an imp called Pusillin: one Book of Incantations, with the key to Dire Maul thrown in. Getting the book back meant chasing Pusillin all over the Warpwood Quarter. Azj'Tordin regretted nothing, and I only regretted the running."] = "埃斯托尔迪是一位躲在拉瑞斯小亭的辛德拉老精灵，被一个叫普希林的小鬼偷了东西：一本咒术之书，外加厄运之槌的钥匙。要拿回那本书，就得满扭木广场地追着普希林跑。埃斯托尔迪什么都不后悔，我只后悔跑了那么多路。"
L["The Shen'dralar Ancient in the courtyard wanted the madness in Dire Maul ended, which meant five pylons, one caged demon, and finally Prince Tortheldrin. I'd been warned the Prince was persuasive, and he wasn't persuasive enough. The reward was a chest tucked under the library stairs, which is exactly where I'd hide treasure too."] = "庭院里的辛德拉古灵想终结厄运之槌的疯狂，这意味着五座水晶塔、一个被关着的恶魔，最后还有托塞德林王子。有人提醒过我，王子很会说服人，可他还不够会说。报酬是藏在图书馆楼梯底下的一个箱子，换我藏宝也会藏在那儿。"
L["Prince Tortheldrin looked a great deal older dead than he had alive, as if the centuries had all caught up with him at once. One of his glaives lay beside him, snapped in two. I took the pieces to the Shen'dralar Ancients, who wanted to hear every detail."] = "托塞德林王子死后看起来比活着时老了许多，好像几百年的岁月一下子全追上了他。他的一把战刃躺在身旁，断成了两截。我把碎片带给辛德拉古灵们，他们想听每一个细节。"
L["I returned Nostro's Compendium of Dragon Slaying to the library, and Lorekeeper Lydros mentioned what it would have fetched on the black market. Then I showed Lydros a dull, flat elven blade and got instructions back: heat it in a certain dragon's breath and temper it in her blood. Lydros said it like a recipe."] = "我把《诺斯特罗的屠龙技术纲要》还给了图书馆，博学者莱德罗斯顺口提了一句它在黑市上能卖多少钱。然后我给莱德罗斯看了一把黯淡的精灵剑，换来一套说明：用某条龙的吐息把它烧热，再用她的血淬火。莱德罗斯说得就跟念菜谱一样。"
L["Knot Thimblejack, a goblin chained up in the Gordok wing, offered to sew me an ogre suit if I brought the runecloth, leather and ogre tannin. It would hold together for ten minutes. Knot reckoned that was plenty to fool an ogre captain, and Knot has had a long time to study ogres."] = "诺特·希姆加克是个被拴在戈多克食人魔那一区的地精，说只要我带来符文布、皮革和食人魔鞣酸，就给我缝一套食人魔装。这套衣服能撑十分钟。诺特觉得骗过一个食人魔队长绰绰有余，而诺特研究食人魔的时间可不短了。"
L["Knot Thimblejack had been chained up by the ogres long enough to have pet names for them. One of them was carrying the shackle key, so I let Knot go. Knot said a goblin's life was meant for more than being an ogre's appetizer, and I didn't argue."] = "诺特·希姆加克被食人魔拴了太久，久到都给它们起了昵称。其中一个身上带着镣铐钥匙，于是我放了诺特。诺特说，地精的一生可不该只是给食人魔当开胃菜，我没跟他争。"
L["Captain Kromcrush had an old story about a creepy elf calling himself a prince, who stole the Gauntlet of Gordok Might from an ogre king. The story was true, and the gauntlet was sitting in the prince's own chest. Kromcrush put the magic back into it and handed it to the new king, long live me."] = "克罗卡斯有个老故事，讲一个自称王子的怪异精灵，从一位食人魔大王手里偷走了戈多克力量护手。故事是真的，护手就躺在王子自己的箱子里。克罗卡斯把魔力重新灌了进去，交给了新的大王。大王万岁，也就是我。"
L["Being king of the Gordok came with one perk worth mentioning: Stomper Kreeg, who keeps the brews, brought me free samples of the good stuff. One of them was called Kreeg's Stout Beatdown. Honest name."] = "当戈多克大王只有一个好处值得一提：管酒的践踏者克雷格给我送来了好酒的免费样品。其中一种叫“克雷格的烈酒”。名副其实。"
L["I found the Codex of Defense in a pile of dust in Dire Maul and gave it back to the librarians for a royal seal. Never read it. Didn't need to."] = "我在厄运之槌的一堆灰尘里找到了《防御宝典》，还给图书管理员，换了一枚皇家徽记。一页没读。也用不着读。"
L["The Light and How To Swing It was gathering dust in Dire Maul, so I returned it, because that's what you do with a library book. The librarians gave me a royal seal. The title had already told me everything inside."] = "《圣光之力》在厄运之槌积灰，所以我把它还了回去，图书馆的书就该这么处理。图书管理员给了我一枚皇家徽记。书名已经把里面的内容全告诉我了。"
L["The librarians paid a royal seal for The Greatest Race of Hunters, which I'd found in the dust in Dire Maul. My pet wanted to chew it first. I said no, mostly."] = "我在厄运之槌的灰尘里找到了《最伟大的猎手》，图书管理员为它付了一枚皇家徽记。我的宠物想先啃两口。我没让它啃。至少大部分没让。"
L["Garona: A Study on Stealth and Treachery was lying in the dust in Dire Maul, unguarded. I could have sold it, but the librarians offered a royal seal, and for once honest work paid better."] = "《迦罗娜：潜行与诡计研究》就躺在厄运之槌的灰尘里，没人看着。我本可以把它卖掉，但图书管理员开价一枚皇家徽记，难得一回，老实干活反倒更赚。"
L["There was a book in the dust at Dire Maul called Holy Bologna: What the Light Won't Tell You. I gave it back to the librarians for a royal seal. They didn't ask whether I'd read it, and I didn't say."] = "厄运之槌的灰尘里有本书，叫《光明不会告诉你的事情》。我把它还给图书管理员，换了一枚皇家徽记。他们没问我读没读过，我也没说。"
L["Frost Shock and You turned up in the dust in Dire Maul, and the librarians gave me a royal seal to have it back. The elements had opinions about that title. For once I agreed with them."] = "《你与冰霜震击》在厄运之槌的灰尘里冒了出来，图书管理员给了我一枚皇家徽记，把它要了回去。元素们对这个书名颇有意见。难得一回，我跟它们站在同一边。"
L["Somebody had left The Arcanist's Cookbook lying in the dust in Dire Maul, so I returned it to the librarians for a royal seal. Did I try any of the recipes first? I'm not saying."] = "有人把《奥法师的食谱》丢在厄运之槌的灰尘里，所以我把它还给图书管理员，换了一枚皇家徽记。我有没有先试做几道菜？这我可不说。"
L["A tome called Harnessing Shadows was lying in the dust in Dire Maul. I gave it back to the librarians for a royal seal. Some of the company I keep would have kept it, but they're not the sort you lend books to."] = "一本叫《束缚之影》的典籍躺在厄运之槌的灰尘里。我把它还给图书管理员，换了一枚皇家徽记。我身边有些伙伴大概会把它留下，不过那些家伙本来就不是能借书的对象。"
L["I found The Emerald Dream lying in the dust in Dire Maul and took my time returning it. The librarians gave me a royal seal anyway. They'd waited this long; another afternoon did them no harm."] = "我在厄运之槌的灰尘里发现了《翡翠梦境》，然后不慌不忙地拿去还。图书管理员还是给了我一枚皇家徽记。他们都等了这么久了，再多等一个下午也没什么。"
L["Tabetha keeps a farm out in the Dustwallow muck, and while she was away somebody raided it and made off with her Tiara of the Deep. It turned up on Hydromancer Velratha, a sand troll in Zul'Farrak. I brought it home, and Tabetha apologized for having been so sharp with me, which almost never happens."] = "塔贝萨在尘泥沼泽的烂泥地里有座农场，她不在的时候有人洗劫了那里，抢走了她的深渊皇冠。后来皇冠出现在祖尔法拉克的沙怒巨魔水占师维蕾萨身上。我把它带了回去，塔贝萨还为之前对我那么凶道了歉，这种事几乎从来没发生过。"
L["Tran'rek in Gadgetzan had promised a cousin in Booty Bay a load of scarab shells weeks ago and was still telling stories instead of delivering. The last scarabs in Tanaris live in Zul'Farrak, so I went and got five. Uncracked, as ordered, though the scarabs had their own ideas about that."] = "加基森的特兰雷克几周前就答应给藏宝海湾的一个表亲送一批圣甲虫壳，到现在还在编故事，就是不发货。塔纳利斯最后的圣甲虫住在祖尔法拉克，所以我去弄了五个。按要求都是完整的，尽管圣甲虫们对此另有想法。"
L["Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan had lent a Divino-matic Rod, a gadget for finding water, to a Sergeant Bly, who took it into Zul'Farrak with a band of adventurers and kept it. I found Bly and asked nicely. Then I asked the other way, which the engineer liked a lot better."] = "加基森的首席工程师沙克斯·比格维兹把一根探水棒，一种找水用的小玩意儿，借给了一个叫布莱中士的人，结果布莱带着一帮冒险者进了祖尔法拉克，就再也没还。我找到布莱，好声好气地问他要。然后我换了个方式问，工程师对这种方式满意多了。"
L["Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan wanted twenty vials of troll temper, which the Sandfury brew out of sandstone. They carry it on them, so gathering it was mostly a matter of gathering trolls. Trenton called it very nice temper indeed, and I've never thought about temper since."] = "加基森的特伦顿·轻锤想要二十瓶巨魔调和剂，那是沙怒巨魔用砂岩熬出来的东西。他们随身带着，所以收集调和剂基本上就是收集巨魔。特伦顿说这调和剂真是好极了，而从那以后我再也没琢磨过调和剂这回事。"
L["Wizzle Brassbolts at the Mirage Raceway wanted an electrified scale off Gahz'rilla to power a racing car. Gahz'rilla is a hydra the Zul'Farrak trolls keep in a sacred pool, and they don't lend it out. Wizzle's only question when I got back was how big it really was, and the honest answer is bigger than whatever you're picturing."] = "沙漠赛道的维兹尔·铜栓想要加兹瑞拉身上一片带电的鳞片，给赛车提供动力。加兹瑞拉是祖尔法拉克的巨魔养在圣池里的九头蛇，他们可不外借。我回来后，维兹尔唯一的问题是它到底有多大，老实说，比你现在想象的还要大。"
L["Mallet of Zul'Farrak"] = "祖尔法拉克之槌"
L["the Altar of Zul, The Hinterlands"] = "祖尔祭坛，辛特兰"
L["Take the Sacred Mallet from Qiaga the Keeper at the top of the Altar of Zul. Then use it at the altar at the top of Jintha'Alor to make the Mallet of Zul'Farrak, which rings the gong at Gahz'rilla's pool."] = "从祖尔祭坛顶上的守护者奇尔加手中夺取神圣之槌。然后在辛萨罗山顶的祭坛上使用它，把它变成祖尔法拉克之槌。用它可以敲响加兹瑞拉水池边的锣。"
L["The gong at Gahz'rilla's pool in Zul'Farrak answers to one mallet, and nobody sells it. Qiaga the Keeper had the Sacred Mallet at the top of the Altar of Zul and no plans to give it up. I took it anyway. It still had to go to the altar at the top of Jintha'Alor, and one use there made it the Mallet of Zul'Farrak.\n\nIt doesn't break and it doesn't get used up, so I can ring for that hydra whenever I like. Whether I'd like to is another matter."] = "祖尔法拉克里加兹瑞拉水池边的那面锣，只认一把槌子，而且没人卖。神圣之槌在祖尔祭坛顶上的守护者奇尔加手里，对方压根没打算交出来。我还是拿到手了。之后还得把它带到辛萨罗山顶的祭坛上，在那儿用一次，它就成了祖尔法拉克之槌。\n\n它不会坏，也不会用掉，所以我想什么时候叫那条九头蛇出来都行。至于我想不想，那是另一回事。"
L["Venom Bottle"] = "毒液瓶"
L["In a Witherbark village in the Hinterlands there were more bottles of vile green venom than any troll needs, so I took one to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill. Lydon wanted better than a bottle: an undamaged venom sac, and undamaged was the hard part. Once Lydon had it, the question was what kind of spider the trolls had been milking, and Lydon sent me to ask Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village, who knows trolls."] = "辛特兰的一个枯木巨魔村子里，摆着的恶心绿色毒液瓶比哪个巨魔需要的都多，所以我拿了一瓶去给塔伦米尔的药剂师林度恩。林度恩想要的比一瓶毒液更好：一个完好无损的毒囊，难就难在完好无损。东西到手后，问题就成了巨魔们到底是从哪种蜘蛛身上挤的毒，林度恩便打发我去森金村问加德林大师，他懂巨魔。"
L["Gryphon Master Talonaxe at Aerie Peak had lost a young gryphon called Sharpbeak and suspected the Witherbark trolls. I searched the cages in both of their villages and found no gryphon. At the top of the Altar of Zul I found one of Sharpbeak's feathers, and no Sharpbeak. Talonaxe sent me off with the feather to Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep, who finds things by other means."] = "鹰巢山的狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧丢了一只叫沙普比克的小狮鹫，怀疑是枯木巨魔干的。我把他们两个村子里的笼子都搜了一遍，没找到狮鹫。在祖尔祭坛顶上，我找到一根沙普比克的羽毛，却没见到沙普比克。沙拉克·鹰斧让我带着羽毛去守望堡找萨迪斯·格希德，他有别的法子找东西。"
L["Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village needed the true name of the spider god the Witherbark worship, and it was written on a tablet in Zul'Farrak that Theka the Martyr was guarding. Theka stopped guarding it. The name is Elortha no Shadra, and I'm told to say it only in whispers, so lean in."] = "森金村的加德林大师需要枯木巨魔所崇拜的蜘蛛之神的真名，那名字刻在祖尔法拉克的一块石板上，由殉教者塞卡守着。后来塞卡不守了。那名字是伊洛萨·诺·沙德拉，有人叮嘱我只能小声说，所以凑近点。"
L["Mazu'kon, out in Mulgore, wanted the head of Witch Doctor Zum'rah, who keeps the graveyard in Zul'Farrak and doesn't welcome visitors. Zum'rah raised the dead at us by the handful. The head came back with me anyway, which was the only part Mazu'kon cared about."] = "莫高雷的马祖康想要巫医祖穆拉恩的脑袋，那家伙看守着祖尔法拉克的墓地，不欢迎访客。祖穆拉恩一把一把地唤起死人来对付我们。脑袋最后还是跟我回来了，而马祖康在乎的也就只有这一点。"
L["Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep offered to find a lost gryphon named Sharpbeak by magic, in exchange for Nekrum Gutchewer's medallion out of Zul'Farrak. Rumor said it gave its wearer an unnaturally long life at a price, and Grimshade was confident the price could be avoided. They always are."] = "守望堡的萨迪斯·格希德提出可以用魔法找到一头叫沙普比克的走失狮鹫，条件是拿祖尔法拉克里耐克鲁姆的徽章来换。传说那枚徽章能让佩戴者活得异常长久，但要付出代价，而格希德很有把握能躲过这个代价。他们总是很有把握。"
L["Archmage Lan'dalock of Dalaran wanted the head of Witch Doctor Zum'rah, who keeps the graveyard in Zul'Farrak. Zum'rah's reply was to wake the graveyard up. The archmage got the head all the same, and I learned that the dead there stay down only once their witch doctor does."] = "达拉然的大法师兰达洛克想要巫医祖穆拉恩的脑袋，那家伙看守着祖尔法拉克的墓地。祖穆拉恩的答复是把整片墓地都叫醒。大法师照样拿到了脑袋，而我学到了一件事：那里的死人，要等他们的巫医倒下了才会老实躺好。"
L["Marvon Rivetseeker, a goblin who studies troll ruins, had been inside the Sunken Temple once and nearly died poking a serpent statue. Marvon's theory was that the altar at the bottom of the round room held the secret, so down I went with a stone circle to test it. It fit exactly and locked in place, which in that temple is never the end of it."] = "玛尔冯·瑞文斯克是个研究巨魔遗迹的地精，进过一次沉没的神庙，戳了一座蛇像，差点送命。玛尔冯的理论是，圆形大厅底部的祭坛藏着秘密，于是我带着一块石环下去验证。它严丝合缝地卡了进去，而在那座神庙里，这从来都不是事情的结局。"
L["Marvon Rivetseeker had a hazy memory of lights over the ring of serpent statues in the Sunken Temple, and a hunch they guarded treasure. Light them in the right order and something does happen: a very large guardian turns up to object. Behind the idol's glass eye sat the Atal'ai treasure, worth every bit of the argument."] = "玛尔冯·瑞文斯克隐约记得，沉没的神庙里那一圈蛇像上方曾亮起过光，直觉那是在守护什么宝藏。按正确的顺序把它们点亮，确实会发生点什么：一个非常巨大的守护者跑出来表示反对。神像的玻璃眼睛后面就是阿塔莱的宝藏，这一架打得值。"
L["Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind had one last assignment for the Explorers' League before retiring: ten Atal'ai tablets out of the Sunken Temple. Pride kept him from asking for help, right up until he asked me. I brought the tablets, and Brohann said both our names would go into the League's history, though I've never gone to check."] = "暴风城的布罗哈恩·铁桶退休前还有探险者协会的最后一项任务：从沉没的神庙里弄出十块阿塔莱石板。自尊心让他一直不肯求助，直到他开口求了我。我带回了石板，布罗哈恩说我们俩的名字都会写进协会的历史，不过我从来没去查过。"
L["Fel'zerul in Stonard didn't trust the Atal'ai or their talk of Hakkar making them immortal, and wanted twenty of their Fetishes of Hakkar to learn what they were for. Twenty is a lot of fetishes. Every one of them came off an Atal'ai who believed very sincerely."] = "斯通纳德的费泽鲁尔不信任阿塔莱，也不信他们说哈卡会让他们永生那一套，想要二十个哈卡神像，弄清楚那些东西是干什么用的。二十个神像可不少。每一个都是从一个非常虔诚的阿塔莱身上拿下来的。"
L["An Atal'ai exile out in the Hinterlands, cast out by the tribe, wanted the head of Jammal'an the Prophet, who had convinced them all that Hakkar would make them immortal. I brought the head. The exile had hoped it might free the tribe, and mourned them anyway."] = "辛特兰有个被部族赶出来的阿塔莱流放者，想要预言者迦玛兰的脑袋，正是迦玛兰让全族都相信哈卡会让他们永生。我带回了脑袋。流放者原本希望这能让部族解脱，但还是为他们哀悼了。"
L["When the shade of Eranikus fell, it left a gem holding part of the dragon's essence, and a voice asking me to set it in the font in its lair so it could finally rest. I did, and the font turned out to be tainted as well, and the last I heard was Eranikus begging me to find the green dragonflight. I've done favors that went better."] = "伊兰尼库斯的阴影倒下后，留下了一块封存着巨龙部分精华的宝石，还有一个声音，请我把它放进巢穴里的精华之泉，好让它终于得以安息。我照做了，结果泉水也被污染了，我最后听到的，是伊兰尼库斯求我去找绿龙军团。我帮过的忙里，比这顺利的可多了。"
L["Olana Brighthoof, a sun priest near Thunder Bluff, had seen it in a vision: past Earth Song Falls, a chamber of white crystals with giants on guard, and at the very top, the right eye of the Earthmother. The vision was right about everything, giants included. I carried it back to Mulgore, where it belongs, under the open sky."] = "奥拉娜·闪蹄是雷霆崖附近的一位太阳祭司，曾在幻象中见过：越过大地之歌瀑布，有一间满是白色水晶的石室，巨人在那里守卫，而在最高处，就是大地母亲的右眼。幻象说的全都没错，连巨人都没说错。我把它带回了莫高雷，带回它该在的地方，敞亮的天空底下。"
L["In the lower Spire a goblin named Bijou, who doesn't usually deal with my sort, traded me a map for her lost belongings. Marshal Maxwell picked three names off it, a war master, a highlord and an overlord, and sent me back to cross them out. That bought the Alliance precious, precious time, he said, precious enough to say twice."] = "在黑石塔下层，一个叫比修的地精，平时不跟我这种人打交道，却用一张地图换回了她丢的东西。麦克斯韦尔元帅从地图上挑出三个名字，一个指挥官、一个大王、一个主宰，派我回去把他们划掉。他说，这为联盟争取了宝贵的、宝贵的时间，宝贵到值得说两遍。"
L["A dead serpent in the lower Spire turned out to be carrying a letter: General Drakkisath's own orders, mostly about protocol. Marshal Maxwell read it, said the plot thickened, and sent me back up to destroy the general. I was going anyway, but I let him think it was his idea."] = "黑石塔下层有条死掉的大蛇，身上居然带着一封信：达基萨斯将军亲笔下的命令，大部分在讲礼节规矩。麦克斯韦尔元帅读完，说事情越来越复杂了，又派我回去消灭那位将军。我本来就要去，不过我让他以为这是他的主意。"
L["On the way up to the Spire, a quartermaster was carrying a letter from Rend Blackhand, mostly insults, saying only those with the Mark of Drakkisath could use the Orb of Command into Blackwing Lair, and the general guards the brand himself. With the general past guarding anything, I pressed my hand to the smoldering brand. I didn't flinch, much."] = "在上黑石塔的路上，有个军需官身上带着雷德·黑手的一封信，内容大半是骂人的话，说只有身负达基萨斯徽记的人才能用命令宝珠进入黑翼之巢，而那枚烙印由将军亲自看守。既然将军已经什么都守不了了，我就把手按在了那枚冒着烟的烙印上。我没怎么缩手。"
L["Helendis Riverhorn at the Vigil had noticed that killing worgs never left fewer worgs, and sent me into the Spire to find out why. The why was Halycon, their gigantic den mother, and I put her down. Helendis told me not to dwell on her suffering, which I hadn't planned to."] = "在摩根的岗哨，赫林迪斯·河角注意到，座狼怎么杀都不见少，于是派我进黑石塔查个究竟。原因就是哈雷肯，它们那头巨大的狼窝之母，我把她解决了。赫林迪斯叫我别去想她受的苦，我本来也没打算想。"
L["Mayara Brightwing hunts art for Count Remington Ridgewell's family museum and had found a piece in the Spire: Doomrigger's Clasp, a jeweled relic said to make dwarves weep. I dug it out of the old Hall of Fortune and took it to the count in a crate. His gratitude, I was told, is nigh worth a king's ransom, and nigh is doing a lot of work there."] = "玛亚拉·布莱特文为雷明顿·瑞治维尔伯爵的家族博物馆搜罗艺术品，在黑石塔里找到了一件：末日扣环，一件镶满宝石的遗物，据说能让矮人看了落泪。我从昔日的财富大厅里把它挖了出来，装进箱子送去给伯爵。有人告诉我，他的感激之情几乎抵得上一笔国王的赎金，而“几乎”这两个字在这里出了很大的力。"
L["Vaelan, in the lower Spire, wanted a gemstone from each of three generals and an old seal to set them in. Forging it took black dragonfire, so I wore Emberstrife down in the Wyrmbog and borrowed his mind just long enough to make him breathe on it. That seal is the key to the upper Spire, and not many keys get made that way."] = "黑石塔下层的维埃兰想要三位将军身上各一块宝钻，外加一枚用来镶嵌它们的古老印章。铸造它需要黑龙之火，所以我在巨龙沼泽把埃博斯塔夫打得精疲力尽，借用了他的心智，刚好够让他朝印章喷一口火。那枚印章就是黑石塔上层的钥匙，用这种方法造出来的钥匙可不多。"
L["Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest had built a gadget for freezing black dragon eggs solid and needed someone to try it in the Rookery atop the Spire. It worked, so I went back up and collected eight. Freeze them first, Tinkee said, or they might hatch before you get them, which is advice you only need once."] = "烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波尔造了个能把黑龙蛋冻得硬邦邦的装置，需要有人去黑石塔顶的孵化间试一试。它管用，于是我又上去收集了八颗。丁奇说，先冻起来，不然你还没拿到它们就孵出来了，这种建议你只需要听一次。"
L["Kibler at Flame Crest tames exotic beasts for rich clients, and wanted a Bloodaxe worg pup out of the Spire before it grew too old to train. I carried one back in a cage, and Kibler gave me a tame one of my own. It is very ferocious and about the size of a boot."] = "烈焰峰的基布雷尔替有钱的主顾驯养奇珍异兽，想要一只黑石塔里的血斧座狼幼崽，得趁它还没大到训不了的时候弄来。我用笼子提回来一只，基布雷尔送了我一只驯好的。它非常凶猛，个头大概跟一只靴子差不多。"
L["Kibler's helper had gone into the Spire for spider eggs weeks before and still wasn't back, so I fetched fifteen myself. Some people, Kibler says, will pay good gold for the most vile of domesticated beasts. I got one free, a little Smolderweb spider, along with a warning not to get bitten."] = "基布雷尔的助手几周前进黑石塔去取蜘蛛卵，到现在还没回来，所以我自己去拿了十五枚。基布雷尔说，有些人愿意花大把金币买最恶心的家养野兽。我白得了一只，一只小小的烟网蜘蛛，外加一句叮嘱：别被咬了。"
L["Ragged John wanted Mother Smolderweb's venom, and not in a jar: he wanted it live, in my veins. So I let the biggest spider in the Spire bite me, walked back feeling awful, and he milked it out of me for the best ale he'd ever brewed. You thought I wanted it for poison, he said, crazy kids."] = "狼狈不堪的约翰想要烟网蛛后的毒液，而且不要装在罐子里的：他要活的，流在我血管里的。于是我让黑石塔里最大的那只蜘蛛咬了我一口，一路难受地走回去，他再从我身上把毒液挤出来，酿出了他这辈子最好的麦酒。他说，你们还以为我要拿它做毒药，疯孩子们。"
L["Urok Doomhowl had cursed Warosh mute, so all Warosh could do was hand me a scroll that came down to: get my mojo. I got the mojo, and with a voice again Warosh told me I was a fool to think I'd reach the top of the Spire, but that my bravery was beyond question. I've had warmer thanks, and worse."] = "乌洛克诅咒瓦罗什变成了哑巴，所以瓦罗什能做的就只有递给我一张卷轴，归结起来就一句话：把我的魔精拿来。我拿到了魔精，瓦罗什重新能说话了，就告诉我，以为自己能登上黑石塔顶是个傻瓜，不过我的勇气无可置疑。我收到过更热情的道谢，也收到过更糟的。"
L["Deep in the Spire, Awbee gave me a scale and sent me to Winterspring, where you stand on a cobalt rune in the caves of Mazthoril and end up in front of Haleh. Haleh scried what Awbee had seen in that doomed place. Dragons, I learned, are forbidden to meddle in mortal affairs, unless one of their own starts it."] = "在黑石塔深处，奥比给了我一片鳞片，让我去冬泉谷，在麦索瑞尔洞穴里站上一枚钴蓝色的符文，人就会出现在哈尔琳面前。哈尔琳用占卜看到了奥比在那个注定毁灭的地方所见的一切。我这才知道，巨龙是不许插手凡人事务的，除非是它们自己的同类先动的手。"
L["We skinned the Beast in the upper Spire, and out climbed a gnome named Pip Quickwit, in a suit, delighted with how the suit had held up. Pip sent me to Malyfous Darkhammer in Everlook with the news and a glowing lump of the Beast's insides. Malyfous asked if Pip was alive, if the suit worked, and then mostly about the lump."] = "我们在黑石塔上层给比斯巨兽剥皮，结果里面爬出来一个叫皮普·急智的侏儒，穿着一身防护服，对这身衣服的表现非常满意。皮普让我带着这个消息和一块发光的比斯巨兽内脏，去永望镇找玛雷弗斯·暗锤。玛雷弗斯问了皮普是不是还活着、那身衣服管不管用，然后问的基本都是那块东西。"
L["Lorax, out in the snows of Winterspring, had bought the soul of a Spire smith named Goraluk Anvilcrack and sent me to collect it with a fel-soaked pike. Goraluk died, the pike drank him up, and I brought back the breastplate he'd stolen too. Lorax thanked me in rhyme, which somehow made it worse."] = "冬泉谷雪地里的罗拉克斯买下了黑石塔一个铁匠古拉鲁克的灵魂，派我带着一支浸透邪能的长矛去收货。古拉鲁克死了，长矛把他吸了个干净，我顺便把他偷走的胸甲也带了回来。罗拉克斯用押韵的话向我道谢，不知怎么的，这让事情更糟了。"
L["Warlord Goretooth was recruiting in Kargath for the Expeditionary Force and wanted the Horde's best, with a speech to match. The cowards were invited to leave. I stayed, and got a grin and my orders, which from Goretooth is about as warm as it gets."] = "军官高图斯在卡加斯为远征军招兵，要的是部落最出色的人，还配了一段相称的演讲。胆小鬼被请出去了。我留了下来，得到了一个咧嘴笑和我的命令，在高图斯那里，这已经算是最热情的待遇了。"
L["Grandmaster Lexlort in Kargath warned me never to trust a goblin, then sent me into the Spire to bring one back: Bijou, an operative who'd been spending Horde gold on side jobs. Bijou had lost her spy gear fleeing an alarm, so I found it, and the reports came back to Kargath without her. Lexlort had to hand it to her: weaseled out again."] = "卡加斯的雷克斯洛特大师警告我永远别相信地精，然后就派我进黑石塔去带一个回来：比修，一个拿部落的金子去干私活的探子。比修躲警报的时候丢了她的间谍装备，于是我把它找了回来，报告送回了卡加斯，人却没回来。雷克斯洛特也不得不服她：又让她溜了。"
L["Galamav the Marksman in Kargath said the Blackrock worgs were no demons, just the brood of Halycon and her mate, so I went into the Spire and killed Halycon. Galamav asked whether I'd survived the rabid pups and Gizrul the Slavener too. I was standing right there, so I let the question answer itself."] = "卡加斯的神射手贾拉玛弗说，黑石的座狼不是什么恶魔，只是哈雷肯和她配偶的后代，于是我进黑石塔杀了哈雷肯。贾拉玛弗问我，是不是连那些发狂的幼崽和奴役者基兹鲁尔也挺过来了。我就站在那儿，所以让这个问题自己回答了。"
L["Word came from the Undercity that Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath wanted a tablet out of the Spire. Urheld Darkstone, a dwarven alchemist thought mad in his day, had carved his formulae into stone rather than share them, and I found one in what was once the Hall of Fortune. Mad or not, the man kept good notes."] = "幽暗城传来消息，说卡加斯的暗法师薇薇安·拉格雷想要黑石塔里的一块石板。乌赫尔德·黑石是一位矮人炼金师，在他那个年代被当成疯子，他宁可把配方刻进石头里也不肯与人分享，而我在曾经的财富大厅里找到了一块。疯不疯另说，这人的笔记做得可真好。"
L["Franclorn Forgewright, the architect of the Dark Iron city, only appears to the dead, so the first thing I had to do was die. Franclorn's hammer, Ironfel, was in the hands of Fineous Darkvire. I took it back and laid it in the hands of Franclorn's statue, and a little door in the base opened on the key to the city."] = "弗兰克罗恩·铸铁是黑铁之城的建筑师，只在死人面前现身，所以我要做的第一件事就是去死。弗兰克罗恩的战锤铁胆落在了弗诺斯·达克维尔手里。我把它夺了回来，放到弗兰克罗恩雕像的手中，底座上的一扇小门打开了，里面就是这座城市的钥匙。"
L["Cyrus Therepentous, out in the Burning Steppes, wanted to taste the fire of Blackrock. Not a request I get often. The fire was Bael'Gar, a giant of pure flame down in the depths. Once Bael'Gar was dead, a scrap of altered dragon molt drew out the essence. Cyrus snatched it from me and told me to take my reward and get out of sight."] = "燃烧平原的塞勒斯·萨雷芬图斯想尝尝黑石的火焰。这种要求我可不常听到。那火焰就是贝尔加，深渊底下一个纯粹由烈焰构成的巨人。贝尔加一死，一块特殊的黑龙皮就把精华吸了出来。塞勒斯从我手里一把抢过去，叫我拿上报酬，赶紧从他眼前消失。"
L["Yuka Screwspigot at Flame Crest had a relative to collect: Ribbly, who'd spent the family's money on one scheme after another and was hiding in Blackrock Depths. Booty Bay had put a bounty on Ribbly, and the family was delighted. Ribbly was finally worth something. Yuka wanted Ribbly back alive, if possible. It wasn't."] = "烈焰峰的尤卡·斯库比格特有个亲戚要接回去：雷布里，这家伙把家里的钱一次又一次地砸进各种发财计划，现在躲在黑石深渊里。藏宝海湾悬赏捉拿雷布里，全家都乐坏了。雷布里总算值点钱了。尤卡希望雷布里能活着回来，如果可能的话。结果不可能。"
L["Maxwort Uberglint at Flame Crest had wanted the Heart of the Mountain for years, a gem the size of your fist, and the Dark Irons wouldn't sell. So I let myself into their vault. You open every coffer in the place before the safe's watchman turns up, and then the watchman has to go. Maxwort was delighted. The Dark Irons, less so."] = "烈焰峰的麦克斯沃特·尤博格林惦记山脉之心好多年了，那是一颗拳头大的宝石，可黑铁矮人就是不卖。于是我自己进了他们的宝库。你得先把里面每个保险箱都打开，金库的看守才会现身，然后就得把看守解决掉。麦克斯沃特高兴坏了。黑铁矮人就没那么高兴了。"
L["Jalinda Sprig at Morgan's Vigil couldn't get a team into the mountain while Lord Incendius kept raising Overmaster Pyron from the ashes. So Incendius had to go. When I reported that Incendius had said the name Ragnaros, Jalinda asked if I was sure, patted my wrist and drifted off into deep thought. I was sure. I'd rather not have been."] = "在摩根的岗哨，加琳达没法派人进山，因为伊森迪奥斯一直在让征服者派隆从灰烬里复活。所以伊森迪奥斯必须死。当我报告说伊森迪奥斯提到了拉格纳罗斯的名字，加琳达问我确不确定，拍了拍我的手腕，就陷入了沉思。我很确定。我倒宁愿自己不确定。"
L["Oralius at Morgan's Vigil talks like a pirate and was convinced the Dark Irons kept the good stuff in their fanny packs. I brought back twenty. Oralius sniffed through the pile, very happy with the goodies, and let me keep one. I'm still not sure what the good stuff was. I'm not sure I want to know."] = "摩根的岗哨有个奥拉留斯，说话像个海盗，坚信黑铁矮人把好东西都藏在他们的挎包里。我带回来二十个。奥拉留斯在那堆东西里嗅来嗅去，对这些宝贝非常满意，还让我留了一个。我到现在都不确定那好东西到底是什么。我也不确定我想不想知道。"
L["Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos had a grievance: the Dark Irons had stolen the family lager recipe. Ragnar wanted every keg of it in Blackrock Depths smashed and the recipe brought home, and called the thieves villains who didn't deserve such a fine brew. Hurley Blackbreath, who had it, disagreed. Briefly. Part of my pay was lager."] = "卡拉诺斯的拉格纳·雷酒有一肚子怨气：黑铁矮人偷走了家传的淡啤酒秘方。拉格纳要我把黑石深渊里每一桶这种酒都砸了，再把秘方带回家，还说那些小偷都是恶棍，根本不配喝这么好的酒。秘方在霍尔雷·黑须手上，他有不同意见。没持续多久。我的报酬里有一部分是淡啤酒。"
L["Mistress Nagmara, a succubus working the Grim Guzzler, had one customer immune to her charms: Private Rocknot. So she wanted a love potion, and I did the shopping. Gromsblood, silver veins out of the cliff giants of Azshara, and spring water from Un'Goro. Last I saw, Nagmara was mixing it and Rocknot was still drinking. Poor Rocknot."] = "娜玛拉小姐是在黑铁酒吧招揽客人的魅魔，有一位客人对她的魅力完全免疫：罗克诺特下士。所以她想要一瓶爱情药水，而跑腿采购的是我。格罗姆之血，艾萨拉悬崖巨人身上的银矿，还有安戈洛的温泉水。我最后一次见到他们时，娜玛拉正在调药，罗克诺特还在喝酒。可怜的罗克诺特。"
L["Somewhere in the depths there's a chalice floating in the air, and it takes offerings: two star rubies, twenty gold bars and ten of truesilver. They made no sound going in. For that, Gloom'rel agreed to teach me to smelt dark iron. Easily the most expensive lesson I've ever taken."] = "深渊里的某个地方有一只飘在半空中的杯子，它接受供品：两颗红宝石、二十块金锭、十块真银锭。丢进去的时候一点声音都没有。为此，格鲁雷尔答应教我熔炼黑铁。这绝对是我上过最贵的一堂课。"
L["Lokhtos Darkbargainer sells the Thorium Brotherhood's secrets out of the Grim Guzzler, and everything comes with a contract. Mine had me swear my sulfuron ingot was genuine and not a facsimile, and that TB Ltd. was not responsible for anything that happened if I went looking for Sulfuras. I signed. I got hammer plans and a cheerful good luck."] = "罗克图斯·暗契在黑铁酒吧里兜售瑟银兄弟会的秘密，什么东西都附带一份契约。我那份要我发誓，我的萨弗隆铁锭是真品而不是仿制品，还要我同意，如果我跑去找萨弗拉斯，不管出了什么事都与瑟银兄弟会（TB Ltd.）无关。我签了。我拿到了锤子的设计图，外加一句欢快的“祝你好运”。"
L["Kargath has its own way of hiring: a poster that says KILL ON SIGHT. The first one listed the Dark Iron rank and file, guardsmen, wardens and footmen. Once Warlord Goretooth had counted those, a second poster went up for the medics, soldiers and officers. I appreciate an employer who puts it in writing."] = "卡加斯招人有自己的一套：一张写着“格杀勿论”的告示。第一张列的是黑铁矮人的普通兵卒，卫士、狱卒和步兵。等军官高图斯把这些数清楚了，第二张告示就贴了出来，这回是医师、士兵和军官。我欣赏把话写在纸上的雇主。"
L["Lexlort in Kargath wanted a traitor, Grark Lorkrub, who'd been feeding our plans to the Blackrock orcs. I shackled Grark in a Blackrock fortress and walked him out through the mountain, hearing all the way that I'd never make it. I made it. Then Warlord Goretooth sent me after General Angerforge, who'd planned the slaughter of the 109th. Also done."] = "卡加斯的雷克斯洛特要抓一个叛徒，格拉克·洛克鲁布，他一直把我们的计划透露给黑石兽人。我在一座黑石要塞里给格拉克铐上镣铐，押着他穿过整座山走了出来，一路上都在听他说我绝对走不出去。我走出去了。然后军官高图斯派我去对付安格弗将军，就是他策划了对第109师的屠杀。这事也办完了。"
L["Shadowmage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath wanted a lager recipe the Dark Irons had stolen from some dwarven brewers. The ale is said to make the drinker stronger and braver, and the Forsaken would like to know how. I fetched it, and off it went to the Apothecarium for study. It's the first time I've felt sorry for a beer."] = "卡加斯的暗法师薇薇安·拉格雷想要一份淡啤酒秘方，那是黑铁矮人从几个矮人酿酒师手里偷来的。据说这种酒能让喝的人更强壮、更勇敢，被遗忘者很想知道其中的奥秘。我把它弄了回来，然后它就被送去炼金房做研究了。这是我第一次替一杯啤酒感到难过。"
L["The Dark Irons' golems run on something special, and Vivian Lagrave wanted ten essences of it for some Forsaken abominations. Turn the city upside down if you must, I was told. I started with the golems and the dwarves who build them, and never needed to turn anything else over."] = "黑铁矮人的傀儡靠一种特别的东西驱动，薇薇安·拉格雷想要十份这种精华，用在被遗忘者的憎恶身上。必要的话就把整座城翻个底朝天，有人这么跟我说。我从傀儡和造傀儡的矮人下手，结果根本不用再翻别的地方。"
L["Thunderheart in Kargath felt something foul seeping out of Blackrock Mountain, and wanted Lord Incendius dead on the theory that the servant leads you to the master. Incendius died, and I brought back the Tablet of Kurniya. Thunderheart took it, said the name Ragnaros, and told Kargath to decide whether to stand or run. I've had warmer welcomes."] = "卡加斯的桑德哈特感觉到有某种污秽的东西正从黑石山渗出来，想要伊森迪奥斯的命，理由是仆人能把你引向主人。伊森迪奥斯死了，我带回了库尔尼亚石板。桑德哈特接过去，说出了拉格纳罗斯的名字，然后叫卡加斯决定是要坚守还是要逃跑。我受过更热情的欢迎。"
L["Lotwil Veriatus was sure Golem Lord Argelmach had died ten years ago, so new machines bearing Argelmach's marks had Lotwil rattled. I brought back Argelmach's head and ten elemental cores from the golems around him. The head was metal, a Dark Iron construct. Lotwil now expects another one, and frankly so do I."] = "鲁特维尔·沃拉图斯确信傀儡统帅阿格曼奇十年前就死了，所以那些带着阿格曼奇标记的新机器让鲁特维尔心神不宁。我带回了阿格曼奇的头，还有从他身边那些傀儡身上弄来的十块元素核心。那颗头是金属的，是黑铁矮人造的构造体。鲁特维尔现在估计还会再冒出一个，老实说，我也这么觉得。"
L["Alaana Stormwalker near Thunder Bluff had word that the wall between our world and the Firelands had cracked somewhere under Blackrock Mountain, and that giants of molten rock were walking through. Alaana called that thrilling and terrifying and wanted a piece of one to study. I brought back a fragment. I'd have gone with terrifying."] = "雷霆崖附近的阿拉娜·风暴行者得到消息，说我们的世界和火焰之地之间的屏障在黑石山底下某处裂开了，熔岩巨人正从裂缝里走过来。阿拉娜说这既令人激动又令人害怕，想要一块它们身上的碎片来研究。我带回了一块碎片。要我说，就只剩害怕。"
L["Betina Bigglezink at Light's Hope has studied the plague for years and thinks the rest of us don't worry enough. Twenty samples of fresh plagued flesh said the plague had changed, so it was back into Stratholme to search the ziggurats for Scourge data. Betina called it astonishing and months of work, which to a scientist is good news."] = "圣光之愿礼拜堂的贝蒂娜·比格辛克研究瘟疫好多年了，觉得我们其他人担心得还不够。二十份新鲜的瘟疫肉块表明瘟疫已经变异，于是我又回到斯坦索姆，到通灵塔里搜寻天灾军团的档案。贝蒂娜说这真是惊人，够她忙上好几个月，这对一个科学家来说可是好消息。"
L["Smokey LaRue at Light's Hope hadn't had a decent smoke since Stratholme fell, and said so, often. The tobacconist there had vowed to burn every leaf before the Scourge got any, and missed a box. Smokey got the stogies back, and I got Smokey's lighter, which seemed fair."] = "圣光之愿礼拜堂的烟鬼拉鲁恩自从斯坦索姆沦陷后就没抽过一口像样的烟，这话常挂在嘴边。那里的烟草商发过誓，宁可把每一片烟叶都烧掉也不留给天灾军团，结果漏了一盒。烟鬼拿回了雪茄，我拿到了烟鬼的打火机，这很公平。"
L["Leonid Barthalomew the Revered calls undeath an illness, Leonid's own included, and gets on with the work regardless. The work this time was the Argent Dawn's spare holy water, sitting in supply crates in Stratholme. The Scourge won't touch holy water, but the vermin in those crates hadn't heard."] = "莱尼德·巴萨罗梅把亡灵状态叫作一种病，包括莱尼德自己的，然后照样埋头干活。这次的活儿是银色黎明的备用圣水，就放在斯坦索姆的补给箱里。天灾军团不会碰圣水，可那些箱子里的害虫显然没听说过这条规矩。"
L["Egan lives out in Terrordale on hatred of the Scourge, and handed me a blaster for the ghosts in Stratholme's streets. Blast a ghost and the soul steps out of it, blast it again and it's free. After fifteen of those, Egan asked whether I'd seen his mother."] = "埃根住在恐惧谷，靠着对天灾军团的仇恨活着，他交给我一把冲击器，专门对付斯坦索姆街上的鬼魂。冲击一个鬼魂，灵魂就会从里面走出来，再冲击一次，它就自由了。这样解放了十五个之后，埃根问我有没有见到他的母亲。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller has a grudge with a face on it: Ramstein the Gorger stood over him when he died defending his own farm, and he hunted it across the wastes until it hid in Stratholme. I brought him the head. He spat and said it was going on his wall."] = "纳萨诺斯·凋零者的仇恨是有脸的：他当年为保卫自己的农场而死时，吞咽者拉姆斯登就站在他身边，后来他一路追杀这家伙穿过荒原，直到它躲进了斯坦索姆。我把那颗头带给了他。他啐了一口，说要把它挂到墙上。"
L["Aurius was holed up in a Stratholme chapel, the only thing keeping him from turning death knight. With the Medallion of Faith back from a Scarlet zealot he could leave, and he went straight for Baron Rivendare. He was dying when it was over, but he said his soul was saved, and seemed to think that the better bargain."] = "奥里克斯躲在斯坦索姆的一座小教堂里，那是唯一能让他不变成死亡骑士的地方。等我从一个血色狂热者手里拿回信仰奖章，他终于能离开了，而他直奔瑞文戴尔男爵而去。一切结束时他已经奄奄一息，但他说他的灵魂得救了，看起来他觉得这笔买卖更划算。"
L["Leonid Barthalomew sent me over to Betina Bigglezink with some frozen eggs, and Betina sent me back into Scholomance with something called Dawn's Gambit, to set down in the Viewing Room. A gambit, as I understand it, means giving up a piece to win the game. I made sure the piece was Vectus."] = "莱尼德·巴萨罗梅让我带着几颗冰冻的龙蛋去找贝蒂娜·比格辛克，贝蒂娜又让我带着一个叫“黎明先锋”的东西回到通灵学院，把它放在观察室里。按我的理解，先锋就是棋盘上最先被牺牲掉的那一枚。我确保了被牺牲的是维克图斯。"
L["Betina Bigglezink at Light's Hope wanted twenty plagued dragon hatchlings put down in Scholomance. Somewhere in all that plague I found one healthy dragon scale, and brought that back too. I don't know what Betina wanted it for. In Scholomance, anything healthy is worth a second look."] = "圣光之愿礼拜堂的贝蒂娜·比格辛克要我在通灵学院干掉二十只瘟疫龙崽。在那一大片瘟疫里，我找到了一片健康的龙鳞，也一并带了回来。我不知道贝蒂娜要它干什么。在通灵学院，任何健康的东西都值得多看一眼。"
L["Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan had lost a prospector named Agmond, whose last report mentioned carved stone urns at the dig outside Uldaman, and Ironband suspected the urns were what had stirred up the troggs. I brought back four. The troggs did seem to feel strongly about them."] = "洛克莫丹的勘察员基恩萨·铁环手下有个叫阿戈莫德的勘察员失踪了，他最后一份报告里提到了奥达曼外挖掘场里的雕纹石罐，铁环怀疑正是这些石罐惊动了穴居人。我带回来四个。穴居人对它们的感情看来确实挺深。"
L["When the troggs overran Uldaman, Krom Stoutarm left his greatest treasure behind in a chest at the end of the North Common Hall. I fought my way to it and carried it home to Ironforge, and it was a beer stein. A Stoutarm without a stein, Krom explained with feeling, is hardly a Stoutarm at all."] = "穴居人占领奥达曼的时候，克罗姆·粗臂把他最宝贵的东西落在了北部大厅尽头的一个箱子里。我一路杀过去，把它带回了铁炉堡，结果那是个啤酒杯。克罗姆动情地解释说，一个粗臂家的人没有啤酒杯，就根本算不上粗臂家的人。"
L["Prospector Stormpike of the Explorers' League sent me after Baelog, whose band had gone into Uldaman and got stuck there. Baelog couldn't go anywhere, but his journal told me how to open a hidden chamber behind a huge locked door, and the chamber was real. Stormpike admitted to having had doubts, which Baelog never had."] = "探险者协会的勘察员塔伯斯·雷矛派我去找巴尔洛戈，他的队伍进了奥达曼，被困在了里面。巴尔洛戈哪儿也去不了了，不过他的日记告诉了我怎么打开一扇上锁巨门后面的密室，而那间密室真的存在。雷矛承认之前有过怀疑，而巴尔洛戈从来没怀疑过。"
L["In the end Talvash del Kissel let me keep the necklace, on two conditions: that I tell everyone, loudly and often, who made it, and that I mention it really isn't cursed. Talvash made it, and it isn't cursed, as far as I know."] = "最后，塔瓦斯德·基瑟尔让我留下了那条项链，条件有两个：我要大声地、经常地告诉所有人是谁做的，还要顺便提一句它真的没有被诅咒。是塔瓦斯德做的，而且据我所知，它没有被诅咒。"
L["Ghak Healtouch in Thelsamar sent me into the Badlands with a shopping list: buzzard gizzards, crag coyote fangs and shards from the rock elementals. The buzzards and the coyotes gave theirs up easily enough. The elementals argued the point. Ghak went over every piece, decided I could be trusted with reagents, and had a harder errand ready before I'd sat down."] = "塞尔萨玛的加克给了我一张采购清单，打发我去荒芜之地：秃鹫的胗、峭壁土狼的獠牙，还有岩石元素的碎片。秃鹫和土狼交出来得还算痛快，元素们可不这么想。加克把每一样都检查了一遍，认定材料可以放心交给我，我还没坐下，更难的差事就已经准备好了。"
L["Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath wanted reagents from the Badlands outside the walls: five buzzard gizzards, ten crag coyote fangs and five shards of rock elemental. Out there everything bites, so I collected from whatever bit first. Jarkal counted it all twice and said the ingredient that really mattered was down in Uldaman."] = "卡加斯的加卡尔想要城墙外荒芜之地的材料：五个秃鹫的胗、十颗峭壁土狼的獠牙和五块岩石元素的碎片。那地方什么都咬人，所以我就从先咬我的那个下手。加卡尔把东西数了两遍，说真正要紧的材料在下面的奥达曼里。"
L["Ghak Healtouch, the alchemist in Thelsamar, wanted a dozen magenta fungus caps from the Uldaman tunnels, with a warning that they puff poison spores when jostled. They do. Ghak paid me with a restorative potion and called the caps an interesting study, yon verily, and I still don't know what yon verily means."] = "塞尔萨玛的炼金师加克想要十二颗奥达曼隧道里的紫色蘑菇，还提醒我，一碰它们就会喷出毒孢子。确实会。加克用一瓶恢复药水付了账，还说这些蘑菇是“有趣的研究，然也然也”，我到现在都不知道“然也然也”是什么意思。"
L["Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath wanted a dozen magenta fungus caps out of the Uldaman tunnels, which let off poison spores if you disturb them, so a little care was called for. I took a little care and a lot of poison. Jarkal paid me with a restorative potion, which was exactly the right reward."] = "卡加斯的加卡尔想要十二颗奥达曼隧道里的紫色蘑菇，这东西一被惊动就会放出毒孢子，所以得稍微小心点。我是小心了一点，毒也吃了一大堆。加卡尔用一瓶恢复药水付了账，这报酬再合适不过了。"
L["Patrick Garrett swept the bat pens in the Undercity and felt it was beneath a Garrett. The family weapon was still in their old chest in Uldaman's South Common Hall, from back when the Garretts dug there. I brought it back, and Patrick turned straight to the bats and told them to tremble, which they didn't."] = "帕特里克·加瑞特在幽暗城打扫蝙蝠棚，觉得这活儿有失加瑞特家的身份。家传的武器还放在奥达曼南部大厅的旧箱子里，那是加瑞特家当年在那里挖掘时留下的。我把它带了回来，帕特里克立刻转身对着蝙蝠，叫它们发抖吧，它们并没有。"
L["Odd Jobs in the Badlands"] = "荒芜之地的零活"
L["Theldurin's Doom"] = "塞尔杜林的厄运"
L["Plenty of people want something out of the Badlands or Uldaman, and few of them want to fetch it themselves. Prospector Ironband has lost a prospector, Krom Stoutarm a treasure, Ghak Healtouch in Thelsamar needs reagents, and a tinkerer called Rigglefuzz is after power stones. None of it is urgent. All of it pays."] = "很多人都想从荒芜之地或奥达曼弄点什么回来，可没几个人愿意亲自去拿。勘察员铁环丢了一个勘察员，克罗姆·粗臂丢了一件宝贝，塞尔萨玛的加克需要材料，还有个叫里格弗兹的工匠在找能量石。这些事都不急，但都有报酬。"
L["Plenty of people want something out of the Badlands or Uldaman, and few of them want to fetch it themselves. Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath needs reagents, Patrick Garrett in the Undercity wants the family weapon back, and a tinkerer called Rigglefuzz is after power stones. None of it is urgent. All of it pays."] = "很多人都想从荒芜之地或奥达曼弄点什么回来，可没几个人愿意亲自去拿。卡加斯的加卡尔需要材料，幽暗城的帕特里克·加瑞特想拿回家传的武器，还有个叫里格弗兹的工匠在找能量石。这些事都不急，但都有报酬。"
L["Between the big jobs, the Badlands kept me busy with small ones. Everybody out there wanted something fetched, found or carried home from Uldaman, and nobody wanted to go down and get it themselves. So I did."] = "大活儿之间，荒芜之地总有些小活儿让我忙个不停。那儿的人个个都想让人去取点东西、找点东西，或者从奥达曼带点东西回来，可谁都不想自己下去拿。所以我去了。"
L["Out in the Badlands, Theldurin the Lost is sure a doom is coming. He won't say its name in case it hears him, but he knows what he needs to stop it, and it's somewhere down in Uldaman."] = "在荒芜之地，迷失者塞尔杜林确信厄运就要降临。他不肯说出它的名字，怕被它听见，但他知道要阻止它需要什么，那东西就在奥达曼深处的某个地方。"
L["Theldurin the Lost, a jumpy dwarf out in the Badlands, was sure a doom was coming and wouldn't say its name in case it heard him. He needed the Tablet of Ryun'eh, from a chest in Uldaman older than anything dwarves ever made. I brought it, and he said it might hold the secret to saving us all, though he still wouldn't say from what.\n\nThe tablet from Uldaman told Theldurin a lot, but not enough. He wanted Yagyin's Digest, a book kept by the very people he'd fled, and he gave me their sigil so they would take me for one of their own.\n\nThey did. Their contact in the city decided I was off to found a new chapter of their order and was glad to help, once I'd brought him three relics he wouldn't say out loud. He wrote them down instead. I brought them.\n\nThe book came with a warning that the truth can burn. Theldurin said they should build me a monument and praise my name until my grandchildren had grandchildren. Then he added that if THEY ever get loose, I can forget the grandchildren. We're all worm food."] = "迷失者塞尔杜林是荒芜之地一个神经兮兮的矮人，他确信厄运就要降临，还不肯说出它的名字，怕被它听见。他需要雷乌纳石板，那东西放在奥达曼的一个箱子里，箱子比矮人造过的任何东西都古老。我把石板带了回去，他说这里面也许藏着拯救我们所有人的秘密，不过他还是不肯说要从什么手里拯救。\n\n奥达曼的石板告诉了塞尔杜林很多事，但还不够。他想要《雅格因的笔记》，而保管这本书的，偏偏就是他当初逃离的那帮人。他把他们的徽章给了我，好让他们把我当成自己人。\n\n他们还真信了。他们在城里的联络人认定我是要去建立他们教团的新分会，很乐意帮忙，前提是我先给他带来三件他不愿说出口的圣物。他改成写在纸上。我带来了。\n\n那本书附带了一句警告：真相会灼人。塞尔杜林说，他们应该给我立座纪念碑，一直歌颂我的名字，直到我的孙子都有了孙子。然后他又补了一句，要是“他们”哪天跑出来了，孙子什么的就别想了。我们全都得喂虫子。"
L["Rigglefuzz, a tinkerer in the Badlands, had once shown the Shadowforge dwarves how to use the power stones they dig out of Uldaman, and was thanked by being thrown out. Now Rigglefuzz wanted sixteen of them, to run a robotic rodent forever. The Shadowforge were no better at sharing the second time."] = "里格弗兹是荒芜之地的一个工匠，曾经教暗炉矮人怎么使用他们从奥达曼挖出来的能量石，得到的感谢是被赶了出去。现在里格弗兹想要十六块，好让一只机械老鼠永远跑下去。第二次，暗炉矮人也没变得更懂得分享。"
L["A Bit of Wet Work"] = "一趟湿活"
L["Sully had been watching Alcaz through his looking glass and saw naga coming ashore, led by a sorceress barking orders. He asked me to thin them out while I was in there and bring back her head. I did both. As Sully put it, the enemy of your enemy is still a naga."] = "苏利一直用望远镜盯着奥卡兹，看见纳迦正在登岸，领头的是个大声发号施令的女巫。他让我进去的时候顺手削减一下它们的数量，再把她的脑袋带回来。两件事我都办了。照苏利的说法，敌人的敌人，也还是纳迦。"
L["The Dragon's Journal"] = "巨龙日记"
L["Archmage Lan'dalock had been scrying Alcaz Island from Dalaran until someone on the island noticed and shut the spell down. Just before that, it caught a journal written in old draconic, and Lan'dalock wanted it. I found it. I can't read a word of draconic, so I'm taking the archmage's word that it was worth the trip."] = "大法师兰达洛克一直在达拉然用法术窥视奥卡兹岛，直到岛上有人察觉，把法术掐断了。就在那之前，法术捕捉到了一本用古龙语写的日记，兰达洛克想要它。我找到了。龙语我一个字都看不懂，所以这一趟值不值，我就听大法师的了。"
L["A Little Payback"] = "有仇必报"
L["Sergeant Ulka had lost good orcs on Alcaz and wanted it squared, naga for orc, starting with the sorceress giving the orders. I came back with her head and a long list of naga who wouldn't be needing theirs. Ulka didn't smile, exactly. From the Kor'kron, that's practically a hug."] = "乌尔卡中士在奥卡兹折了不少好兽人，想把这笔账算清，一个纳迦抵一个兽人，就从那个发号施令的女巫算起。我带回了她的脑袋，外加一长串再也用不着自己脑袋的纳迦。乌尔卡也不算是笑了。可在库卡隆那里，这差不多就等于一个拥抱。"
L["Blood Red Bandanas"] = "血红头巾"
L["Ulka's people had been fighting humans in red bandanas on Alcaz, which put Ulka in mind of a gang from the Eastern Kingdoms. I collected the bandanas and carried them to Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. Eitrigg confirmed it: Defias, a very long way from Westfall. Nobody could tell me what they were doing there."] = "乌尔卡的手下在奥卡兹一直在跟一群戴红头巾的人类交手，这让乌尔卡想起了东部王国的一个帮派。我收集了那些头巾，带去奥格瑞玛交给伊崔格。伊崔格证实了：是迪菲亚，离西部荒野可远得很。至于他们在那儿干什么，谁也说不上来。"
L["Krol'dok No More!"] = "踏平克罗多克！"
L["Marcus Tilwell"] = "马库斯·提尔威尔"
L["Somewhere in Krol'dok I found Marcus Tilwell, who wouldn't explain how any of it had happened and only wanted out. So we left together, me in front. Apparently I wouldn't believe the story anyway. Having seen the place, I'd believe almost anything."] = "我在克罗多克的某个角落找到了马库斯·提尔威尔，他不肯解释这一切是怎么发生的，只想赶紧出去。于是我们一起离开，我走在前头。据说就算他讲了，我也不会信。见识过那个地方之后，我差不多什么都信。"
L["Magus Olvek"] = "魔导师奥尔维克"
L["Past Due"] = "逾期未付！"
L["Magus Olvek in Dalaran needed a book for a thesis, and Arcanist Doan had borrowed it from the old Dalaran library before the Third War and never brought it back. Doan lives in the Scarlet Monastery now, so I collected it the hard way. Considering the late fees, Doan got off lightly."] = "达拉然的魔导师奥尔维克写论文需要一本书，而奥法师杜安在第三次大战之前从达拉然的旧图书馆把它借走，就再也没还。杜安如今住在血色修道院，所以我只能用硬办法去收。考虑到那笔滞纳金，杜安这样已经算便宜他了。"
L["the gates of Stormwind, Elwynn Forest"] = "暴风城大门，艾尔文森林"
L["Major Mattingly"] = "玛丁雷少校"
L["the Valley of Strength, Orgrimmar"] = "力量谷，奥格瑞玛"
L["Overlord Runthak"] = "伦萨克"
L["The Drakefire Amulet opens the way into Onyxia's Lair, in the south of Dustwallow Marsh. Behind it waits the dragon who sat at Stormwind's court for years as Lady Prestor. Highlord Bolvar Fordragon would very much like a word with her, or failing that, her head."] = "龙火护符打开了通往奥妮克希亚的巢穴的道路，巢穴就在尘泥沼泽南部。里面等着的，正是那头化身普瑞斯托女伯爵、在暴风城的朝堂上坐了多年的巨龙。大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根很想跟她谈一谈，谈不成的话，要她的脑袋也行。"
L["The Drakefire Amulet opens the way into Onyxia's Lair, in the south of Dustwallow Marsh. Behind it waits the brood mother of the black dragonflight, Deathwing's own daughter. Thrall would like all of Orgrimmar to see how that meeting ends."] = "龙火护符打开了通往奥妮克希亚的巢穴的道路，巢穴就在尘泥沼泽南部。里面等着的是黑龙军团的龙母，死亡之翼的亲生女儿。萨尔希望整个奥格瑞玛都能看到这场会面的结局。"
L["The amulet got us through the door of Onyxia's Lair, down in the south of Dustwallow Marsh, and after that it was up to us. Onyxia had spent years in Stormwind as Lady Prestor, at the king's table, steering the kingdom wherever she liked. In her own home she didn't bother with manners. There were whelps. There were a great many whelps.\n\nWe came out with her head, and I carried it to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind Keep. Bolvar had it hung over the city gates, where everyone passing through could see what had been whispering to their king. The whole city stood a little straighter that day.\n\nMajor Mattingly at the gates had a reward for me afterwards, and a speech to go with it: the journey, he said, had only just begun. I've been walking ever since, so he may have had a point."] = "护符带我们穿过了奥妮克希亚的巢穴大门，那地方在尘泥沼泽最南边，之后就全看我们自己了。奥妮克希亚化身普瑞斯托女伯爵，在暴风城待了好些年，在国王的桌边占着一席之地，想把王国往哪儿带就往哪儿带。到了自己家里，她就懒得讲礼数了。里面有雏龙。有非常、非常多的雏龙。\n\n我们带着她的脑袋出来了，我把它送到了暴风要塞的大领主伯瓦尔·弗塔根手里。伯瓦尔下令把它挂在城门上方，让每个进出城的人都看看，一直在他们国王耳边低语的到底是什么东西。那天，整座城的人腰杆都挺得更直了一点。\n\n后来，城门口的玛丁雷少校给了我一份奖励，外加一番演讲：他说，一切才刚刚开始。从那以后我就一直在路上，所以他说的也许没错。"
L["The amulet got us through the door of Onyxia's Lair, down in the south of Dustwallow Marsh, and after that it was up to us. Onyxia didn't greet us. She breathed on us, which is how dragons say hello. Then came the whelps, a great many whelps, as if she'd been saving them for company.\n\nWe came out with her head, and I carried it to Thrall in Orgrimmar. Thrall sent me on to Overlord Runthak, who had it raised over the Valley of Strength for all to see. Every orc in the city stood a little taller that day, and so did I.\n\nRunthak had a reward for me afterwards, and a speech to go with it: the journey, he said, had only just begun. Easy for him to say. He wasn't the one who carried the head."] = "护符带我们穿过了奥妮克希亚的巢穴大门，那地方在尘泥沼泽最南边，之后就全看我们自己了。奥妮克希亚没跟我们打招呼。她冲我们喷了一口气，龙打招呼就是这么打的。接着来的是雏龙，一大堆雏龙，好像她专门留着招待客人似的。\n\n我们带着她的脑袋出来了，我把它送到了奥格瑞玛的萨尔那里。萨尔又让我去找伦萨克，伦萨克把它高高挂在力量谷上空，让所有人都看得到。那天，城里每个兽人都站得更挺了一点，我也是。\n\n后来，伦萨克给了我一份奖励，外加一番演讲：他说，一切才刚刚开始。说得倒轻巧。扛着那颗脑袋的又不是他。"
L["Victory for the Alliance"] = "联盟的胜利"
L["Onyxia's Lair, Dustwallow Marsh"] = "奥妮克希亚的巢穴，尘泥沼泽"
L["Celebrating Good Times"] = "英雄庆典"
L["The Journey Has Just Begun"] = "一切才刚刚开始"
L["Victory for the Horde"] = "部落的胜利"
L["For All To See"] = "万众敬仰"
L["Lorekeeper Lydros had said the blade wasn't finished until a dragon breathed on it, which is an odd way to temper steel and a very common way to die. So in the middle of all that, I laid Quel'Serrar on the floor of Onyxia's Lair and let her do the forging. Lydros was right. It came out of the fire a proper sword."] = "博学者莱德罗斯说过，这把剑要等龙对它喷过一口气才算完工。这种淬火的方法很怪，这种送命的方法倒是很常见。于是在那一片混乱之中，我把奎尔塞拉放在奥妮克希亚的巢穴的地上，让奥妮克希亚来当铁匠。莱德罗斯说得没错。从火里出来的，是一把真正的剑。"
L["Sprite Jumpsprocket"] = "斯普莱特"
L["Jasper Fel"] = "贾斯伯·菲尔"
L["Toxic Soil"] = "有毒的土壤"
L["Alba Fairmoon, at Sentinel Hill, says something is poisoning Westfall. The crops are failing, the wells taste of metal, and if nobody finds the source, nothing will grow there for decades. Alba has a sample kit and a great many questions."] = "哨兵岭的阿尔巴·晴月说，有什么东西正在毒害西部荒野。庄稼一片片枯死，井水喝起来有股金属味，要是没人找到源头，那里几十年都长不出东西来。阿尔巴带着一套采样工具，还有一肚子的问题。"
L["Alba Fairmoon turned up at Sentinel Hill with a sample kit and a theory: something was poisoning Westfall. I drew water from the farm wells and pulled gills off the murlocs along the shore, because murlocs, it turns out, are very sensitive souls. The wells came back full of metal. Not the good kind.\n\nThe Defias held the mines, so I ran their miners out of the Jangolode and the Gold Coast Quarry. Wrong mines. The poison came from somewhere deeper, and the crates lying around Moonbrook said where: the Deadmines, busy again after all these years.\n\nAlba wanted it blown up. A gnome called Sprite Jumpsprocket in the Dwarven District was thrilled to hear it, and SI:7 already knew all about it, which I found less thrilling. Jasper Fel handed me a remote detonator and asked me not to mention him to the elf. So I won't."] = "阿尔巴·晴月带着一套采样工具和一个推论来到了哨兵岭：有东西在毒害西部荒野。我从农场的水井里打了水，又从海岸边的鱼人身上扯了些鳃下来，因为事实证明，鱼人是非常敏感的生灵。井水的结果出来了：满是金属。可惜不是值钱的那种。\n\n矿洞都被迪菲亚兄弟会占着，于是我把他们的矿工从詹戈洛德矿洞和金海岸矿洞里赶了出去。找错矿了。毒是从更深的地方来的，月溪镇周围散落的那些箱子说明了来处：死亡矿井，过了这么多年，又忙活起来了。\n\n阿尔巴想把那地方炸了。矮人区有个叫斯普莱特的侏儒，一听这事就兴奋得不得了；军情七处则早就一清二楚，这一点就没那么让我兴奋了。贾斯伯·菲尔塞给我一个远程引爆器，还请我别在那个精灵面前提起他。所以我就不提了。"
L["Testing the Wells"] = "测试水井"
L["Murloc Gills"] = "鱼人的鳃"
L["The State of the Mines"] = "矿洞近况"
L["Moonbrook Espionage"] = "月溪镇谍报"
L["Explosive Consultation"] = "爆破咨询"
L["A Dynamite Plan"] = "炸药计划"
L["Detonation at a Distance"] = "远程引爆"
L["Alba was waiting in the hills behind Moonbrook, wearing the look people get right before something loud. I pressed the button. Somewhere under Westfall a forge stopped being a forge, and for the first time in years the soil had a chance. Best thing I ever did with a button."] = "阿尔巴在月溪镇后面的山丘上等着，脸上挂着人们在一声巨响之前特有的那种表情。我按下了按钮。西部荒野地底下的某处，一座熔炉不再是一座熔炉了，这么多年来，这片土地头一回有了转机。这是我用按钮干过的最棒的一件事。"
-- New stories: Green Hills, Naralex, Yeti, Myzrael, Thunderfury
L["The Green Hills of Stranglethorn"] = "荆棘谷的青山"
L["In the north of Stranglethorn Vale, a famous dwarf hunter has pitched camp with a handful of companions and a great many guns. Hemet Nesingwary has come for big game, and he only takes on hunters who can prove themselves.\n\nLearn the jungle's tigers, panthers and raptors from the expedition's own hunters, and you may hear what Hemet really came for. Barnil Stonepot, meanwhile, has a small literary emergency and would rather Master Nesingwary never heard about it."] = "在荆棘谷北部，一位大名鼎鼎的矮人猎手带着几个同伴和一大堆枪扎下了营地。赫米特·奈辛瓦里是来猎大型猎物的，而他只收能证明自己本事的猎人。\n\n跟着远征队自己的猎手们学会对付丛林里的猛虎、黑豹和迅猛龙，你也许就能听到赫米特此行真正的目的。与此同时，巴尼尔·石罐遇上了一桩小小的文学紧急事件，而且最好别让奈辛瓦里大师听到风声。"
L["Welcome to the Jungle"] = "欢迎来到丛林"
L["Barnil Stonepot"] = "巴尼尔·石罐"
L["Nesingwary's Expedition, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "奈辛瓦里远征队营地（荆棘谷）"
L["Ajeck Rouack"] = "艾耶克·罗欧克"
L["Sir S. J. Erlgadin"] = "埃尔加丁爵士"
L["Kravel Koalbeard"] = "克拉维尔·浓须"
L["Roon Wildmane"] = "鲁恩·蛮鬃"
L["Barnil Stonepot greets visitors at Nesingwary's Expedition, in the north of Stranglethorn Vale. The camp belongs to Hemet Nesingwary, a famous big game hunter who doesn't usually welcome strangers. Barnil thinks you look like you've seen enough action to meet him."] = "巴尼尔·石罐在荆棘谷北部的奈辛瓦里远征队营地迎接来客。营地的主人是赫米特·奈辛瓦里，一位著名的大型猎物猎手，平常可不怎么欢迎陌生人。巴尼尔觉得你看起来身经百战，够格去见他一面。"
L["So there's a camp up in the north of Stranglethorn, and the first face you meet there is Barnil Stonepot. Barnil told me whose camp it was. Hemet Nesingwary's: war hero, big game hunter, not one for welcoming strangers. Then Barnil looked me over and decided I'd seen enough action to risk an introduction.\n\nHemet turned out friendlier than his reputation. He'd come to the jungle for a rare beast, he said, and I could join the hunt once I'd proved myself. Raptors with him. Tigers and panthers with two of his hunters.\n\nI'd come to Stranglethorn looking for paid work. I'd found three teachers and an exam."] = "话说荆棘谷北边有座营地，到了那儿第一个见到的就是巴尼尔·石罐。巴尼尔告诉我这是谁的营地：赫米特·奈辛瓦里的。战争英雄，大型猎物猎手，不太欢迎陌生人。然后巴尼尔上下打量了我一番，认定我见过的阵仗够多，值得冒险引荐一下。\n\n赫米特本人比传闻里友善。他说他是为了一头稀有的野兽才来丛林的，等我证明了自己，就可以加入狩猎。迅猛龙跟他学。猛虎和黑豹跟他手下的两位猎手学。\n\n我来荆棘谷是想找份有钱拿的活儿。结果找到了三位老师和一场考试。"
L["Kravel Koalbeard, at the Mirage Raceway, had a crate for an old customer who'd long since left for Stranglethorn. Hemet's a rich dwarf, Kravel explained, and it's a good idea to keep up with the rich ones. The crate held special-gauge ammunition. Hemet paid me, asked after crusty old Kravel, and answered the question himself: still up to no good, he'd wager."] = "沙漠赛道的克拉维尔·浓须有个箱子，要交给一位早就去了荆棘谷的老主顾。克拉维尔解释说，赫米特是个有钱的矮人，跟有钱人保持联系总没错。箱子里装的是特殊口径的弹药。赫米特付了我钱，问起老顽固克拉维尔过得怎么样，又自己替我答了：他敢打赌，那家伙准还在捣鬼。"
L["Roon Wildmane, in Shadowprey Village, once spent many days hunting Desolace with a dwarf named Hemet, long enough for the old enmity between their peoples to be forgotten. Roon sent me to Stranglethorn with a kodo horn. Hemet knew whose it was at a glance, and what it meant: come back and hunt again. His next expedition might take him to Desolace, he said. Hunters always say that about the next expedition."] = "葬影村的鲁恩·蛮鬃曾经和一个名叫赫米特的矮人在凄凉之地一起狩猎了许多天，久到两族之间的宿怨都被抛在了脑后。鲁恩让我带着一只科多兽角去荆棘谷。赫米特一眼就认出了那是谁的角，也明白它的意思：回来，再一起打猎。他说，下一次远征也许会去凄凉之地。猎人说起下一次远征，总是这么说。"
L["Hunting in Stranglethorn"] = "荆棘谷狩猎"
L["Tiger Mastery"] = "猎虎"
L["Ajeck Rouack, at Nesingwary's Expedition, learned tiger hunting from her father as a girl, and she teaches it the same way: start easy, on the young tigers near camp. It gets harder from there."] = "奈辛瓦里远征队营地的艾耶克·罗欧克小时候跟父亲学会了猎虎，她教人的方法也一样：从简单的开始，先猎营地附近的猛虎幼崽。之后就越来越难了。"
L["Ajeck Rouack learned to hunt tigers from her father when she was a girl, and she teaches it the way he must have: start small. The young ones live near camp. From there you work your way up the family tree, and the elders take it personally.\n\nThen the real lesson. The party had been tracking one tigress for weeks without getting near her. They called her Sin'Dall. Ajeck wanted her paw, and wanted me to do what nobody of my kind had done before.\n\nTracking her was no easy task, exactly as promised. But I came back with the paw, and Ajeck named me a Master Tiger Hunter. Most impressive, I do say, was how she put it.\n\nNo certificate, mind you. Just the title, and a paw nobody asked to have back."] = "艾耶克·罗欧克小时候跟父亲学会了猎虎，她教人的法子想必和她父亲当年一样：从小的开始。幼崽就住在营地附近。从那儿起，你就顺着它们的家谱一路往上猎，而辈分越高的，越把这事当成私仇。\n\n接着才是真正的一课。狩猎队追踪一只母老虎已经好几个星期了，却始终近不了它的身。他们管它叫辛达尔。艾耶克想要它的爪子，还想让我做到我的同族里从来没人做到过的事。\n\n追踪它果然不是件简单的差事，跟说好的一模一样。不过我带着爪子回来了，艾耶克封我为猎虎大师。她的原话是：我得说，你真是太出色了。\n\n先说清楚，没有证书。只有一个头衔，外加一只没人想要回去的爪子。"
L["Young Tigers"] = "猛虎幼崽"
L["Stranglethorn Tigers"] = "荆棘谷猛虎"
L["Elder Tigers"] = "老年猛虎"
L["Sin'Dall"] = "辛达尔"
L["Panther Mastery"] = "猎豹"
L["Sir S. J. Erlgadin, at Nesingwary's Expedition, won't let anyone into Hemet's crack hunting party who can't handle a panther. The lessons start easy, with the young ones. Tracking them down, the knight warns, is only half the challenge."] = "奈辛瓦里远征队营地的埃尔加丁爵士不会让任何对付不了黑豹的人加入赫米特的精英狩猎队。课程从简单的开始，先猎幼崽。这位骑士提醒你：找到它们只是挑战的一半。"
L["Sir S. J. Erlgadin handles the panthers, and in the knight's view Hemet has assembled a crack group, and nobody joins a crack group without proving it. So: panthers. They start you easy, on the young ones, and work you up to the shadowmaws.\n\nTracking them down is only half the challenge, Erlgadin says. I can tell you what the other half is. It's the panther.\n\nAt the top of the list sat Bhag'thera, a great panther who'd been prowling the jungle and slipping the whole expedition. His fang would earn me Erlgadin's respect. I spent a good while learning why everyone else had come home empty-handed. Then I didn't.\n\nErlgadin cheered and called me mighty. I've been living up to it ever since, mostly sitting down."] = "黑豹归埃尔加丁爵士管。在这位骑士看来，赫米特组建的是一支精英队伍，而没证明过自己，谁也别想进精英队伍。所以：黑豹。先从简单的幼崽开始，一路练到深喉猎豹。\n\n埃尔加丁说，找到它们只是挑战的一半。另一半是什么，我可以告诉你。是黑豹本身。\n\n名单最上头的是巴尔瑟拉，一头巨大的黑豹，一直在丛林里游荡，把整支远征队耍得团团转。拿到它的牙，我就能赢得埃尔加丁的尊敬。我花了好一阵子才弄明白，为什么其他人都空手而归。后来，我没有空手而归。\n\n埃尔加丁欢呼起来，说我真是勇猛无比。从那以后，我一直努力配得上这个称号——大多数时候是坐着努力。"
L["Young Panthers"] = "猎豹幼崽"
L["Panthers"] = "黑豹"
L["Shadowmaw Panthers"] = "深喉猎豹"
L["Bhag'thera"] = "巴尔瑟拉"
L["Raptor Mastery"] = "猎龙"
L["Hemet Nesingwary teaches the raptor lessons himself, at his camp in northern Stranglethorn. He'll tell you which raptors to hunt. He won't tell you where to find them. Locating the beasts, he says, is half the challenge."] = "赫米特·奈辛瓦里在他位于荆棘谷北部的营地亲自教授迅猛龙课程。他会告诉你该猎哪种迅猛龙，但不会告诉你去哪儿找。他说，找到野兽本身就是挑战的一半。"
L["Hemet teaches raptors himself, and his first lesson is that he won't tell you where they are. Locating the beasts is half the challenge, he says. Raptors, in my experience, are happy to help with that half.\n\nThree breeds of raptor later, he told me about the one that kept getting away from him. Tethis, Ajeck calls him, a wily old raptor that even Hemet had failed to kill. Prove yourself a true master, Hemet said, and bring back the talon.\n\nTethis was elusive right up until the moment he wasn't. I'll leave it there.\n\nHemet took the talon and tried a title out on me: Master Raptor Slayer. Has a nice ring to it, eh? It does. I'd never once managed to work it into conversation. Until now."] = "迅猛龙课是赫米特亲自教的，他的第一课就是：他不会告诉你它们在哪儿。他说，找到野兽就是挑战的一半。根据我的经验，迅猛龙很乐意帮你搞定这一半。\n\n猎完三种迅猛龙之后，他跟我讲起了那条老是从他手里溜走的。艾耶克管它叫泰希斯，一条狡猾的老迅猛龙，连赫米特都没能杀掉它。赫米特说，证明你是真正的大师，把它的爪子带回来。\n\n泰希斯一直神出鬼没，直到它不再神出鬼没的那一刻。就说到这儿吧。\n\n赫米特接过爪子，试着给我安了个头衔：迅猛龙猎杀大师。听起来挺响亮的，是吧？确实响亮。只是我一次都没能把它塞进聊天里。直到现在。"
L["Stranglethorn Raptors"] = "荆棘谷迅猛龙"
L["Lashtail Raptors"] = "鞭尾迅猛龙"
L["Jungle Stalkers"] = "丛林捕猎者"
L["Tethis"] = "泰希斯"
L["The Missing Pages"] = "丢失的书页"
L["Barnil Stonepot, at Nesingwary's Expedition, was trusted to proofread Hemet's novel, The Green Hills of Stranglethorn, right up until a gust of wind scattered it across the jungle. Barnil needs the missing pages back before Master Nesingwary finds out."] = "奈辛瓦里远征队营地的巴尼尔·石罐一直负责校对赫米特的小说《荆棘谷的青山》，深受信任——直到一阵风把书稿吹得散落整片丛林。巴尼尔得赶在奈辛瓦里大师发现之前，把丢失的书页找回来。"
L["Barnil Stonepot was proofreading Hemet's novel, The Green Hills of Stranglethorn, when a gust of wind went through camp and took the novel with it. Barnil got most of it back. The rest was out in the jungle, and Master Nesingwary, I was told firmly, must never find out.\n\nHere's what nobody tells you about collecting a book one page at a time. The pages don't share. A page only stacks with copies of itself, and I got copies of every page except the one I needed. For weeks I carried more of that novel than its author did. Somewhere in Booty Bay, someone is still asking for page fourteen.\n\nI read a few on the walk back. The sentences were short. The hunts were long. Somebody was always having a drink and being brave about it.\n\nBarnil says the ending is quite something. I'll take Barnil's word for it."] = "巴尼尔·石罐正在校对赫米特的小说《荆棘谷的青山》，一阵风刮过营地，把小说一起卷走了。巴尼尔捡回了大半。剩下的散落在丛林里，而且有人郑重其事地告诉我，这事绝对不能让奈辛瓦里大师知道。\n\n一页一页地收集一本书，有件事没人会提前告诉你：这些书页互不合群。每一页只能和同一页的副本叠在一起，而我捡到了每一页的副本，唯独缺我要的那一页。那几个星期，我身上带着的这本小说比作者本人手里的还多。藏宝海湾的某个角落，至今还有人在求购第十四页。\n\n回来的路上我读了几页。句子很短。狩猎很长。总有人在喝酒，而且喝得一脸英勇。\n\n巴尼尔说结局相当了不起。我就信巴尼尔的话吧。"
L["Chapter I"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第一章"
L["Chapter II"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第二章"
L["Chapter III"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第三章"
L["Chapter IV"] = "荆棘谷的青山 - 第四章"
L["King Bangalash"] = "虎王邦加拉什"
L["You've proved yourself against the expedition's tigers, panthers and raptors, and Hemet Nesingwary is finally ready to tell you why he came to Stranglethorn: a great white tiger he has had in his sights for a long time."] = "你已经在猛虎、黑豹和迅猛龙身上证明了自己，赫米特·奈辛瓦里终于准备告诉你，他为什么来到荆棘谷：为了一头他盯了很久的巨大白虎。"
L["With the tigers, the panthers and the raptors behind me, Hemet finally told me about the big hunt. King Bangalash, a great white tiger. Hemet had had his sights on that tiger for a long time. He was the reason the whole expedition was in Stranglethorn.\n\nI won't tell you where the king holds court. Locating the beast is half the challenge, as a dwarf once told me. I'll tell you he was well named, and that I came back with his head.\n\nHemet was delighted. Bloody well done, right-o, cheers, I say, cheers. He said he was honored to count me a comrade of his great hunting party, which is a thing I now get to say in taverns.\n\nIn the morning the sun also rose, over a jungle with one king fewer in it."] = "猛虎、黑豹和迅猛龙都搞定之后，赫米特终于跟我讲起了那场大狩猎。虎王邦加拉什，一头巨大的白虎。赫米特盯上那头老虎已经很久了。整支远征队之所以会来荆棘谷，就是为了它。\n\n我不会告诉你这位国王在哪儿临朝听政。正如一位矮人曾经告诉我的，找到野兽就是挑战的一半。我只告诉你，它不愧这个名号，而我带着它的脑袋回来了。\n\n赫米特高兴坏了。干得太漂亮了，好极了，干杯，我说，干杯！他说能把我算作他伟大狩猎队的一员，他深感荣幸。这句话现在我可以在酒馆里拿出来说了。\n\n第二天早上，太阳照常升起，照着一片少了一位国王的丛林。"
L["Big Game Hunter"] = "王牌猎人"
L["Waking Naralex"] = "唤醒纳拉雷克斯"
L["Beneath the Barrens, in the Wailing Caverns, a druid named Naralex lies asleep. He went down to dream the dry land green again, and the dream went wrong. Strange beasts crawl out of the caves now, and the oases carry a taint nobody can name.\n\nFind his disciples above the caverns' entrance, and follow the trouble down into the dark to where the dreamer sleeps."] = "在贫瘠之地的地底，哀嚎洞穴之中，一位名叫纳拉雷克斯的德鲁伊正在沉睡。他下去是为了用梦境让这片干旱的土地重新变绿，梦却出了岔子。如今怪异的野兽从洞穴里爬出来，绿洲也染上了一种谁也说不出来历的污秽。\n\n去洞穴入口上方找他的信徒，然后顺着麻烦一路深入黑暗，直到那位做梦者沉睡的地方。"
L["Above the entrance to the Wailing Caverns, in the Barrens, the disciples of a druid named Naralex keep a lonely watch. Their master went down to dream the dry land green again, and strange beasts have been crawling up out of the caves ever since.\n\nLend the disciples a hand, and follow the trouble down into the dark to where the dreamer sleeps."] = "在贫瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴入口上方，德鲁伊纳拉雷克斯的信徒们正孤零零地守望着。他们的导师下去是为了用梦境让这片干旱的土地重新变绿，从那以后，怪异的野兽就不断从洞穴里爬上来。\n\n帮这些信徒一把，然后顺着麻烦一路深入黑暗，直到那位做梦者沉睡的地方。"
L["New oases have sprung up across the Barrens, and the druids of Thunder Bluff can feel a strange power seeping up beneath them. Tonga Runetotem, at the Crossroads, wants to know where it comes from.\n\nFollow the water down to the Wailing Caverns, where a druid named Naralex went to dream the Barrens green again and never came back up."] = "贫瘠之地各处冒出了新的绿洲，雷霆崖的德鲁伊们能感觉到一股奇怪的力量正从底下渗上来。十字路口的图加·符文图腾想知道这股力量从何而来。\n\n顺着水源一路往下，来到哀嚎洞穴。一位名叫纳拉雷克斯的德鲁伊曾下到那里，想用梦境让贫瘠之地重新变绿，却再也没有上来。"
L["The Barrens / Thunder Bluff / Darnassus / Wailing Caverns"] = "贫瘠之地 / 雷霆崖 / 达纳苏斯 / 哀嚎洞穴"
L["The Forgotten Pools"] = "遗忘之池"
L["Elder Rise, Thunder Bluff"] = "长者高地（雷霆崖）"
L["Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem"] = "大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾"
L["the cave above the Wailing Caverns entrance, The Barrens"] = "哀嚎洞穴入口上方的山洞，贫瘠之地"
L["Nalpak"] = "纳尔帕克"
L["Ebru"] = "厄布鲁"
L["the Pools of Vision, Thunder Bluff"] = "预见之池（雷霆崖）"
L["Apothecary Zamah"] = "药剂师扎玛"
L["the docks, Ratchet, The Barrens"] = "棘齿城码头（贫瘠之地）"
L["Crane Operator Bigglefuzz"] = "起重机操作员比戈弗兹"
L["Mebok Mizzyrix"] = "麦伯克·米希瑞克斯"
L["near the Wailing Caverns, The Barrens"] = "哀嚎洞穴附近，贫瘠之地"
L["Falla Sagewind"] = "菲拉·古风"
L["the Cenarion Enclave, Darnassus"] = "塞纳里奥区（达纳苏斯）"
L["The Dreaming Oases"] = "梦境绿洲"
L["New oases have been springing up across the Barrens, and the druids can feel a strange power seeping up from beneath them. Tonga Runetotem, at the Crossroads, wants someone to go and look into the water. Closely."] = "贫瘠之地各处不断冒出新的绿洲，德鲁伊们能感觉到一股奇怪的力量正从底下渗上来。十字路口的图加·符文图腾想找个人去水里看看。仔细地看。"
L["Tonga Runetotem, at the Crossroads, had a problem most places would envy: the Barrens kept growing new oases. Tonga didn't trust it. The druids could feel some power seeping up from below, and a druid who feels something will not rest until somebody else has gone and poked it.\n\nI poked. There were cracks in the bottoms of the pools, with gas bubbling up out of them. Tonga gave me a handful of seeds, dead and dry, and had me drop them into the crack at the Stagnant Oasis. They grew. Right there, out of nothing.\n\nA few snapjaw shells later, Tonga had an answer and didn't like it. The land was dreaming and couldn't wake, and the dream was coming from the Wailing Caverns. Before I went anywhere near them, I was to see Hamuul Runetotem in Thunder Bluff. Druids always want a second opinion."] = "十字路口的图加·符文图腾碰上了一个大多数地方求之不得的问题：贫瘠之地不停地长出新的绿洲。图加信不过这事。德鲁伊们能感觉到有某种力量从地底渗上来，而德鲁伊一旦感觉到了什么，不等别人去戳一戳，是绝不会罢休的。\n\n我去戳了。池底有裂缝，气体正从里面咕嘟咕嘟往外冒。图加给了我一把种子，又死又干，让我把它们丢进死水绿洲的裂缝里。它们长出来了。就在那儿，凭空长出来的。\n\n收了几块钳嘴龟壳之后，图加有了答案，而且不喜欢这个答案。这片土地在做梦，醒不过来，而梦是从哀嚎洞穴里来的。在我靠近那里之前，得先去雷霆崖见哈缪尔·符文图腾。德鲁伊总想再多听一个意见。"
L["The Barrens Oases"] = "贫瘠之地的绿洲"
L["The Stagnant Oasis"] = "死水绿洲"
L["Altered Beings"] = "变异的生物"
L["Hamuul Runetotem"] = "哈缪尔·符文图腾"
L["Disciples of Naralex"] = "纳拉雷克斯的信徒"
L["Above the entrance to the Wailing Caverns, in the Barrens, two disciples of the druid Naralex keep watch: Nalpak and Ebru. Their master went down into the caverns to heal the land, and strange beasts have been coming up ever since."] = "在贫瘠之地的哀嚎洞穴入口上方，德鲁伊纳拉雷克斯的两位信徒守在那里：纳尔帕克和厄布鲁。他们的导师下到洞穴里去治愈这片土地，从那以后，怪异的野兽就不断地爬上来。"
L["Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem, on Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff, has walked in the land of dreams and seen what waits in the Wailing Caverns. Above the caverns' entrance, two disciples of the druid Naralex could use a hand too."] = "雷霆崖长者高地上的大德鲁伊哈缪尔·符文图腾曾行走于梦境之地，看见了哀嚎洞穴里等待着的东西。洞穴入口上方，德鲁伊纳拉雷克斯的两位信徒也需要有人帮一把。"
L["There's a cave above the entrance to the Wailing Caverns, and in it two disciples of a druid named Naralex. Naralex had a lovely plan: enter the Emerald Dream and grow the Barrens back into a forest. Somewhere along the way the dream went bad, and the caverns filled up with whatever crawled out of it.\n\nDeviates, the disciples call them. Nalpak looks on the bright side and thought their hides would make good leather. Ebru just wanted them dead, seven each of four kinds, and was very particular about the count. Happily, the hides came off the same beasts, so I did both jobs at once.\n\nEbru called it the first step toward a restored Barrens. Their master, I gathered, was still down there somewhere, asleep."] = "哀嚎洞穴入口上方有个山洞，里面住着一位名叫纳拉雷克斯的德鲁伊的两个信徒。纳拉雷克斯有个美好的计划：进入翡翠梦境，让贫瘠之地重新长成一片森林。可半路上梦变了味，洞穴里于是挤满了从梦里爬出来的各种东西。\n\n信徒们管它们叫变异生物。纳尔帕克凡事往好处想，觉得它们的皮能做成好皮革。厄布鲁只想让它们死，四种各七只，数目一只都不能差。好在皮就长在同一批野兽身上，所以两份活儿我一并干完了。\n\n厄布鲁说这是让贫瘠之地恢复原貌的第一步。听下来，他们的导师还在下面某个地方睡着呢。"
L["Hamuul Runetotem does his scouting asleep. He'd gone into the land of dreams and seen a cult of druids in the Wailing Caverns, druids who had meant to heal the Barrens and lost their way. He was too old to stay long. Nara Wildmane had stayed, and Nara had seen their faces.\n\nThe Druids of the Fang, she called them. Four leaders, a dream gem apiece, and all four haunting her sleep. She wanted the gems. I understood that to include the leaders.\n\nAbove the cave mouth, two disciples of Naralex had requests of their own, hides and a body count, and the caverns supplied both. When I came back with the gems, Nara said her dreams were finally free of those faces. Somebody slept well that night. Not me."] = "哈缪尔·符文图腾侦察都是在睡梦里进行的。他进入了梦境之地，看见哀嚎洞穴里有一群德鲁伊结成了教派，他们本想治愈贫瘠之地，结果却迷失了方向。他年纪太大，没法久留。纳拉·蛮鬃留了下来，也看清了他们的脸。\n\n她称他们为尖牙德鲁伊。四个首领，每人一颗梦境宝石，四个人都在她的睡梦里阴魂不散。她要那些宝石。我理解为：连首领一起拿下。\n\n洞口上方，纳拉雷克斯的两个信徒也有自己的要求：皮革，外加一个击杀数，洞穴里两样都管够。我带着宝石回来时，纳拉说她的梦里终于不再有那些脸了。那天晚上有人睡了个好觉。不是我。"
L["Leaders of the Fang"] = "尖牙德鲁伊"
L["Deviate Hides"] = "变异皮革"
L["Deviate Eradication"] = "清除变异者"
L["Apothecary Zamah, sent out to Thunder Bluff by the Royal Apothecary Society, wanted ten serpentbloom from the darkest corners of the Wailing Caverns, in the service of the Dark Lady. I picked them between snakes. Zamah called them splendid specimens, which from an apothecary is practically a hug."] = "药剂师扎玛是皇家药剂师协会派驻雷霆崖的，为了替黑暗女王效力，想要十朵长在哀嚎洞穴最黑暗角落里的毒蛇花。我在一条条蛇之间把它们摘了回来。扎玛称赞它们是绝佳的样本，这话从药剂师嘴里说出来，几乎就等于一个拥抱了。"
L["Serpentbloom"] = "毒蛇花"
L["Crane Operator Bigglefuzz in Ratchet had tried to unload a huge shipment from Booty Bay all at once and brought the lot down, and in the confusion Mad Magglish ran off with a bottle of 99-year-old port and hid in the Wailing Caverns. I brought the bottle back. Bigglefuzz, who had been about to lose the job over it, hurried it off to Gazlowe as a gift."] = "棘齿城的起重机操作员比戈弗兹想一口气卸下一大批从藏宝海湾运来的货，结果整批都砸了下来。混乱之中，疯狂的马格利什卷走了一瓶99年波尔多陈酿，躲进了哀嚎洞穴。我把酒带了回来。比戈弗兹差点为这事丢了饭碗，赶紧把它当作礼物送去给了加兹鲁维。"
L["Trouble at the Docks"] = "港口的麻烦"
L["Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet is convinced the raptors of the Barrens are cleverer than other raptors, that the cleverness lives in their horns, and that ground horn in wine makes a smart drink worth a fortune. I brought back horns off the sunscale scytheclaws. Mebok was grinding them before I'd let go."] = "棘齿城的麦伯克·米希瑞克斯坚信，贫瘠之地的迅猛龙比别处的迅猛龙聪明，聪明劲儿就藏在它们的角里，把角磨成粉兑进酒里，就是一种能卖大钱的智慧饮料。我从赤鳞镰爪龙身上弄回了角。我还没松手，麦伯克就已经开始磨了。"
L["Raptor Horns"] = "迅猛龙角"
L["The horns didn't work. Mebok wasn't discouraged, since nobody gets rich on the first try, and had moved on to Wailing Essence, which gathers in the ectoplasmic things down in the Wailing Caverns and might be what makes the Barrens so strange. I brought six portions. Mebok promised to send me more once the fortune came in. I'm still waiting."] = "角没起作用。麦伯克并不灰心，毕竟没人第一次就能发财，于是转而研究哀嚎香精。这玩意儿聚集在哀嚎洞穴深处那些灵质生物身上，说不定正是贫瘠之地如此古怪的原因。我带回了六份。麦伯克答应等发了财就再多分我一些。我还在等。"
L["Smart Drinks"] = "智慧饮料"
L["Just inside the Wailing Caverns, a Disciple of Naralex waits for the four Fanglords to fall. Once they have, the disciple means to walk all the way down to the sleeping druid and wake him, and will need protecting every step."] = "就在哀嚎洞穴里面不远处，一位纳拉雷克斯的信徒正等着四位尖牙领主倒下。等他们都倒下了，这位信徒打算一路走到沉睡的德鲁伊身边，把他唤醒，而每一步都需要有人保护。"
L["With the Fanglords dead, the disciple waiting inside the caverns finally had a clear road and someone to stand in front. We walked all the way down. Every time the disciple stopped to cast, the caverns sent something to interrupt, and I interrupted back.\n\nNaralex lay at the bottom, tossing in his sleep. The disciple reached into the dream after him, and Naralex, not helping, dreamed up something huge and hungry that climbed out of the water. It went down. Naralex woke with a shout, thanked us kindly, and left to find the rest of his disciples.\n\nThe beast left a glowing green shard behind. Someone in Ratchet sent me back toward the caverns to Falla Sagewind, who called it a nightmare and said it belonged with a wise druid. Mathrengyl Bearwalker, all the way over in Darnassus, looked into it, said things in the Emerald Dream were not as anyone had thought, and that the Cenarion druids alone would attend to it. I took the hint."] = "尖牙领主们一死，等在洞穴里的那位信徒终于有了一条畅通的路，还有个人挡在前面。我们一路走到了最底下。每当信徒停下来施法，洞穴就会派点什么东西来打断，而我就把它们打断回去。\n\n纳拉雷克斯躺在最深处，在睡梦里辗转反侧。信徒探进梦里去找他，而纳拉雷克斯非但不帮忙，还梦出了一个又大又饿的东西，从水里爬了出来。它倒下了。纳拉雷克斯大喊一声醒了过来，客客气气地向我们道了谢，就去找他其余的信徒了。\n\n那头野兽留下了一块发着绿光的碎片。棘齿城有人让我回洞穴那边找菲拉·古风，菲拉说这是一场噩梦，应该交给一位睿智的德鲁伊。远在达纳苏斯的玛斯雷·驭熊者仔细看了看，说翡翠梦境里的事情并不像大家想的那样，这事只有塞纳里奥议会的德鲁伊会去处理。我听懂了言外之意。"
L["With the Fanglords dead, the disciple waiting inside the caverns finally had a clear road and someone to stand in front. We walked all the way down. Every time the disciple stopped to cast, the caverns sent something to interrupt, and I interrupted back.\n\nNaralex lay at the bottom, tossing in his sleep. The disciple reached into the dream after him, and Naralex, not helping, dreamed up something huge and hungry that climbed out of the water. It went down. Naralex woke with a shout, thanked us kindly, and left to find the rest of his disciples.\n\nThe beast left a glowing green shard behind. Someone in Ratchet sent me back toward the caverns to Falla Sagewind, who called it a nightmare and said it belonged with a wise druid. Hamuul Runetotem looked into it, said things in the Emerald Dream were not as anyone had thought, and told me not to concern myself with it. I'm trying."] = "尖牙领主们一死，等在洞穴里的那位信徒终于有了一条畅通的路，还有个人挡在前面。我们一路走到了最底下。每当信徒停下来施法，洞穴就会派点什么东西来打断，而我就把它们打断回去。\n\n纳拉雷克斯躺在最深处，在睡梦里辗转反侧。信徒探进梦里去找他，而纳拉雷克斯非但不帮忙，还梦出了一个又大又饿的东西，从水里爬了出来。它倒下了。纳拉雷克斯大喊一声醒了过来，客客气气地向我们道了谢，就去找他其余的信徒了。\n\n那头野兽留下了一块发着绿光的碎片。棘齿城有人让我回洞穴那边找菲拉·古风，菲拉说这是一场噩梦，应该交给一位睿智的德鲁伊。哈缪尔·符文图腾仔细看了看，说翡翠梦境里的事情并不像大家想的那样，又叫我别为这事操心。我正在努力。"
L["The Glowing Shard"] = "发光的碎片"
L["Glowing Shard"] = "发光的碎片"
L["the depths of the Wailing Caverns"] = "哀嚎洞穴深处"
L["In Nightmares"] = "在噩梦中"
L["Are We There, Yeti?"] = "雪怪计划！"
L["Everlook sits at the cold end of Winterspring, a goblin trading town where travelers come in out of the snow. Umi Rumplesnicker has been drawing up plans there, and she'll let you in on them if you promise not to tell.\n\nUmi's friends always seem to have the great ideas. This time she has one of her own. It needs a few things from the snowfields outside town, and someone who can keep a straight face."] = "永望镇坐落在冬泉谷寒冷的一端，是座地精贸易小镇，旅人们从风雪里进来歇脚。乌米一直在那儿画着设计图，只要你保证不说出去，她就让你知道其中的秘密。\n\n乌米的朋友们好像总有好点子。这一次，她也有了一个自己的点子。这个点子需要镇外雪原上的几样东西，还需要一个能憋住不笑的人。"
L["Winterspring / Tanaris / Un'Goro Crater"] = "冬泉谷 / 塔纳利斯 / 安戈洛环形山"
L["Umi Rumplesnicker"] = "乌米"
L["Legacki"] = "莱加奇"
L["Sprinkle"] = "斯普琳科"
L["Quixxil"] = "奎克希尔"
L["Umi's Secret"] = "乌米的秘密"
L["Umi Rumplesnicker, in Everlook in Winterspring, has plans for something great and is bursting to tell someone. Promise to keep it quiet and she'll let you in on the secret, and on the shopping list that comes with it."] = "冬泉谷永望镇的乌米正计划着一件了不起的东西，憋着不跟人说就浑身难受。只要你保证守口如瓶，她就会把秘密告诉你，连同附带的采购清单一起。"
L["So there's a tinkerer in Everlook called Umi Rumplesnicker, and she had a secret. She'd let me in on it if I promised not to tell. I promised, and I've kept my word right up until now.\n\nHer friends, she said, always had the great ideas. Well, now she had one. A mechanical yeti. They'd be frightened out of their wits, and then, once they'd stopped shaking, terribly impressed.\n\nA yeti needs a coat, so I went southeast and collected ten thick furs from the ice thistle yetis, who were still wearing them. Then it needed horns, the big ones off the patriarchs and matriarchs in their cave. Only the best-looking ones, Umi said. No beat up or broken horns, please.\n\nTry asking a yeti patriarch to hold still so you don't scuff the goods."] = "话说永望镇有个叫乌米的工匠，她有个秘密。只要我保证不说出去，她就告诉我。我保证了，而且一直守口如瓶，直到现在。\n\n她说，她的朋友们总有好点子。这下好了，她也有了一个。一只机械雪人。朋友们会被吓得魂飞魄散，然后，等他们不再发抖了，就会佩服得五体投地。\n\n雪人得有件外套，所以我往东南去，从冰蓟雪人身上收集了十张厚毛皮，它们当时还穿在身上呢。接下来还需要角，得是洞里那些雪人王和雪人女王头上的大角。乌米说了，只要最好看的。磕坏的、断掉的角，麻烦不要。\n\n你倒是试试让一只雪人王站着别动，好让你别把货给刮花了。"
L["Thick Yeti Fur"] = "厚雪人毛皮"
L["Pristine Yeti Horns"] = "完美的雪人角"
L["Umi Rumplesnicker's project is finished, and she has already written to her friends in Everlook, Gadgetzan and Un'Goro Crater to say a surprise is coming. Somebody has to deliver it. Umi, in Everlook, is looking at you."] = "乌米的作品完工了，她已经写信给永望镇、加基森和安戈洛环形山的朋友们，说有个惊喜就要到了。总得有人去送这个惊喜。永望镇的乌米正看着你呢。"
L["Umi had written ahead to tell her friends a surprise was coming. The surprise was me, with her mechanical yeti in my pack.\n\nFirst stop, right there in Everlook: Legacki. I switched the yeti on, it went stomping over roaring its head off, and Legacki jumped a foot in the air, called me a big meanie and guessed who'd put me up to it in one try. Umi, it turns out, is always playing jokes on Legacki.\n\nThen the long road south. In Gadgetzan the next friend also guessed Umi. At Marshal's Refuge in Un'Goro, Quixxil didn't guess anything. Quixxil ran. The yeti followed. Quixxil asked it why. It roared, which I suppose is an answer.\n\nBack in Everlook, Umi was thrilled. That would teach them to make fun of her ideas, she said. I didn't mention what Legacki had told me. Some secrets you keep."] = "乌米提前写了信，告诉朋友们有个惊喜要来。那个惊喜就是我，背包里装着她的机械雪人。\n\n第一站就在永望镇：莱加奇。我打开雪人的开关，它一路咚咚咚地冲过去，吼得震天响，莱加奇吓得跳起一尺高，骂我是个大坏蛋，然后一猜就猜中了是谁指使我的。原来乌米老是拿莱加奇开玩笑。\n\n然后是往南的漫漫长路。到了加基森，下一位朋友也猜到了是乌米。在安戈洛的马绍尔营地，奎克希尔什么都没猜。奎克希尔撒腿就跑。雪人在后面追。奎克希尔问它为什么。它吼了一声，我想这也算是个回答吧。\n\n回到永望镇，乌米乐坏了。她说，这下看他们还敢不敢嘲笑她的点子。莱加奇跟我说的话，我一个字也没提。有些秘密，就该守着。"
L["Umi's Friends"] = "乌米的朋友们"
L["The Shards of Myzrael"] = "密斯莱尔水晶碎块"
L["High in the northern mountains of the Arathi Highlands, a cluster of crystals pulses with a voice. It belongs to Myzrael, a princess of the earth, held deep beneath the Highlands by the giants.\n\nFind the Shards of Myzrael and hear her out. Freeing a princess is the stuff of old songs, though the songs never mention how much walking is involved."] = "在阿拉希高地北部的高山上，一簇水晶随着一个声音明灭跳动。那声音属于密斯莱尔，一位大地公主，被巨人们囚禁在高地深处。\n\n找到密斯莱尔水晶碎块，听听她怎么说。解救公主是古老歌谣里的情节，只不过歌谣里从来不提要走多少路。"
L["Arathi Highlands / Ironforge / Badlands"] = "阿拉希高地 / 铁炉堡 / 荒芜之地"
L["The Princess Trapped"] = "被困的公主"
L["Shards of Myzrael"] = "密斯莱尔水晶碎块"
L["the northern mountains, Arathi Highlands"] = "北部山区，阿拉希高地"
L["Drywhisker Gorge, Arathi Highlands"] = "枯须峡谷（阿拉希高地）"
L["Iridescent Shards"] = "虹光水晶碎块"
L["the Circle of Inner Binding, Arathi Highlands"] = "内禁锢法阵（阿拉希高地）"
L["Stone of Inner Binding"] = "内禁锢之石"
L["Keystone"] = "钥匙之石"
L["the Forlorn Cavern, Ironforge"] = "荒弃的洞穴（铁炉堡）"
L["Gerrig Bonegrip"] = "葛利·硬骨"
L["Hammerfall, Arathi Highlands"] = "落锤镇（阿拉希高地）"
L["Zaruk"] = "萨鲁克"
L["In the northern mountains of the Arathi Highlands, a cluster of crystals called the Shards of Myzrael pulses with a voice. It belongs to a princess of the earth, trapped beneath the Highlands by giants, and she would very much like out."] = "在阿拉希高地北部的山中，一簇名为密斯莱尔水晶碎块的水晶随着一个声音明灭跳动。那声音属于一位被巨人困在高地地底的大地公主，而她非常想出来。"
L["So there's a crystal up in the mountains of northern Arathi, and it talks. Put a hand on it and a voice turns up in your head: Myzrael, a princess of the earth, chained deep under the Highlands by the giants. She asked very nicely.\n\nThe kobolds of Drywhisker Gorge were allies of the giants, and they had what she needed: a dozen Motes of Myzrael, to wake a second cluster of shards in their cave. They gave them up eventually.\n\nThen the Stones of Binding. Three stone circles across the Highlands, a key in each, and elementals on guard at every one. I brought all three keys to the Stone of Inner Binding, and the princess called me her rescuer.\n\nNobody had ever called me that before. I could get used to it."] = "话说阿拉希北部的山上有块水晶，它会说话。把手放上去，脑子里就会响起一个声音：密斯莱尔，一位大地公主，被巨人们锁在高地深深的地底。她请求得非常客气。\n\n枯须峡谷的狗头人是巨人的盟友，而他们手里正好有她需要的东西：十二份密斯莱尔之尘，用来唤醒他们洞里的另一簇水晶碎块。他们最后还是交出来了。\n\n接着是禁锢之石。高地各处有三座石阵，每座里面有一把钥匙，每座都有元素生物把守。我把三把钥匙都带到了内禁锢之石，公主称我为她的拯救者。\n\n以前从来没人这么叫过我。我可以习惯这个称呼。"
L["I took a pendant off a fallen foe once, and it would not stop pulsing. Hold it and a vision comes: the northern mountains of Arathi, a brilliant crystal jutting out of the earth, and a sense of someone pleading for help. I followed the vision. The crystal was there, and so was the pleading."] = "有一回我从一个倒下的敌人身上拿到一枚坠饰，它一刻不停地跳动着。握住它，就会看到一个幻象：阿拉希北部的群山，一块耀眼的水晶从地里突出来，还有一种有人在苦苦求救的感觉。我跟着幻象去了。水晶在那儿，求救声也在。"
L["Crystal in the Mountains"] = "山中的水晶"
L["Pendant of Myzrael"] = "密斯莱尔坠饰"
L["a rare drop from foes around level 30 to 40"] = "30到40级左右敌人的稀有掉落"
L["Stones of Binding"] = "禁锢之石"
L["Breaking the Keystone"] = "打开钥匙之石"
L["Myzrael has one more favor to ask, through the Stone of Inner Binding. A last lock, the Keystone, still holds her, and its key is carried by Fozruk, a stone watcher who walks the Arathi Highlands. You may want company."] = "密斯莱尔通过内禁锢之石，还有最后一个忙要请你帮。最后一道锁——钥匙之石——仍然困着她，而它的钥匙在弗兹鲁克身上。弗兹鲁克是一位在阿拉希高地上四处行走的石头守望者。你最好找几个同伴。"
L["The last lock was the Keystone, and its key, the Rod of Order, belonged to Fozruk. Fozruk is a stone watcher, which is a polite word for a giant, and spends the day walking the Highlands. Finding the giant took a while. Taking the rod took a while longer.\n\nI set the rod in the Keystone and felt the ground shudder. Then the princess, very loud: free, she was free! Not ready to face her old jailers, mind you. She needed time to gather her strength, and when she was ready, someone would have to summon her to the surface. You can guess who.\n\nShe sent me to a friend of hers, Gerrig Bonegrip, in a shop in the Forlorn Cavern of Ironforge. Gerrig had been expecting me, and welcomed me as one who serves a higher cause. Nobody had ever said that about me before either."] = "最后一道锁是钥匙之石，而它的钥匙——秩序魔棒——在弗兹鲁克手里。弗兹鲁克是一位石头守望者，这是对巨人的客气说法，成天在高地上走来走去。找到这个巨人花了一阵子。把魔棒拿到手，又花了更长一阵子。\n\n我把魔棒插进钥匙之石，感觉大地一阵震颤。接着是公主的声音，响亮极了：自由了，她自由了！不过，她还没准备好面对当年的狱卒。她需要时间恢复力量，等她准备好了，得有人把她召唤到地面上来。你猜得到是谁。\n\n她让我去找她的一位朋友：葛利·硬骨，在铁炉堡荒弃的洞穴里开着一间店。葛利早就在等我了，欢迎我这位侍奉更崇高使命的人。以前也从来没人这么说过我。"
L["The last lock was the Keystone, and its key, the Rod of Order, belonged to Fozruk. Fozruk is a stone watcher, which is a polite word for a giant, and spends the day walking the Highlands. Finding the giant took a while. Taking the rod took a while longer.\n\nI set the rod in the Keystone and felt the ground shudder. Then the princess, very loud: free, she was free! Not ready to face her old jailers, mind you. She needed time to gather her strength, and when she was ready, someone would have to summon her to the surface. You can guess who.\n\nShe sent me to a friend of hers, Zaruk, in Hammerfall. Zaruk had been expecting me, and said that if we were to bring the Lady back to the surface, we had much to discuss. Nobody had ever needed me for anything that grand before."] = "最后一道锁是钥匙之石，而它的钥匙——秩序魔棒——在弗兹鲁克手里。弗兹鲁克是一位石头守望者，这是对巨人的客气说法，成天在高地上走来走去。找到这个巨人花了一阵子。把魔棒拿到手，又花了更长一阵子。\n\n我把魔棒插进钥匙之石，感觉大地一阵震颤。接着是公主的声音，响亮极了：自由了，她自由了！不过，她还没准备好面对当年的狱卒。她需要时间恢复力量，等她准备好了，得有人把她召唤到地面上来。你猜得到是谁。\n\n她让我去落锤镇找她的一位朋友：萨鲁克。萨鲁克早就在等我了，说如果我们要把那位女士带回地面，有很多事要商量。以前从来没人需要我去做这么宏大的事。"
L["Myzrael's Allies"] = "密斯莱尔的盟友"
L["Gerrig Bonegrip, in the Forlorn Cavern of Ironforge, knows how Myzrael can be summoned. It takes a scroll, and the scroll went missing along with someone called Theldurin the Lost, last heard of in the Badlands. The name is not encouraging."] = "铁炉堡荒弃的洞穴里的葛利·硬骨知道该怎么召唤密斯莱尔。这需要一份卷轴，而卷轴和一个叫迷失者塞尔杜林的人一起不见了，最后听说他在荒芜之地。这名字可不怎么让人放心。"
L["Zaruk, in Hammerfall, knows how Myzrael can be summoned. It takes a scroll, and the scroll went missing along with someone called Theldurin the Lost, last heard of in the Badlands. The name is not encouraging."] = "落锤镇的萨鲁克知道该怎么召唤密斯莱尔。这需要一份卷轴，而卷轴和一个叫迷失者塞尔杜林的人一起不见了，最后听说他在荒芜之地。这名字可不怎么让人放心。"
L["Gerrig had more to say after that. The higher cause had a name, the Twilight's Hammer, and the Lady was their Lady. To bring her back they needed the Scroll of Myzrael, and one of their own, Theldurin, had lost his mind, scorned their teachings and fled to the Badlands with it.\n\nTheldurin was mad, all right. He said hello seven times, apologized, and took the apology back. But when I mentioned the scroll, he made perfect sense. Summon her? You don't want that, he said. If she comes up, we're all in trouble. Maybe she's already free, gathering her strength.\n\nI had just finished setting her free.\n\nThe scroll had been torn up by enraged rock elementals, who were still fighting over the scraps. I collected the scraps. Theldurin called them our only chance against the evil of Myzrael, and went looking for his scrap-ratchet."] = "之后葛利还有话要说。那个更崇高的使命有个名字：暮光之锤。而那位女士，正是他们的女主人。要把她带回来，他们需要密斯莱尔卷轴，可他们自己人当中有个叫塞尔杜林的，失了心智，唾弃他们的教义，带着卷轴逃到了荒芜之地。\n\n塞尔杜林确实疯了。他跟我打了七遍招呼，道了个歉，又把道歉收了回去。可我一提到卷轴，他说的话就句句在理了。召唤她？你可不会想那么做的，他说。要是她上来了，我们全都得遭殃。说不定她已经自由了，正在积蓄力量呢。\n\n我才刚把她放出来。\n\n卷轴被一群被激怒的石元素撕碎了，它们还在为那些碎片打个不停。我把碎片收齐了。塞尔杜林说这是我们对抗密斯莱尔之邪恶的唯一机会，然后就去找他的碎片棘轮了。"
L["Zaruk had more to say after that. The higher cause had a name, the Twilight's Hammer, and the Lady was their Lady. To bring her back they needed the Scroll of Myzrael, and one of their own, Theldurin, had lost his mind, scorned their teachings and fled to the Badlands with it.\n\nTheldurin was mad, all right. He said hello seven times, apologized, and took the apology back. But when I mentioned the scroll, he made perfect sense. Summon her? You don't want that, he said. If she comes up, we're all in trouble. Maybe she's already free, gathering her strength.\n\nI had just finished setting her free.\n\nThe scroll had been torn up by enraged rock elementals, who were still fighting over the scraps. I collected the scraps. Theldurin called them our only chance against the evil of Myzrael, and went looking for his scrap-ratchet."] = "之后萨鲁克还有话要说。那个更崇高的使命有个名字：暮光之锤。而那位女士，正是他们的女主人。要把她带回来，他们需要密斯莱尔卷轴，可他们自己人当中有个叫塞尔杜林的，失了心智，唾弃他们的教义，带着卷轴逃到了荒芜之地。\n\n塞尔杜林确实疯了。他跟我打了七遍招呼，道了个歉，又把道歉收了回去。可我一提到卷轴，他说的话就句句在理了。召唤她？你可不会想那么做的，他说。要是她上来了，我们全都得遭殃。说不定她已经自由了，正在积蓄力量呢。\n\n我才刚把她放出来。\n\n卷轴被一群被激怒的石元素撕碎了，它们还在为那些碎片打个不停。我把碎片收齐了。塞尔杜林说这是我们对抗密斯莱尔之邪恶的唯一机会，然后就去找他的碎片棘轮了。"
L["The Lost Fragments"] = "遗失的卷轴碎片"
L["Summoning the Princess"] = "召唤大地公主"
L["Theldurin the Lost, hiding in the Badlands, has pieced the Scroll of Myzrael back together with his scrap-ratchet. Read at the Shards of Myzrael, where you first heard her voice, it will call the princess up. Theldurin has some firm ideas about what happens next."] = "躲在荒芜之地的迷失者塞尔杜林用他的碎片棘轮把密斯莱尔卷轴拼回了原样。在你第一次听见她声音的密斯莱尔水晶碎块那里宣读卷轴，就能把公主召唤上来。至于接下来该怎么办，塞尔杜林有些相当坚定的想法。"
L["I read the scroll at the Shards of Myzrael, right where the princess first asked me for help, and up she came. Free, rested, and in no mood to thank anyone. She'd promised me once that her gratitude would shake the very foundations of the earth. She meant it literally.\n\nWhen she finally went down, I took her Eldritch Shackles and bound them to the Shards. From somewhere far below came a wail, and then a roar.\n\nThe Shards don't feel warm anymore. They hum with something that wishes the surface ill. Fair enough. If somebody let me out and then put me back, I'd hold a grudge too.\n\nRescuing a princess, it turns out, is only half the job. The other half is putting her back."] = "我在密斯莱尔水晶碎块那儿宣读了卷轴，就在公主第一次向我求助的地方，然后她就上来了。自由了，休养好了，而且完全没有要感谢谁的意思。她曾经向我保证，她的感激之情将撼动大地的根基。她是认真的，字面意义上的。\n\n等她终于倒下，我取下她的怪异镣铐，把它们和水晶碎块缚在了一起。从极深的地底传来一声哀号，接着是一声咆哮。\n\n水晶碎块摸上去不再温暖了。它们嗡嗡作响，带着某种对地面世界的恶意。这也说得过去。要是有人把我放出来又把我塞回去，我也会记仇的。\n\n原来解救公主只是活儿的一半。另一半是把她送回去。"
L["Thunderfury"] = "雷霆之怒"
L["Deep in Molten Core, Garr and Baron Geddon each keep half of a relic called the Bindings of the Windseeker. They give them up rarely, and only after a great many evenings of asking.\n\nCarry a half to Silithus and see where it leads. Legends are made at the end of roads like this one, provided you bring patience, a great deal of arcanite, and thirty-nine friends."] = "在熔火之心深处，加尔和迦顿男爵各自保管着一件名为逐风者禁锢之颅的遗物的一半。这两位很少交出来，就算交，也得你上门讨上好多个晚上。\n\n带着其中一半去希利苏斯，看看它会把你引向何方。传奇就诞生在这样一条路的尽头——前提是你带上耐心、大量的奥金，还有三十九个朋友。"
L["Molten Core / Silithus"] = "熔火之心 / 希利苏斯"
L["Examine the Vessel"] = "复生之瓶"
L["the Ravaged Twilight Camp, Silithus"] = "暮光营地废墟（希利苏斯）"
L["Prince Thunderaan"] = "桑德兰王子"
L["The Bindings of the Windseeker"] = "逐风者禁锢之颅"
L["Deep in Molten Core, Garr and Baron Geddon each carry half of the Bindings of the Windseeker, and neither gives it up often. Win either half, then take it to Highlord Demitrian at the Ravaged Twilight Camp in northwestern Silithus."] = "在熔火之心深处，加尔和迦顿男爵各自带着半个逐风者禁锢之颅，而且谁都不常交出来。拿到任意一半之后，把它带到希利苏斯西北部暮光营地废墟的德米提恩那里。"
L["Garr and Baron Geddon live down in Molten Core, and each of them carries half of the Bindings of the Windseeker. They carry them the way a miser carries his coin: rarely seen, never offered. We killed the pair of them week after week. I won't say how many weeks. Some of the people who were there still won't talk about it.\n\nThen one night a half dropped, and it was mine.\n\nIt led me to Silithus, to a ruined Twilight camp and a man called Highlord Demitrian, who took one look at it and fell to his knees. My Master's eternal prison, he said. He must be released. He gave me a vessel to examine, I examined it, and he asked the Master to bless my efforts.\n\nI noticed the word Master. I decided to worry about it later."] = "加尔和迦顿男爵住在熔火之心底下，各自带着半个逐风者禁锢之颅。它们带着它的样子，就像守财奴揣着钱袋：难得一见，从不出手。我们一周又一周地把这两位干掉。到底多少周我就不说了。当时在场的一些人，到现在都不愿意提这事。\n\n然后某天晚上，掉了一半，而且归了我。\n\n它把我引到了希利苏斯，一座残破的暮光营地，还有一个叫德米提恩的人。他只看了一眼，就跪倒在地。他说，这是吾主的永恒牢狱。必须让他重获自由。他给了我一只瓶子让我查看，我查看了，然后他祈求吾主保佑我的努力。\n\n我注意到了“吾主”这个词。我决定晚点再为这事操心。"
L["Thunderaan the Windseeker"] = "逐风者桑德兰"
L["Highlord Demitrian, in his ruined camp in Silithus, knows how to free the Windseeker from his prison. It takes both halves of the Bindings, ten bars of elementium, and the Essence of the Firelord, which only Ragnaros can give up."] = "希利苏斯那座残破营地里的德米提恩知道该如何把逐风者从牢狱中释放出来。这需要禁锢之颅的左右两半、十块源质锭，以及火焰之王的精华——而只有拉格纳罗斯交得出这东西。"
L["Demitrian's list was short. Both halves of the Bindings. Ten bars of elementium to fortify his vessel. And the Essence of the Firelord, which you only get by destroying Ragnaros' body at the bottom of Molten Core.\n\nThe second half of the Bindings took its own sweet time, same as the first. Ragnaros took some persuading. The elementium took everything else. Every bar wants ten bars of arcanite and a fiery core besides, so a hundred bars of arcanite went into a sword I hadn't even seen yet. I stopped counting the gold. The banker didn't.\n\nWhen I finally laid it all out, Demitrian didn't thank me. He called on his Master to rise and break his bonds, and told me to behold him who is older than existence.\n\nSo I beheld. He was free, and he was not in a grateful mood."] = "德米提恩的清单很短。禁锢之颅的左右两半。十块源质锭，用来加固他的瓶子。还有火焰之王的精华，只有在熔火之心最底层摧毁拉格纳罗斯的躯体才能拿到。\n\n禁锢之颅的另一半和第一半一样，慢悠悠地不肯露面。拉格纳罗斯则需要好好“劝”一劝。剩下的一切全耗在了源质锭上。每一块都要十块奥金锭外加一个炽热之核，所以有一百块奥金锭投进了一把我连见都还没见过的剑里。我不再数花了多少金币。银行职员可没停。\n\n等我终于把所有东西摆出来，德米提恩并没有谢我。他呼唤吾主起身，挣脱束缚，还叫我瞻仰这位比存在本身更古老的他。\n\n于是我瞻仰了。他自由了，而且心情可一点也谈不上感激。"
L["Rise, Thunderfury!"] = "觉醒吧，雷霆之怒！"
L["The Dormant Wind Kissed Blade is in your hands, and it sleeps. Highlord Demitrian, at the Ravaged Twilight Camp in Silithus, has the craft to wake it. Go and ask him. Firmly."] = "风吻之刃就在你手中，但它沉睡着。希利苏斯暮光营地废墟的德米提恩有唤醒它的手艺。去问问他吧。态度坚决点。"
L["For someone who'd spent ages in a prison that had been riding around in my bags, Prince Thunderaan came out swinging. It took forty of us to put him down. When he went, he left a sword behind, dormant, with the wind still moving in it.\n\nDemitrian was a different man by then. He cowered. He begged me to spare him and hand over the blade, and he'd wake it with the very materials I'd brought for his Master's return. Then I could leave him to reshape his pathetic life. His words. I didn't argue with any of them.\n\nSo he made it. Thunderfury, Blessed Blade of the Windseeker. It takes longer to say than to swing, and far longer to get than either.\n\nNow and then someone in a tavern asks, did someone say Thunderfury? Someone did. It was me."] = "被关了不知多少年，牢笼还一直在我背包里跟着我到处跑，桑德兰王子一出来就挥拳开打。我们四十个人才把他放倒。他倒下时留下了一把剑，沉睡着，风仍在剑身里流动。\n\n那时的德米提恩已经判若两人。他畏畏缩缩，求我饶他一命，把剑交给他，他会用我为迎接他主人归来而带来的那些材料唤醒它。然后我就可以放他走，让他去重塑他那可悲的人生。这是他的原话。我一句也没反驳。\n\n于是他把剑铸成了。雷霆之怒，逐风者的祝福之剑。念完全名比挥一下还费时，而弄到手比这两样都费时得多。\n\n时不时就有人在酒馆里问：有人说雷霆之怒吗？有人说了。就是我。"
L["Molten Core"] = "熔火之心"
L["The Green Hills"] = "荆棘谷的青山"
-- WoW Forever: The Drowned City
L["The Drowned City"] = "沉没之城"
L["At the Rebel Camp in northern Stranglethorn, a few deserters are holding out against their old commander, Colonel Kurzen, and Brother Nimetz wants to know what turned a good officer so cruel. To the south, at Grom'gol Base Camp, Kin'weelay of the Darkspear wants a piece of an old legend from the Vile Reef, a troll city the sea swallowed long ago.\n\nBoth trails lead out to the water off Stranglethorn's coast, where something old has come back up. Every treasure hunter in Booty Bay has heard about it."] = "在荆棘谷北部的反抗军营地，几个逃兵正在顽抗他们的老长官库尔森上校，而尼麦兹修士想知道，是什么让一位好军官变得如此残忍。在南边的格罗姆高营地，暗矛部族的肯维雷想要暗礁海一段古老传说的碎片——那是一座早已被大海吞没的巨魔城市。\n\n两条线索都通向荆棘谷外海，那里有某种古老的东西重新浮出了水面。藏宝海湾的每个寻宝人都听说过这件事。"
L["At the Rebel Camp in northern Stranglethorn, a few deserters are holding out against their old commander, Colonel Kurzen, outnumbered ten to one. Lieutenant Doren needs every blade he can get, and Brother Nimetz wants to know what turned a good officer so cruel.\n\nThe answer leads a long way from the jungle and then straight back to it, out to the water off Stranglethorn's coast, where something old has come back up. Every treasure hunter in Booty Bay has heard about it."] = "在荆棘谷北部的反抗军营地，几个逃兵正在顽抗他们的老长官库尔森上校，对方人数是他们的十倍。多伦上尉需要他能找到的每一把刀剑，而尼麦兹修士想知道，是什么让一位好军官变得如此残忍。\n\n答案会把你带到离丛林很远的地方，然后又径直带回来，一直通到荆棘谷外海——那里有某种古老的东西重新浮出了水面。藏宝海湾的每个寻宝人都听说过这件事。"
L["At Grom'gol Base Camp in Stranglethorn, Kin'weelay of the Darkspear wants a piece of an old legend from the Vile Reef, a troll city the sea swallowed long ago. Commander Aggro'gosh has trouble enough on land without more of it coming out of the water.\n\nThe legend leads out to the reef and past it, to something old that has come back up off Stranglethorn's coast. Every treasure hunter in Booty Bay has heard about it."] = "在荆棘谷的格罗姆高营地，暗矛部族的肯维雷想要暗礁海一段古老传说的碎片——那是一座早已被大海吞没的巨魔城市。指挥官阿格罗戈什在陆地上的麻烦已经够多了，可不想再有更多麻烦从水里冒出来。\n\n传说会把你引向礁石，再越过礁石，找到荆棘谷外海重新浮出水面的某种古老的东西。藏宝海湾的每个寻宝人都听说过这件事。"
L["Stranglethorn Vale / The Drowned City"] = "荆棘谷 / 沉没之城"
L["Stranglethorn Vale / Hillsbrad Foothills / The Drowned City / Ironforge"] = "荆棘谷 / 希尔斯布莱德丘陵 / 沉没之城 / 铁炉堡"
L["Stranglethorn Vale / The Drowned City / Durotar"] = "荆棘谷 / 沉没之城 / 杜隆塔尔"
L["Jungle Secrets"] = "丛林中的秘密"
L["Private Thorsen"] = "列兵索尔森"
L["near the Rebel Camp, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "反抗军营地附近，荆棘谷"
L["the Rebel Camp, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "反抗军营地（荆棘谷）"
L["Lieutenant Doren"] = "多伦上尉"
L["the two-story house in Kurzen's Compound, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "库尔森的营地中的两层小楼，荆棘谷"
L["Bookie Herod's Records"] = "书呆子赫罗德的档案"
L["the Stockpile, Kurzen's Compound, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "储藏室，库尔森的营地，荆棘谷"
L["Bookie Herod's Strongbox"] = "书呆子赫罗德的保险箱"
L["Corporal Sethman"] = "塞斯曼下士"
L["Sergeant Yohwa"] = "尤瓦中士"
L["Brother Nimetz"] = "尼麦兹修士"
L["Loremaster Dibbs"] = "博学者迪布斯"
L["Abra Cadabra"] = "安布拉·卡达布拉"
L["Commander Aggro'gosh"] = "指挥官阿格罗戈什"
L["the top floor of the inn, Booty Bay, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "旅店顶楼，藏宝海湾，荆棘谷"
L["Dudd Fizzlescroll"] = "达德·嘶卷"
L["The Rebel Camp in northern Stranglethorn is a band of deserters holding out against Colonel Kurzen, their old commander. Private Thorsen, on the road near camp, could use a hand right now, and Sergeant Yohwa has work for anyone who can fight."] = "荆棘谷北部的反抗军营地是一群逃兵，他们正在顽抗自己的老长官库尔森上校。营地附近路上的列兵索尔森眼下正需要帮手，而尤瓦中士有活儿要交给任何能打的人。"
L["So there's a camp of deserters in northern Stranglethorn, outnumbered ten to one by their old colonel. I pulled one of them, Private Thorsen, out of a scrap with Kurzen's men on the road. Thorsen had been sent back to spy on Kurzen. Kurzen, it turned out, knew.\n\nSo somebody in camp was talking. Lieutenant Doren sent me into Kurzen's Compound for his logistics officer's papers. Nothing about Thorsen, but a little brass key hidden in a ledger's binding, and a strongbox in the caves out back that it opened. Inside was a muddy note with Thorsen's whole routine, signed with one letter. M.\n\nBetween errands, the sergeant had me thin out Kurzen's men and rob his medicine men of their remedies. Then the corporal who keeps the patrol schedules told me who'd walked with Thorsen last week. I took that back to Doren and let him do the arithmetic."] = "是这样的，荆棘谷北部有个逃兵营地，他们那位老上校的人马是他们的十倍。其中一个，列兵索尔森，在路上跟库尔森的人打了起来，被我拉了出来。索尔森是被派回去监视库尔森的。结果库尔森早就知道了。\n\n这就说明营地里有人走漏了消息。多伦上尉派我潜进库尔森的营地，去拿那边后勤官的文件。关于索尔森的什么都没有，倒是在一本账簿的书脊里藏着一把小小的黄铜钥匙，后面山洞里还有个保险箱，正好能用它打开。里面是一张沾泥的便笺，写着索尔森的全部日常行踪，落款只有一个字母。M。\n\n跑腿的间隙，中士让我去削减一下库尔森的人手，再把他那些巫医的药抢过来。后来，管巡逻时间表的那位下士告诉我上周是谁跟索尔森一起走的。我把这个消息带回去交给多伦，剩下的算术让他自己做。"
L["Bookie Herod"] = "书呆子赫罗德"
L["The Hidden Key"] = "隐藏的钥匙"
L["The Spy Revealed!"] = "找出内鬼！"
L["Patrol Schedules"] = "巡逻时间表"
L["Report to Doren"] = "向多伦报告"
L["The Second Rebellion"] = "以彼之道还施彼身"
L["Bad Medicine"] = "库尔森的药物"
L["Colonel Kurzen"] = "库尔森上校"
L["Brother Nimetz at the Rebel Camp has a question nobody else is asking: what turned a once-noble man into the colonel they're fighting? Sergeant Yohwa and Lieutenant Doren, meanwhile, are ready to go after Kurzen's best troops, and the colonel himself."] = "反抗军营地的尼麦兹修士有个别人都没在问的问题：是什么把一个曾经高尚的人变成了他们正在对抗的那位上校？与此同时，尤瓦中士和多伦上尉已经准备好去对付库尔森的精锐部队，还有上校本人。"
L["The sergeant sent me after Kurzen's special forces, down in the caves they call the Stockpile, and then the lieutenant sent me after the colonel himself. Kurzen commanded from the very back of it. I came out with his head, which settled the military side of things.\n\nBrother Nimetz was stuck on another side. Kurzen had once been a good man, and Nimetz wanted to know what turned him. So I copied four troll legends off tablets in the old ruins, and pried a handful of fetishes off the Skullsplitter witchdoctors down south.\n\nNimetz added a scout's report: the local trolls were all worked up, repeating one word. I'lalai. He bundled the lot and sent me to a friend of his in Southshore. Stranglethorn to Hillsbrad, with a parcel. Nobody in that camp does anything by halves."] = "中士派我去对付库尔森的特种部队，就在他们称作储藏室的那片山洞底下，接着上尉又派我去找上校本人。库尔森躲在最里头指挥。我提着他的脑袋出来了，军事方面的事就这么了结了。\n\n尼麦兹修士卡在了另一方面。库尔森曾经是个好人，尼麦兹想知道是什么改变了他。于是我从古老废墟的石板上抄下了四段巨魔传说，又从南边的劈颅巫医身上撬下了几个神像。\n\n尼麦兹又添上了一份斥候的报告：当地的巨魔都激动得不行，嘴里反复念着同一个词。伊拉莱。他把这些东西打成一包，派我去找他在南海镇的一位朋友。从荆棘谷到希尔斯布莱德，带着一个包裹。那个营地里的人做什么事都不含糊。"
L["Kurzen's Mystery"] = "库尔森的秘密"
L["Troll Witchery"] = "巨魔巫术"
L["An Acquaintance in Southshore"] = "南海镇的熟人"
L["Special Forces"] = "特种部队"
L["Nimetz had one more name for me later on. Kurzen was dead, but whatever had turned him was not: an ogre mage called Mai'Zoth, holed up in a mound in the eastern mountains and said to bend minds. Nimetz was positive Mai'Zoth had done it. I brought back the Mind's Eye, the thing the ogre used, and handed it over very carefully."] = "后来尼麦兹又给了我一个名字。库尔森已经死了，可把他变成那样的东西还没死：一个叫麦佐斯的食人魔法师，盘踞在东边山里的一座土丘上，据说能扭曲人的心智。尼麦兹认定就是麦佐斯干的。我把心灵之眼——那个食人魔用的东西——带了回来，非常小心地交了出去。"
L["Mai'Zoth"] = "麦佐斯"
L["The Vile Reef"] = "暗礁海"
L["Kin'weelay at Grom'gol Base Camp wants a shard of an old tablet in the Vile Reef, a troll city the sea swallowed long ago. The tablet is sacred to the Darkspear. The murlocs living in the ruins don't care."] = "格罗姆高营地的肯维雷想要暗礁海里一块古老石板的碎片，那是一座早已被大海吞没的巨魔城市。这块石板对暗矛部族来说是神圣的。住在废墟里的鱼人可不在乎。"
L["Kin'weelay wanted a shard of a tablet out of the Vile Reef, an old troll city an earthquake sank long ago. Murlocs live in it now. The tablet tells the tale of Gri'lek, a hero of troll legend, and Kin'weelay wanted a piece of it for Orgrimmar. I chipped one off and swam for it.\n\nKin'weelay found the shard odd. It spoke of a lost city, I'lalai, as a great sprawling civilization, and the reef ruins aren't nearly big enough. So I went up the coast to another old ruin with hide and charcoal and took a rubbing of a second legend.\n\nCommander Aggro'gosh had naga swarming the ruins on the sea floor and wanted their tridents. Kin'weelay remembered a cavern by the reef from diving there as a youngster. I found it, west of the reef, with naga gathered all around. Naga never gather anywhere for a good reason."] = "肯维雷想要暗礁海里一块石板的碎片。那是一座古老的巨魔城市，很久以前被一场地震沉进了海里，如今住着鱼人。石板上讲的是巨魔传说中的英雄格里雷克的故事，肯维雷想要一块送去奥格瑞玛。我敲下一块，拼命游走了。\n\n肯维雷觉得这块碎片有点古怪。上面说失落之城伊拉莱是一个庞大繁盛的文明，可礁石间的那片废墟远远没那么大。于是我带着兽皮和木炭沿海岸往上走，到另一处古老的废墟拓下了第二段传说。\n\n指挥官阿格罗戈什那边，海底废墟里纳迦成群，他要它们的三叉戟。肯维雷想起了小时候在礁石边潜水时见过的一个洞穴。我找到了它，就在礁石西边，周围聚满了纳迦。纳迦聚到一起，从来不会是为了什么好事。"
L["The Gurubashi Legends of Old"] = "古老的古拉巴什传说"
L["Locating the Lost City"] = "定位失落之城"
L["Enemies in the Water"] = "水中的敌人"
L["Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore has read the report from the Rebel Camp with shaking hands, and he believes a lost city has risen off Stranglethorn's coast. He wants its legends and its magic studied. Krazek in Booty Bay wants something from the place too."] = "南海镇的博学者迪布斯读反抗军营地送来的报告时双手直发抖，他相信荆棘谷外海有一座失落之城浮出了水面。他想研究那里的传说和魔法。藏宝海湾的克拉兹克也想从那地方弄点东西。"
L["Beyond the cavern west of the Vile Reef lie ruins the naga are guarding, and Kin'weelay at Grom'gol thinks they may be the lost city. Commander Aggro'gosh wants to know what the naga are after. Krazek in Booty Bay has an interest in the place too."] = "暗礁海西边的洞穴另一头，是纳迦把守的废墟，格罗姆高的肯维雷认为那可能就是失落之城。指挥官阿格罗戈什想知道纳迦在找什么。藏宝海湾的克拉兹克也对那个地方很感兴趣。"
L["Loremaster Dibbs read the report with shaking hands. If the trolls were right, the lost city of I'lalai had risen off Stranglethorn's coast, which made it, in his words, the archeological discovery of the century. Could I possibly go back down there? With hide and charcoal?\n\nSo into the Drowned City I went, with friends. I took rubbings of four tablets and collected troll fetishes, since Dibbs suspected whatever magic raised the city might have something to do with what took the colonel's mind.\n\nKrazek in Booty Bay had me on a second job: a crew of Saltseer pirates had got there first and were looting magical things he'd rather loot himself. He especially wanted their captain, Dreadrise, out of the picture. Permanently. The picture is clearer now."] = "博学者迪布斯读报告的时候手一直在抖。要是巨魔们说得没错，失落之城伊拉莱已经在荆棘谷外海浮出了水面，用他的话说，这是本世纪最重大的考古发现。我能不能再下去一趟？带上兽皮和木炭？\n\n于是我带着朋友们进了沉没之城。我拓了四块石板，还收集了巨魔神像，因为迪布斯怀疑，不管是什么魔法让这座城市升了起来，都可能和夺走上校心智的东西有关。\n\n藏宝海湾的克拉兹克给了我第二份活儿：一伙盐水先知海盗抢先到了那里，正在搜刮各种魔法物件，而他更想自己来搜刮。他尤其希望他们的船长德雷德莱斯从画面里消失。永远消失。现在画面清爽多了。"
L["Past the cavern the naga were guarding stood the ruins Kin'weelay had hoped for: the lost city of I'lalai, up out of the sea after all that time. Kin'weelay was too old to go in, and wanted etchings of every tablet inside. Commander Aggro'gosh wanted the naga's leader dead before they found whatever they were looking for. I brought enough friends to manage both.\n\nKrazek in Booty Bay had me on a second job: a crew of Saltseer pirates had got there first and were looting magical things he'd rather loot himself. He especially wanted their captain out of the picture. Permanently. The picture is clearer now."] = "越过纳迦把守的那个洞穴，就是肯维雷盼望已久的废墟：失落之城伊拉莱，过了那么多年终于从海里升了起来。肯维雷年纪太大，进不去了，想要里面每一块石板的拓片。指挥官阿格罗戈什想在纳迦找到它们要找的东西之前，干掉它们的首领。我叫上了足够多的朋友，两件事都办妥了。\n\n藏宝海湾的克拉兹克给了我第二份活儿：一伙盐水先知海盗抢先到了那里，正在搜刮各种魔法物件，而他更想自己来搜刮。他尤其希望他们的船长从画面里消失。永远消失。现在画面清爽多了。"
L["Take Two With Water"] = "就水服下两片"
L["Magics of the Drowned City"] = "沉没之城的魔法"
L["The Only Good Brinescale..."] = "唯一的好盐鳞……"
L["Shady Saltseers"] = "可疑的盐水先知"
L["The Saltseer Captain"] = "盐水先知船长"
L["Archmage Timear in Dalaran had heard about the ruin and wanted one of the idols the old Gurubashi witch doctors used to focus their blood magic. For its archeological value, the archmage said. I found one and handed it over to the Kirin Tor, who I'm sure will be very responsible with it."] = "达拉然的大法师提迈尔听说了那片废墟，想要一尊古代古拉巴什巫医用来汇聚血魔法的神像。用大法师的话说，是为了它的考古价值。我找到一尊，交给了肯瑞托，我相信他们一定会非常负责地对待它。"
L["Ancient Gurubashi Secrets"] = "上古古拉巴什秘密"
L["Mazu'kon in Mulgore had heard the old Gurubashi channeled their blood magic through idols of pure truesilver and wanted one, strictly for academics. The advice was to kill the most impressive-looking priest in the place. It was good advice. Academics, I'm told, is a very broad field."] = "莫高雷的马祖康听说古代古拉巴什人是通过纯真银打造的神像来引导血魔法的，于是想要一尊，严格来说只为学术研究。别人给的建议是：杀掉那地方看起来最威风的祭司。这建议不错。听说学术研究是个非常宽泛的领域。"
L["Ancient Gurubashi Idol"] = "上古古拉巴什神像"
L["Somewhere in the city I picked up a scrap of scroll covered in symbols I couldn't read. It didn't feel dangerous, so I took it to Dudd Fizzlescroll in Booty Bay, a collector of odd magic. One less mystery in my pack."] = "在城里的某个地方，我捡到一片残缺的卷轴，上面满是我看不懂的符号。感觉不像危险的东西，所以我把它带给了藏宝海湾专门收集古怪魔法的达德·嘶卷。背包里少了一个谜团。"
L["Partial Mystical Notes"] = "不完整的秘法笔记"
L["the Drowned City"] = "沉没之城"
L["A Tale Worth Telling"] = "值得讲述的故事"
L["Loremaster Dibbs calls what you brought back a discovery of historical proportions, and has written to the Explorers' League in Ironforge to say so. Someone has to carry the letter. He also has a friend in Dalaran who would love to see one of those fetishes."] = "博学者迪布斯称你带回来的东西是一项具有历史意义的发现，还专门写信告诉了铁炉堡的探险者协会。总得有人去送这封信。他在达拉然还有一位朋友，很想看看那些神像中的一个。"
L["The Darkspear keep their history by telling it. Kin'weelay at Grom'gol wants your etchings taken to Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village, one of the wisest of the Darkspear, who will want to hear this tale."] = "暗矛部族靠讲述来保存自己的历史。格罗姆高的肯维雷希望你把拓片带给森金村的加德林大师，他是暗矛部族最睿智的人之一，一定会想听听这个故事。"
L["Dibbs called it a discovery of historical proportions and wrote to his colleague at the Explorers' League straight away. I carried the letter to Historian Karnik in Ironforge, with a copy of Dibbs's translations of the tablets. A whole drowned city's worth of legend, in my pack.\n\nI'd gone to Stranglethorn to help a few rebels with their colonel. I came back with the archeological discovery of the century. That's the thing about discoveries of historical proportions: somebody still has to walk them to Ironforge."] = "迪布斯说这是一项具有历史意义的发现，当即给他在探险者协会的同事写了信。我把信送到铁炉堡的史学家卡尼克手上，还附上一份迪布斯翻译的石板译文。整整一座沉没之城的传说，就装在我的背包里。\n\n我当初去荆棘谷，只是想帮几个反抗军对付他们的上校。回来的时候却带着本世纪最重大的考古发现。具有历史意义的发现就是这样：总还得有人一步一步把它们送到铁炉堡。"
L["The Darkspear keep their history by telling it, Kin'weelay explained: legends passed down to the younglings, lessons and cautionary tales. So the etchings went to Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village, their spiritual leader, to hear the truth of it. Kin'weelay even made me a copy of my own, and offered another if I ever lost it. For a small fee.\n\nSo the tale of I'lalai goes into the telling now, around the fire in Durotar. Somewhere a youngling is going to hear it and want to go diving. I know the feeling."] = "肯维雷解释说，暗矛部族靠讲述来保存历史：传给孩子们的传说、教训，还有警世的故事。所以拓片被送到了森金村的加德林大师那里，他是他们的精神领袖，好让他听听其中的真相。肯维雷甚至给我也做了一份副本，还说要是我弄丢了，可以再给我做一份。只收一点小钱。\n\n于是，伊拉莱的故事如今在杜隆塔尔的篝火旁传讲开来。总有一天，某个小家伙听了会想去潜水。我懂那种感觉。"
L["Findings for the Explorer's League"] = "给探险者协会的发现"
L["Dibbs also had a friend in Dalaran, Abra Cadabra, who studies troll magic and would want a look at one of the fetishes. The Kirin Tor are particular about who they let in. They let me in. Abra got the fetish, and I got to say I'd delivered a troll fetish to someone called Abra Cadabra, which I still enjoy."] = "迪布斯在达拉然还有一位朋友，安布拉·卡达布拉，专门研究巨魔魔法，肯定想看看其中一个神像。肯瑞托对放谁进去很挑剔。他们放我进去了。安布拉拿到了神像，而我从此可以说，我给一个叫安布拉·卡达布拉的人送过巨魔神像，这事我到现在还觉得很有意思。"
L["The Web of Magic"] = "魔法之网"
L["A Tale Spun Around the Fire"] = "营火旁的故事"
-- WoW Forever: Highway Robbery
L["Highway Robbery"] = "高岭越货案"
L["On a rise at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace, a campfire has gone cold beside a camp that's been picked clean. The travelers who made it never left, and the marks on their bones don't match any centaur's weapon.\n\nIf the caravans' gossip is right, whoever did it has done it before. Following that gossip leads a long way out of Desolace, to the docks of Booty Bay and farther still."] = "在凄凉之地的科多兽坟场边缘，一处高坡上的营火早已熄灭，旁边的营地被洗劫一空。搭起这处营地的旅人再也没能离开，而他们骨头上的痕迹，和半人马的任何武器都对不上。\n\n如果商队之间的传言没错，干这事的人以前就干过。顺着这些传言，你会远远离开凄凉之地，一路追到藏宝海湾的码头，甚至更远。"
L["Desolace / Stranglethorn Vale / Arathi Highlands"] = "凄凉之地 / 荆棘谷 / 阿拉希高地"
L["Extinguished Campfire"] = "熄灭的营火"
L["the Kodo Graveyard, Desolace"] = "科多兽坟场，凄凉之地"
L["the inn, Booty Bay, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "藏宝海湾的旅店，荆棘谷"
L["The Pillaged Camp"] = "遭劫的营地"
L["On a rise at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard in Desolace, a campfire has burned out and the camp around it has been stripped bare. Take a look at what's left. Whatever happened here, the scavengers of Desolace may have seen it before."] = "在凄凉之地的科多兽坟场边缘，一处高坡上的营火已经燃尽，四周的营地被扒得精光。去看看还剩下些什么。不管这里出了什么事，凄凉之地那些拾荒的人或许早就见过。"
L["So I'm crossing Desolace, which is never anyone's first choice, and on a rise above the Kodo Graveyard there's a campfire gone cold. Around it lay two humans and a dwarf, or what was left of them. Their packs had been emptied, and the cuts on the bones didn't come from any centaur blade I know.\n\nI wanted someone who knew this country's bones, so I took it to the goblin bone collector at Kormek's Hut. Bibbly F'utzbuckle heard me out and said I'd found another one, in the tone you'd use for a cart that's thrown a wheel again."] = "话说我正在穿越凄凉之地，这种路从来没人会首选，结果在科多兽坟场上方的一处高坡上，有一堆凉透了的营火。营火周围躺着两个人类和一个矮人，或者说，是他们剩下的部分。他们的背包被翻空了，骨头上的刀痕也不是我知道的任何一种半人马刀刃砍出来的。\n\n我想找个熟悉这片土地上那些骨头的人，于是把这事带去了考米克小屋，找那个收骨头的地精。比布里·弗斯巴克听我说完，说我又找到了一处，那口气就像在说哪辆货车又掉了个轮子。"
L["On the Lam"] = "逍遥法外"
L["Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut has seen camps like this before. Caravan gossip blames a band of marauders who fled Desolace with an Alliance marshal on their trail. If one of them is trying to get a boat out, Booty Bay is the place to look."] = "考米克小屋的比布里·弗斯巴克以前见过这样的营地。商队里的传言把账算在一伙劫掠者头上，他们被一名联盟治安官追捕，逃离了凄凉之地。如果其中有人想搭船离开，就该去藏宝海湾找找。"
L["According to Bibbly, the caravans blamed a band of marauders who ran once a marshal got on their trail. People on the run end up in ports, so I went to Booty Bay and found one of them, Tokal, drinking at the inn. Tokal asked if I was with the marshal, looked me over and decided I wasn't. I'm still working out how to take that.\n\nThe rest of the story cost me a cherry grog. Tokal's crew had robbed those camps, yes, but for pay, not for the Horde. Their boss was a night elf named Illari Duskfeather. She told them which camps to hit and let them keep most of the loot. The rarer finds she kept for herself, and when the marshal closed in, she left them for dead.\n\nTokal isn't out for revenge, but won't stand in the way of anyone who is. Illari had once mentioned a hideout on the Arathi coast."] = "照比布里的说法，商队把账算在一伙劫掠者头上，一个治安官盯上他们之后，他们就跑了。逃亡的人最后总会跑到港口去，所以我去了藏宝海湾，在旅店里找到了其中一个，托卡尔，正在喝酒。托卡尔问我是不是跟治安官一伙的，把我上下打量了一番，认定我不是。这话该怎么理解，我到现在还没想明白。\n\n剩下的故事花了我一杯樱桃酒。托卡尔那伙人确实抢了那些营地，但那是拿钱办事，不是为了部落。他们的头儿是个暗夜精灵，叫伊莱丽·暮羽。她告诉他们该抢哪些营地，大部分战利品也让他们留着。比较稀罕的东西她都自己收着，等治安官逼近了，她就把他们丢下等死。\n\n托卡尔不打算报仇，但谁要去报仇，托卡尔也不会拦着。伊莱丽曾经提过，她在阿拉希海岸有个藏身处。"
L["Bibbly F'utzbuckle"] = "比布里·弗斯巴克"
L["Cherry for Your Thoughts?"] = "你有故事我有酒"
L["Tokal"] = "托卡尔"
L["No Honor Among Thieves"] = "盗岂有道"
L["Tokal says the crew's old boss, Illari Duskfeather, once mentioned a hideout on the coast of the Arathi Highlands. Near the Arathi end of the Thandol Span, a rope bridge crosses to a hillside, and a rowboat waits at the water below."] = "托卡尔说，团伙以前的老大伊莱丽·暮羽曾经提过，她在阿拉希高地的海岸有个藏身处。在萨多尔大桥靠阿拉希的那一头附近，有一座绳桥通往一处山坡，下方的水边停着一艘划艇。"
L["The rowboat below the Thandol Span goes where no road does, out to a lonely dock on the Arathi coast. Illari Duskfeather was waiting there, and she wanted to know what I was doing on her dock.\n\nShe has her reasons for what happened in Desolace, and how much of them you get to hear depends on who's asking. I'll keep my half of that conversation to myself. It ended with her key in my hand.\n\nThe key opened her cache at the other end of the dock. Inside were a small box and some coin, likely the rarer finds she'd kept from her crew. I took them. The people they were taken from won't be needing them."] = "萨多尔大桥下的那艘划艇，能去到没有路通的地方，一直划到阿拉希海岸边一座孤零零的码头。伊莱丽·暮羽就在那儿等着，想知道我跑到她的码头上来干什么。\n\n对于凄凉之地发生的事，她有她的理由，至于你能听到多少，要看问的人是谁。那场谈话里我说的那一半，我就自己留着了。谈话的结果是，她的钥匙到了我手里。\n\n钥匙打开了码头另一头她的储藏箱。里面有一个小盒子和一些钱币，八成就是她瞒着手下私藏的那些稀罕东西。我拿走了。它们原来的主人，已经用不着了。"
-- Dungeon stories: Hidden Enemies, Blackfathom Villainy, The Mad King, Thorns of the Razorfen, The City of Dalaran, Lost in the Thicket, An Ancient Grudge
L["The City of Dalaran"] = "达拉然城"
L["An emissary from Dalaran has come to Southshore asking the Alliance for help, and the Kirin Tor's high council would prefer that it stayed quiet. Over in Tarren Mill, Magus Wordeen Voidglare has business at the mages' prison camp on Lordamere Lake, and questions about the city beyond it.\n\nThe Kirin Tor rebuilt Dalaran after the Legion flattened it and have kept outsiders at arm's length ever since. Something has gone wrong inside, and for once they are asking for help."] = "一位来自达拉然的使者来到南海镇，向联盟求援，而肯瑞托的最高议会宁愿此事不要声张。另一边，塔伦米尔的大法师沃迪恩·伍德格莱尔在洛丹米尔湖畔的法师监狱营地有事要办，对湖那边的那座城市也颇有疑问。\n\n燃烧军团把达拉然夷为平地之后，肯瑞托重建了这座城市，从此一直把外人拒之门外。如今城里出了岔子，他们难得开口求一次助。"
L["An emissary of the Kirin Tor has come to the town hall in Southshore asking the Alliance for help, and the high council would prefer that it stayed quiet. Archmage Modera sent him, and she needs someone who can be discreet.\n\nThe Kirin Tor rebuilt Dalaran after the Legion flattened it and have kept outsiders at arm's length ever since. Something has gone wrong inside, badly enough that they are asking anyway."] = "肯瑞托的一位使者来到南海镇的市政厅，向联盟求援，而最高议会宁愿此事不要声张。派他来的是大法师茉德拉，她需要一个懂得保密的人。\n\n燃烧军团把达拉然夷为平地之后，肯瑞托重建了这座城市，从此一直把外人拒之门外。如今城里出了岔子，严重到他们顾不上这些，还是开口求助了。"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare came to Tarren Mill to study, but the Undercity has more urgent work for him. Four Forsaken thieves are locked up in the mages' prison camp on Lordamere Lake, and Wordeen has questions about the city behind it.\n\nThe Kirin Tor rebuilt Dalaran right on the Dark Lady's doorstep and have kept the Forsaken out ever since. Wordeen would very much like to know what they keep in there."] = "大法师沃迪恩·伍德格莱尔来塔伦米尔本是为了做研究，可幽暗城有更紧要的差事交给他。四个被遗忘者窃贼被关在洛丹米尔湖畔的法师监狱营地里，而沃迪恩对营地后面的那座城市也有些疑问。\n\n肯瑞托就在黑暗女王的家门口重建了达拉然，从此一直不让被遗忘者进去。沃迪恩非常想知道，他们在里面藏了些什么。"
L["Alterac Mountains / City of Dalaran"] = "奥特兰克山脉 / 达拉然城"
L["An Alarming Request"] = "紧急求援"
L["Emissary Jacques"] = "使者雅克"
L["the town hall, Southshore, Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "市政厅，南海镇，希尔斯布莱德丘陵"
L["the Violet Citadel, Dalaran, Alterac Mountains"] = "紫罗兰城堡，达拉然，奥特兰克山脉"
L["the Park, Stormwind City"] = "公园（暴风城）"
L["the top of the Wizard's Sanctum, Mage Quarter, Stormwind City"] = "巫师圣殿顶层，法师区，暴风城"
L["by the Dalaran sewers on Lordamere Lake, Silverpine Forest"] = "洛丹米尔湖畔的达拉然下水道旁，银松森林"
L["Emissary Jacques has come down from Dalaran to the town hall in Southshore, asking the Alliance for help. The Kirin Tor rarely ask anyone for anything, and their high council would rather this stayed quiet."] = "使者雅克从达拉然下山，来到南海镇的市政厅向联盟求援。肯瑞托很少有求于人，他们的最高议会也宁愿这件事不要声张。"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare came to Tarren Mill to study, but has more pressing work. Four Forsaken robbed the Undercity and fled to Dalaran, where the mages locked them in a camp by Lordamere Lake. Wordeen is curious about the city, too."] = "大法师沃迪恩·伍德格莱尔来塔伦米尔是为了做研究，但眼下有更要紧的事。四个被遗忘者洗劫了幽暗城，逃到了达拉然，法师们把他们关进了洛丹米尔湖畔的一座营地。沃迪恩对那座城市也很好奇。"
L["There's a Kirin Tor emissary in the town hall in Southshore, Jacques, with the look of a man sent to ask for something his betters would rather not ask for. Something had knocked Dalaran's ley lines loose, and the city's constructs had started breaking things instead of minding them. The high council wanted it kept quiet. Archmage Modera wanted help, and had sent Jacques to find some.\n\nSo I went up to Lordamere Lake and found Modera, or a shimmering image of her, waiting by the water outside the city. The Kirin Tor don't let outsiders in, she told me, but just now they couldn't afford to turn anyone away. The guards on the walls looked calm. Modera warned me not to read anything into that."] = "南海镇的市政厅里有个肯瑞托的使者，叫雅克，一看就是被派来求一件他的上司们宁可不求的事。有什么东西把达拉然的魔力线震松了，城里的构造体不再看管东西，反倒开始砸东西。最高议会想把这事捂住。大法师茉德拉想找帮手，就派雅克出来找。\n\n于是我上了洛丹米尔湖，在城外的水边找到了茉德拉，确切地说，是她的一个闪着微光的影像。她告诉我，肯瑞托不让外人进城，可眼下他们谁也拒绝不起。城墙上的守卫看上去很镇定。茉德拉提醒我，别从这一点上看出什么来。"
L["Magus Wordeen came to Tarren Mill to study and ended up running the Dark Lady's errands. Four Forsaken had robbed a vault in the Undercity and fled to Dalaran, and the mages had locked them up in the Lordamere Internment Camp. So I broke into a prison to rob the prisoners. The last of them, Kegan Darkmar, was kept under guard in a house, and the warden's footlocker in there held a grimy key. \"A sewer key?\" said Wordeen, plainly glad he wouldn't be the one using it.\n\nOnce I'd thinned out the wizards patrolling the old ruins, Wordeen had news. Dalaran's barrier was down, and the sewers on the city's northern edge might not be warded. At the entrance stood an image of Archmage Modera, who told me to put my weapon away. She'd been counting on the Horde taking an interest, and she had a proposition."] = "大法师沃迪恩来塔伦米尔是为了做研究，结果成了替黑暗女王跑腿的。四个被遗忘者洗劫了幽暗城的一座金库，逃去了达拉然，法师们把他们关进了洛丹米尔收容所。于是我闯进一座监狱，为的是抢劫囚犯。最后一个叫凯根·达克玛，被看押在一栋房子里，房里典狱长的箱子里有一把脏兮兮的钥匙。“下水道钥匙？”沃迪恩说，显然很庆幸要用它的人不是他。\n\n我把在旧废墟里巡逻的巫师清理掉一批之后，沃迪恩有了消息。达拉然的屏障失效了，城北边缘的下水道可能没有设防。入口处站着大法师茉德拉的影像，她让我把武器收起来。她早就料到部落会对这里感兴趣，而她有个提议。"
L["Prison Break In"] = "入室偷窃"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare"] = "大法师沃迪恩·伍德格莱尔"
L["Key to the City"] = "城市大门钥匙"
L["Dalaran Patrols"] = "达拉然巡逻队"
L["Blood in the Streets"] = "喋血街头"
L["Archmage Modera's image, by Dalaran's sewers on Lordamere Lake, has a key for you and a quiet way into the city. In Stormwind, Shylamiir and High Sorcerer Andromath each have an errand in Dalaran as well."] = "大法师茉德拉的影像就在洛丹米尔湖畔的达拉然下水道旁，她有一把钥匙要给你，还有一条悄悄进城的路。在暴风城，莎拉米尔和高阶巫师安多玛斯也各有一件差事要在达拉然办。"
L["Archmage Modera's image, waiting outside Dalaran's sewers, has a proposition for the Horde. Melisara in Tarren Mill has Forsaken business in the city, and Doctor Martin Felben in the Undercity would like some samples."] = "大法师茉德拉的影像正在达拉然的下水道外等候，她有个提议要给部落。塔伦米尔的梅里萨拉在城里有被遗忘者的事务要处理，幽暗城的马丁·费尔本医生则想要些样本。"
L["Modera's image handed me a sewer key and a plan. The trouble had started at the top of the Violet Citadel, the wards were barely holding, and the Kirin Tor were too busy propping them up to deal with anything else. I was to come in quietly through the sewers and meet her at the citadel.\n\nQuietly lasted as far as the sewers. The streets above were thick with loose magic and constructs that had forgotten whose side they were on. Modera herself, the real one, was waiting on the citadel steps, and she opened a portal up to the Violet Chamber for us.\n\nUp there the Shade of the Archmage was holding the Arcane Mote, and it took some persuading to let go. I carried the mote back out to the lake for her image to look over. It seemed pleased, as far as you can tell with an image."] = "茉德拉的影像交给我一把下水道钥匙和一个计划。麻烦是从紫罗兰城堡顶上开始的，结界勉强撑着，肯瑞托忙着给结界撑腰，别的什么都顾不上。我要悄悄从下水道进去，到城堡跟她会合。\n\n“悄悄”只撑到了下水道。上面的街道上到处是失控的魔法，还有忘了自己站哪边的构造体。茉德拉本人，真的那个，正在城堡的台阶上等着，她为我们开了一道通往紫罗兰密室的传送门。\n\n上面，大法师之影抓着奥术微粒，得好好劝一劝才肯撒手。我把微粒带回湖边，给她的影像过目。它看上去挺满意，如果影像也看得出满意的话。"
L["Modera's proposition was plain enough. She doubted the Horde had Dalaran's best interests at heart, and she'd take our help anyway, since if Dalaran fell the Undercity would go with it. She enchanted my sewer key to get past her wards and told me to meet her at the Violet Citadel. The Kirin Tor would be far too busy to stop me. I could help myself to what I found on the way, as long as I remembered what I'd come for.\n\nUnder the streets and up through the city we went, with every construct in Dalaran trying to tidy us away. Modera opened a portal from the citadel steps, and at the top the Shade of the Archmage gave up the Arcane Mote. I didn't hand it to Modera. I took it home to Wordeen in Tarren Mill."] = "茉德拉的提议说得很直白。她不相信部落真心为达拉然着想，但还是愿意接受我们的帮助，因为达拉然要是倒了，幽暗城也跑不掉。她给我的下水道钥匙施了魔法，好让它通过她的结界，然后让我到紫罗兰城堡跟她会合。肯瑞托会忙得根本顾不上拦我。路上找到什么，我都可以随手拿走，只要记得自己是为什么来的。\n\n我们从街道底下钻过去，又穿过整座城往上走，达拉然的每一个构造体都想把我们当杂物收拾掉。茉德拉在城堡的台阶上开了一道传送门，到了顶上，大法师之影交出了奥术微粒。我没把它交给茉德拉。我把它带回了塔伦米尔，交给了沃迪恩。"
L["Heart of Disruption"] = "动乱之源"
L["Image of Archmage Modera"] = "大法师茉德拉的影像"
L["Starving Arcane"] = "饥渴的奥术"
L["The breach had scrambled the enchantments and factotums all over Dalaran, the ones keeping up its defenses included, and all that loose magic drew in rogue elementals looking for a free meal. Modera, busy with the wards, asked me to thin out what she called the elemental throng. I worked through the remnants and the mana echoes until the throng was a good deal thinner."] = "裂口把达拉然各处的魔法造物和杂役傀儡都搅乱了，连维持城防的那些也不例外，这么多散逸的魔法又引来了一群想白吃一顿的失控元素。茉德拉忙着维持结界，便请我去清理一下她所说的“元素群”。我一路收拾那些残渣和法力回响，直到这群东西稀疏了不少。"
L["A Green Sample"] = "绿色样本"
L["Shylamiir"] = "莎拉米尔"
L["Shylamiir, the herbalism trainer in Stormwind's park, was annoyed to be disturbed and decided I might as well be useful. Dalaran's mages had taken up botany, the Kirin Tor keep to themselves, and Shylamiir wanted a sample from the city's central garden. The garden had gone fel, with a fel ancient rooted in the middle of it. I came back with one Fel Infused Blossom and a low opinion of Dalaran's gardeners."] = "莎拉米尔是暴风城公园里的草药学训练师，被人打扰很是不快，干脆决定让我派点用场。达拉然的法师们迷上了植物学，肯瑞托又向来关起门来过日子，所以莎拉米尔想要一份城中央花园的样本。那座花园已经被邪能侵染了，正中间还扎根着一棵邪能古树。我带回来一朵注入邪能的花朵，还有对达拉然园丁的一肚子意见。"
L["Power Overwhelming"] = "势不可挡"
L["High Sorcerer Andromath"] = "高阶巫师安多玛斯"
L["High Sorcerer Andromath in Stormwind was worried about the Kirin Tor. They had kept to themselves since Archimonde flattened their city, and now they were rebuilding it with arcane energy leaking out everywhere. If the Alliance didn't help, it could lose one of its strongest allies. So I went after the worst of the leaks, a mana elemental called the Arcanic Enigma, and dispersed it."] = "暴风城的高阶巫师安多玛斯很担心肯瑞托。自从阿克蒙德把他们的城市夷为平地，他们就一直关起门来过日子，现在他们正在重建，奥术能量却四处外泄。联盟要是不伸手帮一把，可能就会失去一个最强大的盟友。于是我去对付其中最严重的一处泄漏，一个名叫奥能之谜的法力元素，把它打散了。"
L["The Grave Knight"] = "墓穴骑士"
L["Melisara"] = "梅里萨拉"
L["Melisara in Tarren Mill didn't care what became of Dalaran. What she cared about was Atrexis, a traitor to the Forsaken and a frighteningly good necromancer, raising an army of the dead in the city's underbelly under the Kirin Tor's noses. She wanted it understood that the Dark Lady's reach goes everywhere. I found Atrexis down in the sewers and passed the message on."] = "塔伦米尔的梅里萨拉根本不在乎达拉然会怎么样。她在乎的是阿特雷克斯，一个背叛了被遗忘者、死灵法术又精通得吓人的家伙，正在城市的底层，就在肯瑞托的眼皮底下召集一支亡灵大军。她要让人明白，黑暗女王的手伸得到任何地方。我在下水道里找到了阿特雷克斯，把这句话带到了。"
L["Opportunistic Education"] = "投机教育"
L["Rexxie Copperclutch"] = "雷克希·铜抓"
L["just inside the Dalaran sewers"] = "达拉然下水道入口内"
L["Just inside the sewers I met Rexxie Copperclutch, a goblin who took one look at me and decided we were in the same line of work. Rexxie's plan was to lift a secret arcane tome from the mages' libraries and split the profits. I brought back The Founding of Dalaran. Rexxie said it would barely sell at a tourist stall and asked whether I'd just grabbed the first book on the shelf. I had. It's being gilded and sold as an archmage's anyway."] = "刚进下水道，我就遇到了雷克希·铜抓，一个地精，看了我一眼就认定我们是同行。雷克希的计划是从法师们的图书馆里偷一本秘传的奥术典籍，然后分赃。我带回来的是《达拉然的建立》。雷克希说这玩意儿在游客摊位上都卖不出价，问我是不是随手抓了书架上的第一本。我是。反正它现在正被镀上金边，当作某位大法师的藏书出售。"
L["Source of Power"] = "力量之源"
L["Doctor Martin Felben"] = "马丁·费尔本医生"
L["Doctor Martin Felben in the Apothecarium heard that Dalaran's own constructs were attacking it and saw an opportunity. An army of arcane-powered abominations, he reasoned, would impress the Dark Lady and might get him the Royal Apothecary Society to run. The constructs weren't going to hand over their cores, so I took six cracked ones without asking. Felben was delighted, which is never a good sign."] = "炼金房的马丁·费尔本医生听说达拉然自己的构造体在攻击这座城，觉得这是个机会。照他的推论，一支以奥术驱动的憎恶大军能让黑暗女王刮目相看，没准还能让他接手皇家药剂师协会。构造体不会乖乖交出核心，所以我没打招呼就拿了六个开裂的。费尔本高兴坏了，这从来都不是什么好兆头。"
L["The Arcane Mote"] = "奥术微粒"
L["Archmage Modera thinks it only fair that you carry the good word, and the mote, to Archmage Celindra in the Violet Citadel. The Council of Six may not like how Modera went about things."] = "大法师茉德拉认为，由你把好消息连同微粒一起带给紫罗兰城堡的大法师塞琳德拉，才算公平。六人议会未必喜欢茉德拉的行事方式。"
L["Magus Wordeen Voidglare in Tarren Mill thinks the Kirin Tor will pay anything to get the mote back, and he knows what he wants for it. Take it to Archmage Modera's image outside Dalaran and see what the mages offer."] = "塔伦米尔的大法师沃迪恩·伍德格莱尔认为，为了拿回微粒，肯瑞托出什么价都肯，而他很清楚自己想要什么。把它带到达拉然城外大法师茉德拉的影像那里，看看法师们开出什么条件。"
L["Modera admitted the Council of Six wouldn't be pleased to hear what she'd been doing behind their backs. She also didn't think they could argue with the results. The city had settled enough for the wards to come down, and she thought it only fair that I be the one to deliver the good word, so this time I went in through the front with the mote in my pack.\n\nArchmage Celindra greeted me in the Violet Citadel with \"Yes? I am quite busy.\" The mote got her attention. I left the citadel a friend of the Kirin Tor, which is more than most people get for going in through the sewers."] = "茉德拉承认，六人议会要是听说她背着他们干的事，不会高兴。可她也不认为他们能对结果说三道四。城里已经安定到可以撤下结界了，她觉得由我去报这个好消息才算公平，所以这一次，我背着装有微粒的背包，从正门走了进去。\n\n紫罗兰城堡里的大法师塞琳德拉用一句“什么事？我很忙。”迎接了我。微粒让她提起了兴趣。我离开城堡时成了肯瑞托之友，对一个从下水道钻进来的人来说，这待遇比大多数人强多了。"
L["Wordeen had been thinking while I was away. Sneaking into the city of mages was all very well, he said, but it was time to negotiate. The Kirin Tor knew things that made his own research look thin, and he wanted the Horde let into their order. The mote was his price, and he was sure they would pay anything to get it back.\n\nSo I carried it back out to Modera's image by the lake, under orders to drive a hard bargain with an archmage whose city I'd just helped save. The mote went back to its owners. The Horde got a promise that there might be room for it in Dalaran one day, and Wordeen will have to make that last."] = "我不在的时候，沃迪恩一直在琢磨。他说，偷偷溜进法师之城固然不错，但现在该谈判了。肯瑞托知道的东西，让他自己的研究显得很单薄，他想让部落也能加入他们的组织。微粒就是他开的价，他确信为了拿回它，他们什么都肯付。\n\n于是我把它带回湖边交给茉德拉的影像，奉命跟一位大法师狠狠讨价还价，而她的城市我刚刚帮着救下来。微粒回到了主人手里。部落得到了一个承诺，说总有一天，达拉然也许会有部落的一席之地。沃迪恩只能靠这句话撑上一阵子了。"
L["Friend of the Kirin Tor"] = "肯瑞托之友"
L["Shrewd Negotiations"] = "精明的谈判"
L["Lost in the Thicket"] = "迷失灌木丛"
L["A dig crew went up into the Wetlands highlands, and the news coming back down has dried up. In Menethil Harbor and in Lakeshire, families are waiting to hear from people who went up there. At Hammerfall there's a rumor that the Dragonmaw are planning something in the same hills.\n\nRethiel the Greenwarden says the land up there is sick. The Deathstalkers want someone to go and look before they move."] = "一支挖掘队上了湿地的高地，从那里传下来的消息断了。在米奈希尔港和湖畔镇，都有人家在等上山的亲人捎来音讯。落锤镇那边则有传闻说，龙喉氏族正在同一片山里谋划着什么。\n\n绿色守卫者雷希耶尔说，那上面的土地病了。亡灵哨兵想先找个人去看看，再决定是否行动。"
L["Caitlin Grassman's husband went up into the Wetlands highlands to see a grass a dig crew had told him about, and he hasn't come home to Menethil Harbor. In Lakeshire, Dorin Songblade's brother took a crew of diggers into the same hills, and his letters have stopped coming.\n\nOut in the marsh, Rethiel the Greenwarden can feel something wrong with the land, and the creatures up in the hills are taking it badly."] = "凯特林·格拉斯曼的丈夫上了湿地的高地，去看一支挖掘队跟他说起的一种草，至今没有回到米奈希尔港。在湖畔镇，多林·桑布雷德的兄弟带着一队挖掘工进了同一片山，他的信也不再寄来了。\n\n在沼泽深处，绿色守卫者雷希耶尔能感觉到这片土地出了问题，而山上的生灵对此反应很糟。"
L["Word has reached Hammerfall that the Dragonmaw are planning something in the Wetlands, and the Deathstalkers want to know more before they move. Their agent is waiting in the hills above the Dragonmaw camp for anyone with the nerve to help.\n\nIn Orgrimmar, Borstan has seen the size of the raptor talons coming back from a dig in the Wetlands highlands, and would like to know how the rest of the raptor tastes."] = "落锤镇收到消息，说龙喉氏族正在湿地谋划着什么，亡灵哨兵想多了解一些再行动。他们的密探就在龙喉营地上方的山头上，等着有胆量的人去帮忙。\n\n在奥格瑞玛，波尔斯坦见过从湿地高地的挖掘场运回来的迅猛龙爪子有多大，很想知道这种迅猛龙身上其他部位是什么味道。"
L["Wetlands / Excavation Site: Wetlands"] = "湿地 / 挖掘场：湿地"
L["Tramping Paws"] = "践踏之爪"
L["Rethiel the Greenwarden"] = "绿色守卫者雷希耶尔"
L["east of the Dun Modr road, Wetlands"] = "丹莫德大路以东，湿地"
L["Whelgar's Excavation Site, Wetlands"] = "维尔加挖掘场（湿地）"
L["the hills above the Dragonmaw camp, Wetlands"] = "龙喉营地上方的山头，湿地"
L["the Drag, Orgrimmar"] = "暗巷区（奥格瑞玛）"
L["the Skywatcher Plateau, Mulgore"] = "观天者台地（莫高雷）"
L["The Greenwarden"] = "绿色守卫者"
L["Out in the marsh east of the Dun Modr road lives Rethiel the Greenwarden, who watches over the Wetlands and could use a hand. First Mate Fitzsimmons in Menethil Harbor knows the way, but would rather you didn't go."] = "丹莫德大路以东的沼泽里，住着守护湿地的绿色守卫者雷希耶尔，眼下正缺个帮手。米奈希尔港的大副菲兹西蒙斯认得路，不过宁愿你别去。"
L["Rethiel the Greenwarden lives out in the marsh east of the Dun Modr road, and told me the roots and ferns spoke well of me. I've had worse references. The land was weeping from festered wounds, Rethiel said, and I was to heal it.\n\nMost of the wound was Mosshide gnolls. There were more of them all the time, cutting down trees and warming themselves with the burning wood, so I thinned them out and took away the flints they used to start their fires. Rethiel meant to smash every one and throw the pieces into the sea.\n\nThe fen creepers were the rest of it. Rethiel called them blisters on the land and wanted them settled back into the marsh, and I obliged. By the end the Greenwarden's faith in my people, which had been tested before, was coming back."] = "绿色守卫者雷希耶尔住在丹莫德大路以东的沼泽里，说树根和蕨草都对我评价不错。我拿到过比这差的推荐信。雷希耶尔说，这片土地正因溃烂的伤口而哭泣，要我去治好它。\n\n伤口大半是藓皮豺狼人。它们越来越多，砍倒树木，再烧着木头取暖，所以我把它们清理掉一批，又拿走了它们用来生火的打火石。雷希耶尔打算把这些打火石一块块砸碎，再把碎片扔进海里。\n\n剩下的是沼泽爬行者。雷希耶尔管它们叫大地上的脓疱，想让它们重新安息在沼泽里，我照办了。到最后，绿色守卫者对我族人的信心，那份曾经受过考验的信心，又回来了。"
L["First Mate Fitzsimmons"] = "大副菲兹西蒙斯"
L["First Mate Fitzsimmons in Menethil Harbor knew where to find the Greenwarden, out in the marsh east of the Dun Modr road, and seemed to hope I wasn't really going. I was. The first mate also told me to leave my money behind. I kept it, and the Greenwarden never mentioned it."] = "米奈希尔港的大副菲兹西蒙斯知道去哪儿找绿色守卫者，就在丹莫德大路以东的沼泽里，而且似乎盼着我其实不会去。我去了。大副还让我把钱留下再走。我没留，绿色守卫者也从没提过这事。"
L["Fire Taboo"] = "火焰管制"
L["Blisters on the Land"] = "大地上的脓疱"
L["Young Crocolisk Skins"] = "小鳄鱼皮"
L["James Halloran"] = "詹姆斯·哈洛兰"
L["James Halloran, the tanner in Menethil Harbor, ships cured crocolisk skins to ports all over the world and was running short of the soft ones that come off young crocolisks. I went out into the marsh and came back with a stack. Halloran called them superb and wanted to start curing them at once, but had more work for me first."] = "米奈希尔港的制皮匠詹姆斯·哈洛兰把鞣好的鳄鱼皮运往世界各地的港口，眼下正缺小鳄鱼身上那种软皮。我去沼泽里转了一圈，带回来一摞。哈洛兰说这些皮好极了，恨不得马上动手鞣制，不过在那之前，还有别的活要我干。"
L["The Highland Dig"] = "高地挖掘场"
L["Caitlin Grassman in Menethil Harbor hasn't seen her husband since he went up into the highlands, and Dorin Songblade in Lakeshire hasn't heard from his brother, who led a dig crew into the same hills. Rethiel the Greenwarden is worried about those hills too."] = "米奈希尔港的凯特林·格拉斯曼自从丈夫上了高地，就再没见过他；湖畔镇的多林·桑布雷德也一直没有兄弟的消息，他的兄弟带着一支挖掘队进了同一片山。绿色守卫者雷希耶尔也在为那片山担心。"
L["Zaruk at Hammerfall has heard the Dragonmaw are planning something in the Wetlands, and a Deathstalker agent is waiting in the hills above their camp for help. Borstan in Orgrimmar wants meat from the raptors at the dig in the highlands."] = "落锤镇的扎鲁克听说龙喉氏族正在湿地谋划着什么，一名亡灵哨兵密探正在他们营地上方的山头等人帮忙。奥格瑞玛的波尔斯坦则想要高地挖掘场那些迅猛龙的肉。"
L["So there's an alchemist in Menethil Harbor, Caitlin Grassman, whose husband climbs mountains to pick her herbs. When a dig crew came through talking about towering grass in the highlands, he went to see it and stayed gone.\n\nDorin Songblade, the armorer in Lakeshire, had a brother up in those hills with diggers from Loch Modan. Dorin would have gone along if not for a pile of girdles to refit. His brother always wrote, and this time he hadn't.\n\nThe dig was in shambles after a run of accidents. Caitlin's husband was alive and very glad to see me. Dorin's brother was in a tent, dead. He had Dorin's face, and DLS carved into the stock of his gun.\n\nFor the Greenwarden I brought back the root core of a Highland Horror. Something ancient was stirring under those hills, Rethiel said, and the diggers should stop digging for their own good."] = "米奈希尔港有个炼金师，叫凯特林·格拉斯曼，她丈夫会爬上山去替她采草药。有一支挖掘队路过，说起高地上有高得吓人的草，他就去看了，然后一去不回。\n\n湖畔镇的护甲匠多林·桑布雷德有个兄弟，带着洛克莫丹来的挖掘工在那片山里。要不是有一堆腰带等着改，多林本来也会一起去。他兄弟向来会写信，这一回却没有。\n\n接连出了几次事故之后，挖掘场一片狼藉。凯特林的丈夫还活着，见到我高兴极了。多林的兄弟躺在一顶帐篷里，已经死了。他长着和多林一样的脸，枪托上刻着DLS。\n\n我给绿色守卫者带回了一只高地恐魔的根核。雷希耶尔说，那片山底下有什么古老的东西正在苏醒，挖掘工为了自己好，该停手了。"
L["Word reached Hammerfall that the Dragonmaw were planning a show in the Wetlands, the kind where a dragon is made to do as it's told. The Deathstalkers won't move on a rumor, so I met their agent in the hills above the camp. She asked if I was the courageous few and told me to keep my voice down.\n\nThe Dragonmaw at the dig thought they'd found a way back to power. I cleared out enough of them for the Deathstalkers to slip in and took a dispatch off one of their casters, which the agent snatched out of my hand. They were hoping to win over Rend. She called that a waste of effort and the news well worth the Dark Lady's time. I'm not to talk about the mission, so I'll stop there.\n\nBorstan in Orgrimmar got the raptor meat and wondered what those raptors had been eating to marble like that."] = "落锤镇收到消息，说龙喉氏族打算在湿地搞一场表演，就是逼着一头龙乖乖听话的那种。亡灵哨兵不会凭一句传闻就行动，所以我去营地上方的山头见了他们的密探。她问我是不是“少数勇者”，又叫我说话小声点。\n\n挖掘场里的龙喉兽人以为自己找到了重掌权力的门路。我清掉了足够多的龙喉兽人，好让亡灵哨兵溜进去，又从他们的一个施法者身上拿到一份急件，密探一把就从我手里抢了过去。他们希望拉拢雷德。她说这是白费力气，但这消息很值得黑暗女王花时间听一听。这次任务我不能多谈，就说到这儿吧。\n\n奥格瑞玛的波尔斯坦拿到了迅猛龙肉，琢磨着那些迅猛龙平时都吃了些什么，才长出这么漂亮的雪花纹。"
L["Seeking Caitlin"] = "寻访凯特林"
L["Llana"] = "兰娜"
L["Llana, who sells reagents in Astranaar, swaps notes on rare plants with an alchemist in Menethil Harbor. The alchemist's last letter said her husband had joined a dig that was turning up signs of some long-lost grass, and then said nothing more about it. So I sailed to the Wetlands to ask. Caitlin Grassman guessed Llana was wondering about the seeds she'd been promised, but she had a bad feeling about that dig herself."] = "阿斯特兰纳卖施法材料的兰娜，常和米奈希尔港的一位炼金师交换珍稀植物的笔记。那位炼金师在上一封信里说，她丈夫加入了一支挖掘队，那里挖出了某种失传已久的草的痕迹，之后就再也没提这事。于是我坐船去了湿地问个究竟。凯特林·格拉斯曼猜兰娜是在惦记答应给的种子，不过她自己对那个挖掘场也有种不好的预感。"
L["Lost in the Thicket Things"] = "迷失在灌木丛中"
L["Caitlin Grassman"] = "凯特林·格拉斯曼"
L["Songblade Search"] = "寻找桑布雷德"
L["Dorin Songblade"] = "多林·桑布雷德"
L["Horrors in the Highland"] = "高地的恐魔"
L["Highland Hides"] = "高地兽皮"
L["James Halloran had heard about the ruins up in the highlands and the raptors living around them. The raptors could hide all they liked, as far as Halloran was concerned, so long as they had hides. I brought back four. They'll make good trim, I'm told, and I got to try on the tanner's stock and pick something in trade."] = "詹姆斯·哈洛兰听说了高地上的废墟，还有住在废墟周围的迅猛龙。在哈洛兰看来，那些迅猛龙爱怎么藏就怎么藏，只要身上有皮就行。我带回来四张。听说这些皮能做成上好的镶边，而我还能试穿制皮匠的存货，挑一件作为交换。"
L["Dragonmaw Rumors"] = "龙喉氏族的流言"
L["Open the Maw"] = "撬开龙喉"
L["Deathstalker Agent"] = "亡灵卫兵密探"
L["Changing Tastes"] = "口味的变迁"
L["Borstan"] = "波尔斯坦"
L["Carried Home"] = "带回家"
L["Ardin Grassman, at the far end of the dig, has something for you to carry home to his wife in Menethil Harbor. In Lakeshire, Dorin Songblade is waiting to hear about his brother."] = "在挖掘场的尽头，阿丁·格拉斯曼有样东西要你带回米奈希尔港，交给他的妻子。在湖畔镇，多林·桑布雷德正等着他兄弟的消息。"
L["Caitlin's husband needed a rest before he could walk out on his own, along the path I'd cleared. While he rested he braided some reeds into a heart and asked me to take it to her, and to tell her he'd be home soon. Caitlin held it close and started planning him a hearty supper.\n\nBefore I left the dig I covered Daewyn with his cloak. Then I went to Lakeshire and told Dorin. He blamed himself for staying behind. He'd been making gear for his brother as a surprise, and finished it after Daewyn had already gone. He couldn't bring himself to sell it or rework it, so he gave it to me."] = "凯特林的丈夫得先歇一歇，才能沿着我清出来的路自己走出去。歇着的时候，他用芦苇编了一颗心，托我带给她，还要我告诉她，他很快就回家。凯特林把它紧紧捧在怀里，开始盘算给他做一顿丰盛的晚饭。\n\n离开挖掘场之前，我用戴温的斗篷盖住了他。然后我去了湖畔镇，告诉了多林。多林怪自己当初留了下来。他一直在给兄弟做一套装备，想给对方一个惊喜，可等他做完，戴温已经动身走了。他既不忍心卖掉，也不忍心改制，就把它给了我。"
L["Heartwoven"] = "心之编织"
L["Ardin Grassman"] = "阿丁·格拉斯曼"
L["Excavation Site: Wetlands"] = "挖掘场：湿地"
L["Fallen in the Fen"] = "命丧沼泽"
L["Daewyn Songblade"] = "戴温·桑布雷德"
L["Old Light"] = "古老之光"
L["Something at the far end of the dig is worth carrying out, if you can get to it. Prospector Whelgar's excavation site in the Wetlands is close by, and the prospector will want a close look at whatever you bring."] = "挖掘场尽头有样东西值得带出来，前提是你能到得了那儿。湿地的勘察员维尔加的挖掘场就在附近，不管你带回什么，这位勘察员都会想仔细看看。"
L["Something at the far end of the dig is worth carrying out, if you can get to it. The elders on Thunder Bluff's Elder Rise know old things better than anyone, and will want to see it."] = "挖掘场尽头有样东西值得带出来，前提是你能到得了那儿。雷霆崖长者高地上的长者们比谁都懂古老的东西，一定会想看看。"
L["The stone machine at the far end of the dig left a piece of itself behind when it went down. It was made of something I'd never handled and threw light around like a kaleidoscope, so I took it to Whelgar's camp outside. The prospector was impressed I'd lived and wanted a good look at it.\n\nThe marks on it looked like titan work. A find like that belonged in the Hall of Explorers, Whelgar said, with the finder's name written in the museum catalogue. High Explorer Magellas admired the keepers' marks on it and wrote my name down. There's a catalogue in Ironforge with me in it now, right next to a rock."] = "挖掘场尽头的那台石头机器倒下时，留下了自己的一块碎片。它的材质我从没摸过，还像万花筒一样四处折射光芒，所以我把它带到了外面维尔加的营地。这位勘察员对我能活着回来很是佩服，想好好看一看它。\n\n上面的纹路看起来像泰坦的手笔。维尔加说，这样的发现应该送进探险者大厅，发现者的名字也要写进博物馆的目录。资深探险家麦格拉斯欣赏了上面守护者的印记，记下了我的名字。现在，铁炉堡有一本目录里写着我，就在一块石头旁边。"
L["The stone machine at the far end of the dig left a shard of itself behind when it went down. It threw light around like a kaleidoscope and felt older than anything I'd ever held, and the people who know about old things live on the Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff.\n\nBashana Runetotem called it fascinating, more than a carving, and sent me on to Muln Earthfury of the Earthen Ring, up on the Skywatcher Plateau. Muln said there were memories in its light, and that it had waited lifetimes to be understood. The Earthen Ring will look after it and study it, and pass on what it has to say once they can hear it."] = "挖掘场尽头的那台石头机器倒下时，留下了自己的一块碎片。它像万花筒一样四处折射光芒，摸起来比我拿过的任何东西都古老，而懂得古老东西的人，都住在雷霆崖的长者高地上。\n\n巴珊娜·符文图腾说它很迷人，不只是一件雕刻，然后让我去找大地之环的穆恩·大地之怒，就在观天者台地上。穆恩说它的光里有记忆，它已经等了好几辈子，等着被人理解。大地之环会照看它、研究它，等他们能听懂了，再把它要说的话传下去。"
L["Lost Relic Carry"] = "送交失落圣物"
L["Prehistoric Prism"] = "史前棱镜"
L["Prospector Whelgar"] = "勘察员维尔加"
L["Elder Knowledge"] = "长者的智慧"
L["Earthen Echo"] = "大地的回音"
L["Bashana Runetotem"] = "巴珊娜·符文图腾"
L["An Ancient Grudge"] = "远古的宿怨"
L["Beldin Steelgrill in Kharanos has heard about a campfire on the hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry, high up where it looks down over the whole quarry. It's probably nothing, but Beldin would like someone to go up and see who's sitting by it.\n\nFrom there the trail leads back to Ironforge and down beneath it, past the High Seat to the Hall of Thanes, a part of the city most visitors never see. Take a few friends along for that."] = "卡拉诺斯的贝尔丁·钢架听说，古博拉采掘场上方的山上有一堆篝火，位置很高，能俯瞰整个采掘场。多半没什么事，不过贝尔丁还是想找个人上去看看，是谁坐在火边。\n\n从那里出发，线索会把你带回铁炉堡，再往下深入地底，经过王座大厅，一直到领主大厅，那是这座城里大多数访客从没见过的地方。去那里的时候，带上几个朋友。"
L["Dun Morogh / Ironforge"] = "丹莫罗 / 铁炉堡"
L["A Visitor to Dun Morogh"] = "丹莫罗的访客"
L["Beldin Steelgrill"] = "贝尔丁·钢架"
L["Steelgrill's Depot, Kharanos, Dun Morogh"] = "钢架补给站，卡拉诺斯，丹莫罗"
L["the Tundrid Hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry, Dun Morogh"] = "古博拉采掘场上方的坦德利丘陵，丹莫罗"
L["Old Ironforge, beneath the High Seat, Ironforge"] = "王座大厅下方的旧铁炉堡，铁炉堡"
L["the bridge before the Hall of Thanes, Old Ironforge, Ironforge"] = "领主大厅前的桥，旧铁炉堡，铁炉堡"
L["Farsen's Watch"] = "法森的守望"
L["Beldin Steelgrill at Steelgrill's Depot in Kharanos has heard about a fire burning on the high ground above Gol'Bolar Quarry, to the east. It's probably a harmless camp, and Beldin would still like someone to climb up and say hello, one way or the other."] = "卡拉诺斯钢架补给站的贝尔丁·钢架听说，东边古博拉采掘场上方的高地上燃着一堆火。多半只是个无害的营地，但贝尔丁还是希望有人爬上去打个招呼，不管结果如何。"
L["The camp on the hill above Gol'Bolar Quarry belonged to Earthseer Farsen, a Wildhammer visiting from Aerie Peak, who greeted me like an old friend. Farsen had noticed Dark Irons creeping around Dun Morogh and, instead of explaining, lent me far sight. I floated over the hills for a while looking down at spies and troggs. There were more of them, Farsen said, than you can see from the sky.\n\nSo I went east to Ironband's Compound and dealt with the spies. One carried a map of tunnels that all met under Ironforge, marked in Dark Iron runes I couldn't read. Then the wind spoke to me in a dwarf's voice and said Farsen needed to see it.\n\nI took it back up the hill. The spies had been scouts, according to the earthseer, and the Dark Irons meant to break into the city's vaults. I was told to hurry."] = "古博拉采掘场上方山头的营地，属于大地先知法森，一位从鹰巢山来访的蛮锤矮人，招呼我就像招呼老朋友一样。法森注意到黑铁矮人在丹莫罗四处潜行，却没有解释，而是把远视之力借给了我。我在山丘上空飘了一阵，俯瞰着底下的间谍和穴居人。法森说，实际的数量比从天上看到的还要多。\n\n于是我往东去了铁环营地，解决了那些间谍。其中一个带着一张地道图，所有地道都在铁炉堡底下交汇，上面标着我看不懂的黑铁符文。接着，风用一个矮人的声音对我说，法森需要看看这张图。\n\n我把它带回了山上。照大地先知的说法，那些间谍只是斥候，黑铁矮人打算闯进城里的宝库。我被告知要抓紧。"
L["Beldin Steelgrill in Kharanos had heard from a mountaineer about a fire up on the hills above Gol'Bolar Quarry. Probably nothing, Beldin said. If the campers were friendly, no harm done, and if they weren't, I'd know how to handle it."] = "卡拉诺斯的贝尔丁·钢架听一个登山者说，古博拉采掘场上方的山上有一堆火。贝尔丁说，多半没什么事。要是露营的人友善，那就没什么损失；要是不友善，我也知道该怎么对付。"
L["Earthseer Farsen"] = "大地先知法森"
L["Nip 'Em in the Bud"] = "防患于未然"
L["Underground Map"] = "地下地图"
L["the Dark Iron Spies, Ironband's Compound, Dun Morogh"] = "黑铁间谍所在地，铁环营地，丹莫罗"
L["The Hall of Thanes"] = "领主大厅"
L["Earthseer Farsen is sure the Dark Irons are after Ironforge's vaults, and their map's tunnels meet in the Hall of Thanes, beneath the High Seat. Take friends and get there first. King Magni, an old friend of Farsen's, will want a report."] = "大地先知法森确信黑铁矮人盯上了铁炉堡的宝库，而他们地图上的地道都在王座大厅底下的领主大厅交汇。带上朋友，抢先赶到那里。麦格尼国王是法森的老朋友，会想听你的报告。"
L["Off the High Seat, past a lot of cobwebs and a fair bit of lava, is the Hall of Thanes, where Ironforge keeps its old lords. Lorekeeper Afadra Dunwall had work to do down there and no patience for ghosts. Something had woken the dead, and I was to settle them.\n\nMost of them were just angry. One was polite. A ghostly attendant begged me to help Faldrim Anvilmar, the thane, who couldn't rest for an old grudge. Faldrim had no interest in resting. My friends and I insisted.\n\nI brought the Dark Iron commander's head up to King Magni, with the earthseer's regards, along with a tablet I'd found behind a vault door. It was the treaty that ended the War of the Three Hammers. Magni pointed out that the Bronzebeards and the Wildhammers both signed it, and the Dark Irons never did."] = "从王座大厅出去，穿过一大堆蛛网和不少岩浆，就是领主大厅，铁炉堡把它的古代领主都安置在那里。博学者阿法德拉·丹沃尔在底下有活要干，对鬼魂毫无耐心。有什么东西惊醒了死者，我得让他们安分下来。\n\n大多数鬼魂只是在发怒。有一个很有礼貌。一位鬼魅随从恳求我帮帮领主法德林·安威玛尔，他因为一桩旧怨无法安息。法德林对安息毫无兴趣。我和朋友们坚持要他安息。\n\n我把黑铁指挥官的头颅带上去交给了麦格尼国王，附上大地先知的问候，还有一块我在一扇宝库门后面找到的石板。那是结束三锤之战的条约。麦格尼指出，铜须和蛮锤都在上面签了字，而黑铁从来没签过。"
L["Old Ironforge Incursion"] = "旧铁炉堡入侵"
L["Afadra Dunwall"] = "阿法德拉·丹沃尔"
L["Important Heirlooms"] = "重要的传家宝"
L["Thom Filch"] = "汤姆·菲尔奇"
L["Thom Filch, a gnome by the bridge, claimed to have been patrolling the vaults when the Dark Irons came up from below in mole machines and left valuables lying about. Important cultural heirlooms, Thom called them, rubbing both hands together, and every one would be catalogued and returned to its proper place. I collected eight. Thom paid as promised, and afterward I found I was better thought of in Gadgetzan, which is a long way from Ironforge."] = "汤姆·菲尔奇是桥边的一个侏儒，声称黑铁矮人坐着钻地机从地底冒出来的时候，自己正在宝库巡逻，结果他们把贵重物品丢得到处都是。汤姆管这些叫重要的文化遗产，一边说一边搓着两只手，还说每一件都会登记造册，物归原处。我收集了八件。汤姆照约定付了钱，后来我发现自己在加基森的名声变好了，那地方离铁炉堡可远着呢。"
L["Ghostly Attendant"] = "鬼魅随从"
L["the Hall of Thanes, Ironforge"] = "领主大厅（铁炉堡）"
L["The Treaty of Understanding"] = "谅解条约"
L["the Reliquary of Kings, the Hall of Thanes"] = "诸王圣物室（领主大厅）"
L["Blackfathom Villainy"] = "黑暗深渊中的恶魔"
L["On Ashenvale's Zoram Strand, the ruins of an old night elf temple run down under the sea. The naga have moved into its flooded halls, and the rumors say they aren't alone down there.\n\nThe Argent Dawn wants to know what is going on in Blackfathom Deeps, and so does the Earthen Ring. Both could use someone willing to go in and look."] = "在灰谷的佐拉姆海岸，一座古老的暗夜精灵神殿的废墟一直延伸到海底。纳迦已经搬进了它被淹没的大厅，而传闻说，下面不止有它们。\n\n银色黎明想知道黑暗深渊里发生了什么，大地之环也一样。双方都需要一个愿意进去看看的人。"
L["Rumors have reached Darnassus that the naga in Blackfathom Deeps, a drowned temple on the coast of Ashenvale, have joined forces with the Twilight's Hammer. The Argent Dawn sent a scout to look into it weeks ago and is still waiting for a report.\n\nStart with Dawnwatcher Shaedlass, at the Argent Dawn's embassy in Darnassus. Ironforge and Auberdine each have an errand down there as well."] = "有传闻传到了达纳苏斯，说黑暗深渊里的纳迦已经和暮光之锤联手，那是灰谷海岸边一座被淹没的神殿。银色黎明几周前就派了一名斥候去调查，至今还在等报告。\n\n先去达纳苏斯的银色黎明大使馆找哨兵沙德拉斯。铁炉堡和奥伯丁也各有一件差事要在那下面办。"
L["At Zoram'gar Outpost, on the coast of Ashenvale, Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring needs help. A little way up the strand lies Blackfathom Deeps, a drowned temple full of naga, and the naga have been prying crystals out of its walls. Je'neu would like to know why.\n\nTsunaman, at Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains, can send you on your way."] = "在灰谷海岸的佐拉姆加前哨站，大地之环的耶努萨克雷需要帮助。沿着海岸往前走不远，就是黑暗深渊，一座满是纳迦的被淹没的神殿，而那些纳迦一直在从墙上撬水晶。耶努想知道这是为什么。\n\n石爪山脉烈日石居的图纳曼可以送你上路。"
L["Ashenvale / Darnassus / Stonetalon Mountains / Thunder Bluff / Blackfathom Deeps"] = "灰谷 / 达纳苏斯 / 石爪山脉 / 雷霆崖 / 黑暗深渊"
L["Blackfathom Deeps"] = "黑暗深渊"
L["Trouble in the Deeps"] = "帮助耶努萨克雷"
L["Tsunaman"] = "图纳曼"
L["Sun Rock Retreat, Stonetalon Mountains"] = "烈日石居（石爪山脉）"
L["Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale"] = "佐拉姆加前哨站（灰谷）"
L["the Argent Dawn's embassy, Craftsmen's Terrace, Darnassus"] = "银色黎明大使馆，工匠区，达纳苏斯"
L["inside Blackfathom Deeps, Zoram Strand, Ashenvale"] = "黑暗深渊内部，佐拉姆海岸，灰谷"
L["Tsunaman, at Sun Rock Retreat in the Stonetalon Mountains, has word that Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring needs help. Je'neu is at Zoram'gar Outpost, far off on the western shore of Ashenvale, where the Horde isn't especially welcome."] = "石爪山脉烈日石居的图纳曼得到消息，大地之环的耶努萨克雷需要帮助。耶努在佐拉姆加前哨站，远在灰谷的西海岸，那里的人可不怎么欢迎部落。"
L["Tsunaman, up at Sun Rock Retreat, had word that Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring needed help on the coast of Ashenvale, and gave me directions to match. Through Windshear Crag or north through the Barrens, then west across the forest until it runs out at the sea. I was also told to be careful, which for the Horde in Ashenvale goes without saying.\n\nZoram'gar Outpost is a small camp on the Zoram Strand. Je'neu was there and pleased that Tsunaman had sent help. We had matters to discuss, he said, and most of them were up the beach in Blackfathom Deeps."] = "烈日石居的图纳曼得到消息，大地之环的耶努萨克雷在灰谷海岸需要帮助，给我指的路也跟这事一样远。穿过风剪峭壁，或者往北穿过贫瘠之地，然后向西横穿森林，一直走到森林在海边到头为止。图纳曼还叮嘱我小心，对身在灰谷的部落来说，这话根本不用说。\n\n佐拉姆加前哨站是佐拉姆海岸上的一座小营地。耶努就在那里，很高兴图纳曼派了帮手来。他说我们有些事要谈，大部分都在海滩那头的黑暗深渊里。"
L["Dawnwatcher Shaedlass, at the Argent Dawn's embassy in Darnassus, sent a scout to Blackfathom Deeps weeks ago and is still waiting for a report. Argent Guard Manados, at the same embassy, wants the Twilight's Hammer down there paid a visit."] = "达纳苏斯银色黎明大使馆的哨兵沙德拉斯几周前派了一名斥候去黑暗深渊，至今还在等报告。同一座大使馆里的银月守卫玛纳杜斯，希望有人去下面拜访一下暮光之锤。"
L["Je'neu Sancrea, at Zoram'gar Outpost, has heard that the naga of Blackfathom Deeps are prying sapphires off the walls of its first tunnels, and would rather they stopped. The Deeps lie a short way north along the Zoram Strand."] = "佐拉姆加前哨站的耶努萨克雷听说，黑暗深渊的纳迦正在从入口那几条隧道的墙上撬蓝宝石，希望它们住手。黑暗深渊就在沿佐拉姆海岸往北不远的地方。"
L["The Argent Dawn keeps an embassy in Darnassus, and one of its Dawnwatchers, Shaedlass, had mislaid a scout. Thaelrid had gone to Blackfathom Deeps weeks before to look into the naga and the Twilight's Hammer and hadn't reported back. A guard standing nearby asked me to bring back some cultists' pendants while I was at it.\n\nI found Thaelrid far inside, alive and out of strength. The place had been a temple of Elune, Thaelrid said, until the corruption of an Old God seeped up into its moonwell and the Old God's servant rose out of the water. Now the cult and the naga held it together, and the cult's leader, Kelris, was sacrificing innocents to that servant for power.\n\nI took the head of Kelris back to Darnassus. The Argent Dawn had long since put him down as dead or missing, and I'd made half of that true."] = "银色黎明在达纳苏斯设有一座大使馆，那里有位哨兵叫沙德拉斯，把一名斥候给弄丢了。塞尔瑞德几周前去黑暗深渊调查纳迦和暮光之锤，一直没回来报告。旁边站着的一名守卫请我顺便带些教徒的坠饰回来。\n\n我在深处找到了塞尔瑞德，还活着，但已经精疲力竭。塞尔瑞德说，这里曾是艾露恩的神殿，直到一位上古之神的腐化渗进了月亮井，那位上古之神的仆从从水中升起。如今暮光教派和纳迦一起盘踞在这里，教派的首领克尔里斯正把无辜者献祭给那个仆从，换取力量。\n\n我把克尔里斯的头颅带回了达纳苏斯。银色黎明早就把他记作死亡或失踪了，我让其中一半成了真。"
L["Je'neu Sancrea started me off just inside the Deeps, where the naga had been prying sapphires off the cave walls. I pried them off first. Je'neu could feel water spirits clinging to them, and wanted a fathom core from the flooded ruins too.\n\nIn the Deeps I also came by a damp note in very poor handwriting. All the priestesses were to bring the crystals to whoever wrote it, and with their power, one day, the world would return to the rule of the Old Gods. The note gave Je'neu a name to go with the trouble, Lorgus Jett of the Twilight's Hammer. I found Lorgus in the Deeps, and that was the end of that plan.\n\nFurther in, an Argent Dawn guard who could barely stand asked me to take the head of the cult's leader, Kelris, to Thunder Bluff. I did, and the tauren there were thoroughly disgusted with him."] = "耶努萨克雷让我先从黑暗深渊的入口附近着手，那里的纳迦一直在从洞壁上撬蓝宝石。我抢在它们前头撬了下来。耶努能感觉到水之灵附着在上面，还想要被淹没的废墟里的一颗深渊之核。\n\n在深渊里，我还捡到一张潮湿的便笺，字迹潦草得厉害。所有女祭司都要把水晶交给写这张便笺的人，凭借水晶的力量，总有一天，世界将回归上古之神的统治。这张便笺让耶努给这桩麻烦对上了一个名字，暮光之锤的洛古斯·杰特。我在深渊里找到了洛古斯，那个计划也就到此为止了。\n\n再往里走，一名几乎站不起来的银色黎明守卫请我把教派首领克尔里斯的头颅送到雷霆崖。我送去了，那里的牛头人对他厌恶透顶。"
L["In Search of Thaelrid"] = "寻找塞尔瑞德"
L["Dawnwatcher Shaedlass"] = "哨兵沙德拉斯"
L["Argent Guard Thaelrid"] = "银月守卫塞尔瑞德"
L["Twilight Falls"] = "暮光之锤的末日"
L["Argent Guard Manados"] = "银月守卫玛纳杜斯"
L["Knowledge in the Deeps"] = "深渊中的知识"
L["Gerrig Bonegrip, down in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge, collects lore. Old lore, the sort that opens doorways and can wake Those Who Sleep. Gerrig had heard the Lorgalis Manuscript was lying at the bottom of Blackfathom Deeps and promised not to forget me for it, not even after the end days. I brought it up. Gerrig was overjoyed and is having copies made for all the brothers and sisters, whoever they are."] = "铁炉堡荒弃的洞穴里的葛利·硬骨收集学识。古老的学识，那种能打开门户、能唤醒沉睡者的东西。葛利听说洛迦里斯手稿就躺在黑暗深渊的最底层，答应我绝不会忘了这份功劳，就算到了末日也不会。我把它带了上来。葛利欣喜若狂，正在给所有的兄弟姐妹抄写副本，不管他们是谁。"
L["Researching the Corruption"] = "研究堕落"
L["Gershala Nightwhisper"] = "戈沙拉·夜语"
L["Gershala Nightwhisper, in Auberdine, is worried about the blood elves and their demon magic, and wanted to know what the same sort of thing had already done to the naga and the satyrs. Blackfathom Deeps has plenty of both, so I came back with eight corrupted brain stems. Gershala thanked me for my selflessness and got straight to work. I left before the work got interesting."] = "奥伯丁的戈沙拉·夜语很担心血精灵和他们的恶魔魔法，想知道同样的东西已经对纳迦和萨特造成了什么影响。黑暗深渊里这两样都多得是，所以我带回来八块堕落者的脑干。戈沙拉感谢我的无私，马上动手干了起来。在活儿变得有意思之前，我就走了。"
L["The Heart of the Void"] = "虚空之心"
L["Blackfathom Pearl"] = "黑暗深渊珍珠"
L["the depths of Blackfathom Deeps, Ashenvale"] = "黑暗深渊深处，灰谷"
L["Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. When it died it left a pearl behind, and Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus called the kill the stuff of real heroes. The pearl went off to be studied at once, for whatever it could tell about the Void."] = "越过克尔里斯，在深渊的最深处，等着的是上古之神的仆从阿库麦尔。它死后留下了一颗珍珠，达纳苏斯的哨兵塞尔高姆说，这一仗是真正英雄的手笔。珍珠立刻被送去研究，看它能透露多少关于虚空的事。"
L["The Essence of Aku'Mai"] = "阿库麦尔水晶"
L["Je'neu Sancrea"] = "耶努萨克雷"
L["Amongst the Ruins"] = "废墟之间"
L["Allegiance to the Old Gods"] = "上古之神的仆从"
L["Damp Note"] = "潮湿的便笺"
L["Blackfathom Deeps, Ashenvale"] = "黑暗深渊（灰谷）"
L["Baron Aquanis"] = "阿奎尼斯男爵"
L["Strange Water Globe"] = "奇怪的水球"
L["Baron Aquanis, a water elemental in the Deeps, left a strange globe behind when it fell. Foul water sloshed about inside, and nothing I did would so much as scratch it. Je'neu Sancrea had long suspected the Baron of being corrupted, and said the globe would show by what, and how. I came away with the Earthen Ring's warmest regards and something more useful besides."] = "阿奎尼斯男爵是深渊里的一个水元素，倒下时留下了一个奇怪的水球。里面晃荡着污浊的水，我怎么弄都没法在上面留下一道划痕。耶努萨克雷早就怀疑男爵受了腐化，说这个水球能显示出它是被什么腐化的，又是怎么腐化的。我带走了大地之环最热情的问候，还有些更实用的东西。"
L["Past Kelris, at the far end of the Deeps, waited Aku'mai, the servant of the Old Gods. It left a pearl behind when it died, and Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff called that a mighty service to all of Kalimdor. The pearl was to be studied at once, for what it might say about the Void, and I was sent off to walk with the Earth Mother."] = "越过克尔里斯，在深渊的最深处，等着的是上古之神的仆从阿库麦尔。它死后留下了一颗珍珠，雷霆崖的巴珊娜·符文图腾说，这是对整个卡利姆多的莫大贡献。珍珠要立刻拿去研究，看它能透露些什么关于虚空的事，而我在一句“愿大地母亲与你同行”中被打发上了路。"
L["The Mad King"] = "疯王"
L["Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to a trogg invasion and a radiation leak, and its people fled to Tinker Town in Ironforge. The machines they left behind are still running down there.\n\nThe exiles want a cure, and their belongings back. In Orgrimmar, the goblins have heard about a new gnomish rig and want its blueprints. Either errand takes you all the way to the bottom of the city."] = "诺莫瑞根是侏儒们在丹莫罗地下的城市，因为穴居人入侵和辐射泄漏而沦陷，城里的居民逃到了铁炉堡的侏儒区。他们留下的机器至今仍在下面运转。\n\n流亡者们想要解药，也想拿回自己的东西。在奥格瑞玛，地精们听说了一种新型的侏儒钻探设备，想弄到它的蓝图。不管接哪件差事，都得一路下到城市的最底层。"
L["Gnomeregan, the gnomes' city under Dun Morogh, was lost to troggs and a radiation leak, and its people now live as exiles in Tinker Town, in Ironforge. Gnoarn, one of them, lost a splendid head of hair in the leak and wants the city back.\n\nStart with Gnoarn, and follow the exiles' requests down into Gnomeregan, where High Tinker Mekkatorque has business of his own."] = "诺莫瑞根是侏儒们在丹莫罗地下的城市，因为穴居人和辐射泄漏而沦陷，城里的居民如今流亡在铁炉堡的侏儒区。其中一位叫诺恩，在泄漏中失去了一头漂亮的头发，想要夺回城市。\n\n先去找诺恩，然后顺着流亡者们的请求深入诺莫瑞根，大工匠梅卡托克在那里也有自己的事要办。"
L["Two years ago, gnome engineering was mostly good for a punch line. Now the gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints.\n\nThe blueprints are in Gnomeregan, under the mountains of Dun Morogh, a long way from home. Sovik, beside Nogg, knows a faster way in than walking."] = "两年前，侏儒的工程学基本上只配当笑料。如今侏儒造出了一种比任何地精伐木机都好的钻探设备，而奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的诺格想要它的蓝图。\n\n蓝图在诺莫瑞根，在丹莫罗的群山底下，离家很远。诺格身边的索维克知道一条比走路快的路。"
L["Ironforge / Dun Morogh / Orgrimmar / Stranglethorn Vale / Gnomeregan"] = "铁炉堡 / 丹莫罗 / 奥格瑞玛 / 荆棘谷 / 诺莫瑞根"
L["The Day After"] = "灾难之后"
L["Gnoarn"] = "诺恩"
L["Tinker Town, Ironforge"] = "侏儒区（铁炉堡）"
L["the Cathedral of Light, Stormwind"] = "光明大教堂（暴风城）"
L["Darnassus"] = "达纳苏斯"
L["Windshear Crag, Stonetalon Mountains"] = "风剪峭壁（石爪山脉）"
L["the Valley of Honor, Orgrimmar"] = "荣誉谷（奥格瑞玛）"
L["Gnoarn, in Tinker Town in Ironforge, lost a magnificent head of hair to the radiation leak in Gnomeregan and blames the troggs for all of it. He thinks the city can still be saved, and Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos is working on how."] = "铁炉堡侏儒区的诺恩在诺莫瑞根的辐射泄漏中失去了一头漂亮的头发，并把这一切都怪到穴居人头上。他认为这座城市还有救，而卡拉诺斯的奥齐·电环正在研究怎么救。"
L["There's a gnome in Tinker Town called Gnoarn, bald as an egg, who will tell you that before the radiation leak in Gnomeregan he had the only gnomefro in all of Azeroth. Then he shakes his fist and curses the troggs.\n\nHe sent me to Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos, who stood right beside him when the bolt hit and remembers the hair coming out in clumps. Ozzie and a partner called Razzle were close to some kind of cure, or else the recipe for a very strong rum, and couldn't say which until they'd tested it.\n\nThe test needed fallout off the irradiated troggs around Gnomeregan, so I filled a leaden phial with the green glow. Ozzie had a captured leper gnome lined up to be cured, and was expecting a full head of hair on the side. I was told to stand back, and I stood well back."] = "侏儒区有个叫诺恩的侏儒，秃得像个鸡蛋，他会告诉你，在诺莫瑞根辐射泄漏之前，他顶着全艾泽拉斯独一无二的侏儒爆炸头。说完他就挥着拳头诅咒穴居人。\n\n他让我去找卡拉诺斯的奥齐·电环，那道辐射击中时，奥齐就站在他旁边，还记得他的头发一撮一撮地往下掉。奥齐和一个叫拉佐的搭档已经快研究出某种解药了，要么就是一种劲儿很大的朗姆酒的配方，不试一下他们也说不准是哪个。\n\n试验需要诺莫瑞根周围那些受辐射的穴居人身上的放射尘，所以我往一个铅瓶里灌满了那种绿光。奥齐已经抓来一个麻风侏儒，准备拿来治病，顺便还指望能长出一头浓密的头发。我被告知站远点，我站得远远的。"
L["Gnogaine"] = "诺恩"
L["Ozzie Togglevolt"] = "奥齐·电环"
L["The Transpolyporter"] = "多极传送器"
L["Gnomes have built a rig better than any goblin shredder, and Nogg, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, wants the blueprints out of Gnomeregan. Gnomeregan is a long walk through dwarf country. Sovik, beside Nogg, has a quicker way to send you."] = "侏儒造出了一种比任何地精伐木机都好的钻探设备，而奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的诺格想要从诺莫瑞根弄出它的蓝图。去诺莫瑞根得穿过矮人的地盘走很远的路。诺格身边的索维克有更快的办法把你送过去。"
L["Nogg was sore about gnomes. Two years ago their engineering was mostly good for a punch line, and now they'd built a rig better than every goblin shredder. Nogg wanted the blueprints, which were locked in a safe deep in Gnomeregan, and only the mekgineer sitting beside it knew the combination.\n\nSovik, next to Nogg, had the travel sorted. Sovik and a partner in Booty Bay had built the Transpolyporter 6000 for the trip.\n\nThe partner was Scooty, who showed the machine off like a new boat and said it had only exploded a dozen or so times. If it went up with me on it, I was promised, it would be quick and painless. Scooty tuned a goblin transponder to my size and weight and mentioned a few side effects, none of them permanent anymore. After that, all I had to do was step on the pad."] = "诺格一提起侏儒就来气。两年前，他们的工程学基本上只配当笑料，现在他们却造出了一种比所有地精伐木机都好的钻探设备。诺格想要那份蓝图，蓝图锁在诺莫瑞根深处的一个保险箱里，只有坐在旁边的那位机械师知道密码。\n\n诺格旁边的索维克已经把路线安排好了。索维克和藏宝海湾的一个搭档为这趟旅程造了一台多极传送器6000型。\n\n那个搭档就是斯库提，炫耀这台机器就像炫耀一艘新船，说它总共才爆炸过十来次。我得到保证，要是它连我一起炸了，过程会又快又不疼。斯库提按我的身高体重调好了一台地精传送器，还提了几种副作用，说现在已经没有一种是永久性的了。之后，我只需要踩上传送台就行。"
L["Rig Wars"] = "设备之战"
L["Nogg"] = "诺格"
L["Chief Engineer Scooty"] = "主工程师斯库提"
L["Sovik"] = "索维克"
L["Gnomer-gooooone!"] = "出发！诺莫瑞根！"
L["Scooty"] = "斯库提"
L["The King of Nothing"] = "一无所有的国王"
L["Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos isn't finished with Gnomeregan's fallout, and the exiles in Tinker Town have a long list of things left behind in the city. High Tinker Mekkatorque, in Tinker Town, has a harder job, at the very bottom of it."] = "卡拉诺斯的奥齐·电环还没跟诺莫瑞根的放射尘打完交道，侏儒区的流亡者们也列了一长串落在城里的东西。侏儒区的大工匠梅卡托克手上的活更难，就在城市的最底层。"
L["Nogg's blueprints are in a safe at the bottom of Gnomeregan, and the only one with the combination is the mekgineer who sits beside it. Between you and the safe lies a whole city of troggs and machines that never got switched off."] = "诺格要的蓝图在诺莫瑞根最底层的一个保险箱里，唯一知道密码的，是坐在保险箱旁边的那位机械师。在你和保险箱之间，隔着一整座满是穴居人和从没关掉过的机器的城市。"
L["Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."] = "奥齐对我第一瓶东西的评价是量不够，剩下的那点也已经不纯了。那些穴居人发的光还不够亮。我得直接从源头取货，从诺莫瑞根深处的软泥怪和恐魔身上弄，而那玩意儿你多看它一眼都会分解。我试了不止一次才装进瓶子。事后奥齐把我上下打量了一遍，对我四肢俱全颇为佩服。\n\n大工匠梅卡托克曾经信任机械师瑟玛普拉格，而瑟玛普拉格背叛了大工匠，背叛了跟着大工匠的每一个侏儒，夺走了这座城市。大工匠管他叫“一无所有的国王”。任务是杀了他。\n\n我一路下到最底层，干掉了他。梅卡托克喜欢认为，瑟玛普拉格脑子里闪过的最后一样东西是我的脚，我也没找到什么理由去纠正这个说法。"
L["The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."] = "侏儒们已经离开了诺莫瑞根，可他们的机器还在运转，穿过那地方花了好一阵子。\n\n知道诺格要的密码的机械师就是瑟玛普拉格，待在最底层，不见客。我用硬办法从他身上拿到了密码，打开了他旁边的保险箱。钻探设备的蓝图就在里面。\n\n诺格说早就知道我办得到，还特意让我知道，索维克曾经有过怀疑。然后诺格清了清嗓子，说到了正题。那台设备里的每一项侏儒创新，都会被拆开来研究，直到变成地精的创新，下一批伐木机会把这些全都装上。"
L["Ozzie's verdict on my first phial was that there wasn't enough in it and what there was had gone impure. The troggs weren't glowing hard enough. I was to get it straight from the tap, off the slimes and horrors deep in Gnomeregan, and that stuff falls apart if you look at it wrong. It took more than one try to bottle. Ozzie looked me over afterwards, impressed that I still had all my limbs.\n\nHigh Tinker Mekkatorque had trusted Mekgineer Thermaplugg, and Thermaplugg had betrayed him and every gnome with him and taken the city. King of nothing, the High Tinker called him. The job was to kill him.\n\nI went all the way down and did it, and brought his engineering notes back for the High Tinker. Mekkatorque likes to think the last thing through Thermaplugg's head was my foot, and I've seen no reason to correct that."] = "奥齐对我第一瓶东西的评价是量不够，剩下的那点也已经不纯了。那些穴居人发的光还不够亮。我得直接从源头取货，从诺莫瑞根深处的软泥怪和恐魔身上弄，而那玩意儿你多看它一眼都会分解。我试了不止一次才装进瓶子。事后奥齐把我上下打量了一遍，对我四肢俱全颇为佩服。\n\n大工匠梅卡托克曾经信任机械师瑟玛普拉格，而瑟玛普拉格背叛了大工匠，背叛了跟着大工匠的每一个侏儒，夺走了这座城市。大工匠管他叫“一无所有的国王”。任务是杀了他。\n\n我一路下到最底层，干掉了他，还把他的工程学笔记带回来交给了大工匠。梅卡托克喜欢认为，瑟玛普拉格脑子里闪过的最后一样东西是我的脚，我也没找到什么理由去纠正这个说法。"
L["The gnomes are gone from Gnomeregan, but their machines kept running, and getting through the place took a while.\n\nThe mekgineer with Nogg's combination was Thermaplugg, at the very bottom, and he wasn't taking callers. I took the combination off him the hard way and opened the safe beside him. The rig blueprints were inside. Thermaplugg's engineering notes came out with me too, and those went to Nogg as well.\n\nNogg had known all along I could do it, and wanted me to know that Sovik had had doubts. Then Nogg cleared his throat and got to the point. Every gnomish innovation in that rig would be pulled apart and studied until it was a goblin innovation, and the next shredders would carry the lot."] = "侏儒们已经离开了诺莫瑞根，可他们的机器还在运转，穿过那地方花了好一阵子。\n\n知道诺格要的密码的机械师就是瑟玛普拉格，待在最底层，不见客。我用硬办法从他身上拿到了密码，打开了他旁边的保险箱。钻探设备的蓝图就在里面。瑟玛普拉格的工程学笔记也被我一并带了出来，同样交给了诺格。\n\n诺格说早就知道我办得到，还特意让我知道，索维克曾经有过怀疑。然后诺格清了清嗓子，说到了正题。那台设备里的每一项侏儒创新，都会被拆开来研究，直到变成地精的创新，下一批伐木机会把这些全都装上。"
L["The Only Cure is More Green Glow"] = "更多的辐射尘！"
L["The Grand Betrayal"] = "大叛徒"
L["High Tinker Mekkatorque"] = "大工匠梅卡托克"
L["Thermaplugg's Engineering Notes"] = "瑟玛普拉格的工程学笔记"
L["Tinkmaster Overspark"] = "工匠大师欧沃斯巴克"
L["Brother Sarno"] = "萨尔诺修士"
L["Save Techbot's Brain!"] = "拯救尖端机器人！"
L["Tinkmaster Overspark built Techbot to help out around Gnomeregan, and when the city fell a stray spark flipped its positronic brain to negatronic, so every kind habit it had now runs backwards. I brought Overspark its memory core. Overspark told the core not to feel bad, promised to have it fixed, and went looking for the plug to a hydro-jack swivel spanner."] = "工匠大师欧沃斯巴克造了尖端机器人，在诺莫瑞根帮忙打杂，城市陷落时，一颗乱窜的火花把它的正电子大脑翻成了负电子大脑，于是它所有的好习惯现在都反着来。我把它的存储器核心带给了欧沃斯巴克。欧沃斯巴克叫核心别难过，保证会把它修好，然后就去找液压旋转扳手的插头了。"
L["Klockmort's Essentials"] = "帮助科劳莫特"
L["Mathiel"] = "玛希尔"
L["Essential Artificials"] = "基础模组"
L["Klockmort Spannerspan"] = "科劳莫特·钢尺"
L["In the rush out of Gnomeregan, the gnomes left behind every last essential artificial, a little part their tinkers and smiths used in nearly everything. Klockmort Spannerspan in Tinker Town needed a dozen for some new experiments, and they were deep in the city, shut up in things called artificial extrapolators. I opened enough of them. Klockmort said my bravery had moved gnomish research forward by a leap and a bound."] = "侏儒们匆忙逃出诺莫瑞根时，把所有的基础模组都落下了，那是他们的工匠和铁匠几乎每样东西都要用上的小零件。侏儒区的科劳莫特·钢尺需要十二个来做些新实验，而它们都在城市深处，关在一种叫模组推演器的东西里。我打开了足够多的推演器。科劳莫特说，我的勇气让侏儒的研究突飞猛进。"
L["Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators"] = "陀螺式挖掘机"
L["Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind had a whole fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to get to Dun Morogh and nowhere near enough parts. By Shoni's account the robots in Gnomeregan roam about like cattle on an open range, so I went and rounded up two dozen sets of robo-mechanical guts. Shoni was pleased. That was one excavationator fixed, with 398 to go."] = "暴风城的舒尼有一整队陀螺式挖掘机要运到丹莫罗，零件却远远不够。照舒尼的说法，诺莫瑞根的机器人就像开阔牧场上的牛群一样四处游荡，所以我去围拢了二十四副机械内胆。舒尼很高兴。这下修好了一台挖掘机，还剩三百九十八台。"
L["Castpipe's Task"] = "卡斯派普的任务"
L["Gaxim Rustfizzle"] = "加克希姆·锈嘶"
L["Gaxim Rustfizzle in Stonetalon, a proud member of the Enlightened Assembly of Arcanology, Alchemy and Engineering Sciences, sent me to Ironforge to help Master Mechanic Castpipe. Castpipe wasn't in the Assembly, Gaxim conceded, but was smart enough that the job had an eighty-four percent chance of being important. Good odds, by Gaxim's reckoning."] = "石爪山脉的加克希姆·锈嘶是奥术、炼金与工程科学启蒙协会的一名自豪会员，派我去铁炉堡帮大机械师卡斯派普的忙。加克希姆承认，卡斯派普不是协会成员，但足够聪明，所以这份差事有百分之八十四的可能很重要。按加克希姆的算法，这概率相当不错。"
L["Data Rescue"] = "抢救数据"
L["Master Mechanic Castpipe"] = "大机械师卡斯派普"
L["Master Mechanic Castpipe had left a great deal of data behind in Gnomeregan and wanted one piece of it back, on a prismatic punch card from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D deep in the city. Getting into that terminal meant clearance from the lesser ones, and each of those wanted a punch card the gnomes had also left behind. I worked my way up from white to prismatic. Castpipe called the data immeasurably important and said my service would be long remembered. I couldn't tell you what was on it."] = "大机械师卡斯派普在诺莫瑞根落下了大量数据，想拿回其中一份，存在城市深处一台矩阵打孔计算机3005-D型的彩色穿孔卡片上。要进那台终端，得先拿到低级终端的权限，而每台低级终端都要一张侏儒们同样落在城里的穿孔卡片。我从白色卡片一路换到了彩色卡片。卡斯派普说这些数据重要得无法估量，还说我的贡献会被长久铭记。至于上面到底是什么，我也说不上来。"
L["A Fine Mess"] = "一团混乱"
L["Kernobee"] = "克努比"
L["Kernobee woke up among the troggs, where some Dark Iron dwarves had thrown the poor wretch after a beating, and wanted out. I led the way to the Clockwerk Run exit, and from there Kernobee made for Ratchet with word that the Dark Irons had a hand in that super rig. Telling Scooty in Booty Bay was my part. Scooty rewarded me, a touch grudgingly, with gear meant to help against that good-for-nothing backstabber Thermaplugg."] = "克努比在穴居人中间醒了过来，这个可怜的家伙被几个黑铁矮人揍了一顿，扔到了那里，一心只想出去。我带路走到发条小径的出口，克努比从那儿动身去棘齿城，带去了黑铁矮人插手那台超级钻探设备的消息。告诉藏宝海湾的斯库提是我的事。斯库提给了我奖励，稍微有点不情愿，是一些用来对付那个一无是处、背后捅刀的瑟玛普拉格的装备。"
L["Grime-Encrusted Ring"] = "脏兮兮的戒指"
L["One of the Dark Iron dwarves in Gnomeregan was carrying a ring so caked in grime that I couldn't tell what it was made of, though something under there had a gleam. The gnomes holding out in the city have a machine for exactly that, the Sparklematic 5200. I put the ring in and paid. It ground and jerked about so violently I worried for it, then stopped with a cheerful ding and opened to show a small box tied with a red bow. It gift wraps, too."] = "诺莫瑞根的一个黑铁矮人身上带着一枚戒指，结满了污垢，我连它是什么材质都看不出来，不过底下有什么东西在闪光。城里坚守的侏儒们正好有一台专干这个的机器，超级清洁器5200型。我把戒指放进去，付了钱。机器嘎吱作响，剧烈地抖来抖去，我都替它担心，然后它欢快地“叮”了一声停下，打开后露出一个系着红色蝴蝶结的小盒子。它还管包礼物。"
L["The Sparklematic 5200!"] = "超级清洁器5200型！"
L["The Sparklematic 5200"] = "超级清洁器5200型"
L["the Clean Zone, Gnomeregan"] = "清洁区（诺莫瑞根）"
L["The plaque on the Sparklematic 5200 promises to put the shine back in shine-tastic, for three silver a go. I had a grime-encrusted find of my own from the city, so in it went with the coins. The machine surged to life, and its frame groaned as it lurched from side to side, as if it meant to wander off with my valuables."] = "超级清洁器5200型上的铭牌保证，每次只要三枚银币，就能让闪亮重新闪亮起来。我从城里也带出了一件脏兮兮的东西，于是把它和硬币一起塞了进去。机器猛地启动，机身左摇右晃，嘎吱作响，好像打算带着我的贵重物品自己走掉。"
L["Return of the Ring"] = "戒指归来"
L["Inside the band of the cleaned ring were the seal of Ironforge and the initials TdK, which led me to Talvash del Kissel in the Mystic Ward. He knew it at once. He'd made several like it in a little shop in Gnomeregan before the city went up, and this one might have belonged to someone who never got out. When I said a Dark Iron had been carrying it, Talvash reckoned that put a new layer of conspiracy on the nine already floating about, and that the authorities ought to hear."] = "清洗干净的戒指内侧刻着铁炉堡的印记和缩写TdK，这让我找到了秘法区的塔瓦斯德·基瑟尔。他一眼就认了出来。在城市毁灭之前，他在诺莫瑞根的一家小店里做过好几枚这样的戒指，这一枚的主人也许没能逃出来。我说是一个黑铁矮人带着它的，塔瓦斯德认为，这给原本就满天飞的九层阴谋又添了一层，应该让当局知道。"
L["Gnome Improvement"] = "侏儒的手艺"
L["Talvash offered to improve the ring for thirty silver, which became thirty silver plus a silver bar and a moss agate, since his own stock had dried up. I brought them. He added a silver and agate lattice and swore he'd normally charge ten times as much. One day, once he's out of the hole he's unjustly in, he means to make the finest trinkets in Azeroth for everyone."] = "塔瓦斯德提出花三十银币帮我改良这枚戒指，后来变成了三十银币外加一块银锭和一块苔藓玛瑙，因为他自己的存货已经用光了。我把东西带了过去。他加了一道银和玛瑙的格纹，发誓说平时要收十倍的价钱。他打算总有一天，等他从这个被冤枉陷进去的困境里爬出来，给所有人打造全艾泽拉斯最好的饰品。"
L["Inside the band of the cleaned ring were the seal of Orgrimmar and three letters still legible, NOG. I knew a Nogg in the Valley of Honor. It wasn't Nogg's ring, as it happened, but the Dark Iron part interested Nogg a great deal. Maybe, Nogg reckoned, the gnomes had stolen the Dark Irons' crazy golem plans to build that rig, and the Dark Irons would be wanting payback."] = "清洗干净的戒指内侧刻着奥格瑞玛的印记，还有三个依稀可辨的字母，NOG。我认识荣誉谷的一个诺格。结果那并不是诺格的戒指，不过诺格对黑铁矮人那部分非常感兴趣。诺格琢磨着，也许侏儒是偷了黑铁矮人那些疯狂的傀儡设计图，才造出了那台钻探设备，而黑铁矮人会想要报复。"
L["Nogg's Ring Redo"] = "诺格的手艺"
L["For the tip about the Dark Irons, Nogg offered to improve the ring, which was probably the simple work of some gnome. I brought the silver bar and moss agate Nogg asked for, plus thirty silver for the trouble, and got the ring back with a silver and agate lattice and more magic in it than before. Nogg reckoned the Dark Irons were a fair lead on how the gnomes had suddenly come down with goblin-like inspiration."] = "作为黑铁矮人那条消息的回报，诺格提出要改良这枚戒指，反正那多半只是哪个侏儒的简单手艺。我带来了诺格要的银锭和苔藓玛瑙，外加三十银币辛苦费，拿回来的戒指多了一道银和玛瑙的格纹，魔力也比以前更强了。诺格认为，侏儒怎么突然有了地精式的灵感，黑铁矮人是条不错的线索。"
L["Hidden Enemies"] = "隐藏的敌人"
L["Thrall will not tolerate traitors in Orgrimmar, and he is sure there are some. The Burning Blade, an old demon-worshipping cult of the orcs, still keeps a cave in Durotar, and the Warchief suspects its reach goes much further into his city.\n\nHis own agents would be recognized, so he wants a new face for the work. Start in Grommash Hold, and follow the trail out to Skull Rock and down beneath the city into Ragefire Chasm."] = "萨尔绝不容忍奥格瑞玛里有叛徒，而他确信城里就有。火刃氏族是兽人一个崇拜恶魔的古老教派，至今仍在杜隆塔尔占着一个山洞，酋长怀疑它的势力早已深入他的城市。\n\n他自己的手下会被认出来，所以他需要一张新面孔来办这件事。从格罗玛什要塞开始，顺着线索去骷髅石，再下到城市底下的怒焰裂谷。"
L["Orgrimmar / Durotar / Thunder Bluff / Undercity / Ragefire Chasm"] = "奥格瑞玛 / 杜隆塔尔 / 雷霆崖 / 幽暗城 / 怒焰裂谷"
L["Ragefire Chasm"] = "怒焰裂谷"
L["Skull Rock"] = "骷髅石"
L["Thrall suspects there are traitors in Orgrimmar, and he'd rather not show his hand by sending agents they already know. He wants a new face for the job. Find the Warchief in Grommash Hold, where he has an errand for you at Skull Rock."] = "萨尔怀疑奥格瑞玛里有叛徒，他不想派对方早就认识的手下去，免得打草惊蛇。他需要一张新面孔来办这件事。到格罗玛什要塞去找酋长，他在骷髅石有件差事要交给你。"
L["Thrall knows there are traitors in Orgrimmar, and he wanted a face the cult had never seen. I was young and unknown, which for once counted in my favor.\n\nThe Burning Blade keep a cave at Skull Rock, where one of them carried a small rune that marks a lieutenant. I brought it to Thrall, who said I reminded him of himself when he was younger.\n\nNext the rune went to Neeru Fireblade, a warlock in the Cleft of Shadow. Thrall knows Neeru leads the cult and leaves him in place on purpose. Neeru welcomed me in, his ranks growing too fast for him to remember faces, and called Thrall a fool. He sends Thrall's people into the chasm under the city against the Searing Blade, he said, which kills off Thrall's followers and tests the cultists. Two of the Searing Blade's leaders were the ones he valued.\n\nThrall wanted every word of it."] = "萨尔知道奥格瑞玛里有叛徒，他想要一张教派从没见过的面孔。我年轻，又没什么名气，这一次总算成了优势。\n\n火刃氏族在骷髅石占着一个山洞，其中一个人身上带着一枚小小的符文，那是军官的标志。我把它交给萨尔，他说我让他想起了年轻时的自己。\n\n接下来，符文被送到了暗影裂口的术士尼尔鲁·火刃那里。萨尔知道尼尔鲁就是教派的头目，故意让他留在原位。尼尔鲁欢迎我入伙，他的队伍扩张得太快，他根本记不住谁是谁，他还骂萨尔是个蠢货。他说，他把萨尔的人派到城下的裂谷里去对付灼刃，这样既能除掉萨尔的追随者，又能考验教徒。灼刃的首领里，有两个是他看重的。\n\n萨尔一个字都不想漏掉。"
L["The Lieutenant's Insignia"] = "军官的徽章"
L["Neeru's Reaction"] = "尼尔鲁的反应"
L["Thrall, in Grommash Hold, wants two leaders of the Searing Blade killed in Ragefire Chasm, under the Cleft of Shadow, without anyone in the Cleft finding out who did it. Rahauro in Thunder Bluff and Varimathras in the Undercity have business in the chasm too."] = "格罗玛什要塞的萨尔要你去怒焰裂谷杀掉灼刃的两名首领，裂谷就在暗影裂口底下，而且不能让暗影裂口的任何人发现是谁干的。雷霆崖的拉哈罗和幽暗城的瓦里玛萨斯在裂谷里也各有事要办。"
L["Neeru had let slip which two of the Searing Blade he valued, and Thrall decided they would go first. One was a satyr. The other was Jergosh, and Thrall had to stop and think what Jergosh was. A warlock, he believed. In Ragefire Chasm that narrows it down very little.\n\nThe way into the chasm is in the Cleft of Shadow, a short walk from Neeru's door, and Neeru was not to learn who had done it. So I strolled past his door on my way to kill his two favorites, doing my best impression of a lieutenant on cult business.\n\nBoth died down there. Back in Grommash Hold, Thrall's people had already told him the caverns were in disarray and Neeru was more than agitated. Thrall allowed that he wasn't displeased, and called it a dent in Neeru's armor."] = "尼尔鲁说漏了嘴，透露了他看重灼刃的哪两个人，萨尔决定先拿他们开刀。一个是萨特。另一个是耶戈什，萨尔得停下来想想耶戈什是什么。他觉得是个术士。在怒焰裂谷，这几乎等于没说。\n\n裂谷的入口就在暗影裂口，离尼尔鲁的门口没几步路，而且不能让尼尔鲁知道是谁干的。于是我悠闲地从他门口走过，去杀他最宠爱的两个手下，尽我所能地扮演一个替教派办事的军官。\n\n两个都死在了下面。回到格罗玛什要塞，萨尔的人已经告诉他，洞穴里乱成了一团，尼尔鲁也不只是有点焦躁。萨尔承认他并非不满意，说这是在尼尔鲁的铠甲上砸出了一个凹坑。"
L["Bazzalan and Jergosh"] = "巴扎兰和耶戈什"
L["Slaying the Beast"] = "饥饿者塔拉加曼"
L["Neeru Fireblade"] = "尼尔鲁·火刃"
L["Neeru Fireblade had a job of his own for me in the chasm. The Warchief, he explained, had charged him with rooting out the demonic influence in Orgrimmar, and the Burning Blade was only one of the threats. He kept a straight face the whole time. The Searing Blade answered to a felguard called Taragaman the Hungerer, and Neeru wanted the heart. I brought it, and Neeru promised to tell Thrall of my success himself."] = "尼尔鲁·火刃在裂谷里也有一份自己的差事要交给我。他解释说，酋长责成他铲除奥格瑞玛的恶魔影响，而火刃氏族只是威胁之一。他从头到尾都板着一张脸。灼刃听命于一个叫饥饿者塔拉加曼的恶魔卫士，尼尔鲁想要它的心脏。我带回来了，尼尔鲁答应会亲自向萨尔报告我的成功。"
L["Testing an Enemy's Strength"] = "试探敌人"
L["Rahauro"] = "拉哈罗"
L["Rahauro, on Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff, speaks for Magatha Grimtotem. Troggs had been coming up out of the lava tunnels under Orgrimmar, and Magatha, ever benevolent, had sent diplomats to make peace. The troggs killed them. The next envoy was me, and there are sixteen fewer troggs now, half of them shamans. Rahauro said it might be worth finding out someday what the troggs actually want."] = "雷霆崖长者高地上的拉哈罗是玛加萨·恐怖图腾的代言人。穴居人一直从奥格瑞玛底下的熔岩隧道里冒出来，向来仁慈的玛加萨派了外交官去讲和。穴居人把他们杀了。下一个使者就是我，现在穴居人少了十六个，其中一半是萨满祭司。拉哈罗说，也许哪天值得弄清楚，穴居人到底想要什么。"
L["Searching for the Lost Satchel"] = "寻找背包"
L["Magatha had also lost one of her own in the chasm. Maur Grimtotem had found something peculiar down there while trying to talk to the troggs, and never came back up to show her what. I found what was left of him. Clubs or fists, by the look of it. The troggs hadn't taken a thing he carried, having no interest in property that I could see."] = "玛加萨还在裂谷里失去了一个自己人。玛尔·恐怖图腾在下面试着跟穴居人沟通时发现了某样奇特的东西，却再也没能上来给她看看是什么。我找到了他的遗骸。从样子看，是被棍棒或拳头打死的。穴居人没拿走他身上的任何东西，就我所见，它们对财物毫无兴趣。"
L["Returning the Lost Satchel"] = "归还背包"
L["Maur Grimtotem"] = "玛尔·恐怖图腾"
L["Maur still had a satchel gripped tight in both arms, as if he'd spent the whole beating protecting it. I got it loose and carried it up to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff. Magatha had left word that whoever found her clansman should be rewarded, and Rahauro saw to it."] = "玛尔的双臂仍紧紧抱着一个背包，好像挨打的整个过程中都在护着它。我把它掰了出来，带到雷霆崖交给拉哈罗。玛加萨留过话，谁找到她的族人都该得到奖赏，拉哈罗照办了。"
L["The Power to Destroy..."] = "毁灭之力"
L["Varimathras, in the Undercity's Royal Quarter, explained that the Legion likes to give its followers gifts, and that the Dark Lady feels some of them would be better off in her hands. The Searing Blade had two spellbooks she wished to borrow. Varimathras made the quotation marks around borrow quite audible. I brought back Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether, and the Searing Blade shouldn't expect either one back."] = "幽暗城皇家区的瓦里玛萨斯解释说，燃烧军团喜欢给追随者送礼物，而黑暗女王觉得，其中有些礼物还是放在她手里更好。灼刃有两本法术书，她想借来用用。瓦里玛萨斯说“借”这个字的时候，引号简直听得见。我带回了《暗影法术研究》和《扭曲虚空的魔法》，灼刃就别指望哪本还能回去了。"
L["Word from Ragefire Chasm has reached the Cleft of Shadow, and Neeru Fireblade is said to be in a foul temper. Thrall, in Grommash Hold, sees a chance to put you closer to Neeru while the warlock is rattled."] = "怒焰裂谷的消息已经传到了暗影裂口，据说尼尔鲁·火刃正大发雷霆。格罗玛什要塞的萨尔看到了一个机会，可以趁这位术士心神不宁时，让你离他更近一步。"
L["Thrall wanted me closer to Neeru while Neeru was rattled. With two of his leaders dead he might be short of help, and Thrall hoped he'd ask me for some. I was to go back to the Cleft and not be too obvious about it.\n\nNeeru snapped at me before he saw who it was, then apologized. His anger, he said, rivaled a rabid kodo bull's. Some of Thrall's do-gooders had caught his leaders unaware, and he blamed himself for sending travelers down there at all. I kept my face very still.\n\nThen he named me one of his lieutenants. The chasm was mostly a loss now, but his agents in the Barrens and Ashenvale would start on something new. Thrall hadn't heard of the Shadow Council in Ashenvale and put his spies on it.\n\nBoth of them said they'd call on me soon. I'm hoping they don't pick the same day."] = "萨尔想趁尼尔鲁心神不宁的时候，让我离他更近一些。两个首领死了，他可能缺人手，萨尔希望他会找我帮忙。我要回暗影裂口去，别表现得太明显。\n\n尼尔鲁没看清是谁就冲我发了火，然后又道了歉。他说，他的怒火堪比一头发疯的科多公牛。萨尔手下的几个好事之徒打了他的首领们一个措手不及，他怪自己当初根本就不该派旅行者下去。我把脸绷得纹丝不动。\n\n接着他任命我为他的军官之一。裂谷现在基本算是丢了，但他在贫瘠之地和灰谷的手下会着手一件新的事。萨尔没听说过灰谷的暗影议会，便派了他的密探去盯着。\n\n两个人都说很快会再找我。但愿他们别挑同一天。"
L["Return to Neeru"] = "回去找尼尔鲁"
L["Report to Thrall"] = "向萨尔复命"
L["Thorns of the Razorfen"] = "剃刀荆棘"
L["In the far south of the Barrens, the quilboar of the Razorfen live in warrens of giant thorns. In Razorfen Kraul their crone, Charlga Razorflank, is raising an army, and she has made enemies a long way from the Barrens.\n\nStart in the Kraul. When it's done with, follow the thorns further south to Razorfen Downs, where the quilboar have been keeping strange company."] = "在贫瘠之地的最南端，剃刀部族的野猪人住在巨型荆棘丛构成的地穴里。在剃刀沼泽，它们的老巫婆卡尔加·刺肋正在召集一支军队，她在离贫瘠之地很远的地方也树了不少敌人。\n\n先去剃刀沼泽。办完那边的事，再顺着荆棘往南走，去剃刀高地，那里的野猪人一直在跟一些奇怪的家伙打交道。"
L["In the far south of the Barrens, the quilboar of the Razorfen live in warrens of giant thorns, and in Razorfen Kraul their crone, Charlga Razorflank, is raising an army. Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet has a job in there, and you'll find other reasons once you're inside.\n\nWhen the Kraul is done with, follow the thorns further south to Razorfen Downs, where the quilboar have been keeping strange company."] = "在贫瘠之地的最南端，剃刀部族的野猪人住在巨型荆棘丛构成的地穴里，在剃刀沼泽，它们的老巫婆卡尔加·刺肋正在召集一支军队。棘齿城的麦伯克·米希瑞克斯在那里面有份差事，进去之后，你还会找到别的理由。\n\n办完剃刀沼泽的事，再顺着荆棘往南走，去剃刀高地，那里的野猪人一直在跟一些奇怪的家伙打交道。"
L["In the far south of the Barrens, the quilboar of the Razorfen live in warrens of giant thorns, and in Razorfen Kraul their crone, Charlga Razorflank, is raising an army. Auld Stonespire, in Thunder Bluff, would like her heart.\n\nWhen the Kraul is done with, follow the thorns further south to Razorfen Downs, where the quilboar have been keeping strange company."] = "在贫瘠之地的最南端，剃刀部族的野猪人住在巨型荆棘丛构成的地穴里，在剃刀沼泽，它们的老巫婆卡尔加·刺肋正在召集一支军队。雷霆崖的奥尔德·石塔想要她的心脏。\n\n办完剃刀沼泽的事，再顺着荆棘往南走，去剃刀高地，那里的野猪人一直在跟一些奇怪的家伙打交道。"
L["The Barrens / Feralas / Thunder Bluff / Undercity / Stormwind / Razorfen Kraul / Razorfen Downs"] = "贫瘠之地 / 菲拉斯 / 雷霆崖 / 幽暗城 / 暴风城 / 剃刀沼泽 / 剃刀高地"
L["Razorfen Kraul"] = "剃刀沼泽"
L["Blueleaf Tubers"] = "蓝叶薯"
L["the Lower Rise, Thunder Bluff"] = "下层高地（雷霆崖）"
L["the Tradesmen's Terrace, Darnassus"] = "贸易区（达纳苏斯）"
L["a hill outside Razorfen Downs, The Barrens"] = "剃刀高地外的山丘，贫瘠之地"
L["the Magic Quarter, Undercity"] = "魔法区（幽暗城）"
L["The Crone of the Kraul"] = "卡尔加·刺肋"
L["The quilboar of the Razorfen have grown a warren of giant thorns in the southern Barrens, Razorfen Kraul, and they don't welcome visitors. Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet wants some tubers dug up in there all the same, and has a gopher to lend for it."] = "剃刀部族的野猪人在贫瘠之地南部长出了一片巨型荆棘构成的地穴，也就是剃刀沼泽，它们可不欢迎访客。尽管如此，棘齿城的麦伯克·米希瑞克斯还是想从里面挖些块茎出来，还有一只地鼠可以借给你用。"
L["Auld Stonespire, on the Lower Rise in Thunder Bluff, remembers when the tauren lived in the southern Barrens, and holds a grudge against the crone who rules Razorfen Kraul there now. In Ratchet, Mebok Mizzyrix has a smaller job in the same thorns."] = "雷霆崖下层高地的奥尔德·石塔还记得牛头人住在贫瘠之地南部的日子，对如今在那里统治剃刀沼泽的老巫婆一直怀恨在心。在棘齿城，麦伯克·米希瑞克斯在同一片荆棘里有件小一点的差事。"
L["Somewhere in Razorfen Kraul I picked up the journal of a dwarf named Henrig Lonebrow, who had no further use for it. I took it to Falfindel Waywarder at Thalanaar, on the Feralas border. Falfindel mourned a brave soul and then got down to business.\n\nThe crone who rules the Kraul, Charlga Razorflank, was raising an army in there, and there wasn't time to send to Darnassus for help. Falfindel wanted her medallion as proof she was finished.\n\nSo back into the thorns I went. Charlga kept a great many quilboar between herself and the door, and the medallion came away with me in the end. Falfindel was glad the Alliance could get on with its work there, and started wondering aloud whether treachery had a hand in the rot in that ground. I left Falfindel to it."] = "在剃刀沼泽的某个地方，我捡到了一个名叫亨里格·独眉的矮人的日记，他已经用不上了。我把它带给了菲拉斯边境萨兰纳尔的法芬德尔。法芬德尔为一个勇敢的灵魂哀悼了一番，然后开始谈正事。\n\n统治剃刀沼泽的老巫婆卡尔加·刺肋正在里面召集一支军队，已经来不及派人去达纳苏斯求援了。法芬德尔想要她的徽章，作为她已经完蛋的证据。\n\n于是我又回到了荆棘丛里。卡尔加在自己和门口之间布置了一大堆野猪人，最后徽章还是被我带走了。法芬德尔很高兴联盟可以继续在那里的工作，又开始自言自语，琢磨那片土地的腐烂是不是有背叛在作祟。我让法芬德尔自己慢慢琢磨。"
L["Auld Stonespire in Thunder Bluff has a long memory. The tauren lived on holy land in the southern Barrens for decades before they were driven out, and Auld has never forgiven it. These days the crone Charlga Razorflank rules down there from Razorfen Kraul and is raising an army. Auld wanted her heart, and said it would be enough to die in peace.\n\nThe Kraul is a maze of thorns as thick as tree trunks, full of quilboar who seemed to know what I'd come for, and Charlga was at the far end of it.\n\nI carried the heart back to Thunder Bluff. Auld was satisfied that the Razorfen finally knew what the tauren had felt. Driving a people from holy ground, Auld told me, is a sin that earns its vengeance. Then came the thanks, very solemn, with the heart still in Auld's hand."] = "雷霆崖的奥尔德·石塔记性很好。牛头人在贫瘠之地南部的圣地上生活了几十年，后来被赶了出去，奥尔德从来没有原谅过。如今，老巫婆卡尔加·刺肋在剃刀沼泽统治着那里，正在召集一支军队。奥尔德想要她的心脏，说有了它就足以安心地死去了。\n\n剃刀沼泽是一座迷宫，荆棘粗得像树干，里面满是野猪人，它们似乎知道我是来干什么的，而卡尔加就在迷宫的最深处。\n\n我把心脏带回了雷霆崖。奥尔德很满意，觉得剃刀部族终于明白了牛头人当年的感受。奥尔德告诉我，把一个民族赶出圣地，是一桩必遭报应的罪孽。接着是致谢，非常庄重，那颗心脏还握在奥尔德手里。"
L["Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet sent me into Razorfen Kraul with a crate full of holes and an owner's manual I was told to read first, so I read it. Out of the crate came a snufflenose gopher, and a poke with the command stick set it rooting for blueleaf tubers while I kept the quilboar off it. Mebok wanted the crate and the stick back along with the six tubers, and got all of it."] = "棘齿城的麦伯克·米希瑞克斯让我带着一个满是孔洞的箱子和一本说明书进了剃刀沼泽，还交代我先读说明书，于是我读了。箱子里钻出一只地鼠，用指挥棒戳它一下，它就开始拱土找蓝叶薯，我则负责把野猪人挡在一边。麦伯克要我把箱子和指挥棒连同六块蓝叶薯一起带回去，全都拿到了。"
L["A Vengeful Fate"] = "奥尔德的报复"
L["Auld Stonespire"] = "奥尔德·石塔"
L["Willix the Importer"] = "进口商威利克斯"
L["near Charlga Razorflank, Razorfen Kraul"] = "卡尔加·刺肋附近，剃刀沼泽"
L["Willix the Importer, a goblin, had gone into Razorfen Kraul after blueleaf tubers for Mebok Mizzyrix and ended up held in a tent not far from Charlga Razorflank. I walked Willix out. The whole way there was a running complaint about the quilboar and the smell, and warnings about trouble that tended to arrive at the same moment as the trouble. Outside, Willix thanked me and announced a good long rest before the trip back to Ratchet."] = "进口商威利克斯是个地精，为了给麦伯克·米希瑞克斯找蓝叶薯进了剃刀沼泽，结果被关在离卡尔加·刺肋不远的一顶帐篷里。我领着威利克斯走了出来。一路上抱怨个不停，嫌野猪人，嫌臭味，还不停地警告有麻烦，可警告往往跟麻烦同时到。到了外面，威利克斯向我道谢，宣布要先好好歇上一大觉，再动身回棘齿城。"
L["Mortality Wanes"] = "临终遗言"
L["Heralath Fallowbrook"] = "赫拉斯·静水"
L["Heralath Fallowbrook lay in the Kraul not far from Charlga Razorflank and didn't have long. A quilboar had taken the pendant Heralath shared with Treshala, Heralath's wife in Darnassus, and Heralath wanted it found and taken home to her with word of the death. I found it on one of the quilboar and carried both to the Tradesmen's Terrace. Treshala wouldn't believe it at first, then said the grief would be carried and Heralath's work would go on, and asked to be left alone to mourn. I went."] = "赫拉斯·静水躺在剃刀沼泽里离卡尔加·刺肋不远的地方，时日无多了。一个野猪人抢走了赫拉斯和塔莎拉共有的坠饰，塔莎拉是赫拉斯在达纳苏斯的妻子，赫拉斯希望把坠饰找回来，连同自己的死讯一起带回家交给她。我在一个野猪人身上找到了坠饰，把两样都带到了贸易区。塔莎拉起初不肯相信，后来说会扛起这份悲痛，赫拉斯的工作也会继续下去，然后请我让她独自哀悼。我走了。"
L["Lonebrow's Journal"] = "亨里格的日记"
L["Falfindel Waywarder"] = "法芬德尔"
L["A Host of Evil"] = "邪恶之地"
L["Myriam Moonsinger keeps watch from a hill near the entrance to Razorfen Downs, at the bottom of the Barrens. A diplomat has set up outside the Downs and is drawing a crowd, and Myriam would like the crowd smaller."] = "麦雷姆·月歌在贫瘠之地最南端剃刀高地入口附近的一座山丘上守望。一个外交官在高地外面安营扎寨，引来了一大群人，麦雷姆希望这群人少一点。"
L["Charlga Razorflank was carrying a small scroll under an insignia you don't recognize. Varimathras, in the Royal Quarter of the Undercity, may know it. Near the entrance to Razorfen Downs, Myriam Moonsinger could use a hand with the crowd gathering there."] = "卡尔加·刺肋身上带着一卷小卷轴，上面的徽记你不认识。幽暗城皇家区的瓦里玛萨斯也许认得。在剃刀高地的入口附近，麦雷姆·月歌需要有人帮忙对付聚集在那里的人群。"
L["Myriam Moonsinger had been sitting on a hill outside Razorfen Downs, keeping an eye on a diplomat. Ambassador Malcin, Myriam suspected, was Scourge, and handed out undeath to anyone who came asking for it. Plenty came. Every day more of them crept out of the briars to stand near the ambassador, quilboar and Death's Head cultists both, and Myriam was in no position to fight that many alone.\n\nI took eight of each kind off the crowd. Myriam thanked me and said that seeing the diplomat's power up close only proved the Scourge were among the worst threats Azeroth had ever faced. Then it was back to watching and studying, and I was pointed at the cave below the hill, the one shaped like a boar's mouth, with the suggestion that I take friends."] = "麦雷姆·月歌一直坐在剃刀高地外的一座山丘上，盯着一个外交官。麦雷姆怀疑，玛克林大使是天灾军团的人，谁去找他要不死之身，他就给谁。去的人还真不少。每天都有更多的人从荆棘丛里爬出来，站到大使身边，有野猪人，也有亡首教徒，麦雷姆一个人根本打不过那么多。\n\n我从人群里把每种各干掉了八个。麦雷姆向我道谢，说近距离见识了这个外交官的力量，只证明了天灾军团是艾泽拉斯有史以来最可怕的威胁之一。然后又回去接着观察和研究了，而我被指向山下那个形状像野猪嘴巴的洞穴，还附带一句建议，最好带上朋友。"
L["The crone had been carrying a small scroll under an insignia I didn't recognize. Varimathras did. Down in the Royal Quarter, the dreadlord asked whether it had come off Charlga, who rules the Kraul.\n\nIt was a letter from Ambassador Malcin, a diplomat to Lordaeron before things changed and a servant of the Scourge since. The letter called Charlga My Lady and offered her the Barrens and more if the Scourge could do as it liked there, and Malcin would wait outside Razorfen Downs to talk it over. If the Scourge wanted a foothold in Kalimdor, Varimathras said, it fell to the Horde to answer.\n\nMalcin was waiting where the letter said, among quilboar and cultists hungry for the bargain. A watcher on the hill above wanted that crowd thinner, so I thinned it on the way through, and Malcin's head went back to the Undercity with me."] = "老巫婆身上带着一卷小卷轴，上面的徽记我不认识。瓦里玛萨斯认得。在皇家区里，这位恐惧魔王问我，它是不是从统治剃刀沼泽的卡尔加身上拿来的。\n\n那是玛克林大使写的一封信，此人在世道变了之前是派驻洛丹伦的外交官，之后就成了天灾军团的仆从。信里称卡尔加为“我的女士”，许诺只要天灾军团能在贫瘠之地为所欲为，就把贫瘠之地乃至更多的土地给她，玛克林会在剃刀高地外面等着跟她详谈。瓦里玛萨斯说，如果天灾军团想在卡利姆多站稳脚跟，那就该由部落来回应。\n\n玛克林就在信上说的地方等着，身边是一群渴望这笔交易的野猪人和教徒。山上的一个守望者希望那群人少一些，所以我在穿过去的路上顺手削减了一番，玛克林的头颅跟着我回到了幽暗城。"
L["An Unholy Alliance"] = "邪恶的盟友"
L["Small Scroll"] = "小卷轴"
L["Myriam Moonsinger"] = "麦雷姆·月歌"
L["Extinguishing the Idol"] = "封印神像"
L["Somewhere in Razorfen Downs, in a cage the Scourge haven't got round to emptying, a stranger named Belnistrasz is still alive and has a proposal for whoever reaches the cage first."] = "在剃刀高地的某个地方，有一个天灾军团还没来得及清空的笼子，里面关着一个叫奔尼斯特拉兹的陌生人，至今还活着，对第一个找到笼子的人有个提议。"
L["Deep in Razorfen Downs, in a cage, I found Belnistrasz. The stranger had fully expected to die in there or end up as a meal for the Scourge, and was very glad to see me, as people in cages generally are. Home, I gathered, was a long way from the Barrens.\n\nBefore anything else, Belnistrasz handed me an oathstone. Among Belnistrasz's kind an agreement made over one of those is a serious bond, and to take the job I had to give it back. I gave it back.\n\nThe job was the quilboar idol. Belnistrasz meant to shut it down with a ritual, and a ritual means standing in one place for a long while as the whole of the Downs comes to object. I stood in front and objected back. When the ritual was done the idol was finished, and we wound things up at Belnistrasz's brazier."] = "在剃刀高地深处的一个笼子里，我找到了奔尼斯特拉兹。这位陌生人原本以为必死无疑，或者会成为天灾军团的一顿美餐，见到我非常高兴，关在笼子里的人一般都这样。我猜，对方的家乡离贫瘠之地很远。\n\n在做任何事之前，奔尼斯特拉兹先递给我一块誓言石。在奔尼斯特拉兹的族人当中，对着这种石头立下的约定是一种庄重的约束，要接下这份差事，我就得把它还回去。我还回去了。\n\n差事就是那座野猪人神像。奔尼斯特拉兹打算用一场仪式封印它，而仪式意味着在一个地方站上很久，整个剃刀高地的东西都会跑来抗议。我站在前面，抗议回去。仪式结束时，神像也就完了，我们在奔尼斯特拉兹的火盆旁收了尾。"
L["Scourge of the Downs"] = "剃刀高地的亡灵天灾"
L["Belnistrasz"] = "奔尼斯特拉兹"
L["a cage in Razorfen Downs"] = "剃刀高地里的一个笼子"
L["The Coldbringer"] = "寒冰之王"
L["Archbishop Benedictus, in the Cathedral of Light in Stormwind, has had grim reports out of Razorfen Downs and wants the power behind them put down. The archbishop is asking for volunteers willing to go all the way to the bottom."] = "暴风城光明大教堂的大主教本尼迪塔斯收到了来自剃刀高地的严峻报告，想把背后的力量铲除掉。大主教正在征召愿意一路深入到最底层的志愿者。"
L["Andrew Brownell, in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity, has studied the master of Razorfen Downs closely enough to want the skull, and would like it fetched up from the very bottom of the Downs."] = "幽暗城魔法区的安德鲁·布隆奈尔对剃刀高地的主人研究得够透彻，想要那颗头骨，希望有人从高地的最底层把它取上来。"
L["Archbishop Benedictus had heard enough about Razorfen Downs. The quilboar there had made a pact with the Scourge, and the pact had bred things worse than either of them. Over all of it sat a lich called Amnennar the Coldbringer, and the archbishop wanted the union ended along with him.\n\nSo down I went, to the very bottom of the Downs, where Amnennar waited in a cold he seems to carry with him. It was a long fight and I did most of it with numb fingers. He went down in the end.\n\nBack at the Cathedral of Light, Benedictus thanked me and said the Scourge would think twice before trying to swell its ranks that way again. I left with the archbishop's blessing of the Light, which was warm, at least."] = "大主教本尼迪塔斯对剃刀高地的事已经听够了。那里的野猪人和天灾军团订了协约，这协约孕育出了比两者都更糟的东西。凌驾于这一切之上的，是一个叫寒冰之王亚门纳尔的巫妖，大主教想让这个联盟和他一起完蛋。\n\n于是我下去了，一直下到剃刀高地的最底层，亚门纳尔就在那里，在一片他似乎随身携带的寒气中等着。那是一场漫长的战斗，我大部分时间都是用冻僵的手指在打。最后他还是倒下了。\n\n回到光明大教堂，本尼迪塔斯向我道谢，说天灾军团以后再想用这种办法扩充队伍，就得三思了。我带着大主教的圣光祝福离开，至少它是暖和的。"
L["Andrew Brownell, in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity, laid out Razorfen Downs for me like a lecture. The quilboar there had thrown in with the Scourge, and the lich who ruled them, Amnennar the Coldbringer, moved them about with his mind. He also had a line straight to Ner'zhul. Brownell wanted that line cut, and the skull brought back to show for it.\n\nThe bottom of the Downs was colder than anything in the Barrens has a right to be, and Amnennar did his best to keep it that way for a long, long fight. The skull came home with me.\n\nBrownell's view was that a lich's loyalty never wavers, and that loyalty of that sort only ever leads to its own destruction."] = "幽暗城魔法区的安德鲁·布隆奈尔给我讲解剃刀高地，就像在上课。那里的野猪人投靠了天灾军团，而统治它们的巫妖，寒冰之王亚门纳尔，能用意念驱使它们。他还有一条直通耐奥祖的线。布隆奈尔想把那条线切断，并把头骨带回来作为凭证。\n\n剃刀高地的底层冷得超出了贫瘠之地该有的程度，而亚门纳尔在一场漫长又漫长的战斗中尽力让它保持这样。头骨跟着我回了家。\n\n布隆奈尔的看法是，巫妖的忠诚从不动摇，而那种忠诚只会走向自我毁灭。"
L["Bring the Light"] = "与圣光同在"
L["Archbishop Benedictus"] = "大主教本尼迪塔斯"
L["Bring the End"] = "寒冰之王"
L["Andrew Brownell"] = "安德鲁·布隆奈尔"
L["The Coldbringer's Eye"] = "凛风之眼"
L["Archmage Lan'dalock in Dalaran wanted the Coldbringer's Eye brought out of Razorfen Downs. It sat in a blue orb behind Amnennar, which made Amnennar the first step of the errand. Once he was out of the way the orb gave it up, and I carried it all the way to the Alterac Mountains for the archmage."] = "达拉然的大法师兰达洛克想把凛风之眼从剃刀高地带出来。它放在亚门纳尔身后的一个蓝色球体里，所以这趟差事的第一步就是亚门纳尔。等他不碍事了，球体就交出了凛风之眼，我一路把它带到奥特兰克山脉，交给了大法师。"
L["Sutara Plainstalker"] = "苏塔拉·平原行者"
L["Sutara Plainstalker, an Earthen Ring quartermaster in Mulgore, wanted the Coldbringer's Eye fetched from Razorfen Downs. It sat in a blue orb behind Amnennar, so Amnennar had to be dealt with first, and I was headed that way regardless. With the lich gone the orb let go of it, and I took it back across the Barrens to Sutara."] = "莫高雷的苏塔拉·平原行者是大地之环的军需官，想要从剃刀高地取回凛风之眼。它放在亚门纳尔身后的一个蓝色球体里，所以得先解决亚门纳尔，反正我本来就要往那边去。巫妖一死，球体就松开了它，我带着它穿过贫瘠之地，交给了苏塔拉。"
-- Profession stories: Master of the Wild Leather, The Mithril Order, The Pledge of Secrecy
L["The Mithril Order"] = "秘银会"
L["Galvan the Ancient, a dwarf smith of the old school, left Booty Bay long ago, but the order he belongs to still keeps members in town, looking for a successor.\n\nYour trainer can point you their way, south into the jungles of Stranglethorn, and in time you'll have to choose between armor and weapons."] = "加尔文是一位老派的矮人铁匠，很久以前就离开了藏宝海湾，但他所属的那个组织至今仍有成员留在镇上，物色着接班人。\n\n你的训练师可以给你指路，南下荆棘谷的丛林。日后，你还得在护甲和武器之间做出选择。"
L["Years ago a dwarf named Galvan trained Hank the Hammer, then left for Booty Bay, and Hank promised to pass the teaching on. Hank still keeps that promise, in Stormwind's Dwarven District.\n\nFrom there the road runs south to Stranglethorn and Gadgetzan before it brings you back to the Great Forge in Ironforge, where armorsmiths and weaponsmiths each want you for their own."] = "多年前，一位名叫加尔文的矮人教过巨锤汉克，之后便去了藏宝海湾。汉克答应过他，要把这门手艺传下去。如今汉克仍在暴风城的矮人区信守着这个承诺。\n\n路从那里向南，经过荆棘谷和加基森，最后把你带回铁炉堡的大锻炉。在那里，护甲铸造师和武器铸造师都想把你收归门下。"
L["Orokk Omosh, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, is the last of twenty generations of Omosh smiths and wants the family recipes to outlive him. Aturk the Anvil, a few steps away, has older ways to teach.\n\nFrom there the road runs south to Stranglethorn and Gadgetzan before it brings you back to the Valley of Honor, where armorsmiths and weaponsmiths each want you for their own."] = "奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的奥罗克·沃姆什是沃姆什家族二十代铁匠中的最后一位，他希望家传的配方能比他活得更久。几步之外的铁砧阿图尔克，则有更古老的技艺可以传授。\n\n路从那里向南，经过荆棘谷和加基森，最后把你带回荣誉谷。在那里，护甲铸造师和武器铸造师都想把你收归门下。"
L["Stranglethorn Vale / Tanaris / Winterspring"] = "荆棘谷 / 塔纳利斯 / 冬泉谷"
L["The Origins of Smithing"] = "锻造的本源"
L["Hank the Hammer"] = "巨锤汉克"
L["between Zul'Gurub and the Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "祖尔格拉布与莫什奥格食人魔山之间，荆棘谷"
L["Joys of Omosh"] = "沃姆什的喜悦"
L["Twenty generations of Omosh have held the hammer Orokk Omosh holds now, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, and he has no heir for the family recipes. Bring your best bronze work and show him you could carry them on."] = "奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的奥罗克·沃姆什手里那把锤子，已经在沃姆什家族传了二十代，可他没有继承人来接手家传的配方。带上你最好的青铜作品，向他证明你能把它们传下去。"
L["There's a smith in the Valley of Honor named Orokk Omosh. Twenty generations of Omosh have held the same hammer, and Orokk is the last of them, with the family recipes and no one to leave them to. He looked me over and decided I would have to do.\n\nThe recipes cost me more bronze than I knew Orgrimmar had, and then iron. Every delivery bought one set of barbaric iron plans and a short speech about the fear I'd see in my enemies' eyes. Once he said I was like his own grandfather, Chief Gorokk, and I took that kindly.\n\nThe last family secret was a dance. Orokk was not crying, he told me, there was soot in his eye. Then he taught me the Omosh Dance of Joy, and was panting a bit by the end. I still do it at the forge when a piece comes out right."] = "荣誉谷有个铁匠，叫奥罗克·沃姆什。同一把锤子在沃姆什家传了二十代，奥罗克是最后一个，守着家传的配方，却没人可以托付。他把我上下打量了一番，认定只好将就用我了。\n\n那些配方花掉的青铜，比我以为整个奥格瑞玛有的还多，后来又换成了铁。每交一批货，就换来一份野人铁设计图，外加一小段演讲，讲我会在敌人眼中看到怎样的恐惧。有一次他说我像他的祖父戈罗克酋长，我就当是句好话收下了。\n\n家族的最后一个秘密是一支舞。奥罗克告诉我，他没哭，是眼睛进了灰。然后他教了我沃姆什的喜悦之舞，跳到最后自己还有点喘。直到现在，每当有件东西打得顺手，我还会在锻炉边跳上一段。"
L["Barbaric Battlements"] = "野人装甲"
L["Orokk Omosh"] = "奥罗克·沃姆什"
L["On Iron Pauldrons"] = "铁肩铠"
L["Trampled Under Foot"] = "踩在脚下"
L["Horns of Frenzy"] = "疯狂之角"
L["Hank the Hammer, in Stormwind's Dwarven District, was trained by a dwarf named Galvan, who made Hank promise to teach any smith with the will to go further. For six golden scale bracers, Hank will show you where smithing comes from."] = "暴风城矮人区的巨锤汉克师从一位名叫加尔文的矮人。加尔文让汉克答应过，要教导每一个有心更进一步的铁匠。打造六副金鳞护腕，汉克就会让你明白锻造的本源。"
L["Aturk the Anvil, in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, remembers the days of crushed skulls and has little use for peacetime. Bring four steel breastplates and four steel helms, and he will give you a taste of war."] = "奥格瑞玛荣誉谷的铁砧阿图尔克还记得那些碾碎头颅的日子，对太平年月提不起什么兴趣。带四套钢质胸甲和四顶钢质头盔给他，他会让你尝尝战争的滋味。"
L["Hank the Hammer learned the trade from Galvan, a dwarf who left for Booty Bay years ago. For six golden scale bracers, Hank taught me where smithing comes from. It never comes from here, I was told, twice, and only from here. I still couldn't tell you which here was which.\n\nThen Hank gave me an insignia to take to McGavan at the Booty Bay smithy. McGavan kept it and swore by Blackhoof's back hair that I was worthy of the Mithril Order. What I got back was a pin to show Galvan, far to the north.\n\nGalvan teaches mining before smithing, so every lesson started with forty bars of mithril. Truesilver got a lecture to itself. He calls it the great silver deceiver, and spent more than ten years in the Alterac Mountains learning why. When my arms worked again, he sent me on to Gadgetzan."] = "巨锤汉克的手艺是跟加尔文学的，那个矮人多年前就去了藏宝海湾。我交了六副金鳞护腕，汉克就教我锻造从何而来。他告诉我，它从来不是从这里来的，这话说了两遍，然后又说它只从这里来。哪个“这里”是哪个，我到现在也说不上来。\n\n接着汉克给了我一枚徽章，让我带去藏宝海湾的铁匠铺找马克迦文。马克迦文把徽章留下了，还以黑蹄的背毛起誓，说我配得上秘银会。我换回来的是一枚别针，要拿去给远在北边的加尔文看。\n\n加尔文先教采矿，再教锻造，所以每堂课都从四十块秘银锭开始。真银还单独占了一堂课。照他的说法，真银根本不是真的，为了弄明白这一点，他在奥特兰克山脉待了十多年。等我的胳膊又能动了，他就打发我去了加基森。"
L["Aturk the Anvil remembers grinding the bones of fallen enemies into filament powder, and hasn't made peace with the Warchief's peace. For four steel breastplates and four helms, Aturk taught me orcish war leggings and made it plain I was a disappointment.\n\nAturk's neighbor was more cheerful, and knew a guy who knew a guy at the smithy in Booty Bay. That was McGavan, who kept the insignia I'd been handed and swore by Blackhoof's back hair that I was worthy of the Mithril Order. I got a pin in exchange, and directions north to Galvan.\n\nGalvan teaches mining before smithing, so every lesson started with forty bars of mithril. Truesilver got a lecture to itself. He calls it the great silver deceiver, and spent more than ten years in the Alterac Mountains learning why. When my arms worked again, he sent me on to Gadgetzan."] = "铁砧阿图尔克还记得把倒下的敌人的骨头磨成粉做灯丝的日子。大酋长已经跟旧敌讲和，他自己却到现在也没跟这份和平讲和。我交了四套钢质胸甲和四顶头盔，阿图尔克教了我兽人护腿的做法，还毫不掩饰地表示我让他很失望。\n\n阿图尔克的邻居要开朗得多，他认识一个人，那人又认识藏宝海湾铁匠铺里的一个人。铁匠铺里的那位就是马克迦文。他把我带去的徽章留下了，以黑蹄的背毛起誓，说我配得上秘银会。我换回一枚别针，还有往北去找加尔文的路线。\n\n加尔文先教采矿，再教锻造，所以每堂课都从四十块秘银锭开始。真银还单独占了一堂课。照他的说法，真银根本不是真的，为了弄明白这一点，他在奥特兰克山脉待了十多年。等我的胳膊又能动了，他就打发我去了加基森。"
L["The Old Ways"] = "古老的技艺"
L["Aturk the Anvil"] = "铁砧阿图尔克"
L["Booty Bay or Bust!"] = "藏宝海湾之旅！"
L["Ox"] = "奥克斯"
L["In Search of Galvan"] = "寻找加尔文"
L["McGavan"] = "马克迦文"
L["Smelt On, Smelt Off"] = "铁匠必修课"
L["The Great Silver Deceiver"] = "白花花的银子"
L["The Art of the Imbue"] = "灌魔工艺"
L["Galvan's Finest Pupil"] = "加尔文的得意门生"
L["The Mithril Kid"] = "秘银小子"
L["Galvan has sent you to Gadgetzan, in Tanaris, to meet Trenton Lighthammer, the old smith's finest pupil. Trenton can teach you about ornate mithril, and has a blacksmithing championship to get ready for."] = "加尔文打发你去塔纳利斯的加基森，见见这位老铁匠最得意的学生特伦顿·轻锤。特伦顿能教你精制秘银的手艺，而且他还得为一场铁匠冠军赛做准备。"
L["Trenton Lighthammer is known in Gadgetzan as the Mithril Kid. Galvan had taught each of us half of the ornate mithril set and left us to find each other, and Trenton saw the plan straight away. So we traded, piece for piece, until we both knew all of it.\n\nThe boots meant the most to Trenton. At last year's All-Valley Blacksmithing Championship, a rival from the Venture Co. Foundry swept his leg, and ornate mithril boots kept him going to the win. This year he wanted the pants too. When we were done, Trenton declared me unsweepable.\n\nAfter that I stood and watched Trenton work. Then I was handed an insignia very like the one I'd given McGavan, and named a blacksmith of the Mithril Order. Galvan had the last word, and a signet worth far more than what I'd given up."] = "特伦顿·轻锤在加基森人称秘银小子。加尔文把精制秘银套装拆成两半，我们俩各教一半，然后让我们自己去找对方。特伦顿一下子就看穿了这个安排。于是我们一件换一件，直到两人都学全了。\n\n对特伦顿来说，最要紧的是那双靴子。去年的全谷铁匠冠军赛上，风险投资公司来的一个对手给了他一记扫堂腿，是精制秘银战靴让他撑到最后拿了冠军。今年他连短裤也想要。等我们换完，特伦顿宣布我从此扫不倒了。\n\n之后我就站在一旁看特伦顿干活。然后有人递给我一枚徽章，跟我当初交给马克迦文的那枚很像，我也就成了秘银会的一名铁匠。最后的话由加尔文来说，他还给了我一枚徽记，比我当初交出去的那枚徽章值钱多了。"
L["A Good Head On Your Shoulders"] = "罩帽和护肩"
L["The World At Your Feet"] = "世界在你脚下"
L["Did You Lose This?"] = "秘银会的认可"
L["Expert Blacksmith!"] = "锻造专家!"
L["Armorsmith or Weaponsmith"] = "护甲铸造师还是武器铸造师"
L["At the Great Forge in Ironforge, Grumnus Steelshaper trains armorsmiths and Ironus Coldsteel trains weaponsmiths. You can follow only one of them, so hear both out. From level 50, weaponsmiths can seek out three masters in Everlook, in Winterspring."] = "在铁炉堡的大锻炉，格鲁努斯·削钢训练护甲铸造师，埃隆努斯·冷钢训练武器铸造师。两人之中你只能跟随一个，所以不妨把两边的话都听完。到了50级，武器铸造师还可以去冬泉谷的永望镇拜访三位大师。"
L["In Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor, Okothos Ironrager trains armorsmiths and Borgosh Corebender trains weaponsmiths. You can follow only one of them, so hear both out. From level 50, weaponsmiths can seek out three masters in Everlook, in Winterspring."] = "在奥格瑞玛的荣誉谷，奥克索斯·铁怒训练护甲铸造师，伯古什训练武器铸造师。两人之中你只能跟随一个，所以不妨把两边的话都听完。到了50级，武器铸造师还可以去冬泉谷的永望镇拜访三位大师。"
L["At the Great Forge there are two trainers who will take a smith further, and each thinks the other went wrong. Grumnus Steelshaper calls armor the smart decision. Ironus Coldsteel says weaponsmiths are the ones with all the gold, and was stacking coins into neat piles while saying it.\n\nBoth wanted a pile of finished work before they'd teach a thing, and a smith only gets to pick one of them. I made my choice and the work to go with it. Which one I took is between me and my anvil.\n\nUp in Everlook, three masters each teach a single weapon to weaponsmiths who bring them a trophy from a dungeon. Picking one of them closes the other two doors for good."] = "大锻炉有两位训练师能带铁匠更进一步，而且都觉得对方走错了路。格鲁努斯·削钢说选护甲才是明智之举。埃隆努斯·冷钢说钱都让武器铸造师赚走了，说这话的时候，他正把金币一摞摞码得整整齐齐。\n\n两人都要先看到一堆成品才肯教，而一个铁匠只能选其中一位。我做了选择，也打好了与之相配的活儿。至于选的是哪位，那是我和我的铁砧之间的事。\n\n在北边的永望镇，有三位大师各教一种武器，教的是能从地下城带回战利品的武器铸造师。选了其中一位，另外两扇门就永远关上了。"
L["In the Valley of Honor there are two trainers who will take a smith further. Okothos Ironrager makes armor for the satisfaction of it, and means to pound steel until there's no breath left to do it with. Borgosh Corebender makes weapons and dreams of a hammer fit for a Warchief, a life's work still in progress.\n\nBoth wanted a pile of finished work first, and both offered one last chance to back out. I made my choice and the work to go with it. Which one I took is between me and my anvil.\n\nUp in Everlook, three masters each teach a single weapon to weaponsmiths who bring them a trophy from a dungeon. Picking one of them closes the other two doors for good."] = "荣誉谷有两位训练师能带铁匠更进一步。奥克索斯·铁怒打造护甲，图的是那份满足感，打算一直敲打钢铁，直到再也喘不上气为止。伯古什打造武器，梦想着打出一把配得上大酋长的锤子，这份毕生的事业至今还没完工。\n\n两人都要先看到一堆成品，也都给了我最后一次反悔的机会。我做了选择，也打好了与之相配的活儿。至于选的是哪位，那是我和我的铁砧之间的事。\n\n在北边的永望镇，有三位大师各教一种武器，教的是能从地下城带回战利品的武器铸造师。选了其中一位，另外两扇门就永远关上了。"
L["The Art of the Armorsmith"] = "铸造护甲的艺术"
L["I took up armor. Grumnus Steelshaper went over my stack of ornate mithril and told me there was no turning back after this, and that it wasn't too late to become a toy maker. A weaponsmith, he meant. I've had a forge tan ever since."] = "我选了护甲。格鲁努斯·削钢把我那一摞精制秘银仔细看了一遍，告诉我这一步迈出去就不能回头了，现在改行当玩具匠也还来得及。他说的玩具匠，指的是武器铸造师。从那以后，我脸上就一直带着锻炉烤出来的颜色。"
L["Okothos Ironrager"] = "奥克索斯·铁怒"
L["I took up armor. Okothos Ironrager checked my ornate mithril and offered me one last chance to back out. I didn't take it, and was wished a lifetime of glory, which I've been working through one helm at a time."] = "我选了护甲。奥克索斯·铁怒检查了我的精制秘银，给了我最后一次反悔的机会。我没要，于是他祝我一生荣耀。这份荣耀，我正一顶头盔一顶头盔地慢慢挣。"
L["The Way of the Weaponsmith"] = "武器铸造师之道"
L["Ironus Coldsteel"] = "埃隆努斯·冷钢"
L["I took up weapons. Ironus Coldsteel had customers waiting and took my axes and maces almost before I'd set them down, then told me to pay attention. I've had customers waiting myself ever since, and I'm still looking for all that gold."] = "我选了武器。埃隆努斯·冷钢那边有顾客等着，我的斧子和锤子还没放稳，他就拿走了，然后叫我认真听好。从那以后，我这边也一直有顾客等着，可他说的那些金子，我还在找。"
L["Borgosh Corebender"] = "伯古什"
L["I took up weapons. Borgosh Corebender looked over my work and offered me a last chance to back out, then told me to prepare to be consumed by knowledge. He wasn't wrong. Some nights I dream in axe heads."] = "我选了武器。伯古什看过我的活儿，给了我最后一次反悔的机会，然后叫我准备好被知识吞没。他没说错。有些晚上，我连做梦都是斧头。"
L["Sweet Serenity"] = "甜美的平静"
L["Lilith the Lithe"] = "轻盈的莉莉丝"
L["Lilith the Lithe sent me into the Scarlet Bastion in Stratholme, where the Crimson Hammersmith guards the recipe for a hammer called Serenity with his life. He meant it. I brought Lilith his apron and became a hammersmith, with the sword and the axe closed to me from then on."] = "轻盈的莉莉丝派我去斯坦索姆的血色堡垒。那里的红衣铸锤师用性命守护着一把名叫“平静”的锤子的配方。他是说到做到的。我把他的围裙带回给莉莉丝，成了一名铸锤大师，从此剑和斧的门都对我关上了。"
L["Snakestone of the Shadow Huntress"] = "沃什加斯的菊石"
L["Kilram"] = "基尔拉姆"
L["Kilram has a scar from Vosh'gajin, the shadow huntress of Blackrock Spire, and warned me not to let her beauty fool me. I brought back her snakestone, which the legend says keeps an axe razor sharp for a thousand years. Kilram made me an axesmith for it, and the sword and the hammer were closed to me for good."] = "基尔拉姆身上有道疤，是黑石塔的暗影猎手沃什加斯留下的。他提醒我别被她的美貌骗了。我把她的菊石带了回来，传说这东西能让一把斧子锋利千年不钝。基尔拉姆因此让我成了铸斧大师，剑和锤的门从此永远对我关上了。"
L["Corruption"] = "腐蚀"
L["Seril Scourgebane"] = "亡灵杀手瑟里尔"
L["Seril Scourgebane was short with me, and said there was a reason for it. The Black Guard, Baron Rivendare's skeletal elite, had stolen the plans for the great blade Corruption, and their swordsmith in Stratholme was keeping them. I destroyed him and brought his insignia back to Everlook, and Seril made me a swordsmith. The hammer and the axe are closed to me now."] = "亡灵杀手瑟里尔对我爱答不理，还说这是有原因的。黑衣守卫，也就是瑞文戴尔男爵手下的骷髅精锐，偷走了巨剑“腐蚀”的设计图，交给他们在斯坦索姆的铸剑师保管。我消灭了他，把他的徽记带回永望镇，瑟里尔就让我成了铸剑大师。如今锤和斧的门都对我关上了。"
L["The Pledge of Secrecy"] = "保密协议"
L["Past a certain point, engineering splits into two schools. Gnome engineers build devices meant to make life easier, and goblin engineers build explosives and the guns to go with them. Each school guards its schemata from the other, so you can learn one and never the other.\n\nYour engineering trainer has a manual on the subject and strong views on which school a sensible engineer would join. Read it and make up your own mind. Then take the manual to the master of the school you want."] = "工程学到了一定程度，就会分成两派。侏儒工程师制造让生活更方便的装置，地精工程师则制造炸药，外加配套的枪械。两派都不让对方看到自己的结构图，所以你只能学其中一派，另一派永远学不到。\n\n你的工程学训练师有一本讲这件事的手册，对明智的工程师该加入哪一派也有很强烈的看法。读完手册，自己拿主意，然后把手册交给你想加入的那一派的大师。"
L["Stormwind / Ironforge / Undercity / Stranglethorn Vale / Tanaris"] = "暴风城 / 铁炉堡 / 幽暗城 / 荆棘谷 / 塔纳利斯"
L["Gnome Engineering"] = "侏儒工程学"
L["Lilliam Sparkspindle"] = "利廉姆·火轴"
L["the Rogues' Quarter, Undercity"] = "盗贼区（幽暗城）"
L["Show Your Work"] = "工作成果"
L["Your engineering trainer has a manual for you, and an opinion to go with it. From here the craft splits into a gnome school and a goblin school, and you can only join one. Read the manual before you choose."] = "你的工程学训练师有一本手册要给你，还附赠一番见解。从这里开始，这门手艺分成侏儒派和地精派，而你只能加入其中一派。做选择之前，先把手册读一读。"
L["Engineering only goes so far before it splits in two, gnome and goblin, and you have to pick. My trainer gave me a manual on it and made plain which school I ought to join. Gnomes build things to make life easier, says the manual, and some of them even work. Goblins build bombs and guns, which have the opposite problem. Join one school and the other keeps its schemata from you for good. The manual says so twice.\n\nBefore I learned a single schematic there was a pledge of lifelong secrecy to sign. I was told to think it over carefully. I read every line and signed.\n\nLast came the samples, because a master wants to see your work before handing over the good schemata. I spent a few long evenings at the bench. Mine passed, and I was given a membership card."] = "工程学学到一定程度就会一分为二，侏儒派和地精派，你得挑一边。我的训练师给了我一本讲这事的手册，还明明白白地告诉我该加入哪一派。手册上说，侏儒造东西是为了让生活更方便，其中有些甚至真能用。地精造的是炸弹和枪，毛病正好反过来。加入一派，另一派的结构图就永远不会让你碰。这一点手册上说了两遍。\n\n我还一张结构图都没学，就先得签一份终生保密的协议。他们叫我慎重考虑。我把每一行都读了，然后签了字。\n\n最后是交样品，因为大师要先看看你的手艺，才肯把好的结构图交给你。我在工作台前熬了几个漫长的晚上。我的样品过关了，拿到了一张会员卡。"
L["I took the manual to Tinkmaster Overspark in Tinker Town, who said he had all the time in the world, since all he does now is stand about while Gnomeregan sits in its cloud of radiation. Then he begged my pardon for the melodrama."] = "我把手册带到侏儒区，交给了工匠大师欧沃斯巴克。他说他有的是时间，反正如今诺莫瑞根笼罩在辐射云里，他每天只能在这儿干站着。说完他又为自己这么煽情向我道了歉。"
L["Graham Van Talen"] = "格拉哈姆·范·塔伦"
L["My trainer said that if I wanted to learn to make metal paperweights, Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay was the one to see. Oglethorpe opened by referring me to his barrister, in case I'd come about a homing robot through my wall. Gnomeregan, he told me, lost one of its greatest engineers the day he left."] = "我的训练师说，要是我想学怎么造金属镇纸，就去藏宝海湾找奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。奥格索普一开口就叫我有事去找他的律师，以防我是为了哪个归巢机器人撞穿我家墙壁的事上门的。他告诉我，他离开的那天，诺莫瑞根就失去了一位最伟大的工程师。"
L["Overspark had signed the same pledge once, like every gnome engineer before me, and was delighted to have me in the fold."] = "欧沃斯巴克当年也签过同样的协议，在我之前的每一位侏儒工程师都签过。看到我入了伙，他高兴得很。"
L["Overspark's list ran to six mithril tubes and two advanced target dummies, among other things, so he could see where my work might be more gnomish. My card says I'm a member in good standing of the Mechanical Engineering Guild, Associated. I'd spell out the initials, but I signed a pledge."] = "欧沃斯巴克的清单上有六根秘银管和两个高级假人，还有些别的，这样他就能看出我的手艺哪里还可以再侏儒一点。我的卡上写着，我是机械工程学联合公会的正式会员。这名字的缩写我本想念给你们听，可我签过保密协议。"
L["Oglethorpe Obnoticus"] = "奥格索普·奥布诺提斯"
L["Oglethorpe has no love for Gnomeregan's politics, or for one of its tinkmasters in particular, but he holds the pledge above all of that."] = "奥格索普对诺莫瑞根的政治毫无好感，对那里的某位工匠大师尤其如此，但在他心里，保密协议比这些都重要。"
L["Oglethorpe went over my mithril tubes and target dummies for gnomish technique. The card he gave me says I'm a member in good standing of the Mechanical Engineering Guild, Associated. I'd spell out the initials, but I signed a pledge."] = "奥格索普把我的秘银管和假人翻来覆去地看，看的是够不够侏儒的手法。他给我的卡上写着，我是机械工程学联合公会的正式会员。这名字的缩写我本想念给你们听，可我签过保密协议。"
L["Goblin Engineering"] = "地精工程学"
L["I took the manual all the way to Gadgetzan, to Nixx Sprocketspring, who said he can smell a fresh recruit a mile off, like good blasting powder. Any fool can learn the basics, says Nixx, and Gnomeregan proves it. Goblin work takes a steady hand, and he leaned hard on the steady."] = "我把手册一路带到加基森，交给尼克斯·斯普克斯宾。他说隔着老远就能闻出新人的味道，就跟闻上好的火药一样。尼克斯说，基础谁都能学，傻瓜也行，诺莫瑞根就是证明。地精的活儿要的是一双稳当的手，“稳当”两个字他咬得特别重。"
L["My trainer called goblin engineering the choice of every brilliant engineer, and I don't argue with compliments. Nixx Sprocketspring in Gadgetzan said he'd smelled me coming a mile off, like good blasting powder, and that goblin work takes a steady hand. He said steady louder than the rest."] = "我的训练师说，地精工程学是所有明智的工程师都会选的一派。别人夸我，我从不顶嘴。加基森的尼克斯·斯普克斯宾说，我还在老远他就闻到我来了，就跟闻上好的火药一样，还说地精的活儿要的是一双稳当的手。“稳当”这两个字，他说得比别的字都响。"
L["Nixx Sprocketspring"] = "尼克斯·斯普克斯宾"
L["Nixx kept it simple. It was a one-way trip, he said, and if I was ready, I should hop aboard."] = "尼克斯说得很简单。他说这是一趟单程旅行，要是我准备好了，就赶紧上船吧。"
L["Nixx asked for forty assorted explosives and five explosive sheep, and told me to keep the safeties armed. My card says I'm a member in good standing of the Goblin Experimental Engineering Korporation, with a K. I suspect the initials came first."] = "尼克斯要了四十颗各式各样的炸弹和五只自爆绵羊，还叮嘱我保险一定要扣好。我的卡上写着，我是地精实验工程学协会的正式会员。这名字的缩写念起来正好是个词，我怀疑他们是先想好了缩写，才凑出的全名。"
L["Master of the Wild Leather"] = "蛮皮护甲大师"
L["Two leatherworkers in Feralas know how to stitch wildvines into armor, and whichever one teaches you will want you working for them while you learn, paying for each pattern in finished leather.\n\nBeyond Wild Leather the trade divides into three high arts, each with a master of its own, and a leatherworker only ever gets to learn one of them."] = "菲拉斯有两位制皮师懂得如何把野葡萄缝进护甲里。不管哪一位教你，都会要你边学边替他干活，每一张图样都得用做好的皮具来换。\n\n蛮皮之后，这门手艺分成三门高深的技艺，各有各的大师，而一个制皮师这辈子只能学其中一门。"
L["Pratt McGrubben, at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas, knows how to stitch wildvines into armor. He'll teach you, if you don't mind working for him while you learn and paying for each pattern in finished leather.\n\nBeyond Wild Leather the trade divides into three high arts, each with a master of its own, and a leatherworker only ever gets to learn one of them."] = "菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比懂得如何把野葡萄缝进护甲里。他愿意教你，只要你不介意边学边替他干活，每一张图样都用做好的皮具来换。\n\n蛮皮之后，这门手艺分成三门高深的技艺，各有各的大师，而一个制皮师这辈子只能学其中一门。"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider, at Camp Mojache in Feralas, knows how to stitch wildvines into armor. He'll teach you, if you don't mind working for him while you learn and paying for each pattern in finished leather.\n\nBeyond Wild Leather the trade divides into three high arts, each with a master of its own, and a leatherworker only ever gets to learn one of them."] = "菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄懂得如何把野葡萄缝进护甲里。他愿意教你，只要你不介意边学边替他干活，每一张图样都用做好的皮具来换。\n\n蛮皮之后，这门手艺分成三门高深的技艺，各有各的大师，而一个制皮师这辈子只能学其中一门。"
L["Feralas / Darnassus / Thunder Bluff / Azshara / Searing Gorge / Badlands / Arathi Highlands / Stranglethorn Vale"] = "菲拉斯 / 达纳苏斯 / 雷霆崖 / 艾萨拉 / 灼热峡谷 / 荒芜之地 / 阿拉希高地 / 荆棘谷"
L["Wild Leather Armor"] = "蛮皮护甲"
L["Pratt McGrubben"] = "普拉特·马克格鲁比"
L["the Craftsmen's Terrace, Darnassus"] = "工匠区（达纳苏斯）"
L["southern Azshara"] = "艾萨拉南部"
L["eastern Badlands"] = "荒芜之地东部"
L["southeastern Searing Gorge"] = "灼热峡谷东南部"
L["western Arathi Highlands"] = "阿拉希高地西部"
L["Thalanaar, Feralas"] = "萨兰纳尔（菲拉斯）"
L["southeast of Grom'gol, Stranglethorn Vale"] = "格罗姆高东南，荆棘谷"
L["Pratt McGrubben, at Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas, thinks you're getting good with leather. He knows how to work wildvines into armor and will teach you, though you'll be working for him a while, and he wants ten pieces of thick leather to start."] = "菲拉斯羽月要塞的普拉特·马克格鲁比觉得你的制皮手艺越来越好了。他懂得如何把野葡萄做进护甲里，也愿意教你，不过你得替他干上一阵子活，而且一开始他就要十块厚皮。"
L["Word of your leatherwork has reached Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache in Feralas. He knows how to work wildvines into armor and will teach you, though you'll be working for him a while, and he wants ten pieces of thick leather to start."] = "你的制皮手艺已经传到了菲拉斯莫沙彻营地的杉多尔·迅蹄耳中。他懂得如何把野葡萄做进护甲里，也愿意教你，不过你得替他干上一阵子活，而且一开始他就要十块厚皮。"
L["Pratt McGrubben teaches Wild Leather at Feathermoon Stronghold, and warned me up front that I'd be working for him while I learned. I pictured sweeping the shop. He meant armor, made by me and handed to him in pairs of turtle scale and nightscape, with a wildvine tucked into every order.\n\nThe wildvines are the trick. They're potent and chaotic, so whatever you stitch one into comes out strong in ways you can't call in advance. Pratt calls the result second to none, guaranteed.\n\nWith every pattern paid for but one, Pratt wrote a letter and sent me to his own teacher, Telonis, in Darnassus. Telonis read it and allowed that Pratt reminds him of a night elf sometimes, which I took to be the warmest thing Darnassus says about a human. Then the cloak pattern was mine. Few in the world know it, Telonis says."] = "普拉特·马克格鲁比在羽月要塞教蛮皮手艺，一开始就跟我讲明了，学的时候得替他干活。我还以为是扫扫铺子。他说的是护甲，由我来做，龟鳞的、夜色的，都是两件一交，每笔订单里还得塞上一株野葡萄。\n\n门道全在野葡萄上。这东西力量强大又混乱无序，不管缝进什么里面，做出来的东西都会很强，只是强在哪儿，事先谁也说不准。普拉特说，这样做出来的东西无与伦比，包你满意。\n\n除了最后一张，所有图样我都付了账。普拉特写了一封信，让我去达纳苏斯找他自己的老师泰龙尼斯。泰龙尼斯读完信，承认普拉特有时候让他想起一个暗夜精灵。我觉得在达纳苏斯，这大概是对人类最热情的评价了。接着，披风的图样就归我了。泰龙尼斯说，世上知道这张图样的人可不多。"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider teaches Wild Leather at Camp Mojache, and warned me up front that I'd be working for him while I learned. I pictured hauling hides. He meant armor, made by me and handed to him in pairs of turtle scale and nightscape, with a wildvine tucked into every order.\n\nThe wildvines are the trick. They're potent and chaotic, so whatever you stitch one into comes out strong in ways you can't call in advance. Jangdor calls the result second to none, guaranteed.\n\nWith every pattern paid for but one, Jangdor wrote a letter and sent me up to Thunder Bluff, to Una, who brought him into the craft. Una read it and was pleased to see one of her finest students with a student of his own. I was pleased to get the cloak pattern. Few in the world know it, Una says."] = "杉多尔·迅蹄在莫沙彻营地教蛮皮手艺，一开始就跟我讲明了，学的时候得替他干活。我还以为是搬搬兽皮。他说的是护甲，由我来做，龟鳞的、夜色的，都是两件一交，每笔订单里还得塞上一株野葡萄。\n\n门道全在野葡萄上。这东西力量强大又混乱无序，不管缝进什么里面，做出来的东西都会很强，只是强在哪儿，事先谁也说不准。杉多尔说，这样做出来的东西无与伦比，包你满意。\n\n除了最后一张，所有图样我都付了账。杉多尔写了一封信，让我上雷霆崖去找犹纳，当年就是她带他入的行。犹纳读完信，很高兴看到自己最出色的学生之一也带起了学生。我呢，很高兴拿到了披风的图样。犹纳说，世上知道这张图样的人可不多。"
L["Wild Leather Shoulders"] = "蛮皮护肩"
L["Wild Leather Vest"] = "蛮皮外衣"
L["Wild Leather Helmet"] = "蛮皮头盔"
L["Wild Leather Boots"] = "蛮皮战靴"
L["Wild Leather Leggings"] = "蛮皮护腿"
L["Pratt McGrubben, Feathermoon Stronghold, then Telonis, Darnassus"] = "普拉特·马克格鲁比，羽月要塞，随后前往泰龙尼斯，达纳苏斯"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider"] = "杉多尔·迅蹄"
L["Jangdor Swiftstrider, Camp Mojache, then Una, Thunder Bluff"] = "杉多尔·迅蹄，莫沙彻营地，随后前往犹纳，雷霆崖"
L["The Three Arts"] = "三门技艺"
L["The leatherworking trade has three high arts, and you may learn only one. Peter Galen in Azshara teaches dragonscale. Sarah Tanner in Searing Gorge teaches elemental leatherworking, and Caryssia Moonhunter at Thalanaar in Feralas teaches tribal. Each has a price for taking you on."] = "制皮这一行有三门高深的技艺，而你只能学其中一门。艾萨拉的彼得·加林教龙鳞制皮，灼热峡谷的萨拉·坦尼教元素制皮，菲拉斯萨兰纳尔的凯雷希亚·猎月教部族制皮。想拜他们为师，各有各的代价。"
L["The leatherworking trade has three high arts, and you may learn only one. Thorkaf Dragoneye in the Badlands teaches dragonscale. Brumn Winterhoof in the Arathi Highlands teaches elemental leatherworking, and Se'Jib in Stranglethorn Vale teaches tribal. Each has a price for taking you on."] = "制皮这一行有三门高深的技艺，而你只能学其中一门。荒芜之地的索卡夫·龙眼教龙鳞制皮，阿拉希高地的布鲁姆·白蹄教元素制皮，荆棘谷的瑟伊布教部族制皮。想拜他们为师，各有各的代价。"
L["At the top, the leatherworking trade splits three ways, and each way has a master of its own. Every one of them asks for the same promise before teaching you a thing. Learn this art and the other two are closed to you for good.\n\nI thought it over longer than I'd admit to a customer. Then I made up my mind, gathered what my new master wanted, and went to make the promise."] = "制皮这一行做到顶，就分成三条路，每条路都有自己的大师。他们每一位在教你任何东西之前，都要你先许下同一个承诺。学了这门，另外两门就永远与你无缘。\n\n我考虑了很久，久到我不会跟顾客承认。然后我拿定主意，备齐了新师父要的东西，去许下了那个承诺。"
L["Dragonscale Leatherworking"] = "龙鳞制皮"
L["Peter Galen"] = "彼得·加林"
L["Peter Galen, out in Azshara, teaches dragonscale and wanted two kinds of proof before taking me on. Samples of my best scorpid work came first, two breastplates and two pairs of gloves. Then ten worn dragonscales, to show I could get hold of the staple of the trade. Peter said it takes a strong will to make a permanent decision like mine. It takes a fair number of scorpids, too."] = "远在艾萨拉的彼得·加林教龙鳞制皮，收我之前要两样证明。先是我最好的蝎壳作品的样品，两件胸甲和两副手套。然后是十片龙鳞，证明我弄得到这一行最基本的材料。彼得说，要做出像我这样永久的决定，需要很强的意志。其实还需要不少蝎子。"
L["Thorkaf Dragoneye"] = "索卡夫·龙眼"
L["Thorkaf Dragoneye teaches dragonscale out in the Badlands and wanted to see my scorpid work first, two breastplates and two pairs of gloves. Those I could make. The ten worn dragonscales I had to go out and find, which I suspect was the point. Once Thorkaf had the lot, the other two arts were closed to me, and I've been working in mail ever since."] = "索卡夫·龙眼在荒芜之地教龙鳞制皮，他想先看看我的蝎壳作品，两件胸甲和两副手套。这些我做得出来。那十片龙鳞就得我自己出门去找了，我怀疑这才是重点。等索卡夫拿齐了东西，另外两门技艺就对我关上了门，从那以后我就一直在做锁甲。"
L["Elemental Leatherworking"] = "元素制皮"
L["Sarah Tanner"] = "萨拉·坦尼"
L["Sarah Tanner teaches elemental leatherworking in Searing Gorge and wanted proof that I was in tune with the elements, which meant bringing two each of their purest essences. Fire, water, earth and wind. I got them the usual way, off the elementals themselves. Sarah said the elements accepted me. They hadn't seemed to at the time."] = "萨拉·坦尼在灼热峡谷教元素制皮，她要我证明自己与元素心意相通，也就是把它们最纯粹的精华各带两份回来。火、水、土、风。我用的是老办法，直接从元素生物身上弄。萨拉说元素接纳了我。当时可一点也看不出来。"
L["Brumn Winterhoof"] = "布鲁姆·白蹄"
L["Brumn Winterhoof teaches elemental leatherworking out in the Arathi Highlands, and a place cost two each of the elements' essences, hearts of fire, globes of water, cores of earth and breaths of wind. I got them the usual way, off the elementals themselves, who had opinions about it. Once Brumn had them all, the other two arts were closed to me."] = "布鲁姆·白蹄在阿拉希高地教元素制皮，想拜他为师，就得交上火焰之心、纯水之球、大地之核和风之气息各两份。我用的是老办法，直接从元素生物身上弄，它们对此颇有意见。等布鲁姆收齐了，另外两门技艺就对我关上了门。"
L["Tribal Leatherworking"] = "部族制皮"
L["Caryssia Moonhunter"] = "凯雷希亚·猎月"
L["Caryssia Moonhunter teaches tribal leatherworking at Thalanaar, on the eastern edge of Feralas, and asked first for an offering to nature. Nature, it seems, wanted my finest Wild Leather, a vest and a helmet. I'd have liked to see nature wear them. Caryssia took them on nature's behalf and promised I'd soon be bending it to my will."] = "凯雷希亚·猎月在菲拉斯东边的萨兰纳尔教部族制皮，她先要我向自然献上一份祭品。看来自然想要的是我最好的蛮皮作品，一件外衣和一顶头盔。我倒真想看看自然穿上它们是什么样子。凯雷希亚代自然收下了，还向我保证，用不了多久我就能让自然听我使唤。"
L["Se'Jib"] = "瑟伊布"
L["Se'Jib teaches tribal leatherworking southeast of Grom'gol, in Stranglethorn, and asked first for an offering to nature. Nature wanted my finest Wild Leather, a vest and a helmet. I'd have liked to see nature wear them. Se'Jib took them on nature's behalf, and after that the other two arts were closed to me."] = "瑟伊布在荆棘谷格罗姆高的东南边教部族制皮，他先要我向自然献上一份祭品。自然想要的是我最好的蛮皮作品，一件外衣和一顶头盔。我倒真想看看自然穿上它们是什么样子。瑟伊布代自然收下了，从那以后，另外两门技艺就对我关上了门。"
-- WoW Forever secret: The Dawn Waker
L["The Dawn Waker"] = "黎明唤醒者"
L["An old ring from Zephras Isle, dented, with Kaldorei writing worn into the band. A hilt in the ruins of Ban'aethal that only shows itself by torchlight. Ealaane Nimbuswalker knows something about the blade that once fit it.\n\nThis is a secret, and its end hasn't been found yet. The trail crosses Kalimdor as far as anyone has followed it, and some of it takes a group."] = "一枚来自泽风岛的旧戒指，坑坑洼洼，指环上的卡多雷文字已经磨得很浅。班奈希尔废墟里有一把剑柄，只在火光下才会现身。埃拉内·漫云知道一些关于那把曾与它相配的剑刃的事。\n\n这是一个秘密，结局至今还没人找到。就大家目前追到的地方而言，这条线索横跨了卡利姆多，有些路段还得组队才能走。"
L["Zephras Isle / Darkshore / Ashenvale / Shen'dralas / Feralas / Azshara / Winterspring / Mount Hyjal"] = "泽风岛 / 黑海岸 / 灰谷 / 辛德拉拉斯 / 菲拉斯 / 艾萨拉 / 冬泉谷 / 海加尔山"
L["The Ancient Hilt"] = "古老剑柄"
L["Ancient Hilt"] = "古老的剑柄"
L["the Ruins of Ban'aethal, Zephras Isle"] = "班奈希尔废墟，泽风岛"
L["the Grove of the Ancients, Darkshore"] = "古树之林，黑海岸"
L["Zoram Strand, Ashenvale"] = "佐拉姆海岸，灰谷"
L["The Ancient Heirloom"] = "古代传家宝"
L["Rorian the Dayseeker hands an old ring to every Skyborne who comes of age in Thendal Village, and another lies upstairs in a house close by. Wear it, carry a Night Watchman's Torch into the ruins of Ban'aethal, and see what the light turns up. Ealaane Nimbuswalker will want to hear about it."] = "在森达尔村，每个成年的天裔都会从逐日者罗里安手里拿到一枚旧戒指，附近一栋房子的楼上还放着另一枚。戴上它，带着守夜人火炬走进班奈希尔废墟，看看火光会照出什么。埃拉内·漫云会想听听这件事的。"
L["I came by an old ring on Zephras Isle. It's dented, and the inside of the band carries a line of Kaldorei script worn so thin I could barely read it. I put it on because it fit.\n\nThere's a dragon asleep in the ruins of Ban'aethal and a hilt there that only shows up by torchlight. I let the dragon sleep and took the hilt to Ealaane Nimbuswalker. She went quiet for a while, then asked me to find the blade that belonged with it.\n\nThe blade wasn't anywhere you'd look on purpose, and I looked in a lot of places before I found it. Ealaane gave it its name, Eluvi'ana, the Night Dancer, and handed it back to me with the hilt. She watched the hilt until I put it away."] = "我在泽风岛弄到了一枚旧戒指。上面有凹痕，指环内侧刻着一行卡多雷文字，磨得太浅，我差点认不出来。我把它戴上了，因为大小正合适。\n\n班奈希尔废墟里睡着一条龙，那里还有一把剑柄，只在火光下才会现身。我让那条龙接着睡，把剑柄带去给了埃拉内·漫云。她沉默了好一会儿，然后请我去找那把本该和它配成一对的剑刃。\n\n那把剑刃不在任何人会特意去找的地方，我找了很多地方才找到。埃拉内给它起了名字，艾露薇亚娜，夜之舞者，然后把它连同剑柄一起还给了我。在我把剑柄收起来之前，她的目光一直没离开过它。"
L["Ancient Heirloom"] = "古代传家宝"
L["Get the Ancient Heirloom. Rorian the Dayseeker gives one to the Skyborne once they come of age, and another lies on the top floor of a house close by."] = "取得古代传家宝。逐日者罗里安会把它交给成年的天裔，附近一栋房子的顶楼还放着另一枚。"
L["Eluvi'ana"] = "艾露薇亚娜"
L["Ealaane Nimbuswalker"] = "埃拉内·漫云"
L["The Befouled Water Globe"] = "被污染的水球"
L["The naga in Darkshore's Ruins of Mathystra each carry a piece of an old amulet. Put it together and take it to the water by the ruins, and something that has guarded them a long time will come up to meet you."] = "黑海岸玛塞斯特拉废墟的纳迦，每个身上都带着一块旧护符的碎片。把护符拼起来，带到废墟旁的水边，某个守护这片废墟很久的东西就会浮上来见你。"
L["Baron Aquanis, a water elemental in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, guards a globe of strange water. Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring, at Zoram'gar Outpost, would very much like to see it."] = "阿奎尼斯男爵是个水元素，待在黑暗深渊被水淹没的大厅里，守着一颗奇怪的水球。大地之环的耶努萨克雷就在佐拉姆加前哨站，他非常想看看这颗水球。"
L["The naga in the Ruins of Mathystra carry an old amulet around in pieces, a few to each naga. Twenty pieces later I had the whole thing, and at the water by the ruins it called up Baron Marinous. He came up angry and didn't last, and he left a clouded glass globe behind.\n\nI took the globe to Onu in the Grove of the Ancients. Onu held it a long while before giving it back, and by then the water inside had gone dark and foul. I've carried it around ever since."] = "玛塞斯特拉废墟的纳迦带着一枚旧护符到处跑，只不过是拆成碎片带的，每个纳迦身上几块。凑够二十块之后，我拼出了完整的护符，在废墟旁的水边，它把马里诺斯男爵召了上来。他一上来就怒气冲冲，没撑多久，留下了一颗浑浊的玻璃水球。\n\n我把水球带到古树之林交给安努。安努捧着它过了很久才还给我，那时里面的水已经变得又黑又臭。从那以后，我就一直带着它。"
L["Baron Aquanis keeps to the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps. He's a water elemental, so keeping to anything is a loose way to put it. He left a globe of strange water behind, and Je'neu Sancrea of the Earthen Ring wanted a look.\n\nJe'neu studied it for a long time. When I asked for the globe back, he gave it to me. The water inside had gone dark and foul, and I've carried it around ever since."] = "阿奎尼斯男爵一直待在黑暗深渊那些被淹没的大厅里。他是个水元素，说他“待”在哪儿，本来就只是个大概的说法。他留下了一颗奇怪的水球，大地之环的耶努萨克雷想看一看。\n\n耶努萨克雷研究了很久。我开口要回水球，他就还给了我。里面的水已经变得又黑又臭，从那以后我就一直带着它。"
L["Mathystral Amulet"] = "玛塞斯特拉护符"
L["the Ruins of Mathystra, Darkshore"] = "玛塞斯特拉废墟，黑海岸"
L["Collect 20 Mathystral Amulet Fragments from the naga in the Ruins of Mathystra and put the amulet together."] = "从玛塞斯特拉废墟的纳迦身上收集20块玛塞斯特拉护符碎片，把护符拼合起来。"
L["Baron Marinous"] = "马里诺斯男爵"
L["Clouded Water Globe"] = "浑浊的水球"
L["the water by the Ruins of Mathystra, Darkshore"] = "玛塞斯特拉废墟旁的水边，黑海岸"
L["Befouled Water Globe"] = "被污染的水球"
L["Onu"] = "安努"
L["Speak with Onu again and ask for the globe back."] = "再次与安努交谈，要回水球。"
L["Speak with Je'neu Sancrea again and ask for the globe back."] = "再次与耶努萨克雷交谈，要回水球。"
L["The Highborne Spirit"] = "上层精灵幽灵"
L["Wear the old ring on Zoram Strand, in Ashenvale, with the befouled globe in your pack, and you won't be alone on the beach for long."] = "背包里装着那颗被污染的水球，戴上旧戒指去灰谷的佐拉姆海岸，你在海滩上不会孤单太久。"
L["On Zoram Strand, with the ring on my finger and the globe in my pack, I met a Highborne spirit who had been waiting a very long time for someone carrying exactly that. He sent me up the Tower of Althalaxx in Darkshore.\n\nAthrikus Narassin keeps the top of that tower, and he kept the key to the strongbox behind him on his belt. Inside the box was his tome. I brought it back to the beach, and the spirit sent me on to Shen'dralas."] = "在佐拉姆海岸，我手上戴着戒指，背包里装着水球，遇见了一个上层精灵的幽灵。他等了很久很久，等的就是带着这两样东西的人。他让我去爬黑海岸的奥萨拉克斯之塔。\n\n埃瑟里克斯·纳拉辛占着那座塔的塔顶，他身后那个保险箱的钥匙，原本挂在他的腰带上。箱子里是他的典籍。我把它带回海滩，幽灵又打发我去了辛德拉拉斯。"
L["Narassin's Tome"] = "纳拉辛的典籍"
L["Highborne Spirit"] = "上层精灵幽灵"
L["Wear the Ancient Heirloom and speak with the Highborne Spirit on Zoram Strand while carrying the Befouled Water Globe. Then take the Azsharan Key from Athrikus Narassin at the top of the Tower of Althalaxx in Darkshore and open the strongbox behind him."] = "携带被污染的水球，戴上古代传家宝，与佐拉姆海岸的上层精灵幽灵交谈。然后从黑海岸奥萨拉克斯之塔顶端的埃瑟里克斯·纳拉辛身上取得艾萨拉钥匙，打开他身后的保险箱。"
L["Synthesis"] = "合成"
L["Mordent Evenshade, outside the temple in Shen'dralas, knows what Narassin's Tome is for. Bring him the tome with the hilt, the Night Dancer and the globe, and he'll tell you what it takes to make the water clean again. Some of it takes a group of five."] = "辛德拉拉斯神殿外的莫登特·暮影知道纳拉辛的典籍是做什么用的。把典籍连同剑柄、夜之舞者和水球一起带给他，他会告诉你怎样才能让水重新变得洁净。其中有些事需要五人小队。"
L["Mordent Evenshade read Narassin's tome and told me the globe needed a Star of Elune, an Abyssal Mote and the Tears of Anguish, none of them anywhere near Shen'dralas.\n\nThe star sat in a vault in the ogre temple in southern Feralas, a vault you only see with the ring on. Opening it took five of us, four pulling switches around the temple at once and one at the vault. The mote was in a chest at the bottom of the sea off Azshara. The tears came off the Highborne ghosts at Lake Kel'theril, and only some of them had any to give."] = "莫登特·暮影读了纳拉辛的典籍，告诉我这颗水球需要一颗艾露恩之星、一颗深渊微粒，还有苦痛之泪，而这些东西没有一样在辛德拉拉斯附近。\n\n那颗星放在菲拉斯南部食人魔神殿的一座宝库里，那座宝库只有戴着戒指才看得见。打开它要五个人，四个人在神殿各处同时拉动开关，一个人守在宝库前。微粒在艾萨拉外海海底的一个箱子里。泪水是从凯斯利尔湖的上层精灵鬼魂身上拿到的，而且不是每个鬼魂都有得给。"
L["Star of Elune"] = "艾露恩之星"
L["the ogre temple in southern Feralas"] = "菲拉斯南部的食人魔神殿"
L["Wear the Ancient Heirloom and find the Shen'dralar Vault on the temple's ground floor. Four Ancient Switches around the temple must be pulled at the same moment to open it, so bring four friends."] = "戴上古代传家宝，在神殿一楼找到辛德拉宝库。要打开它，必须同时拉动神殿各处的四个古代开关，所以带上四个朋友。"
L["Abyssal Mote"] = "深渊微粒"
L["under the water off Azshara"] = "艾萨拉外海的水下"
L["Finish the quests that begin with Kirith and end with Azsharite, then open the Abyssal Chest under the water in Azshara."] = "完成从“基利斯”开始、到“艾萨拉水晶”结束的系列任务，然后打开艾萨拉水下的深渊宝箱。"
L["Tears of Anguish"] = "苦痛之泪"
L["Lake Kel'theril, Winterspring"] = "凯斯利尔湖，冬泉谷"
L["Once Mordent Evenshade has told you what the globe needs, take the Tears of Anguish from the Anguished Highborne and Suffering Highborne at Lake Kel'theril."] = "在莫登特·暮影告诉你水球需要什么之后，从凯斯利尔湖的痛苦的上层精灵和受难的上层精灵身上取得苦痛之泪。"
L["The Shrine of Coalescence"] = "聚合神龛"
L["With the star, the mote and the tears in hand, Mordent sends you to Hyjal, to the Shrine of Coalescence."] = "艾露恩之星、深渊微粒和苦痛之泪都已到手，莫登特让你前往海加尔山的聚合神龛。"
L["At the Shrine of Coalescence in Hyjal I laid out the star, the mote and the tears and used the globe, and the water inside it cleared.\n\nWith the water clear I could see what the globe was. It held the last of an elemental that once guarded a Highborne city, and I had met that elemental at the bottom of its own ruins and killed it. When I brought the globe back to Shen'dralas, Mordent didn't hold that against me."] = "在海加尔山的聚合神龛，我摆好了星、微粒和泪水，用了水球，里面的水就变清了。\n\n水清了，我才看出这颗水球是什么。里面装着一个元素最后残存的部分，它曾经守护过一座上层精灵的城市，而我在它自己的废墟底下遇见了它，还把它杀了。我把水球带回辛德拉拉斯的时候，莫登特倒也没为这件事跟我计较。"
L["Cleansed Water Globe"] = "净化的水球"
L["the Shrine of Coalescence, Mount Hyjal"] = "聚合神龛，海加尔山"
L["Take the Star of Elune, the Abyssal Mote and the Tears of Anguish to the Shrine of Coalescence in Hyjal, and use the Befouled Water Globe there."] = "把艾露恩之星、深渊微粒和苦痛之泪带到海加尔山的聚合神龛，在那里使用被污染的水球。"
L["The Two Blades"] = "两把剑"
L["Mordent has heard the clean globe out, and sends you to the last prince of Eldre'Thalas in Dire Maul. Prince Tortheldrin remembers two blades. This is as far as anyone has followed the Dawn Waker so far."] = "莫登特听完了净化后的水球要说的话，打发你去厄运之槌找埃雷萨拉斯的最后一位王子。托塞德林王子记得两把剑。到目前为止，大家追寻黎明唤醒者，也只走到了这一步。"
L["Mordent sent me to Dire Maul, to Prince Tortheldrin, who spoke of two blades, Eluvi'ana and Eluvi'tor, and of knowledge kept for those honored in his court. I had one of the blades on my belt already.\n\nLorekeeper Lydros made me an Arcanum of Binding out of a libram, a black diamond, two brilliant shards and an arcane crystal, and I bound the old hilt with it. When I went back, the prince gave me a scrawled note. It's a short riddle. Day has to wake where night dances, and something has to be cast in flames born of air.\n\nThat's where the trail stops for now, for me and for everyone else hunting it. I keep the hilt and the Night Dancer together, in case the answer turns up."] = "莫登特让我去厄运之槌找托塞德林王子。王子说起了两把剑，艾露薇亚娜和艾露薇托尔，还说起一些只留给他宫廷中受敬重之人的学识。其中一把剑，早就挂在我的腰带上了。\n\n博学者莱德罗斯用一本圣典、一颗黑钻石、两块魔光碎片和一块奥术水晶，给我做了一份束缚秘药，我用它束缚了那把旧剑柄。我回去之后，王子给了我一张潦草的字条，上面是一个简短的谜语。白昼必须在黑夜起舞之处醒来，还有某样东西必须在生于空气的火焰中铸成。\n\n线索暂时就断在这里，对我是这样，对其他所有追寻它的人也是。我把剑柄和夜之舞者放在一起，以防哪天答案自己冒出来。"
L["Libram of Binding"] = "束缚圣典"
L["Dire Maul, Feralas"] = "厄运之槌，菲拉斯"
L["Scrawled Note"] = "潦草的字条"
L["Prince Tortheldrin"] = "托塞德林王子"
L["Use the Arcanum of Binding on the Ancient Hilt, then speak with Prince Tortheldrin again. The note's riddle is still unsolved."] = "对古老的剑柄使用束缚秘药，然后再次与托塞德林王子交谈。字条上的谜语至今无人解开。"
-- WoW Forever: Strahnbrad Mystery
L["Strahnbrad Mystery"] = "斯坦恩布莱德之谜"
L["Strahnbrad is a ruined town in the Alterac Mountains, and the Syndicate runs its business from there. The Syndicate is a gang of thieves led by Alterac's old nobility. Southshore wants them gone, and Tarren Mill has put a price on one of their barons.\n\nThe gang has a mystery of its own. The casters in Strahnbrad pass around a singed note about the old bellows at the town forge, which are said to come to life when no one is watching."] = "斯坦恩布莱德是奥特兰克山脉中一座已成废墟的小镇，辛迪加就在那里做买卖。辛迪加是一伙由奥特兰克旧贵族领导的盗贼。南海镇想除掉他们，塔伦米尔则对他们的一位男爵发出了悬赏。\n\n这伙人自己也有一桩谜案。斯坦恩布莱德的施法者们传阅着一张焦灼的便笺，说的是镇上熔炉边那对旧风箱，据说没人看着的时候，它们就会活过来。"
L["Southshore's last magistrate was murdered, and the killers were never found. Magistrate Henry Maleb, the new one, is almost certain they were hired by the Syndicate, a gang of thieves led by the old nobles of fallen Alterac.\n\nThe Syndicate keeps a camp in the mountains north of Tarren Mill and its headquarters in the ruins of Strahnbrad. Maleb would like to begin with the camp."] = "南海镇的上一任镇长遭到谋杀，凶手始终没有找到。新任的赫尼·马雷布镇长几乎可以肯定，凶手是辛迪加雇来的。辛迪加是一伙盗贼，首领是已经覆灭的奥特兰克王国的旧贵族。\n\n辛迪加在塔伦米尔以北的山里有一处营地，总部则设在斯坦恩布莱德的废墟中。马雷布想先从营地下手。"
L["A wanted poster in Tarren Mill names Baron Vardus, one of the old Alterac nobles who lead the Syndicate, a gang of thieves in the mountains to the north. High Executor Darthalia wants his head.\n\nThe Syndicate's headquarters is the ruined town of Strahnbrad. The casters there pass around a singed note about the old bellows at the town forge, which are said to come to life when no one is watching."] = "塔伦米尔的一张通缉令上写着瓦杜斯男爵的名字。他是领导辛迪加的奥特兰克旧贵族之一，辛迪加则是北边山里的一伙盗贼。高级执行官达萨利亚想要他的人头。\n\n辛迪加的总部设在已成废墟的小镇斯坦恩布莱德。那里的施法者们传阅着一张焦灼的便笺，说的是镇上熔炉边那对旧风箱，据说没人看着的时候，它们就会活过来。"
L["Alterac Mountains / Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "奥特兰克山脉 / 希尔斯布莱德丘陵"
L["Syndicate Assassins"] = "辛迪加刺客"
L["Magistrate Henry Maleb"] = "赫尼·马雷布镇长"
L["the Syndicate camp at Sofera's Naze, Alterac Mountains"] = "索菲亚高地的辛迪加营地，奥特兰克山脉"
L["the wanted poster in Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "塔伦米尔的通缉令，希尔斯布莱德丘陵"
L["Southshore's new magistrate, Henry Maleb, has the job because the last one was murdered. The killers were never found, but Maleb's clues point to a Syndicate camp in the mountains north of Tarren Mill. Find him in the town hall."] = "南海镇的新任镇长赫尼·马雷布能坐上这个位子，是因为上一任遭人谋杀。凶手始终没有找到，但马雷布掌握的线索指向塔伦米尔以北山里的一处辛迪加营地。去市政厅找他吧。"
L["Southshore's new magistrate has the job because the last one was murdered, and Henry Maleb is almost certain the Syndicate paid for it. His clues led to a Syndicate camp in the mountains north of Tarren Mill, so I went up and started on their footpads and thieves.\n\nOn a table in the camp at Sofera's Naze lay a list of supplies, everything from food to masks and poison, wanted in a hurry for what it called an important mission against Southshore. Maleb found it very troubling and decided the Syndicate had declared war on his town.\n\nThe gang is run by Alterac's old nobles, who hide among the common members. You tell them apart by the signet ring, Maleb said. I brought seven back from the ruins of Strahnbrad, and the magistrate said the Syndicate was now just a gang of thugs. I'd thought of them that way from the start."] = "南海镇的新镇长能坐上这个位子，是因为上一任遭人谋杀，而赫尼·马雷布几乎可以肯定，出钱的是辛迪加。他的线索指向塔伦米尔以北山里的一处辛迪加营地，于是我上了山，先从他们的劫匪和窃贼下手。\n\n索菲亚高地营地里的一张桌子上放着一份补给清单，从食物到面具和毒药应有尽有，要得很急，说是为了一项针对南海镇的重要任务。马雷布觉得这事非常令人不安，认定辛迪加已经向他的小镇宣战了。\n\n这伙人由奥特兰克的旧贵族掌管，他们藏在普通成员中间。马雷布说，要靠徽记之戒才能认出他们。我从斯坦恩布莱德的废墟里带回了七枚，镇长说辛迪加现在不过是一群暴徒了。我从一开始就是这么看他们的。"
L["Foreboding Plans"] = "预备行动计划"
L["Syndicate Documents"] = "辛迪加文档"
L["Noble Deaths"] = "贵族之死"
L["Baron Vardus"] = "瓦杜斯男爵"
L["Shadowy Assassins still slip into Southshore now and then, and one of them carries a contract. Take it and bring it to Magistrate Maleb in the town hall, who will want to know whose name is on it."] = "暗影刺客仍会不时潜入南海镇，其中一个身上带着一份契约。把它拿到手，交给市政厅里的马雷布镇长，他会想知道上面写的是谁的名字。"
L["A wanted poster in Tarren Mill names Baron Vardus, one of the old Alterac nobles who lead the Syndicate up in the mountains. High Executor Darthalia will pay for his head."] = "塔伦米尔的一张通缉令上写着瓦杜斯男爵的名字，他是在山里领导辛迪加的奥特兰克旧贵族之一。高级执行官达萨利亚会为他的人头付赏金。"
L["The Syndicate hadn't given up on Southshore. Their assassins still slipped into town now and then, and one I killed was carrying a contract, which seems careless for someone in that trade. I took it to Maleb.\n\nAfter reading it, the magistrate wanted the head of Baron Vardus, one of the nobles who lead the Syndicate. Vardus moves around the Alterac Mountains, so finding him took some walking, and getting the head off him took less time than that. I brought it back down to Southshore and handed it over."] = "辛迪加并没有放过南海镇。他们的刺客仍会不时溜进镇里，我杀掉的一个身上还带着一份契约，对干这一行的人来说，这可有点粗心。我把契约交给了马雷布。\n\n镇长读完之后，想要瓦杜斯男爵的人头，他是领导辛迪加的贵族之一。瓦杜斯在奥特兰克山脉里四处走动，所以找他费了不少脚力，把他的头拿下来倒没花那么久。我把头带回山下的南海镇，交了上去。"
L["There's a wanted poster up in Tarren Mill for Baron Vardus. The Syndicate is a gang of thieves led by what's left of Alterac's nobility, and Vardus is one of those nobles. The poster still calls him Baron, which is more courtesy than most wanted men get.\n\nHigh Executor Darthalia wanted his head. Vardus moves around the Alterac Mountains, so finding him took some walking, and getting the head off him took less time than that. I carried it back down to Tarren Mill and collected the bounty from Darthalia."] = "塔伦米尔贴着一张瓦杜斯男爵的通缉令。辛迪加是一伙盗贼，领头的是奥特兰克贵族的残余，瓦杜斯就是其中之一。通缉令上还尊称他一声男爵，大多数通缉犯可没这份礼遇。\n\n高级执行官达萨利亚想要他的人头。瓦杜斯在奥特兰克山脉里四处走动，所以找他费了不少脚力，把他的头拿下来倒没花那么久。我把头带回山下的塔伦米尔，从达萨利亚那里领了赏金。"
L["Assassin's Contract"] = "刺客的契约"
L["the Shadowy Assassins, Southshore, Hillsbrad Foothills"] = "暗影刺客所在地，南海镇，希尔斯布莱德丘陵"
L["Baron's Demise"] = "男爵之死"
L["WANTED: Baron Vardus"] = "通缉：瓦杜斯男爵"
L["The Syndicate's casters in Strahnbrad carry a singed note. Rumor has it the old bellows at the town forge come to life when no one is watching. The note is scorched as if by fire magic, and the forge might want a taste of the same."] = "斯坦恩布莱德的辛迪加施法者身上带着一张焦灼的便笺。传言说，镇上熔炉边的旧风箱会在没人看着的时候活过来。便笺像是被火焰魔法烧焦的，那座熔炉说不定也想尝尝同样的滋味。"
L["One of the Syndicate's casters in Strahnbrad had a singed note on them. According to the note, the old bellows at the town forge had a mind of their own and came to life when no one was watching. Whoever wrote it wanted the matter cleared up before coming back, ghost story or not.\n\nSo I went and watched the bellows. They did nothing, which to be fair is what the rumor said they'd do. Then I gave each of them some fire. A flare went up over my head both times, and after the second an ancient fire elemental came out of the top of the forge and landed between them.\n\nIt was made of fire and didn't mind more of it, so I put it out the hard way. Afterward I took my findings down to Kundric Zanden, the town historian in Southshore."] = "斯坦恩布莱德的一个辛迪加施法者身上带着一张焦灼的便笺。照便笺上的说法，镇上熔炉边那对旧风箱有自己的主意，没人看着的时候就会活过来。写便笺的人希望在自己回来之前把这事弄清楚，管它是不是鬼故事。\n\n于是我去盯着那对风箱看。它们什么也没做，说句公道话，传言里本来就是这么说的。然后我给它们各来了一把火。两次都有一道火光从我头顶升起，第二次之后，一个远古火元素从熔炉顶上冒了出来，落在两个风箱中间。\n\n它本身就是火做的，再多点火也不在乎，所以我只好硬碰硬地把它扑灭。之后我下山去了南海镇，把我的发现告诉了镇上的历史学家昆迪瑞克·赞德恩。"
L["One of the Syndicate's casters in Strahnbrad had a singed note on them. According to the note, the old bellows at the town forge had a mind of their own and came to life when no one was watching. Whoever wrote it wanted the matter cleared up before coming back, ghost story or not.\n\nSo I went and watched the bellows. They did nothing, which to be fair is what the rumor said they'd do. Then I gave each of them some fire. A flare went up over my head both times, and after the second an ancient fire elemental came out of the top of the forge and landed between them.\n\nIt was made of fire and didn't mind more of it, so I put it out the hard way. Afterward I took my findings down to Shara Blazen in Tarren Mill."] = "斯坦恩布莱德的一个辛迪加施法者身上带着一张焦灼的便笺。照便笺上的说法，镇上熔炉边那对旧风箱有自己的主意，没人看着的时候就会活过来。写便笺的人希望在自己回来之前把这事弄清楚，管它是不是鬼故事。\n\n于是我去盯着那对风箱看。它们什么也没做，说句公道话，传言里本来就是这么说的。然后我给它们各来了一把火。两次都有一道火光从我头顶升起，第二次之后，一个远古火元素从熔炉顶上冒了出来，落在两个风箱中间。\n\n它本身就是火做的，再多点火也不在乎，所以我只好硬碰硬地把它扑灭。之后我下山回到塔伦米尔，把我的发现告诉了莎拉·布拉森。"
L["the Syndicate Wizards and Argus Shadow Mages, Strahnbrad, Alterac Mountains"] = "辛迪加巫师和暗影大法师所在地，斯坦恩布莱德，奥特兰克山脉"
