L["The spirit totem wasn't enough, it turned out. Bath'rah wanted voodoo in it, and the strongest voodoo around was in the feathers of six trolls down in the Sunken Temple. They were still using them. I took them anyway.\n\nBath'rah worked the feathers into the totem and announced it was about time a troll got a full night's rest, then handed me something from a long life of collecting, for my trouble. The spirits of that place still don't care for Bath'rah. Now they have to get past the totem first."] = "结果，光有灵魂图腾还不够。巴斯拉想往里面加点巫毒，而附近最强的巫毒，就在沉没的神庙底下六个巨魔的羽毛里。他们还在用那些羽毛呢。我还是拿走了。\n\n巴斯拉把羽毛编进图腾，宣布也该让巨魔好好睡上一整晚了，然后从他漫长一生攒下的收藏里拿了一样东西给我，算是辛苦费。那地方的灵魂到现在还是看巴斯拉不顺眼。只不过现在，它们得先过图腾这一关。"
L["Master Gadrin turned the spider god's true name into a spell of summoning and sent me to read it at the altar of Shadra'Alor, deep in Witherbark country. I read it, and Shadra came. The Witherbark get their strongest venom from her. Now so did I.\n\nApothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill was delighted. One drop had killed nearly two dozen rabbits, he told me, though he admitted some of them had been very small. He wanted a sample sent to his superior in the Undercity, so I carried it there, and the Royal Apothecary Society called my service undeniable. Nobody asked the rabbits."] = "加德林大师把蜘蛛之神的真名变成了一道召唤法术，派我到枯木巨魔地盘深处的沙德拉洛祭坛去念。我念了，沙德拉就来了。枯木巨魔最厉害的毒液就是从她那儿弄来的。这回我也弄到了。\n\n塔伦米尔的药剂师林度恩高兴坏了。他告诉我，一滴就毒死了将近两打兔子，不过他也承认，其中有几只个头很小。他想把样本送给他在幽暗城的上司，于是我把它送了过去，皇家药剂师协会说我的贡献无可否认。没人问过兔子的意见。"
L["Grimshade kept his end of the bargain. He asked for room to work and warned me that if the ritual went wrong, I'd better close my eyes. It didn't. Sharpbeak was in a cage at the top of Jintha'Alor, and the high priestess of the Vilebranch trolls had the key.\n\nGryphon Master Talonaxe took the news about as calmly as a dwarf can, which is to say not at all. So up I went, all the way to the top of Jintha'Alor, took the key off the priestess, and opened the cage.\n\nSharpbeak's parents flew home with him and fussed over him like new parents, and Talonaxe admitted to a little mist in the eyes. The gryphons of Aerie Peak will sing my name, he says, for a long, long time."] = "格希德说到做到。他要我给他腾出地方干活，还警告我，要是仪式出了岔子，我最好把眼睛闭上。没出岔子。沙普比克被关在辛萨罗山顶的一只笼子里，钥匙在邪枝巨魔的高阶女祭司手上。\n\n狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧听到这消息，拿出了一个矮人所能有的全部冷静，也就是说，一点也没有。于是我上去了，一路爬到辛萨罗的最顶上，从女祭司身上拿走钥匙，打开了笼子。\n\n沙普比克的爸妈带着它飞回了家，围着它团团转，跟头一回当爹妈似的。沙拉克·鹰斧承认自己眼眶有点湿。他说，鹰巢山的狮鹫会传唱我的名字，很久很久。"
L["Through an oathstone of the green dragonflight, a dragon named Itharius spoke straight into my mind. If I gave him the gem that had chained what was left of Eranikus, we would work together to redeem him. I gave it up. Itharius said my choices so far had been the right ones, and that my deeds from here on would decide whether that continued. No pressure.\n\nFirst we needed to speak with Eranikus through the gem, so Itharius sent me to the far east of Winterspring, to a medium named Umbranse who speaks for the dead. Umbranse was willing. But his best augury device had been taken from him, and without it there was nothing to be done.\n\nI'm still waiting to hear who took it."] = "通过一块绿龙军团的誓言石，一条名叫伊萨里奥斯的龙直接在我脑子里说话。他说，只要我把那块禁锢着伊兰尼库斯残存部分的宝石交给他，我们就能一起救赎伊兰尼库斯。我交了。伊萨里奥斯说，我到目前为止的选择都是对的，至于以后还能不能一直对下去，就看我接下来的所作所为了。一点压力都没有。\n\n首先我们得通过宝石跟伊兰尼库斯对话，所以伊萨里奥斯派我去冬泉谷的最东边，找一个名叫阿姆布兰希的灵媒，他能替死者说话。阿姆布兰希愿意帮忙。可他最好的占卜器具被人拿走了，没有它，什么也做不了。\n\n到底是谁拿走的，我还在等消息。"
L["The discs from Uldaman had a sequel. Their glyphs mentioned Uldum, a place in the Tanaris desert most people call a myth, and the scholars back home wanted me to carry the discs to its sealed gates and see what happened. Nobody could say what would. They seemed to think that was the exciting part.\n\nAt the gates I touched a pedestal, the discs hummed in my pack, and another stone watcher sprang up, every bit as polite as the first. It was a guardian of entry, it said, and my discs were missing the Plates of Uldum.\n\nNobody knows where the plates are. The scholars put the whole thing on hold and paid me an honorarium. Uldum beckons, they told me. It'll have to keep beckoning."] = "奥达曼的圆盘还有续集。圆盘上的符文提到了奥丹姆，一个位于塔纳利斯沙漠、大多数人都当成神话的地方。家乡那边的学者们想让我把圆盘带到它那扇被封印的大门前，看看会发生什么。谁也说不准会发生什么。他们好像觉得这才是最刺激的部分。\n\n到了门口，我碰了一下石座，背包里的圆盘嗡嗡作响，接着又蹦出来一个石卫兵，跟第一个一样彬彬有礼。它说它是入口的守护者，还说我的圆盘缺了奥丹姆板片。\n\n没人知道那些板片在哪儿。学者们把整件事搁置了，付了我一笔酬金。他们说，奥丹姆在召唤。那就让它接着召唤吧。"
