L["The Flame's Casing"] = "烈焰之盒"
L["The Torch of Retribution"] = "惩戒火炬"
L["Squire Maltrake"] = "侍卫玛特拉克"
L["Set Them Ablaze!"] = "烧掉它们！"
L["Trinkets..."] = "打开箱子…"
L["Broodling Essence"] = "雏龙精华"
L["Chillwind Horns"] = "冰风奇美拉角"
L["Return to Tinkee"] = "返回丁奇身边"
L["Velarok Windblade"] = "威拉罗克·温布雷"
L["Hoard of the Black Dragonflight"] = "黑龙的财宝"
L["Battered Dwarven Skeleton"] = "残破的矮人骸骨"
L["Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest had invented the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 and wanted eight broodling essences caught with it from the black broodlings of the Burning Steppes. I caught them. Then Tinkee had a letter for Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Felnok wanted eight uncracked chillwind horns, and what came of it was a package that had to go all the way back to Flame Crest. Gnomes invent things. Couriers walk them around."] = "烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波尔发明了龙灵采集器900型，想让人拿着它，从燃烧平原的黑色雏龙身上采集八份雏龙精华。我采到了。接着丁奇又有一封信要送给永望镇的菲诺克，菲诺克要八支完整的冰风奇美拉角，折腾到最后，换来一个包裹，还得一路送回烈焰峰。侏儒负责发明东西。信使负责拎着它们满世界溜达。"
L["Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold had found pieces of a tablet left by the Twilight's Hammer and wanted the rest. I brought eight fragments, and the restored tablet went to Hermit Ortell, who once ran with the cult and now lives alone out in the desert. Ortell wanted the three chapters of the Twilight Lexicon to read the rest of it. The cultists carrying them did not hand them over politely."] = "塞纳里奥要塞的地质学家拉克斯班找到了暮光之锤留下的几块石板残片，想把剩下的也凑齐。我带回了八块碎片，复原的石板又送到了隐士奥泰尔手里，这人当年跟着那个教派混过，如今独自住在沙漠里。奥泰尔要暮光词典的三个章节，才能把石板上剩下的内容读完。身上揣着这些章节的教徒，可没有客客气气地交出来。"
L["Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles tests people before trusting them. Faith meant stepping off a plank high over the canyon. Endurance meant Grenka's claw, strength meant the fragments of Rok'Alim, and lore meant a trip to Braug Dimspirit in the Stonetalon Mountains, who sent me after the Legacy of the Aspects and then asked me a question about it. I answered right. Braug sent me on to Parqual Fintallas in the Undercity, who had one more test waiting."] = "千针石林的多恩·平原行者信任一个人之前，总要先考验一番。信仰的试炼，就是从高悬在峡谷上方的木板上一步迈出去。耐力的试炼要格林卡的爪子，力量的试炼要罗卡里姆的碎片，知识的试炼则意味着跑一趟石爪山脉，去找布劳格·幽魂，他派我去找《巨龙的遗产》，然后就这本书问了我一个问题。我答对了。布劳格又让我去幽暗城找帕科瓦·芬塔拉斯，那里还有一场试炼等着我。"
L["Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity needed a pile of kraul guano from Razorfen Kraul. I didn't ask what for. I brought it, Faranell was thrilled, and there was more work after that."] = "幽暗城的大药剂师法拉尼尔需要从剃刀沼泽弄来一堆沼泽蝙蝠的粪便。我没问拿来干什么。我带回去了，法拉尼尔高兴坏了，而且后面还有更多活儿。"
L["Caretaker Alen at Light's Hope Chapel told me the dead of Stratholme can't rest, and that a man named Egan was trying to do something about it. All anyone knew was that Egan had last been seen around Stratholme, so that's where I looked."] = "圣光之愿礼拜堂的护理者奥林告诉我，斯坦索姆的亡者无法安息，有个叫埃根的人正想为此做点什么。大家只知道埃根最后一次露面是在斯坦索姆附近，所以我就去那儿找了。"
L["Nathanos Blightcaller doesn't hand out favors. First I had to go to the Quel'Lithien lodge in the north of the Eastern Plaguelands for the Quel'Thalas Registry, and thin out the rangers, pathstriders and woodsmen camped there. Then Nathanos wanted Duskwing, a bat that hunts north of Marris Stead, or at least a patch of its fur. After that, apparently, we could talk."] = "纳萨诺斯·凋零者可不会白白给人好处。首先，我得去东瘟疫之地北部的奎尔林斯小屋取回奎尔萨拉斯名册，顺手把驻扎在那里的游侠、巡路者和护林者清掉一批。然后纳萨诺斯要暗翼蝠，一只在玛瑞斯农场北边捕猎的蝙蝠，起码也得带回一块暗翼蝠的皮。办完这些，看样子，我们才有得谈。"
L["Marvon Rivetseeker had left something called the Stone Circle in a workshop in Ratchet and wanted it fetched. I fetched it, and Marvon had plans for it."] = "玛尔冯·瑞文斯克把一个叫石环的东西落在了棘齿城的车间里，想找人去取回来。我取回来了，而玛尔冯对它另有打算。"
L["Brohann Caskbelly of the Explorers' League in Stormwind wanted the Temple of Atal'Hakkar found, and the trail started in the Hinterlands. High Thane Falstad Wildhammer at Aerie Peak sent me to Gryphon Master Talonaxe, who sent me to Rhapsody Shindigger, who knew a tale about the temple and would tell it for a cocktail of roc gizzards, groddoc livers and ironfur livers. I brought the ingredients, heard the tale, and carried a fragment of an Atal'ai tablet back to Brohann."] = "暴风城探险者协会的布罗哈恩·铁桶想找到阿塔哈卡神庙，而线索要从辛特兰开始。鹰巢山的弗斯塔德·蛮锤把我打发给狮鹫管理员沙拉克·鹰斧，鹰斧又把我打发给拉普索迪·铁铲。拉普索迪知道一个关于那座神庙的故事，只要一杯用大鹏的砂囊、格罗多克猩猩的肝脏和铁鬃熊的肝脏调成的鸡尾酒，就肯讲出来。我把材料凑齐，听完了故事，然后带着一块阿塔莱石板碎片回到了布罗哈恩那里。"
L["Fel'zerul in Stonard wanted to know more about the trolls at the Pool of Tears, and sent me to collect ten of their Atal'ai artifacts. Fel'zerul couldn't make sense of them and sent me with the bundle to an Atal'ai exile hiding in the Hinterlands, who could. Then I took what the exile had to say back to Stonard."] = "斯通纳德的费泽鲁尔想多了解一些泪水之池的巨魔，就派我去收集十件他们的阿塔莱神器。费泽鲁尔看不懂这些东西，于是让我带着这捆神器，去找躲在辛特兰的一个阿塔莱流放者，那人看得懂。然后我把流放者的话带回了斯通纳德。"
L["Before anyone at Chillwind Camp would talk to me about Scholomance, Commander Ashlam Valorfist wanted Sorrow Hill cleared of skeletal flayers and slavering ghouls, and then the four watchtowers of Andorhal marked with a beacon torch, standing in each doorway in turn. Only then did the commander mention the school."] = "寒风营地的人肯跟我谈起通灵学院之前，指挥官阿什拉姆·瓦罗菲斯特先要我把悔恨岭的骷髅剥皮者和被奴役的食尸鬼清理干净，再拿着信号火炬，挨个站到安多哈尔四座哨塔的门口，给它们做上标记。直到这时，指挥官才提起那所学校。"
L["Before High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark would talk to me about Scholomance, the Scarlet Crusade's camp between Felstone Field and Dalson's Tears had to lose its command tent and gain a Scourge banner, and the four watchtowers of Andorhal had to be marked with a beacon torch, from each doorway in turn. Only then did the executor mention the school."] = "亡灵壁垒的高级执行官德灵顿肯跟我谈起通灵学院之前，血色十字军在费尔斯通农场和达尔松之泪之间的营地得先少一顶指挥帐篷、多一面亡灵天灾的战旗，安多哈尔的四座哨塔也得挨个站在门口，用信号火炬做上标记。直到这时，执行官才提起那所学校。"
L["Prospector Stormpike in Ironforge sent me to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan, who was worried about a prospector called Agmond, missing out in the Badlands. I found him. He was dead, killed by a trogg called Murdaloc, so I dealt with Murdaloc and twelve of his Stonevault bonesnappers and reported back to Ironband."] = "铁炉堡的勘察员塔伯斯·雷矛让我去洛克莫丹找勘察员基恩萨·铁环，铁环正为一个叫阿戈莫德的勘察员发愁，那人在荒芜之地失踪了。我找到了他。他已经死了，是一个叫莫达洛克的穴居人干的，于是我收拾了莫达洛克，外加他手下的十二个石窟断骨者，然后回去向铁环复命。"
L["In Searing Gorge, Velarok Windblade told me a story about the black dragonflight and asked for help paying them back. Paying them back took four hearts of flame, four globes of golem oil, eight thorium-plated daggers and a Symbol of Ragnaros, all for the Torch of Retribution. Squire Maltrake then had me carry it into the four sentry towers and set each one ablaze, and the chest that opened afterwards held a black dragonflight molt. Cyrus Therepentous in the Burning Steppes wanted to see it."] = "在灼热峡谷，威拉罗克·温布雷给我讲了一个关于黑龙军团的故事，请我帮忙找它们算账。这笔账算下来，要四份烈焰之心、四份傀儡之油、八把瑟银匕首和一个拉格纳罗斯符记，全都是为了造出惩戒火炬。接着侍卫玛特拉克让我举着火炬走进四座哨塔，把每一座都点着，之后打开的那只箱子里放着一张黑龙皮。燃烧平原的塞勒斯·萨雷芬图斯想看看它。"
L["Thunderheart in Kargath sent me into Blackrock Mountain first, to the quarry, where Overmaster Pyron kept watch over the way into the depths. Pyron fell, and the way in was open."] = "卡加斯的桑德哈特先派我进了黑石山，去采石场，征服者派隆就在那里把守着通往深渊的道路。派隆倒下了，进去的路也就通了。"
L["Hierophant Theodora Mulvadania in Kargath wanted ten fractured elemental shards from the golems and elementals of the Burning Steppes. I brought them, and Theodora sent a sample with me to Lotwil Veriatus, camped to the east of Kargath."] = "卡加斯的塞朵拉·穆瓦丹尼想要十块断裂的元素碎片，得从燃烧平原的傀儡和元素生物身上弄。我带回来了，塞朵拉又让我带上一份样本，去找在卡加斯东边扎营的鲁特维尔·沃拉图斯。"
L["Before he told me anything, the old man in the cottage wanted his corner of the Eastern Plaguelands cleaned up: fifteen slabs of meat from the carrion grubs and devourers, thirty plaguebats out of the sky, and a pack of plaguehounds, runts and all. Then he talked."] = "在告诉我任何事之前，小屋里的老人想先把他在东瘟疫之地的那一角清理干净：从腐肉虫和腐肉吞噬者身上弄来十五块肉，从天上打下三十只瘟疫蝙蝠，再收拾一群瘟疫犬，连幼犬也不放过。然后他才开口。"
-- END CONTENT STRINGS
